005 11:12' prior: 34940251!OBCodeNode is an abstract superclass for node classes that represent program elements active in the image. Though it provides little functionality, it exists for structural purposes.!!OBClassAwareNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 11:23' prior: 34940498!OBClassAware node models program elements that are part of a class. It provides methods for manipulating the class, as well as methods relating to sorting according to class hierarchy.iVarstheClass 	- the class that this node is part ofsuperior 	- during hierarchical sorting this refers to the nearest superclass			  that belongs to the group being sorted!!OBClassAwareNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'PDC 6/26/2007 21:41'!on: anObject	self subclassResponsibility ! !!OBClassAwareNode class methodsFor: 'sorting' stamp: 'dr 10/24/2008 18:55'!sortHierarchicallyOptimized: nodes	"Reimplements sortHierarchically in a crude and ugly way that is however much more efficient"		| classNodes sortedResults supersChain superior result chain1 chain2 i max |	classNodes := (nodes collect: [:classNode | classNode theClass]) asOrderedCollection.	sortedResults := SortedCollection sortBlock: [:assoc1 :assoc2 |		result := nil.		chain1 := assoc1 key.		chain2 := assoc2 key. 		max := chain1 size min: chain2 size.		i := 1.		[result isNil and: [i <= max]] whileTrue: [			(chain1 at: i) = (chain2 at: i)				ifTrue: [i := i + 1]				ifFalse: [result := (chain1 at: i) name < (chain2 at: i) name]].		result isNil ifTrue: [			chain1 size < chain2 size] ifFalse: [result]	].	nodes do: [:classNode |		supersChain := classNode theClass withAllSuperclasses reversed.		supersChain removeAllSuchThat: [:cl | (classNodes includes: cl) not].		superior := supersChain size > 1			ifTrue: [superior := supersChain atLast: 2. nodes detect: [:e | e theClass = superior]]			ifFalse: [nil].		sortedResults add: supersChain contents -> classNode.	].	^(sortedResults collect: [:assoc | assoc value]) asArray! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'lr 2/17/2009 20:43'!allCategories	"Return all categories of theClass and its superclasses."		| categories |	categories := self theClass withAllSuperclasses		inject: Set new		into: [ :result :class | 			result 				addAll: class organization categories;				yourself ].	^ OrderedCollection new		add: (OBAllMethodCategoryNode on: self theClass);		addAll: (categories asSortedCollection			collect: [ :category | OBMethodCategoryNode on: category inClass: self theClass ]);		yourself! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'dr 2/15/2008 15:30'!browse	OBCodeBrowser defaultBrowserClass openOnClass: self theNonMetaClass! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 4/3/2009 13:59'!browseHierarchy	OBHierarchyBrowser openOnClass: self theClass! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 13:30'!browserEnvironment	^ BrowserEnvironment new forClasses: (Array with: self theClass)! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'nodes' stamp: 'dvf 8/31/2005 13:11'!classNode	^self theClass asNode! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/25/2009 10:10'!containingPackage	^ PackageOrganizer default		mostSpecificPackageOfClass: self theClass		ifNone: [ super containingPackage ]! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: '*ob-sunitintegration' stamp: 'AdrianKuhn 12/22/2009 16:36'!hasTestSuite	^ self theClass includesBehavior: TestCase! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'ancestry'!isDescendantOfClass: aClassNode	^ self theClassName = aClassNode theClassName! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'dr 9/18/2008 10:17'!isDescendantOfClassCat: aClassCategoryNode	"optimized version: sending #category to the class is slow"	^ (self theNonMetaClass environment organization 		listAtCategoryNamed: aClassCategoryNode name)			includes: self theNonMetaClassName! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: '*ob-sunitintegration' stamp: 'lr 10/14/2008 10:39'!testSuite	^ (self theClass includesBehavior: TestCase)		ifTrue: [ self theClass suite ]		ifFalse: [ super testSuite ]! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!theClass	^ theClass! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!theClass: aClass	theClass := aClass! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!theClassName	^ self theClass name! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!theMetaClass	^ self theClass theMetaClass! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!theNonMetaClass	^ self theClass theNonMetaClass! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!theNonMetaClassName	^ self theNonMetaClass name! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'lr 8/19/2009 22:24'!title	^ self theNonMetaClassName! !!OBClassAwareNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/25/2009 10:23'!withinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment	^ anEnvironment includesClass: self theClass! !!OBClassCommentNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 11:24' prior: 34940927!OBClassCommentNode represents the comment attached to a particular class. !!OBClassCommentNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified'!on: classRef	^ self new setClass: classRef! !!OBClassCommentNode methodsFor: 'comparing' stamp: 'dr 10/29/2008 22:13'!= aClassOrCommentNode	^(aClassOrCommentNode isKindOf: OBClassAwareNode) and: [self theClass = aClassOrCommentNode theClass]! !!OBClassCommentNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/25/2009 10:42'!definedWithinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment	^ (super definedWithinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment) and: [ anEnvironment definesClass: self theClass ]! !!OBClassCommentNode methodsFor: 'definition' stamp: 'jk 8/23/2007 17:16'!definition	^ OBClassCommentDefinition on: self theClass! !!OBClassCommentNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 10/30/2008 09:52'!isClassCommentNode    ^true! !!OBClassCommentNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'cwp 12/13/2004 00:51'!name	^ self theClass name! !!OBClassCommentNode methodsFor: 'initializing'!setClass: aClass	self theClass: aClass! !!OBClassNode commentStamp: 'lr 8/4/2007 10:30' prior: 34941060!OBClassNode wraps a class for display in various types of code browsers. It provides many navigation methods for the different types of browsers where classes may appear. The instance-variable theClass is always a non-metaclass.!!OBClassNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 11/30/2004 21:06'!on: aClass 	^ self new setClass: aClass ! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'PDC 6/25/2007 22:40'!= other	^(self species = other species) and: [self theClass = other theClass] ! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:05'!allCategory	^ Array with: (OBAllMethodCategoryNode on: self theClass)! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'ancestry'!ancestrySelector	^ #isDescendantOfClass:! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'lr 2/17/2009 20:47'!categories	| categories publicCategories privateCategories |	categories := self theClass organization categories.	publicCategories := categories		reject: [ :each | each beginsWith: #private ].	privateCategories := categories		select: [ :each | each beginsWith: #private ].	^ publicCategories sort , privateCategories sort		collect: [ :each | OBMethodCategoryNode on: each inClass: self theClass ]! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'nodes' stamp: 'dr 7/4/2008 16:49'!categoryNodeNamed: aString 	^ OBMethodCategoryNode on: aString inClass: theClass! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 10/23/2008 14:12'!classCategory	^self theNonMetaClass category! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'nodes' stamp: 'dr 10/23/2008 14:11'!classCategoryNode	^ OBClassCategoryNode 		on: self classCategory		inEnvironment: self theClass environment! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 12/12/2004 23:31'!classHierarchy	^ self nodeHierarchyWithClass: OBClassNode! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'lr 11/7/2009 17:47'!classVariables	^ self theNonMetaClass allClassVarNames asArray sort		collect: [:ea | OBClassVariableNode on: ea inClass: self theClass]! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 12/12/2004 23:31'!commentHierarchy	^ self nodeHierarchyWithClass: OBClassCommentNode! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/25/2009 10:41'!definedWithinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment	^ (super definedWithinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment) and: [ anEnvironment definesClass: self theClass ]! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!definition	^ OBClassDefinition 		environment: self theClass environment 		template: self theClass definition! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'lr 3/28/2006 18:29'!dropOnClassCategory: aNode	self theNonMetaClass category: aNode name.	self signalSelection.	^ true! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'lr 4/6/2006 11:31'!dropSelector	^ #dropOnClass:! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'dr 7/10/2008 16:26'!fileOut	self theNonMetaClass fileOut! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 6/30/2006 00:57'!hasOrganization	^ true! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'PDC 6/25/2007 21:38'!hash	^ self theClass hash! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'navigating'!instanceVariables	^ self theClass allInstVarNames asArray sort		collect: [:ea | OBInstanceVariableNode on: ea inClass: self theClass]! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 11/28/2007 14:57'!isClassNode	^true! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'dr 12/2/2008 18:42'!isDescendantOfMethodCat: category	^ false! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 12/12/2004 23:30'!metaclassHierarchy	^ self nodeHierarchyWithClass: OBMetaclassNode! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/9/2008 09:18'!methods	^ self theClass selectors collect: [ :each | 		(MethodReference class: self theClass selector: each)			asNode ]! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'dr 9/15/2008 17:13'!name	^ self theClass name! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 5/20/2007 00:27'!nodeHierarchyWithClass: aClass	^ self surroundingHierarchy collect: [:ea | aClass on: ea]! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!organization	^ self theClass organization! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'printing' stamp: 'cwp 12/10/2004 23:53'!printOn: aStream	aStream		print: self class;		nextPut: $<;		print: self theClass;		nextPut: $>! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'lr 8/4/2007 10:29'!setClass: aClass	self theClass: aClass theNonMetaClass! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: '*ob-shout-morphic' stamp: 'dr 8/21/2008 15:13'!shouldBeStyledBy: aShoutMorph    super shouldBeStyledBy: aShoutMorph.    ^true! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 10/23/2008 13:28'!surroundingHierarchy	| class result |	result := OrderedCollection new.	class := self theNonMetaClass.	class allSuperclasses reverseDo: 		[:aClass | 		result add: aClass].	class allSubclassesWithLevelDo:		[:aClass :level |		result add: aClass]	 	startingLevel: 0.		^ result! !!OBClassNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 10/17/2007 23:58'!users	| nodes |	nodes := (SystemNavigation default allCallsOn: (theClass environment associationAt: theClass name))				collect: [:ref | OBClassRefNode on: self name inMethod: ref].	^ nodes asArray sort: [:a :b | a theClassName <= b theClassName]! !!OBMetaclassNode commentStamp: 'lr 8/4/2007 10:30' prior: 34941351!OBMetaclassNode is essentially the same as an OBClassNode, but overrides a few methods to work properly with metaclasses. The instance-variable theClass is always a metaclass.!!OBMetaclassNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'dr 2/15/2008 15:36'!browse	^ OBCodeBrowser defaultBrowserClass openOnClass: self theNonMetaClass! !!OBMetaclassNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'cwp 12/13/2004 00:56'!name 	^ self nonMetaName! !!OBMetaclassNode methodsFor: 'displaying'!nonMetaName	^ self theNonMetaClass name! !!OBMetaclassNode methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'lr 8/4/2007 10:29'!setClass: aClass	self theClass: aClass theMetaClass! !!OBMethodCategoryNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:29' prior: 34941595!OBMethodCategory represents a category within a ClassOrganization. Instead of an organization definition, OBMethodCategory presents a MethodDefinition with the class' default method template.!!OBAllMethodCategoryNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:31' prior: 34941858!OBAllMethodCategory implements the synthetic '-- all --' category, which contains all the methods in a class.!!OBAllMethodCategoryNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified'!on: className	^ self on: '-- all --' inClass: className! !!OBAllMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 13:54'!browserEnvironment	^ ClassEnvironment 		onEnvironment: BrowserEnvironment new		classes: (Array with: self theClass)! !!OBAllMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!category	^ 'as yet unclassified'! !!OBAllMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!methodReferences	^ self theClass selectors asSortedArray 		collect: [:ea | MethodReference new setStandardClass: self theClass methodSymbol: ea]! !!OBMethodCategoryNode class methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'cwp 9/18/2004 22:58'!actionsForParent: aNode	^ #()! !!OBMethodCategoryNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'PDC 6/26/2007 21:47'!on: aClass	self subclassResponsibility ! !!OBMethodCategoryNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!on: aString inClass: aClassReference	^ self new setName: aString class: aClassReference! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'comparing' stamp: 'PDC 6/25/2007 22:42'!= other 	^ self species = other species 		and: [self theClass = other theClass and: [self name = other name]]! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'lr 2/17/2009 20:49'!allMethods	| allMethods |	allMethods := OrderedCollection new.	self theClass withAllSuperclassesDo: [ :class | 		class methodDict keysAndValuesDo: [ :selector :method | 			self name = (class organization categoryOfElement: selector)				ifTrue: [ allMethods add: selector] ] ].	^ allMethods collect: [ :selector | 		OBMethodNode 			on: selector			inClass: (self theClass 				whichClassIncludesSelector: selector) ]! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'ancestry'!ancestrySelector	^ #isDescendantOfMethodCat:! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'dr 2/15/2008 15:37'!browse	OBCodeBrowser defaultBrowserClass openOnClass: self theClass category: name! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 13:48'!browserEnvironment	^ BrowserEnvironment new forClass: self theClass protocols: (Array with: self category)! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!category	^ name! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!container	^ self theClass! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'public'!definition	^ OBMethodDefinition inCategory: self category inClass: self theClass! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'lr 4/6/2006 11:46'!dropOnClass: aNode	self methods do: [ :each | each dropOnClass: aNode ].	aNode signalChildrenChanged.	^ true! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'drag and drop'!dropSelector	^ #dropOnMethodCategory:! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'services'!fileOut	self theClass fileOutCategory: name! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'comparing' stamp: 'cwp 7/6/2007 00:02'!hash	^ theClass hash bitXor: name hash! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 10/30/2008 10:23'!isCategoryNode    ^true! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'ancestry'!isDescendantOfMethodCat: other	^ (other theClassName = self theClassName) and: [other name = name]! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 10/30/2008 09:49'!isMethodCategoryNode    ^true! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 9/14/2005 09:06'!methodReferences	^ (self theClass organization listAtCategoryNamed: name)		collect: [:ea | MethodReference new						setClassSymbol: self theNonMetaClassName						classIsMeta: self theClass isMeta						methodSymbol: ea						stringVersion: '']! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'dvf 8/19/2005 17:16'!methods	^ self methodReferences collect: [:ref | ref asNode]! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'dr 7/18/2007 11:51'!name	^name! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dvf 8/16/2005 17:47'!printOn: aStream	super printOn: aStream.	aStream nextPut: $<.	self name printOn: aStream.	aStream nextPut: $>.! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'cwp 9/19/2004 00:11'!remove	self theClass removeCategory: name.	self signalDeletion! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'cwp 6/11/2009 16:59'!renameTo: aString 	self container organization renameCategory: self name toBe: aString.! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/4/2009 20:55'!setName: aString	name := aString! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: 'initializing'!setName: aString class: aClass	name := aString.	self theClass: aClass! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: '*ob-shout-morphic' stamp: 'dr 8/21/2008 15:13'!shouldBeStyledBy: aShoutMorph    super shouldBeStyledBy: aShoutMorph.    (self theClass isBehavior or: [self theClass isTrait]) ifTrue: [aShoutMorph classOrMetaClass: self theClass].    ^true! !!OBMethodCategoryNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 13:46'!withinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment	^ self methods anySatisfy: [ :each | each withinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment ] ! !!OBMethodNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:37' prior: 34942028!OBMethodNode wraps a method in a particular class. It supplies an OBMethodDefinition for displaying and editing the source code of the method, and various actions for manipulating the method. It has two roles: first it appears in the right most pane of a standard system browser. Second, it often serves as the root node for an OBListBrowser, and has navigation methods for senders, implementors etc.OBMethodNode also serves as the superclass for nodes that represent *parts* of a method, such as sends of a particular message, references to a class, accesses to a instance variable, etc.!!OBClassRefNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:38' prior: 34942681!Each instance of OBClassRefNode refers to a reference to a particular class from the source code of a method. It's used in the OBListBrowser created by the 'browse references' class action.!!OBClassRefNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 12/1/2004 00:50'!on: aClassName inMethod: aMethodRef	^ self new setClassName: aClassName reference: aMethodRef! !!OBClassRefNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2004 22:14'!name	^ className! !!OBClassRefNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 12/1/2004 01:16'!selection	| start parser |	(parser := Compiler parserClass new) parseSelector: self source.	start := parser endOfLastToken.	start := (self source asString findString: className startingAt: start).	^ start to: start + className size - 1! !!OBClassRefNode methodsFor: 'initialize-release' stamp: 'cwp 12/1/2004 01:10'!setClassName: theName reference: aMethodRef	self setReference: aMethodRef.	className := theName.! !!OBMessageNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:40' prior: 34942932!An OBMessageNode refers to a message send in the source code of a method. They are typically used in the 'senders' browser.!!OBMessageNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!fromMethodNode: aMethodNode	^ self new 		setMessage: aMethodNode selector		selector: aMethodNode selector		class: aMethodNode theClass! !!OBMessageNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!on: aSelector inMethod: aSelector2 inClass: classRef	^ self new setMessage: aSelector selector: aSelector2 class: classRef! !!OBMessageNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!on: aSelector inMethodNode: aNode	^ self 		on: aSelector 		inMethod: aNode selector 		inClass: aNode theClass! !!OBMessageNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 10:39'!on: aSelector inMethodReference: ref	^ self 		on: aSelector 		inMethod: ref methodSymbol		inClass: ref actualClass! !!OBMessageNode methodsFor: 'converting' stamp: 'cwp 8/22/2007 23:56'!asMethodNode	^ OBMethodNode on: selector inClass: self theClass! !!OBMessageNode methodsFor: 'navigating'!implementors	^ self implementorsOf: message! !!OBMessageNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2004 21:26'!name	^ message! !!OBMessageNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 7/18/2007 19:31'!selection	| methodNode assoc |	methodNode := Parser new 					parse: self source					class: self theClass.	assoc := (methodNode encoder rawSourceRanges) 			associations detect: [:ea | ea key selectorIs: message]						ifNone: [nil -> (1 to: 0)].						"Some messages are generated by the compiler."	^ assoc value! !!OBMessageNode methodsFor: 'navigating'!sendersOfMessage	^ self sendersOf: message! !!OBMessageNode methodsFor: 'initializing'!setMessage: aSelector selector: aSelector2 class: aClass	message := aSelector.	selector := aSelector2.	self theClass: aClass! !!OBMessageNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'alog 2/25/2008 03:49'!unifySelectors	selector := message! !!OBMethodNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!on: aMethodReference	^ self new setReference: aMethodReference! !!OBMethodNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'dr 1/9/2008 14:18'!on: aSelector inClass: aClassReference	^ self new setSelector: aSelector class: aClassReference! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'comparing' stamp: 'lr 11/13/2008 13:44'!= other 	^ self species = other species and: [ self theClass = other theClass and: [ self selector = other selector ] ]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private'!addOverridersOf: aSelector inClass: aClass to: aCollection	aClass subclasses do: 		[:ea | (ea includesSelector: aSelector)					ifTrue: [aCollection add: ea]					ifFalse: [self addOverridersOf: aSelector inClass: ea to: aCollection]]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'ancestry'!ancestrySelector	^ #isDescendantOfMethod: ! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'dc 5/2/2007 19:05'!annotationString	^ (OBAnnotationRequest onClass: self theClass selector: self selector)		getAnnotations.! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'converting' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2007 01:39'!asMethodNode	^ self! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'dr 2/15/2008 15:37'!browse 	OBCodeBrowser defaultBrowserClass defaultBrowserClass openOnClass: self theClass selector: selector! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 12:23'!browserEnvironment	^ BrowserEnvironment new forClass: self theClass selectors: (Array with: self selector)! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 10:41'!category	^ [ self reference category ifNil: [ '' ] ] 		on: Error		do: [ :err | '' ]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/25/2009 10:11'!containingPackage	^ PackageOrganizer default		mostSpecificPackageOfMethod: self reference		ifNone: [ super containingPackage ]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 10:41'!defaultSource	^ String streamContents: 		[ :stream | 		self writeMethodHeaderTo: stream.		stream			nextPut: Character cr;			tab;			nextPutAll: '"This method does not exist."';			nextPut: Character cr;			tab;			nextPutAll: 'self halt.' ]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 12/1/2004 00:36'!definition	^ OBMethodDefinition		selection: self selection		source: self source		inClass: self theClass! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 21:59'!displayString	^ (self theClass includesLocalSelector: selector) 		ifTrue: [ super displayString ]		ifFalse: [ super displayString asText addAttribute: TextEmphasis italic ]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'cwp 10/18/2004 00:29'!doRemove	self theClass removeSelector: self selector.	self signalDeletion! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'lr 10/27/2009 17:29'!dropOnClass: aNode	aNode theClass 		compile: self source		classified: (self theClass organization 			categoryOfElement: self selector).	Sensor shiftPressed		ifFalse: [ self theClass removeSelector: self selector ].	aNode signalChildrenChanged.	^ true! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'dc 8/24/2007 11:57'!dropOnMethodCategory: aNode	"We don't support dropping on another class yet."	aNode theClass = self theClass ifFalse: [^ false].	self theClass organization		classify: self selector		under: aNode category		suppressIfDefault: false.			aNode signalChildrenChanged.		^ true! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'actions'!fileOut	self theClass fileOutMethod: selector! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2004 21:08'!fullName	^ self theClassName, '>>', selector! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'cwp 6/11/2009 15:25'!fullNameWithProtocol    ^ self fullName , ' {' ,  self category , '}'! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 10/11/2006 20:46'!hasSelector	^ true! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 10/9/2006 18:13'!hasVersions	^ true! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'comparing' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2004 22:07'!hash	^ theClass hash bitXor: selector hash! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'dr 7/2/2007 17:10'!hierarchyImplementors    ^OBClassAwareNode sortHierarchicallyOptimized: (self hierarchyImplementorsOf: selector)! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'dr 2/7/2008 09:49'!hierarchyImplementorsOf: aSelector     | classCollection |     classCollection := SortedCollection new.     self theClass withAllSuperAndSubclassesDoGently: [:class | (class includesSelector: aSelector)						ifTrue: [classCollection add: (MethodReference new setStandardClass: class methodSymbol: aSelector)]].	^classCollection collect: [:ref | ref asNode]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'dr 7/2/2007 17:10'!hierarchySenders    ^self hierarchySendersOf: selector! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'dr 7/2/2007 17:01'!hierarchySendersOf: aSelector	| hierarchySenders |	hierarchySenders := (SystemNavigation default allCallsOn: aSelector) select: [:ea | (self theClass withAllSuperclasses includes: ea actualClass) or: [			                                       self theClass allSubclasses includes: ea actualClass]].	^hierarchySenders asSortedArray collect: [:ref | OBMessageNode on: aSelector inMethodReference: ref]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 1/2/2005 23:12'!implementors	^ self implementorsOf: selector! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2004 23:48'!implementorsOf: aSelector	^ (SystemNavigation default allImplementorsOf: aSelector) asSortedArray			collect: [:ref | OBMethodNode on: ref]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2004 23:49'!inheritanceRoot	| rootClass |	rootClass := (self theClass withAllSuperclasses asArray					select: [:ea | ea includesSelector: self selector]) last.	^ OBCollectionNode on: {OBMethodNode 								on: self selector 								inClass: rootClass}! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'cwp 11/28/2004 10:37'!isDescendantOfMethod: other	^ other selector = selector		and: [self theClass withAllSuperclasses includes: other theClass].	! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'dr 11/29/2008 17:26'!isDescendantOfMethodCat: aMethodCatNode	^aMethodCatNode theClass = self theClass and: [(self theClass organization categoryOfElement: self selector) = aMethodCatNode name]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'cwp 10/17/2004 23:55'!isDescendantOfMethodVersion: anOBMethodVersionNode 	^ false! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'jk 8/25/2007 16:46'!isLocalSelector	^ self theClass localSelectors includes: self selector.! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 11/2/2006 11:21'!isMethodNode	^true! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 7/24/2007 00:48'!isOverridden	self theClass allSubclassesDo: 		[:class | (class includesSelector: self selector) ifTrue: [^ true]].	^ false! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 7/24/2007 00:49'!isOverride	self theClass allSuperclassesDo: 		[:class | (class includesSelector: self selector) ifTrue: [^ true]].	^ false! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'nodes'!messageNode	^ OBMessageNode fromMethodNode: self! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private'!messageSelectors	^ ((self theClass compiledMethodAt: self selector ifAbsent: [^ #()]) messages) asSortedArray! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'dc 1/26/2008 11:52'!messages	^ self messageSelectors			collect: [:sel | OBMessageNode 								on: sel 								inMethod: selector 								inClass: self theClass]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 08:17'!moveToPackage	| packagesNames selection packages |	packages := PackageOrganizer default packages asSortedCollection: [ :a :b | a packageName <= b packageName ].	packagesNames := packages collect: [ :ea | ea packageName ].	selection := OBChoiceRequest 		prompt: nil		labels: packagesNames		values: packages.	selection isNil ifFalse: [ selection addMethod: self reference ]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2004 21:08'!name	^ selector! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'jk 5/20/2007 11:01'!nameWithClassNameInBrackets	^ selector, '  (', self theClassName, ')'! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2004 23:49'!overrides	| classes |	classes := OrderedCollection new.	self addOverridersOf: self selector inClass: self theClass to: classes.	^ classes collect: [:ea | OBMethodNode on: selector inClass: ea] ! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'printing' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2004 21:59'!printOn: aStream	aStream		nextPutAll: self class name;		nextPut: $<;		nextPutAll: self theClass name;		nextPut: $#;		nextPutAll: self selector;		nextPut: $>! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!reference	^ self referenceForMethod: selector ofClass: self theClassName! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 08:17'!remove	| senders choice |	senders := SystemNavigation default allCallsOn: self selector.	senders isEmpty ifTrue: [ ^ self doRemove ].	choice := OBChoiceRequest 		prompt: 'This message has ' , senders size asString , ' senders.'		labels: #(				'Remove it'				'Remove, then browse senders'				'Don''t remove, but show me those senders'				'Forget it -- do nothing -- sorry I asked'			)		values: #(				#doRemove				#removeAndBrowse				#simpleBrowseSenders				nil			).	choice isNil ifFalse: [ ^ self perform: choice ]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private'!removeAndBrowse	self simpleBrowseSenders.	self theClass removeSelector: self selector.	self signalDeletion! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 12/1/2004 00:37'!selection	^ 1 to: 0! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!selector	^ selector! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'navigating'!selectorAndMessages	^ self messages copyWithFirst: self messageNode! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'navigating'!senders	^ self sendersOf: selector! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private'!sendersOf: aSelector	^ (SystemNavigation default allCallsOn: aSelector) asSortedArray			collect: [:ref | OBMessageNode on: aSelector inMethodReference: ref]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'initializing'!setReference: aMethodReference	self 		setSelector: aMethodReference methodSymbol		class: (aMethodReference actualClass)! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'initializing'!setSelector: aSelector class: aClass	selector := aSelector.	self theClass: aClass! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: '*ob-shout-morphic' stamp: 'dr 8/21/2008 15:13'!shouldBeStyledBy: aShoutMorph    super shouldBeStyledBy: aShoutMorph.    (self theClass isBehavior or: [self theClass isTrait]) ifTrue: [aShoutMorph classOrMetaClass: self theClass].    ^true! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'avi 9/17/2005 01:29'!simpleBrowseSenders	OBSendersBrowser browseRoot: self! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'dc 6/27/2007 13:03'!source	^ (self theClass sourceCodeAt: self selector ifAbsent: [^ self defaultSource]) 		asText makeSelectorBold! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!sourceFiles	^ OBSourceFilesRequest signal! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private'!sourcePointer	^ (self theClass compiledMethodAt: self selector) sourcePointer! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'navigating'!versions	^ (OBMethodVersion scan: self sourceFiles from: self sourcePointer)		collect: [:ea | OBMethodVersionNode on: ea]! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 5/20/2007 09:04'!withinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment	^ anEnvironment includesSelector: self selector in: self theClass! !!OBMethodNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'dc 6/27/2007 13:21'!writeMethodHeaderTo: aStream	|keywords|	self selector numArgs = 0 ifTrue: [aStream nextPutAll: self selector. ^ self].		keywords := self selector keywords.	(1 to: keywords size)       do: [:i |			aStream				nextPutAll: (keywords at: i);				space;				nextPutAll: 'arg';				print: i		 ]	separatedBy: [aStream space]! !!OBMethodVersionNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:41' prior: 34943123!OBMethodVersions refer to OBMethodVersions, and are used by the VersionBrowser.!!OBMethodVersionNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!on: aMethodVersion 	^ self new setVersion: aMethodVersion! !!OBMethodVersionNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'dr 2/15/2008 15:37'!browse	OBCodeBrowser defaultBrowserClass openOnClass: self theClass selector: version selector! !!OBMethodVersionNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 10/17/2004 23:57'!category	^ self theClass organization categoryOfElement: version selector! !!OBMethodVersionNode methodsFor: 'compiling' stamp: 'cwp 10/17/2004 23:53'!definition	^ (OBMethodDefinition source: version source inClass: self theClass)		callback: [:sel | 					version selector = sel						ifTrue: [self class on: version latest]						ifFalse: [OBMethodNode on: sel inClass: self theClass]]! !!OBMethodVersionNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'cwp 10/17/2004 23:43'!isDescendantOfMethodVersion: aNode	^ (version = aNode version)! !!OBMethodVersionNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'cwp 11/27/2004 21:38'!name	| stamp |	stamp := version stamp ifNil: ['<timestamp missing>'].	^ version theClassName, '>>', version selector, ' ', stamp! !!OBMethodVersionNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!reference	^ self referenceForMethod: version selector ofClass: self theClassName.! !!OBMethodVersionNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 10/11/2006 20:55'!selector	^ version selector! !!OBMethodVersionNode methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'cwp 3/11/2007 21:29'!setVersion: aMethodVersion	version := aMethodVersion.	self setSelector: version selector class: version theClass! !!OBMethodVersionNode methodsFor: '*ob-shout-morphic' stamp: 'dr 12/16/2008 11:20'!shouldBeStyledBy: aShoutMorph    aShoutMorph classOrMetaClass: nil.    ^false! !!OBMethodVersionNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 10/17/2004 23:44'!version	^ version! !!OBVariableNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:46' prior: 34943265!OBVariableNode is an abstract superclass for the two types of variables a class can contain - class variables and instance variables. The only difference between the two subclasses is how they search for methods that refer to them.!!OBClassVariableNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:51' prior: 34943564!OBClassVariable provides a method for finding methods which refer to a shared variable, ie, by searching for an association in the literal frame rather than for bytecodes refering to an instance variable.!!OBClassVariableNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 21:42'!accessors	| literal |	literal := self theClass bindingOf: name.	^ ((self systemNavigation allCallsOn: literal) asArray sort)		collect: [:ref | OBMethodNode on: ref]! !!OBClassVariableNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 12:25'!browserEnvironment	^ VariableEnvironment referencesToClassVariable: self name in: self theClass! !!OBClassVariableNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 3/8/2009 18:01'!withinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment	^ (anEnvironment classVariablesFor: self theClass) includes: self name! !!OBInstanceVariableNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:50' prior: 34943839!OBClassVariable provides a method for finding methods which refer to an instance, ie, by searching for instance variable access bytecodes rather than for an association in the literal frame.!!OBInstanceVariableNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2004 23:48'!accessors	| accessors |	accessors := OrderedCollection new.	self theClass withAllSubAndSuperclassesDo: [:class |		(class whichSelectorsAccess: name) asSortedCollection			do: [:ea | ea = #DoIt ifFalse: [accessors add: 					(self referenceForMethod: ea ofClass: class name)]]].	^ accessors asArray	collect: [:ref | OBMethodNode on: ref]! !!OBInstanceVariableNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 12:26'!browserEnvironment	^ VariableEnvironment referencesToInstanceVariable: self name in: self theClass! !!OBInstanceVariableNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 3/8/2009 18:00'!withinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment	^ (anEnvironment instanceVariablesFor: self theClass) includes: self name! !!OBVariableNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'PDC 6/26/2007 21:47'!on: anObject	self subclassResponsibility ! !!OBVariableNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!on: instVarName inClass: aClassReference 	^ self new setName: instVarName class: aClassReference! !!OBVariableNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'PDC 6/25/2007 23:01'!accessors	self subclassResponsibility ! !!OBVariableNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 3/13/2009 14:18'!fullName	^ self theClassName , ' ' , self name! !!OBVariableNode methodsFor: 'displaying'!name	^ name! !!OBVariableNode methodsFor: 'initializing'!setName: aString class: aClass	name := aString.	self theClass: aClass! !!OBClassCategoryNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:58' prior: 34944097!OBClassCategory represents a system category in the image's SystemOrganization.!!OBClassCategoryNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!on: aString	^ self new setName: aString! !!OBClassCategoryNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!on: aString inEnvironment: anEnvironment	^ self new setName: aString environment: anEnvironment! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'ancestry'!ancestrySelector	^ #isDescendantOfClassCat:! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'dr 2/15/2008 15:30'!browse	OBCodeBrowser defaultBrowserClass openOnEnvironment: environment category: name! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 12:27'!browserEnvironment	^ BrowserEnvironment new forCategories: (Array with: self name)! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'private'!classNames	^ environment organization listAtCategoryNamed: name! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'dvf 8/15/2005 17:31'!classes	^ self classNames collect: [:ea | (environment at: ea) asNode]! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'dvf 8/17/2005 17:25'!comments	^ self classNames collect: [:ea | (environment at: ea) asCommentNode ]! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 9/22/2004 22:13'!container	^ environment! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 9/26/2008 12:15'!containingPackage	^ PackageOrganizer default packages		detect: [ :each | each includesSystemCategory: self name ]		ifNone: [ super containingPackage ]! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'displaying'!definition	^ OBClassDefinition 		environment: environment 		template: ((environment at: #Class) template: name)! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'drag and drop'!dropSelector	^ #dropOnClassCategory:! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'services'!fileOut	environment organization fileOutCategory: name.! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: '*ob-sunitintegration' stamp: 'AdrianKuhn 12/22/2009 16:39'!hasTestSuite	^ self classes anySatisfy: [ :node | node hasTestSuite ]! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 7/17/2006 08:47'!isCategory	^ true! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 10/30/2008 09:54'!isCategoryNode	^ true! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 10/30/2008 09:48'!isClassCategoryNode    ^true! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'ancestry'!isDescendantOfClassCat: other	^ other name = name! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'class creation'!isRedefinedBy: definition	"No class is selected, so the definition can't be a redefinition."		^ false! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'dvf 8/15/2005 17:52'!metaclasses	^self classNames collect: [:ea | (environment at: ea) asClassSideNode]! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'dr 12/9/2008 20:17'!name	^name! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'printing' stamp: 'cwp 5/11/2007 00:59'!printOn: aStream	aStream		nextPutAll: self class name;		nextPut: $<;		nextPutAll: self name;		nextPut: $>! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'cwp 9/19/2004 00:11'!remove	environment organization removeSystemCategory: name.	self signalDeletion! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'cwp 6/11/2009 16:59'!renameTo: aString 	self container organization renameCategory: self name toBe: aString.	! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'initializing'!setName: aString	self setName: aString environment: self class environment! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'initializing'!setName: aString environment: anEnvironment	name := aString asSymbol.	environment := anEnvironment! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: '*ob-shout-shout' stamp: 'dr 8/21/2008 15:14'!shouldBeStyledBy: aShoutMorph    super shouldBeStyledBy: aShoutMorph.    ^true! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: '*ob-sunitintegration' stamp: 'lr 10/14/2008 11:01'!testSuite	| suite |	suite := TestSuite new.	self classes do: [ :node |		node testSuite isNil			ifFalse: [ suite addTest: node testSuite ] ].	^ suite tests isEmpty		ifFalse: [ suite ]! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: 'displaying'!text	^ 'Object subclass: #NameOfSubclass	instanceVariableNames: ''''	classVariableNames: ''''	poolDictionaries: ''''	category: ''', self name, ''''! !!OBClassCategoryNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 8/8/2007 22:12'!withinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment	^ anEnvironment includesCategory: self name! !!ORPackageExtensionNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'lr 11/25/2009 09:15'!classes	^ self extensionClasses collect: [ :each | each asNode ]! !!ORPackageExtensionNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'lr 11/25/2009 09:15'!comments	^ self extensionClasses collect: [ :each | each asCommentNode ]! !!ORPackageExtensionNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 12:11'!definition	^ self! !!ORPackageExtensionNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 12/3/2009 18:51'!extensionClasses	^ environment packages		inject: Set new		into: [ :classes :info | 			classes 				addAll: (info extensionClasses					collect: [ :each | each theNonMetaClass ]);				yourself ]! !!ORPackageExtensionNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'lr 11/25/2009 09:15'!metaclasses	^ self extensionClasses collect: [ :each | each asClassSideNode ]! !!ORPackageExtensionNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 12:11'!name	^ '*Extensions'! !!ORPackageExtensionNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 12:12'!text	^ nil! !!OBCodeNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'PDC 6/26/2007 21:40'!on: anObject	self subclassResponsibility ! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'lr 5/2/2007 17:30'!annotationString	"Provide a line of content for an annotation pane, representing information about the method associated with the selected node."		^ nil! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 2/6/2009 11:36'!browserEnvironment	"Answer a refactoring browser environemnt of the receiving node."	^ BrowserEnvironment new! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 9/26/2008 12:11'!containingPackage	"Answer the PackageInfo instance that contains the receiver, or nil if no such package exists."		^ nil! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/25/2009 10:23'!definedWithinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment	^ self withinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 6/30/2006 00:37'!hasOrganization	^ false! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 10/11/2006 20:47'!hasSelector	^ false! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 10/9/2006 18:12'!hasVersions	^ false! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 8/20/2009 22:39'!isCategoryNode	^ false! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 8/22/2009 11:17'!isClassCategoryNode	^ false! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 8/22/2009 11:17'!isClassCommentNode	^ false! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 8/21/2009 11:23'!isClassNode	^ false! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 2/9/2008 16:23'!isDescendantOfClass: aNode	^ false! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 8/21/2009 11:23'!isEnvironmentNode	^ false! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 8/22/2009 11:17'!isMethodCategoryNode	^ false! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 8/22/2009 11:18'!isMethodNode	^ false! !!OBCodeNode methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 11:54'!withinBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment	^ false! !!OBEnvironmentNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:01' prior: 34944242!OBEnvironmentNode wraps an instance of SystemDictionary. In current Squeak images, there is only one such instance, but OB-Standard is coded so as to use rely on this assumption as little as possible. Thus OBEnvironmentNode typically serves as the root of the standard browser, and passes its environment on to other nodes in the tree.!!OBEnvironmentNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified'!forImage	^ self on: Smalltalk! !!OBEnvironmentNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified'!on: anEnvironment	^ self new setEnvironment: anEnvironment! !!OBEnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigating'!categories	^ environment organization categories collect: [:cat | OBClassCategoryNode 															on: cat															inEnvironment: environment]! !!OBEnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 9/20/2005 08:43'!categoryNodeNamed: aString 	^ OBClassCategoryNode on: aString! !!OBEnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!environment	^ environment! !!OBEnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 6/30/2006 00:54'!hasOrganization	^ true! !!OBEnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 8/21/2009 11:23'!isEnvironmentNode	^ true! !!OBEnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'lr 2/9/2008 12:00'!name 	^ environment name! !!OBEnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'accessing'!organization	^ self environment organization! !!OBEnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'initializing'!setEnvironment: anEnvironment	environment := anEnvironment! !!OREnvironmentNode class methodsFor: 'instance-creation' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 13:01'!onEnvironment: aBrowserEnvironment	^ self forImage setBrowserEnvironment: aBrowserEnvironment! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 13:00'!browserEnvironment	^ browserEnvironment! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 20:45'!classCategories	^ self browserEnvironment categories collect: [ :each | OBClassCategoryNode on: each ]! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 12/8/2009 08:15'!classProtocols	^ self browserEnvironment allNonMetaClasses 		inject: OrderedCollection new		into: [ :result :class |			result				addAll: (class asNode allCategory);				addAll: (class asNode categories);				yourself ]! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 21:40'!classVariables	| classes variables |	classes := Dictionary new.	self browserEnvironment classesDo: [ :class |		(self browserEnvironment classVariablesFor: class) do: [ :name |			(classes				at: ((class whichClassDefinesClassVar: name)					ifNil: [ class whichSuperclassSatisfies: [ :each | each poolDictionaryNames includes: name ] ])				ifAbsentPut: [ Set new ])					add: name ] ].	variables := OrderedCollection new.	classes keysAndValuesDo: [ :class :names | 		names do: [ :name |			variables add: (OBClassVariableNode on: name inClass: class) ] ].	^ variables! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 21:54'!classes	^ self browserEnvironment allNonMetaClasses collect: [ :each | each asNode ]! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 3/8/2009 15:55'!comments	^ self browserEnvironment allClasses collect: [ :each | each asCommentNode ]! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 3/5/2009 20:45'!environments	^ self browserEnvironment environments asSortedCollection collect: [ :label |		self class onEnvironment: ((self browserEnvironment 			environmentNamed: label) 				label: label) ]! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 3/8/2009 18:47'!instanceVariables	| classes variables |	classes := Dictionary new.	self browserEnvironment classesDo: [ :class |		(self browserEnvironment instanceVariablesFor: class) do: [ :name |			(classes				at: (class whichClassDefinesInstVar: name)				ifAbsentPut: [ Set new ])					add: name ] ].	variables := OrderedCollection new.	classes keysAndValuesDo: [ :class :names | 		names do: [ :name |			variables add: (OBInstanceVariableNode on: name inClass: class) ] ].	^ variables! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 12/8/2009 08:15'!metaclassProtocols	^ self browserEnvironment allMetaClasses 		inject: OrderedCollection new		into: [ :result :class |			result				addAll: (class asClassSideNode allCategory);				addAll: (class asClassSideNode categories);				yourself ]! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 21:54'!metaclasses	^ self browserEnvironment allMetaClasses collect: [ :each | each asClassSideNode ]! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 2/11/2008 22:10'!methods	| result |	result := OrderedCollection new.	self browserEnvironment classesAndSelectorsDo: [ :class :selector |		result add: (MethodReference class: class selector: selector)			asNode ].	^ result! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/11/2008 22:09'!name	^ self browserEnvironment name! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 11/25/2009 09:12'!packageCategories	^ self browserEnvironment categories collect: [ :each | OBClassCategoryNode on: each ]! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 13:44'!packageExtensionCategory	^ Array with: (ORPackageExtensionNode on: '*Extensions' inEnvironment: self browserEnvironment)! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 21:56'!protocols	^ self browserEnvironment classes gather: [ :class | class asNode categories ]! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 13:30'!selectorEnvironment	"Make sure that the receiver is a selector environment."		| selectorEnvironment |	selectorEnvironment := SelectorEnvironment new.	browserEnvironment classesAndSelectorsDo: [ :class :selector |		selectorEnvironment addClass: class selector: selector ].	^ browserEnvironment := selectorEnvironment! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 13:00'!setBrowserEnvironment: anEnvironment	browserEnvironment := anEnvironment! !!OREnvironmentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/8/2009 10:33'!text	^ self name! !!OBClassRefSearchNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'cwp 4/15/2007 21:27'!classSatisfiesQuery: aClass	^ (SystemNavigation default allCallsOn: (Smalltalk associationAt: query) from: aClass) isEmpty not! !!OBClassRefSearchNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'dr 2/18/2009 16:13'!classes	| refs classNames nodes |	refs := SystemNavigation default allCallsOn: (Smalltalk associationAt: query ifAbsent: [^#()]).	classNames := refs collect: [:ea | ea classSymbol].	nodes := classNames asSet collect: [:ea | OBClassNode on: (Smalltalk at: ea)].	^ nodes asArray sort: [:a :b | a theClassName <= b theClassName]! !!OBClassRefSearchNode methodsFor: 'display' stamp: 'cwp 7/20/2007 22:23'!name	^ (super name copyWithFirst: $#) , ' (class refs)'! !!OBClassSearchNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'cwp 6/11/2009 12:45'!classSatisfiesQuery: aClass	| classQueried |	classQueried := aClass name.	query do: [:aQuery |		(classQueried includesSubstring: aQuery caseSensitive: false)			ifTrue: [classQueried := classQueried 						copyFrom: (classQueried indexOfSubCollection: aQuery) + aQuery size						to: classQueried size]			ifFalse:[^false]].	^true! !!OBClassSearchNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 11/13/2008 13:44'!classes	^ ((SystemNavigation default allClasses select: [ :ea | self classSatisfiesQuery: ea ]) collect: [ :ea | OBClassNode on: ea ]) asArray! !!OBClassSearchNode methodsFor: 'display' stamp: 'cb 7/19/2007 13:52'!name|name|	name := '*'.	query do: [:ea | name := name , ea, '*'].	^name, ' (classes)'! !!OBImplementorSearchNode methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 4/15/2007 20:40'!classSatisfiesQuery: aClass	^ aClass includesSelector: query! !!OBImplementorSearchNode methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 10/22/2008 09:44'!classes	^ (SystemNavigation default allClassesImplementing: query)		collect: [:ea | OBClassNode on: ea]! !!OBImplementorSearchNode methodsFor: 'display' stamp: 'dr 10/22/2008 09:15'!name	^super name, ' (implementors)'	! !!OBMethodSearchNode methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 10/22/2008 09:54'!classSatisfiesQuery: aClass	^ aClass selectors anySatisfy: [:ea | ea includesSubstring: query caseSensitive: true]! !!OBMethodSearchNode methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 10/22/2008 09:38'!classes	| nav classes |	nav := self systemNavigation.	classes := IdentitySet new.	(Symbol selectorsContaining: query) 		do: [:ea | classes addAll: (nav allClassesImplementing: ea)].	^ classes asArray collect: [:ea | OBClassNode on: ea]! !!OBMethodSearchNode methodsFor: 'display' stamp: 'cb 7/19/2007 21:18'!name	^ super name, '* (implementors)'! !!OBSearchNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 10/22/2008 09:38'!on: aString	^ self basicNew setRawQuery: aString! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'comparing' stamp: 'cwp 4/19/2007 00:36'!= other	^ self species = other species and: [self query = other query]! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'PDC 6/25/2007 21:23'!classSatisfiesQuery: aClass	self subclassResponsibility ! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'PDC 6/25/2007 21:19'!classes	self subclassResponsibility ! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'PDC 6/25/2007 21:16'!comments	^self classes collect: [:ea| ea theClass asCommentNode]! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'dr 10/20/2008 16:17'!displayString	^ self name.! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'comparing' stamp: 'cwp 4/19/2007 00:36'!hash	^ query hash! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'cwp 4/15/2007 20:31'!isAncestorOf: aNode	^ self = aNode or: [self classSatisfiesQuery: aNode theClass]! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'cwp 5/12/2007 23:12'!isAncestorOf: aNode using: aSelector	^ self = aNode or: [self classSatisfiesQuery: aNode theClass]! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'PDC 6/25/2007 21:17'!metaclasses	^self classes collect: [:ea| ea theMetaClass asClassSideNode]! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'display' stamp: 'cwp 4/7/2007 23:28'!name	^ query! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'cwp 4/15/2007 20:14'!nodesForRefs: refs		| classNames nodes |	classNames := refs collect: [:ea | ea classSymbol].	nodes := classNames asSet collect: [:ea | OBClassNode on: (Smalltalk at: ea)].	^ nodes asArray sort: [:a :b | a theClassName <= b theClassName]! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 4/8/2007 00:26'!query	^ query! !!OBSearchNode methodsFor: 'initialize-release' stamp: 'PDC 6/29/2007 06:37'!setRawQuery: aString 	query := aString! !!OBSenderSearchNode methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 4/15/2007 21:27'!classSatisfiesQuery: aClass	^ (SystemNavigation default allCallsOn: query from: aClass) isEmpty not! !!OBSenderSearchNode methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 4/15/2007 21:32'!classes	^ self nodesForRefs: (SystemNavigation default allCallsOn: query)	! !!OBSenderSearchNode methodsFor: 'display' stamp: 'cb 7/17/2007 11:53'!name	^ (super name copyWithFirst: $#) , ' (senders)'! !!OBSelectorNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:03' prior: 34944640!OBSelectorNode wraps an instance of Symbol. It typically serves as the root of a senders or implementors OBListBrowser, and is used when cmd-n or cmd-m is invoke from the definition panel, and so no OBMethodNode is available.!!OBSelectorNode class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 10/31/2004 01:11'!on: aSelector	^ self new selector: aSelector! !!OBSelectorNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 10/11/2006 20:56'!hasSelector	^ true! !!OBSelectorNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2004 23:48'!implementors	^ (SystemNavigation default allImplementorsOf: self selector) asSortedArray			collect: [:ref | OBMethodNode on: ref]! !!OBSelectorNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'DM 5/23/2007 18:20'!isAncestorOf: aNode 	^ (aNode source findString: selector string startingAt: 0 ) isNonZero.! !!OBSelectorNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'PDC 6/25/2007 22:55'!methods	methods ifNil: 			[methods := SystemNavigation default allMethodsNoDoitsSelect: 							[:m | 							m hasLiteralSuchThat: 									[:lit | 									lit isString and: 											[lit isSymbol not 												and: [lit includesSubstring: selector string caseSensitive: false]]]]].	^ methods collect: [:m | OBMethodNode on: m]! !!OBSelectorNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 10/31/2004 01:12'!name	^ selector printString! !!OBSelectorNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 7/18/2007 13:57'!reference    | references |    "this is a bit hacky actually..."    references := SystemNavigation default allImplementorsOf: selector.    references ifEmpty: [self error: 'No method with this selector exists!!'].    ^references first! !!OBSelectorNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 10/31/2004 01:11'!selector	^ selector! !!OBSelectorNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 10/31/2004 01:10'!selector: aSelector	selector := aSelector! !!OBSelectorNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 10/31/2004 01:12'!selectorAndMessages	^ Array with: self! !!OBSelectorNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 11/1/2004 02:22'!senders	^ (SystemNavigation default allCallsOn: self selector) asSortedArray			collect: [:ref | OBMessageNode on: self selector inMethodReference: ref]! !!OBSelectorNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 10/31/2004 01:48'!sendersOfMessage	^ (SystemNavigation default allCallsOn: self selector) asSortedArray			collect: [:ref | OBMessageNode on: self selector inMethodReference: ref]! !!ORAddMethodChangeNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 11/2/2009 00:02'!accept: aText notifying: aController	"Just to make sure that it compiles, try with the standard compiler."		| compilerClass |	compilerClass := self theClass isNil		ifTrue: [ Object compilerClass ]		ifFalse: [ self theClass compilerClass ].	compilerClass new		compile: aText asString in: self theClass		classified: nil notifying: aController		ifFail: [ ^ false ].	change 		class: change changeClass		protocol: change protocol		source: aText asString.	^ true! !!ORAddMethodChangeNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 11/1/2009 23:30'!after	^ ORChangesBrowser prettyPrint		ifTrue: [ change parseTree formattedCode ]		ifFalse: [ change source ]! !!ORAddMethodChangeNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 11/1/2009 23:42'!before	^ (self theClass isNil or: [ (self theClass includesSelector: self selector) not ]) 		ifTrue: [ String new ]		ifFalse: [			ORChangesBrowser prettyPrint				ifTrue: [ (self theClass parseTreeFor: self selector) formattedCode ]				ifFalse: [ self theClass sourceCodeAt: self selector ] ]! !!ORAddMethodChangeNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 1/31/2009 00:15'!browse	OBSystemBrowser openOnClass: self theClass selector: self selector! !!ORAddMethodChangeNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 1/31/2009 00:15'!selector	^ self change selector! !!ORChangeNode class methodsFor: 'instance-creation' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 18:15'!on: aRule	^ self new initializeOn: aRule! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 3/19/2008 16:49'!add: aNode to: aCollection	| node |	aNode change changes do: [ :each |		aNode change == each ifFalse: [ 			node := each asNode setParent: aNode.			aCollection addLast: node.			self add: node to: aCollection ] ].	^ aCollection! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 11/1/2009 23:40'!after	| text |	text := change printString.	(text endsWith: '!!')		ifTrue: [ text := text allButLast ].	^ (RBParser parseExpression: text)		formattedCode! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 11/1/2009 23:40'!before	^ String new! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 1/31/2009 00:18'!browse	OBSystemBrowser openOnClass: self theClass! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 18:16'!change	^ change! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 3/19/2008 16:48'!changes	^ self add: self to: OrderedCollection new! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 1/31/2009 00:04'!doItReceiver	^ self theClass isNil ifFalse: [ self theClass theNonMetaClass ]! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 3/19/2008 16:57'!indent	^ String new: (0 max: 2 * self level) withAll: Character space! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 3/19/2008 16:57'!indentedName	^ self indent , self name! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'lr 3/12/2008 09:15'!initializeOn: aChange	change := aChange! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 3/19/2008 16:57'!level	^ self parent isNil		ifTrue: [ -1 ]		ifFalse: [ self parent level + 1 ]! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 3/19/2008 16:51'!name	^ self change name! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dc 3/13/2008 17:55'!parent	^ parent! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'copying' stamp: 'lr 3/12/2008 10:09'!postCopy	super postCopy.	parent := nil! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 3/12/2008 10:02'!remove	self parent isNil ifTrue: [ ^ self ].	self parent remove: self! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 3/12/2008 10:08'!remove: aNode	self change removeChange: aNode change! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 11/12/2009 22:35'!selectedClass	^ self theClass! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'lr 3/12/2008 09:14'!setParent: aNode	parent := aNode! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 11/1/2009 23:41'!text	^ ORChangesBrowser displayDiffs		ifFalse: [ self after ]		ifTrue: [			TextDiffBuilder				buildDisplayPatchFrom: self before				to: self after ]! !!ORChangeNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 1/31/2009 00:03'!theClass	^ self change changeClass! !!OBCollectionNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:31' prior: 34944930!OBCollectionNode is a trivial wrapper for a collection of nodes. It is typically used as an artificial root node for metagraphs that have no natural root.!!OBCollectionNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 3/15/2004 23:17'!on: aCollection	^ self new setCollection: aCollection! !!OBCollectionNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 12/24/2007 02:48'!on: aCollection named: aString	^ (self on: aCollection)		name: aString;		yourself! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!addChild: aNode 	(collection includes: aNode) ifFalse: [ collection := collection copyWith: aNode ]! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 3/15/2004 23:19'!children	^ collection! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: '*ob-standard-testing' stamp: 'cb 7/18/2007 11:46'!hasOrganization	^ false! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: '*ob-standard-testing' stamp: 'cwp 4/1/2007 22:59'!hasSelector	^ false! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: '*ob-standard-testing' stamp: 'cwp 4/1/2007 23:00'!hasVersions	^ false! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'dr 9/18/2008 10:09'!isAncestorOf: aNode     ^ collection anySatisfy: [:ea | ea = aNode or: [ea isAncestorOf: aNode]]! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: '*ob-standard-testing' stamp: 'cwp 8/22/2009 11:19'!isCategoryNode	^ false! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: '*ob-standard-testing' stamp: 'cwp 8/22/2009 11:18'!isEnvironmentNode	^ false! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'cwp 12/24/2007 02:34'!name	^ name ifNil: [collection species name]! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!name: aString 	name := aString! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!removeChild: aNode 	(collection includes: aNode) ifTrue: [ collection := collection copyWithout: aNode ]! !!OBCollectionNode methodsFor: 'initalizing' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!setCollection: aCollection 	collection := aCollection! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'comparing' stamp: 'cwp 1/31/2004 14:57'!= other	^ self class = other class and: [self name = other name]! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'cwp 2/29/2004 13:49'!accept: aText notifying: aController	^ self text: aText! !!OBNode methodsFor: '*ob-morphic' stamp: 'cwp 3/2/2004 21:28'!acceptDroppedNode: aNode 	^ aNode perform: self dropSelector with: self! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'cwp 3/3/2004 00:44'!ancestrySelector	^ #isDescendantOf: ! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 09:34'!announce: anObject 	| announcer |	^ (announcer := OBAnnouncer current) isNil		ifFalse: [ announcer announce: anObject ]! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 3/13/2007 00:18'!announceChangedWith: anObject	anObject announce: (OBNodeChanged node: self)! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 12/16/2007 20:33'!announceChildrenChangedWith: anObject	anObject announce: (OBChildrenChanged node: self)! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 11/12/2007 23:07'!announceCreationWith: anObject	anObject announce: (OBNodeCreated node: self)! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 3/13/2007 00:21'!announceDeletionWith: anObject	anObject announce: (OBNodeDeleted node: self)! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 3/13/2007 00:34'!announceSelectionWith: anObject	(anObject announce: OBAboutToChange)		isVetoed ifFalse: [anObject announce: (OBSelectingNode node: self)]! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'jk 3/26/2008 13:19'!anyNavigation	^ self metaNode anyNavigation! !!OBNode methodsFor: '*ob-morphic' stamp: 'avi 2/20/2004 14:00'!asDraggableMorph	^(StringMorph contents: self name)		color: Color white;		yourself! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'converting' stamp: 'cwp 8/18/2007 18:09'!asFan	^ OBFan parent: self! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'dr 10/31/2008 16:21'!backgroundColor	^nil! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'cwp 8/20/2007 15:46'!childAncestorOf: aNode indexIn: aBlock 	^ self metaNode 		childOf: self		ancestorOf: aNode		indexIn: aBlock! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'dr 9/15/2008 11:46'!childNodes	^ metaNode childrenForNode: self! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'jk 3/28/2008 12:43'!columnAfter: anOBColumn withFan: anOBFan selection: aSmallInteger	| newIndex |	anOBFan restrictToNavigation: self navigation.	newIndex := anOBFan indexOf: self.	^ self navigation columnAfter: anOBColumn withFan: anOBFan selection: newIndex.! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 4/7/2008 11:32'!defaultChildNodes	^ metaNode defaultChildrenForNode: self! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'cwp 3/22/2004 20:48'!definition	^ self! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 01:06'!demandSelection	^ OBAnnouncer current announce: (OBNodeCreated node: self)! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'cwp 5/20/2007 01:57'!displayString	^ metaNode displayStringForNode: self! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'cwp 5/20/2007 20:02'!displayStringForChild: aNode	^ metaNode displayStringForParent: self child: aNode! !!OBNode methodsFor: '*ob-morphic' stamp: 'cwp 3/2/2004 21:29'!dropSelector	"Override in subclasses"		^ #dropOnNode: ! !!OBNode methodsFor: '*ob-sunitintegration' stamp: 'AdrianKuhn 12/22/2009 16:35'!hasTestSuite	^false! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'comparing' stamp: 'cwp 1/31/2004 14:57'!hash	^ self name hash! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'cwp 7/23/2007 01:45'!icon	^ metaNode iconForNode: self! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 7/18/2007 11:23'!icons    ^#()! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'cwp 5/11/2007 00:18'!isAncestorOf: aNode	^ self isAncestorOf: aNode using: self ancestrySelector! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'cwp 5/11/2007 00:53'!isAncestorOf: aNode using: aSelector	^ aNode perform: aSelector with: self! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'ancestry' stamp: 'cwp 3/3/2004 00:44'!isDescendantOf: aNode	^ false! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 3/3/2004 23:24'!metaNode	^ metaNode! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 9/17/2008 13:49'!metaNode: aMetaNode	metaNode := aMetaNode! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'cwp 12/10/2003 22:27'!name	self subclassResponsibility! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 3/26/2008 12:34'!navigation	^ navigation! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 3/26/2008 12:34'!navigation: anObject	navigation := anObject! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'cwp 5/18/2007 20:33'!noteChild: aNode	metaNode noteParent: self child: aNode! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'utility' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!referenceForMethod: selector ofClass: className 	| classIsMeta symbol |	classIsMeta := className endsWith: ' class'.	symbol := classIsMeta 		ifTrue: [ (className allButLast: 6) asSymbol ]		ifFalse: [ className ].	^ MethodReference new 		setClassSymbol: symbol		classIsMeta: classIsMeta		methodSymbol: selector		stringVersion: symbol , '>>' , selector! !!OBNode methodsFor: '*ob-shout-shout' stamp: 'dc 9/4/2008 17:40'!shouldBeStyledBy: aShoutMorph    aShoutMorph classOrMetaClass: nil.    ^false! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 12:15'!signalChanged	self announce: (OBNodeChanged node: self)! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 12:15'!signalChildrenChanged	self announce: (OBChildrenChanged node: self)! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 12:15'!signalDeletion	self announce: (OBNodeDeleted node: self)! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 13:59'!signalSelection	(self announce: OBAboutToChange)		isVetoed ifFalse: [self announce: (OBSelectingNode node: self)]! !!OBNode methodsFor: '*ob-sunitintegration' stamp: 'lr 2/17/2009 20:54'!testSuite	^ nil! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'cwp 12/7/2003 19:27'!text	^ ''! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'cwp 3/14/2004 14:09'!text: aText	^ false! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'cwp 2/29/2004 18:30'!textSelection	^ 1 to: 0! !!OBNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'cwp 8/28/2004 00:14'!title	^ nil! !!OBNode methodsFor: '*ob-morphic' stamp: 'cwp 3/2/2004 21:28'!wantsDroppedNode: aNode	^ aNode respondsTo: self dropSelector! !!ORBasicLintNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 1/17/2009 12:16'!browse	self result browserInstance open! !!ORBasicLintNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 10/22/2008 14:05'!result	^ result! !!ORBasicLintNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 7/16/2009 09:48'!text	| text |	text := String 		streamContents: [ :stream |			stream cr; cr.			self result isClassEnvironment				ifTrue: [					self result classNames asSortedCollection						do: [ :each | stream nextPutAll: each; cr ] ]				ifFalse: [					self result classesAndSelectorsDo: [ :class :selector |						stream nextPutAll: class name; nextPutAll: '>>'; print: selector; cr ] ] ]		limitedTo: 4096.	text size < 4096		ifFalse: [ text := text , '...' ]. 	^ super text , text! !!ORBasicLintNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 8/7/2009 12:58'!update: anEnvironment	result := rule filteredResult.	result isSelectorEnvironment ifTrue: [		result copy classesAndSelectorsDo: [ :class :selector |			(anEnvironment includesSelector: selector in: class)				ifFalse: [ result removeClass: class selector: selector ] ] ].	problemCount := result problemCount! !!ORCompositeLintNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 10/22/2008 13:48'!compositeRules	^ self rules select: [ :each | each isComposite ]! !!ORCompositeLintNode methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 16:46'!initializeOn: aRule	super initializeOn: aRule.	self update! !!ORCompositeLintNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 15:58'!isComposite	^ true! !!ORCompositeLintNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 10/22/2008 13:48'!leafRules	^ self rules reject: [ :each | each isComposite ]! !!ORCompositeLintNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 15:30'!rules	^ rules! !!ORCompositeLintNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 5/29/2008 14:41'!update	rules := rule rules collect: [ :each | each asNode ]! !!ORCompositeLintNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 10/22/2008 14:22'!update: anEnvironment	self rules do: [ :each | each update: anEnvironment ].	problemCount := self rules inject: 0 into: [ :result :each | result + each problemCount ]! !!ORLintNode class methodsFor: 'instance-creation' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 15:21'!on: aRule	^ self new initializeOn: aRule! !!ORLintNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 1/17/2009 12:16'!browse! !!ORLintNode methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'lr 10/22/2008 14:16'!initializeOn: aRule	rule := aRule.	problemCount := 0! !!ORLintNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 15:58'!isComposite	^ false! !!ORLintNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'djr 11/9/2008 13:17'!isEmpty	^ problemCount = 0! !!ORLintNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 15:23'!name	^ rule name! !!ORLintNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 10/22/2008 14:16'!problemCount	^ problemCount! !!ORLintNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 10/22/2008 13:50'!rationale	^ self rule rationale! !!ORLintNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 15:22'!rule	^ rule! !!ORLintNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/24/2009 19:56'!text	^ self name asText allBold , (self rationale isEmpty		ifFalse: [ String cr , String cr , self rationale ]		ifTrue: [ String new ])! !!ORLintNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 10/22/2008 14:04'!update: anEnvironment! !!ORTransformationLintNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 1/17/2009 12:16'!browse	self changes browserInstance open! !!ORTransformationLintNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 10/22/2008 14:09'!changes	^ changes! !!ORTransformationLintNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/24/2009 19:56'!text	^ super text , (String streamContents: [ :stream |		stream cr; cr.		self changes changes			do: [ :each | stream nextPutAll: each displayString; cr ] ])! !!ORTransformationLintNode methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 10/22/2008 14:17'!update: anEnvironment	changes := CompositeRefactoryChange named: self name.	changes changes: self rule changes.	problemCount := changes problemCount! !!OBNullNode methodsFor: 'navigation' stamp: 'jk 3/28/2008 13:26'!columnAfter: anOBColumn withFan: anOBFan selection: aSmallInteger 	| navigation |	navigation := anOBFan anyNavigation.	anOBFan restrictToNavigation: navigation.	^ navigation columnAfter: anOBColumn withFan: anOBFan selection: aSmallInteger.! !!OBPanel commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:23' prior: 34945140!A panel is an object that manages part of the browser's window. It provides a protocol for receiving notifications when the current domain node changes, and reacts to these changes.!!OBColumnPanel commentStamp: 'cwp 12/6/2004 23:50' prior: 34945384!OBColumnPanel handles navigation around the nodes of the object graph. It maintains a list of columns, which track the user's path through the node tree. As nodes are selected, additional columns are added to the list, which appear as panes on the right of the panel. iVars:columns	- A collection of OBColumns, each of which manages a single pane in the scroller.minPanes - The minimum number of panes that should ever be visible.maxPanes - The maximum number of panes that should ever be visible.!!OBColumnPanel class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'dr 11/17/2008 16:30'!minPanes: min maxPanes: max	^ self basicNew setMinPanes: min maxPanes: max! !!OBColumnPanel class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'dr 11/17/2008 16:30'!new	^ self minPanes: 1 maxPanes: 1 ! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 23:46'!buildOn: aBuilder 	^aBuilder scroller: self with: [columns do: [:ea | ea buildOn: aBuilder]]! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing columns' stamp: 'lr 3/21/2009 20:02'!clearAfter: aColumn 	| start |	aColumn isNil ifTrue: [ ^ self ].	start := (columns indexOf: aColumn) + 1.	start 		to: columns size		do: [ :i | (columns at: i) clear ]! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing columns' stamp: 'cwp 2/28/2006 18:12'!columnAfter: aColumn 	^ [self columns after: aColumn]		on: Error		do: [:err | nil]! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing columns' stamp: 'cwp 2/28/2006 19:07'!columnBefore: aColumn 	^ self columnBefore: aColumn ifAbsent: [nil]! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing columns' stamp: 'dr 11/12/2008 16:24'!columnBefore: aColumn ifAbsent: aBlock	^ [self columns before: aColumn]		on: Error 		do: [:err | aBlock value]! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'constructing' stamp: 'dr 9/24/2008 10:42'!columnClass   ^OBColumn! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/16/2004 21:46'!columns	^columns! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/16/2004 21:46'!columns: anObject	columns := anObject! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing columns' stamp: 'cwp 11/16/2004 22:22'!currentColumn	^self columns reversed detect: [:ea | ea hasSelection] ifNone: []! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 7/19/2007 00:55'!currentNode	^ current! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 11/4/2008 19:59'!currentOrRootNode	^ current ifNil: [root] ! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 11/26/2004 21:55'!defaultBackgroundColor	^ browser defaultBackgroundColor! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing columns' stamp: 'cwp 11/16/2004 23:01'!emptyColumn	^ OBColumn inPanel: self! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 11/4/2008 19:59'!hasSelection	^ false   ! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'dr 11/10/2008 16:11'!hopTo: aNode 	| column |	column := self columns last.	[ column		refreshAndSignal: false;		includesNode: aNode ] whileFalse: 		[ column := self 			columnBefore: column			ifAbsent: [ ^ self jumpTo: aNode ] ].	column select: aNode.! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 11/4/2008 19:58'!isNavigation	^ true ! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'constructing' stamp: 'cwp 2/25/2007 20:40'!isVariableHeight	^ true! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'dr 10/24/2008 15:03'!jumpTo: aNode 	| column |	self selectAncestorsOf: aNode.	column := self columns reversed 				detect: [:ea | ea selectedNode = aNode] 				ifNone: [^ self].	self clearAfter: column next.	self announcer announce: (OBSelectionChanged column: column)! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 11/16/2004 23:34'!jumpToRoot	^ self columns first selection: 0! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 8/19/2009 22:26'!labelString	| node |	self columns reverseDo: [ :each |		node := each selectedNode.		(node notNil and: [ node title notNil ])			ifTrue: [ ^ node title ] ].	^ nil! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/16/2004 23:29'!maxPanes	^maxPanes! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/16/2004 22:54'!minPanes	^ minPanes! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 10:32'!nodeDeleted: ann 	ann node = self root ifFalse: [ ^ self ].	current := nil.	self columns first clear.	self announcer announce: (OBSelectionChanged column: self)! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2004 00:52'!okToReclaimPane	columns size > minPanes ifFalse: [^ false].	^ columns last isEmpty or: [(columns at: columns size - 1) shouldBeLast].! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing columns' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 00:39'!popColumn	self announcer unsubscribe: self columns removeLast.! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing columns' stamp: 'dr 9/24/2008 11:12'!pushColumn: aColumn	self columns addLast: aColumn. 	self changed: #columns.! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 5/28/2007 01:35'!reclaimPanes	| old |	old := columns size.	[self okToReclaimPane] whileTrue: [self popColumn].	columns size = old ifFalse: [self changed: #columns]! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'dr 11/4/2008 19:59'!root	^root! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 08:31'!selectAncestorsOf: aNode 	| subtree |	subtree := OBSubtree 		from: root		to: aNode.	subtree isNil ifFalse: [ self selectSubtree: subtree ]! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 10/21/2008 09:52'!selectNode: announcement	^ self hopTo: announcement node! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 8/19/2007 23:05'!selectSubtree: aSubtree	aSubtree selectInColumns: columns! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing columns' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 09:29'!selected: aColumn 	| next |	(next := aColumn next) isNil		ifFalse: [ next parent: aColumn selectedNode ]! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 3/11/2007 21:08'!selectedNode	^ self currentNode! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 9/18/2008 10:53'!selectionChanged: ann	current := ann column selectedNode.	self selectionChangedIn: ann column! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 7/19/2007 00:13'!selectionChangedIn: aColumn	aColumn hasSelection		ifTrue: [self selected: aColumn]		ifFalse: [self clearAfter: aColumn].	self reclaimPanes.! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 11/13/2008 13:38'!selectionPath	^ ((self columns collect: [ :e | e parent ]) select: [ :e | e notNil ]) allButFirst! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode 	root := aNode.	root metaNode: aMetaNode.	self pushColumn: (OBColumn 			inPanel: self			metaNode: aMetaNode			node: root).	minPanes - self columns size timesRepeat: [ self pushColumn: self emptyColumn ]! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!setMinPanes: min maxPanes: max 	columns := OrderedCollection new.	minPanes := min.	maxPanes := max! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 11/18/2004 00:00'!sizing	^ (columns size max: minPanes) min: maxPanes! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 6/5/2006 01:32'!subscribe	self announcer		observe: OBSelectingNode send: #selectNode: to: self;		observe: OBSelectionChanged send: #selectionChanged: to: self;		observe: OBNodeCreated send: #selectNode: to: self;		observe: OBNodeDeleted send: #nodeDeleted: to: self.! !!OBColumnPanel methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 3/18/2007 20:36'!vResizing	^ #spaceFill! !!OBFixedButtonPanel commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:35' prior: 34945955!OBFixedButtonPanel displays a horizontal row of buttons. In contrast to OBVarButtonPanel, the buttons do not change as nodes are selected in the navigation panel; instead they are enabled and disabled according to whether the actions they represent are applicable to the selected node.!!OBFixedButtonPanel class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 2/28/2006 10:41'!new	^ self basicNew initialize! !!OBFixedButtonPanel methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 23:52'!buildOn: aBuilder 	^aBuilder fixedButtonBar: self with: []! !!OBFixedButtonPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 1/30/2009 17:29'!color	^browser defaultBackgroundColor ! !!OBFixedButtonPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!commands	| commands node buttons grouped groups |	node := self currentNode.	node ifNil: 		[ ^ #() ].	commands := (self announce: OBNodeCommandScan) 		commandsOn: node		for: self.	buttons := commands select: [ :ea | ea wantsButton ].	groups := (buttons collect: [ :ea | ea group ]) asSet asSortedCollection: [ :a :b | a > b ].	grouped := groups collect: 		[ :ea | 		(buttons select: [ :b | b group = ea ]) asSortedCollection: [ :a :b | a order <= b order ] ].	^ grouped gather: [ :ea | ea ]! !!OBFixedButtonPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 3/11/2007 21:15'!currentNode	^ browser currentOrRootNode ! !!OBFixedButtonPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 3/11/2007 21:14'!isSelected: aNode	^ true! !!OBFixedButtonPanel methodsFor: 'constructing' stamp: 'cwp 2/25/2007 20:40'!isVariableHeight	^ false! !!OBFixedButtonPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 3/11/2007 21:14'!selectionChanged: ann	self changed: #commands! !!OBFixedButtonPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'avi 12/4/2007 10:48'!subscribe	self announcer		observe: OBSelectionChanged		send: #selectionChanged:		to: self.	self announcer		observe: OBNodeChanged		send: #selectionChanged:		to: self.! !!OBFixedButtonPanel methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 3/18/2007 22:16'!vResizing	^ #rigid! !!OBPanel class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 8/31/2004 10:46'!inBrowser: aBrowser	^ self new browser: aBrowser! !!OBPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 10/13/2006 09:29'!announce: aClass 	^ self browser announce: aClass! !!OBPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 4/17/2006 15:52'!announcer	^ browser announcer! !!OBPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/16/2004 21:58'!browser	^ browser! !!OBPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!browser: aBrowser 	browser := aBrowser.	self subscribe! !!OBPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/18/2008 15:28'!definitionPanel    ^nil! !!OBPanel methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 5/24/2007 12:20'!isDefinition   ^false! !!OBPanel methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 11/20/2004 21:09'!isNavigation	^ false! !!OBPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 4/17/2006 19:36'!subscribe! !!OBAnnotationPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'lr 5/2/2007 17:23'!accept: aString notifying: aController	^ false! !!OBAnnotationPanel methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 23:57'!buildOn: aBuilder 	^aBuilder textfield: self with: []! !!OBAnnotationPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 4/11/2008 13:45'!environment	^ Smalltalk! !!OBAnnotationPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'lr 5/2/2007 17:20'!selection	^ 1 to: 0! !!OBAnnotationPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 08:20'!selectionChanged: ann 	text := ann node isNil 		ifTrue: [ String new ]		ifFalse: [ ann node annotationString ].	self changed: #text! !!OBAnnotationPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'lr 5/2/2007 17:17'!subscribe	self announcer 		observe: OBSelectionChanged		send: #selectionChanged:		to: self! !!OBAnnotationPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'lr 5/2/2007 17:21'!text	^ text! !!OBAnnotationPanel methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'lr 5/2/2007 17:19'!vResizing	^ #rigid! !!OBDefinitionPanel commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:35' prior: 34946306!OBDefinition serves as the model for the text pane of a typical browser. It's main responsibility is to act as a relay between a PluggableTextMorph and a Definition supplied by the currently selected node.iVars:browser - The browser of which this panel is a part.!!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'MAD 1/22/2008 10:56'!aboutToChange: ann	| ok |	self canDiscardEdits ifTrue: [^ true].	ok := OBConfirmationRequest			prompt: 'Changes have not been saved.Is it OK to discard those changes?'			confirm: 'Discard changes'.	(ok isNil not and: [ok])		ifTrue: [self changed: #clearUserEdits]		ifFalse: [ann veto]! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 3/3/2007 23:11'!aboutToChangeSilently: ann	self canDiscardEdits ifFalse: [ann veto]! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 00:41'!accept: aText notifying: aController	^ self 		withDefinitionDo: [:def | [def accept: aText notifying: aController]									on: OBAnnouncerRequest									do: [:notification | notification resume: self announcer]]		ifNil: [true]! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: '*ob-shout' stamp: 'dc 8/24/2007 12:34'!addItem: classAndMethod	"Used by the system when the user clicks on a link in a class comment. For example see class comment of SystemProgressMorph and click on displayProgressAt:from:to:during:."	|tokens class methodNode|	tokens := classAndMethod findTokens: Character space.	tokens size ~= 2 ifTrue: [^ self].	class := Smalltalk classNamed: tokens first.	class ifNil: [^ self].	methodNode := OBMethodNode on: tokens second inClass: class.	methodNode browse! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 23:48'!buildOn: aBuilder 	^aBuilder textarea: self with: []! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 11/19/2008 16:09'!definition: aDefinition	definition := aDefinition. 	selection := nil.	self changed: #text! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 11/19/2008 16:10'!definitionChanged: ann 	definition := ann definition.	self changed: #text! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/18/2008 15:28'!definitionPanel    ^self! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 3/23/2004 00:23'!doItContext	^ self 		withDefinitionDo: [:def | (def respondsTo: #doItContext) ifTrue: [def doItContext]]		ifNil: [nil]! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 3/23/2004 00:23'!doItReceiver	^ self 		withDefinitionDo: [:def | (def respondsTo: #doItReceiver) ifTrue: [def doItReceiver]]		ifNil: [nil]! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 4/19/2007 21:56'!environment	^ self selectedClass environment! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 09:29'!getDefinition	| node |	^ (node := browser currentNode) isNil		ifFalse: [ node definition ]! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 7/10/2008 14:40'!isDefinition    ^true! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 9/26/2008 11:58'!isEditable     "there's no reason why a def panel shouldn't always be readable"	^true! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 08:31'!node: aNode 	self definition: (aNode isNil ifFalse: [ aNode definition ])! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 11/4/2008 19:47'!nodeChanged: ann	self node: ann node! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 11/19/2008 15:58'!refresh: announcement	| oldDefinition | 	definition ifNil: [^ self].	oldDefinition := definition.	definition := self getDefinition ifNil: [oldDefinition].	definition text = oldDefinition text ifTrue: [^ self].	self canDiscardEdits			ifTrue: [self changed: #text]			ifFalse: [self changed: #codeChangedElsewhere]! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 11/4/2008 19:53'!selectedClass	^ self 		withDefinitionDo: [:def | (def respondsTo: #selectedClass) ifTrue: [def selectedClass]] 		ifNil: [nil]   ! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'lr 2/9/2008 11:17'!selection	^ selection ifNil: [ selection := self withDefinitionDo: [ :def | def textSelection ] ifNil: [ 1 to: 0 ] ]! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'lr 2/9/2008 11:17'!selection: anInterval	selection := anInterval.	self changed: #selection! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 11/19/2008 16:10'!selectionChanged: ann	self node: ann column selectedNode! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: '*ob-shout' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 11:23'!shoutAboutToStyle: aPluggableShoutMorph 	| node |	^ (node := browser currentNode) isNil		ifFalse: [ node shouldBeStyledBy: aPluggableShoutMorph ]		ifTrue: [ false ]! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 12/11/2007 17:52'!subscribe	self announcer 		observe: OBAboutToChange		send: #aboutToChange:		to: self;				observe: OBAboutToChangeSilently		send: #aboutToChangeSilently:		to: self;				observe: OBSelectionChanged		send: #selectionChanged:		to: self;						observe: OBNodeChanged		send: #nodeChanged:		to: self;								observe: OBRefreshRequired		send: #refresh:		to: self;							observe: OBDefinitionChanged		send: #definitionChanged: 		to: self.! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 11/19/2008 16:21'!text	^ self withDefinitionDo: [:def | def text] ifNil: ['']! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dc 6/1/2007 12:10'!vResizing	^ #spaceFill! !!OBDefinitionPanel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 3/22/2004 20:41'!withDefinitionDo: workBlock ifNil: nilBlock	definition ifNil: [ ^ nilBlock value].	^ workBlock value: definition! !!OBMercuryPanel class methodsFor: 'class initialization' stamp: 'lr 1/31/2009 14:10'!initialize	"OBMercuryPanel initialize"	Preferences 		addPreference: #mercuryPanel		categories: #('browsing')		default: false		balloonHelp: 'Adds the mercury panel to OmniBrowser. This panel is the one on top to search senders, implementors, classes...'! !!OBMercuryPanel class methodsFor: 'class initialization' stamp: 'dr 10/18/2008 10:34'!unload    	Preferences removePreference: #mercuryPanel! !!OBMercuryPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 10/20/2008 18:08'!accept: aText notifying: anObject  	aText asString withBlanksTrimmed ifEmpty: [^self].	OBMercuryQuery find: aText for: self.	self changed: #text! !!OBMercuryPanel methodsFor: 'user interface' stamp: 'cwp 4/19/2007 22:30'!addTextCommandsToMenu: aMenu selection: aTextSelection! !!OBMercuryPanel methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 8/16/2007 11:40'!buildOn: aBuilder 	^ aBuilder textfield: self with: []! !!OBMercuryPanel methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'cwp 7/20/2007 00:33'!environment	^ Smalltalk! !!OBMercuryPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 2/25/2007 19:44'!selection	^ 1 to: 0! !!OBMercuryPanel methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'cwp 3/3/2007 00:28'!string: aString	self systemNavigation browseMethodsWithString: aString! !!OBMercuryPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 2/25/2007 19:43'!text	^ ''! !!OBMercuryPanel methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 3/18/2007 20:54'!vResizing	^ #rigid! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: 'user interface' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!addEditingItemsToMenu: aMenu shifted: aBoolean 	| items |	items := aBoolean 		ifTrue: [ self shiftedYellowButtonMenu ]		ifFalse: [ self yellowButtonMenu ].	items do: 		[ :ea | 		ea = #- 			ifFalse: 				[ aMenu 					add: ea first					action: ea second ]			ifTrue: [ aMenu addLine ] ]! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: 'user interface' stamp: 'cwp 4/19/2007 21:35'!addMoreToMenu: aMenu	aMenu addLine.	aMenu		add: 'more...' translated		action: #shiftedTextPaneMenuRequest! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!addTextCommandsToMenu: aMenu selection: aTextSelection 	| scan |	scan := self announce: OBTextCommandScan.	scan 		populateMenu: aMenu		withNodes: {  aTextSelection  }		forRequestor: self! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: 'user interface' stamp: 'cwp 12/26/2007 09:30'!allowsEditing	^ true! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: '*ob-standard-cmds' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 22:11'!browseIt: aSymbol	| entry |	entry := self environment at: aSymbol ifAbsent: [nil].	entry ifNil: [^ self implementorsOfIt: aSymbol].	((entry isKindOf: Class) or: [entry isKindOf: Trait]) ifFalse: [entry := entry class].	OBCodeBrowser defaultBrowserClass openOnClass: entry.	^ true! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: '*ob-standard-cmds' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 22:14'!environment	^ Smalltalk! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: '*ob-standard-cmds' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2007 01:04'!implementorsOfIt: aSelector 	| node |	node := OBSelectorNode on: aSelector.	(self announce: (OBShowImplementors of: node)) execute.	^true! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 12/26/2007 13:35'!isEditable	^ true! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 10/20/2008 16:44'!menu: aMenu shifted: aBoolean selection: aTextSelection 	self addEditingItemsToMenu: aMenu shifted: aBoolean.	self addTextCommandsToMenu: aMenu selection: aTextSelection.	self addMoreToMenu: aMenu.	^ aMenu ! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!perform: aSelector orSendTo: anObject 	| receiver |	receiver := (self respondsTo: aSelector) 		ifTrue: [ self ]		ifFalse: [ anObject ].	receiver perform: aSelector! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: '*ob-standard-cmds' stamp: 'dr 11/14/2008 11:16'!referencesToIt: aClassName 	| class | 	class := self environment at: aClassName ifAbsent: [^false].	class isBehavior ifFalse: [^false].	OBReferencesBrowser browseRoot: (OBClassNode on: class).	^true! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: '*ob-standard-cmds' stamp: 'cwp 8/24/2007 01:08'!sendersOfIt: aSelector 	| node |	node := OBSelectorNode on: aSelector.	(self announce: (OBShowSenders of: node)) execute.	^true! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: 'user interface' stamp: 'cwp 7/1/2007 16:56'!shiftedYellowButtonMenu	^ Array streamContents:		[:stream |		stream			nextPut: (Array with: 'explain' translated with: #explain);			nextPut: #-;			nextPut: (Array 						with: 'selectors containing it (W)' translated 						with: #methodNamesContainingIt);			nextPut: (Array 						with: 'method strings with it (E)' translated 						with: #methodStringsContainingit);			nextPut: (Array 						with: 'method source with it' translated 						with: #methodSourceContainingIt);			nextPut: (Array 						with: 'class names containing it' translated 						with: #classNamesContainingIt);			nextPut: (Array 						with: 'class comments with it' translated 						with: #classCommentsContainingIt);			nextPut: (Array 						with: 'change sets with it' translated 						with:  #browseChangeSetsWithSelector);			nextPut: #-;			nextPut: (Array with: 'save contents to file...' translated with: #saveContentsInFile);			nextPut: #-;			nextPut: (Array with: 'more...' translated with: #yellowButtonActivity)]! !!OBTextPanel methodsFor: 'user interface' stamp: 'lr 2/4/2008 08:49'!yellowButtonMenu	^ Array streamContents:		[:stream |		stream 				nextPut: (Array with: 'find...(f)' translated with: #find);			nextPut: (Array with: 'find again (g)' translated with: #findAgain);			nextPut: (Array with: 'set search string (h)' translated with: #setSearchString);			nextPut: #-;			nextPut: (Array with: 'do again (j)' translated with: #again);			nextPut: (Array with: 'undo (z)' translated with: #undo);			nextPut: #-;			nextPut: (Array with: 'copy (c)' translated with: #copySelection);			nextPut: (Array with: 'cut (x)' translated with: #cut);			nextPut: (Array with: 'paste (v)' translated with: #paste);			nextPut: (Array with: 'paste...' translated with: #pasteRecent);			nextPut: #-;			nextPut: (Array with: 'do it (d)' translated with: #doIt);			nextPut: (Array with: 'print it (p)' translated with: #printIt);			nextPut: (Array with: 'inspect it (i)' translated with: #inspectIt);			nextPut: (Array with: 'explore it (I)' translated with: #exploreIt);			nextPut: (Array with: 'debug it' translated with: #debugIt);			nextPut: #-;			nextPut: (Array with: 'accept (s)' translated with: #accept);			nextPut: (Array with: 'cancel (l)' translated with: #cancel)]! !!OBMorphicPlatform class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/1/2007 16:10'!default	^ self new! !!OBMorphicPlatform class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2009 21:54'!initialize	OBPlatform current: self new! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2009 22:16'!builder	^ OBMorphBuilder new! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'preferences' stamp: 'cwp 8/20/2009 08:17'!enableGently: aSymbol	Preferences enableGently: aSymbol! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'interaction' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2009 23:30'!handleBrowseRequest: request	^ (OBPlatform current build: request browser) openInWorld! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'interaction' stamp: 'dc 9/18/2007 10:48'!handleChoiceRequest: request	^ UIManager default		chooseFrom: request labels		values: request values		lines: request lines		title: (request prompt ifNil: [''])! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'interaction' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 09:38'!handleCloseRequest: request 	(SystemWindow allInstances 		detect: [ :ea | ea model = request browser ]		ifNone: [ ^ nil ]) delete! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'interaction' stamp: 'DamienCassou 10/14/2009 09:48'!handleConfirmationRequest: request	|choice|	choice := UIManager default		chooseFrom: {request okChoice. request cancelChoice}		values: {true. false}		title: request prompt.	^ choice		ifNil: [false]		ifNotNil: [choice]! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'interaction' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 10:35'!handleDirectoryRequest: request 	| fileDirectory |	fileDirectory := UIManager default chooseDirectory.	fileDirectory isNil ifTrue: [ ^ nil ].	^ fileDirectory pathName! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'interaction' stamp: 'lr 7/4/2009 16:43'!handleInformRequest: anOBInformRequest 	UIManager default inform: anOBInformRequest message! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'interaction' stamp: 'lr 7/4/2009 16:43'!handleMultiLineTextRequest: request	^ UIManager default			multiLineRequest: request prompt			centerAt: Sensor cursorPoint			initialAnswer: request template			answerHeight: 200! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'interaction' stamp: 'lr 10/11/2009 12:18'!handleMultipleChoiceRequest: aRequest	| menu |	aRequest values isEmpty		ifTrue: [ ^ aRequest values ].	menu := MenuMorph new.	menu stayUp: true.	aRequest prompt isEmptyOrNil		ifFalse: [ menu addTitle: aRequest prompt ].	aRequest values do: [ :value |		menu			addUpdating: #label: target: aRequest selector: #toggleMorphic:			argumentList: (Array with: value) ].	menu addLine.	menu add: 'ok' target: menu selector: #delete.	menu invokeModal.	^ aRequest selection asArray! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'interaction' stamp: 'DamienCassou 9/20/2009 15:55'!handleTextRequest: request	| text |	text := UIManager default				request:request prompt				initialAnswer: request template.	^ (text isNil or: [text isEmpty])		ifTrue: [nil]		ifFalse: [text]! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'interaction' stamp: 'lr 5/14/2008 15:42'!handleWaitRequest: request	^ Cursor wait showWhile: request block! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'preferences' stamp: 'cwp 7/1/2007 16:46'!menuWithIcons	^ Preferences menuWithIcons! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'preferences' stamp: 'cwp 7/1/2007 16:41'!optionalButtons	^ Preferences optionalButtons ! !!OBMorphicPlatform methodsFor: 'preferences' stamp: 'cwp 7/1/2007 17:09'!setPreference: aSymbol toValue: anObject	^ Preferences setPreference: aSymbol toValue: anObject! !!OBShoutPlatform class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2009 23:32'!initialize	OBPlatform current: self new! !!OBShoutPlatform methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2009 22:18'!builder	^ OBShoutBuilder new! !!OBPlatform class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 6/1/2007 16:08'!current	^ Current ifNil: [self default]! !!OBPlatform class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!current: aPlatform 	Current := aPlatform! !!OBPlatform class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2009 21:54'!default	self subclassResponsibility ! !!OBPlatform methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2009 22:11'!build: anObject	^ self builder build: anObject! !!OBPlatform methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2009 22:11'!builder	self subclassResponsibility! !!OBPosition methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'jk 3/22/2008 19:04'!clearSelection	self index: 0! !!OBPosition methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'jk 3/22/2008 18:53'!hasSelection	^ self index > 0! !!OBPosition methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 3/22/2008 19:05'!index	^ index ifNil: [ index := 0 ]! !!OBPosition methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 3/22/2008 19:02'!index: anObject	index := anObject! !!OBPosition methodsFor: 'printing' stamp: 'lr 11/13/2008 13:38'!printOn: aStream 	aStream		nextPutAll: self className;		nextPutAll: '<'.	self index printOn: aStream.	aStream nextPut: $>! !!OBPosition methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'jk 3/22/2008 20:12'!selection	^ self index! !!OBPosition methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'jk 3/22/2008 20:24'!selection: aSmallInteger 	self index: aSmallInteger! !!OBSubtree class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 8/19/2007 13:15'!from: root to: leaf	^ self new initializeWithRoot: root leaf: leaf! !!OBSubtree methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 12/5/2008 15:59'!childOf: current ancestorOf: leaf indexOn: stream 	| fan |	fan := current asFan. 	stream nextPut: fan.           	^fan ancestorOf: leaf in: [:index | stream nextPut: index] ! !!OBSubtree methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 08:31'!initializeWithRoot: root leaf: leaf 	| current |	state := Array streamContents: 		[ :stream | 		current := self 			childOf: root			ancestorOf: leaf			indexOn: stream.		[ current isNil or: [ current = leaf ] ] whileFalse: 			[ current := self 				childOf: current				ancestorOf: leaf				indexOn: stream ].		current isNil ifFalse: 			[ current metaNode hasChildren ifTrue: 				[ stream					nextPut: current asFan;					nextPut: 0 ] ] ].	^ current isNil ifFalse: [ self ]! !!OBSubtree methodsFor: 'printing' stamp: 'jk 4/2/2008 12:48'!printOn: aStream	aStream		nextPutAll: 'Subtree< '.	self state readStream do: [ :e | e printOn: aStream. aStream nextPut: Character space].	aStream		nextPut: $>! !!OBSubtree methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'lr 3/21/2009 20:02'!selectInColumns: aCollection 	| column stream col |	column := aCollection first.	stream := state readStream.	stream atEnd ifFalse: 		[ column 			fan: stream next			selection: stream next ].	[ stream atEnd ] whileFalse: 		[ column := (col := column 			nextColumnWithFan: stream next			selection: stream next) isNil 			ifTrue: [ column next ]			ifFalse: [ col ] ]! !!OBSubtree methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 12/5/2008 15:57'!state	^ state ! !!OBSwitch class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 5/17/2007 23:47'!inColumn: aColumn 	^ self basicNew setColumn: aColumn filter: nil.! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 10/21/2008 13:34'!buildOn: aBuilder	^aBuilder radioButtonBar: self with: []! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 7/14/2007 10:18'!currentNode: aNode	self changed: #list! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 5/18/2007 00:06'!filter	^ filter! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'lr 3/21/2009 20:02'!filter: aFilter 	filter := aFilter.	filter isNil ifTrue: [ ^ self ].	filter activate.	self changed: #list! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 5/17/2007 21:41'!isActive	^ filter notNil! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 7/19/2007 15:17'!isEnabled: aButtonModel    ^true! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 08:31'!list	^ filter isNil 		ifFalse: [ filter listForNode: column selectedNode ]		ifTrue: 			[ #() ]! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dkh 3/21/2009 13:49'!longDescriptions	^ filter 		ifNotNil: [filter longDescriptionsForNode: column selectedNode]		ifNil: [#()]! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'lr 12/3/2009 19:03'!okToChange	^ column okToChange! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 5/18/2007 21:45'!refresh	self changed: #selection! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'lr 3/4/2009 08:31'!selection	^ filter isNil 		ifFalse: [ filter selection ]		ifTrue: [ 0 ]! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'lr 3/21/2009 20:02'!selection: anInteger 	filter isNil ifTrue: [ ^ self ].	filter selection: anInteger.	self changed: #selection.	column listChanged! !!OBSwitch methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 22:27'!setColumn: aColumn filter: aFilter 	column := aColumn.	filter := aFilter! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:35' prior: 34946645!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor implements the protocol expected by the SystemBrowser app registry, and thus allows OmniBrowser to be chosen as the default system browser. Caveat: because the required protocol is a little ...odd.... it can't be implemented well by OBSystemBrowser directly. OBSystemBrowserAdaptor does this reasonably well, but it has no way to provide a more natural name than its class name to the app registry menu.!!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 7/19/2007 16:34'!browserClass    ^OBSystemBrowser! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor class methodsFor: 'registry protocol' stamp: 'dr 7/19/2007 16:34'!fullOnClass: aClass selector: aSelector	^ self browserClass 		openOnClass: aClass		selector: aSelector! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 22:01'!initialize	self register! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 9/28/2009 09:21'!nameForViewer	^ 'OmniBrowser'! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor class methodsFor: 'registry protocol' stamp: 'dr 7/19/2007 16:35'!open	self browserClass open! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor class methodsFor: 'registry protocol' stamp: 'dr 7/19/2007 16:35'!openBrowser	self browserClass open! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor class methodsFor: 'registry protocol' stamp: 'dr 7/19/2007 16:35'!openBrowserView: adaptor label: ignored 	^ self browserClass 		openOnClass: adaptor targetClass 		selector: adaptor selector! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 21:52'!register	Smalltalk at: #SystemBrowser ifPresent: [:class | class register: self]! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'cwp 9/28/2009 01:25'!unload    	self unregister! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 21:53'!unregister	Smalltalk at: #SystemBrowser ifPresent: [:class | class unregister: self]! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor methodsFor: 'registry protocol' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 21:50'!labelString	^ 'System Browser'! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor methodsFor: 'registry protocol' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 21:49'!openEditString: anUndefinedObject 	^ self! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 21:55'!selector	^ selector! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor methodsFor: 'registry protocol' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 21:49'!setClass: aClass selector: aSelector 	class := aClass.	selector := aSelector! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'dc 4/24/2007 15:09'!spawnHierarchy	^ OBHierarchyBrowser openOnClass: self targetClass ! !!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 4/24/2007 18:05'!targetClass	^class! !!OBTextSelection class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 10/13/2006 16:52'!on: anOBPluggableTextMorph 	^ self new! !!OBTextSelection class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 10/14/2006 20:10'!on: anInterval inText: aString	^ self new setSelection: anInterval inText: aString! !!OBTextSelection class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 10/14/2006 20:59'!onAllOf: aString 	^ self on: (1 to: aString size) inText: aString! !!OBTextSelection methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 10/14/2006 20:15'!fullText	^ text! !!OBTextSelection methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 10/14/2006 20:44'!hasSelector	^ self selector notNil! !!OBTextSelection methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 12/11/2009 14:04'!selection	^ selection! !!OBTextSelection methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 10/14/2006 21:31'!selector	^ self text asString findSelector! !!OBTextSelection methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 9/1/2008 10:23'!setSelection: anInterval inText: aString	selection := anInterval.	text := aString ! !!OBTextSelection methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 10/14/2006 20:14'!text	^ text atAll: selection! !!Object methodsFor: '*omnibrowser-converting' stamp: 'cwp 4/17/2006 12:16'!asAnnouncement	^ self! !!BorderedSubpaneDividerMorph methodsFor: '*ob-morphic' stamp: 'cwp 7/23/2007 02:09'!styleWith: aBuilder	self vResizing = #spaceFill 		ifTrue: [aBuilder styleVerticalDivider: self]		ifFalse: [aBuilder styleHorizontalDivider: self]! !!ClassOrganizer methodsFor: '*ob-standard-testing' stamp: 'cwp 9/18/2004 23:59'!isClassOrganizer	^ true! !!TraitDescription methodsFor: '*ob-standard-converting' stamp: 'lr 2/19/2009 15:26'!asCommentNode	^ OBClassCommentNode on: self baseTrait! !!TraitDescription methodsFor: '*ob-standard' stamp: 'lr 3/29/2009 16:37'!browserIcon	^ nil! !!OBPluggableListMorph commentStamp: 'dr 7/18/2007 14:27' prior: 34947142!I am a special kind of PluggableListMorph and provides methods to access icons for list elements. I use OBLazyListMorph as listMorphClass!!OBPluggableListMorph methodsFor: 'model access' stamp: 'cwp 7/24/2007 00:12'!iconAt: index	^ model iconAt: index! !!OBPluggableListMorph methodsFor: 'list management' stamp: 'lr 4/3/2009 13:26'!listMorphClass	^ OBLazyListMorph! !!OBPluggableListMorph methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'lr 5/4/2009 20:25'!mouseUp: event	"Override a change in PLM that breaks OmniBrowser. This version of the method	is from Squeak 3.7 and was originally stamped: 'ls 6/22/2001 22:49'"	| row previousSelectionIndex icon |	row := self rowAtLocation: event position.	"aMorph ifNotNil: [aMorph highlightForMouseDown: false]."	model okToChange ifFalse:		[^ self].	(autoDeselect == false and: [row == 0]) ifTrue: [^ self].  "work-around the no-mans-land bug"	"No change if model is locked"	previousSelectionIndex := self selectionIndex.	((autoDeselect == nil or: [autoDeselect]) and: [row == self selectionIndex])		ifTrue: [self changeModelSelection: 0]		ifFalse: [self changeModelSelection: row].	Cursor normal show.	"Trigger icon action"	(previousSelectionIndex = self selectionIndex		and: [ (row := self rowAtLocation: event position) ~= 0		and: [ (icon := self iconAt: row) notNil		and: [ (icon := OBMorphicIcons iconNamed: icon) notNil		and: [ (event position x - self left < icon width) ] ] ] ])			ifTrue: [ model clickIconAt: row ]! !!RBLintRule methodsFor: '*ob-refactory-converting' stamp: 'lr 2/23/2009 21:51'!asNode	^ self subclassResponsibility! !!ORPluggableRewriteRule class methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'lr 2/24/2009 17:10'!isVisible	^ false! !!ORPluggableRewriteRule methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/24/2009 13:57'!name	^ 'Rewrite Code'! !!ORPluggableRewriteRule methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/24/2009 13:53'!rewriteRule: aRule	rewriteRule := aRule! !!RBTransformationRule methodsFor: '*ob-refactory-converting' stamp: 'lr 2/23/2009 23:50'!asNode	^ ORTransformationLintNode on: self! !!RBTransformationRule methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 2/23/2009 23:50'!browserInstance	| change |	change := CompositeRefactoryChange named: self name.	change changes: self changes.	^ change browserInstance! !!RBTransformationRule methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 2/23/2009 23:50'!open	^ self browserInstance open! !!OBLazyListMorph commentStamp: 'dr 7/18/2007 14:28' prior: 34947343!I am an adapted version of LazyListMorph. I can display icons and colors for my elements.!!OBLazyListMorph methodsFor: 'drawing' stamp: 'lr 12/23/2009 15:22'!display: item atRow: row on: canvas 	"Display the given item at row row."		| drawBounds top icon |	drawBounds := self drawBoundsForRow: row.	drawBounds := drawBounds intersect: self bounds.	(listSource iconAt: row) ifNotNil: [ :name | 		icon := OBMorphicIcons iconNamed: name.		top := drawBounds top + ((drawBounds height - icon height) // 2).		canvas 			translucentImage: icon			at: drawBounds left @ top.		drawBounds := drawBounds left: drawBounds left + icon width + 2 ].	item isText 		ifTrue: [ 			canvas 				drawString: item string				in: drawBounds				font: (font emphasized: (item emphasisAt: 1))				color: (item colorAt: 1) ]		ifFalse: [			canvas 				drawString: item				in: drawBounds				font: font				color: (self colorForRow: row) ]! !!Exception class methodsFor: '*ob-standard' stamp: 'lr 3/28/2009 15:56'!browserIcon	^ #exception! !!AddMethodChange methodsFor: '*ob-refactory-converting' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 18:30'!asNode	^ ORAddMethodChangeNode on: self! !!ParseNode methodsFor: '*ob-standard' stamp: 'cwp 7/18/2007 19:31'!selectorIs: aSymbol	^ false! !!RBCompositeLintRule methodsFor: '*ob-refactory-converting' stamp: 'lr 2/23/2009 21:09'!asNode	^ ORCompositeLintNode on: self! !!RBMethodName methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 3/12/2008 16:23'!printOn: aStream	| argumentStream |	self selector isNil 		ifTrue: [ self selector: (#value numArgs: self arguments size) ].	argumentStream := self arguments readStream.	self selector keywords keysAndValuesDo: [ :key :part |		key = 1 ifFalse: [ aStream space ].		aStream nextPutAll: part.		(self selector isUnary or: [ argumentStream atEnd ]) 			ifTrue: [ ^ self ].		aStream space; nextPutAll: argumentStream next ]! !!ClassEnvironment methodsFor: '*ob-refactory' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 21:05'!browserClass	^ self classNames size > 1		ifTrue: [ ORClassBrowser ]		ifFalse: [ ORSingleClassBrowser ]! !!PluggableButtonMorph methodsFor: '*ob-morphic' stamp: 'cwp 7/21/2007 21:18'!styleWith: aBuilder	aBuilder styleButton: self! !!SystemOrganizer methodsFor: '*ob-standard-testing' stamp: 'cwp 9/18/2004 23:58'!isClassOrganizer	^ false! !"OmniBrowser"!"OB-Morphic"!"OB-Standard"!"OB-Refactory"!"OB-Regex"!"OB-SUnitIntegration"!"OB-Shout"!!O2InteractionRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 12/7/2004 00:13' prior: 0!OBInteractionRequest is an abstract superclass for notifications that request some interaction with the user. It's useful for catching such notifications in an exception handler, while allowing other notifications to operate normally.!!O2BrowseRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 12/7/2004 00:10' prior: 0!This notification is raised whenever a browser needs to be opened. The default action is to open a SystemWindow in Morphic, but it can be caught in situations where that's not appropriate. The OB test suite uses this extensively. !!O2ChoiceRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:26' prior: 0!This notification is used to ask the user for to choose from a list of alternatives. Its defaultAction is to open a PopUpMenu. Test cases an intercept the notification and respond programmatically.prompt	- A string describing the choice the user is asked to make.labels	- A list of strings describing the alternatives.values	- When the user chooses an alternative, the corresponding item from this list is returned!!O2ConfirmationRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:30' prior: 0!This notification is used to ask the user to confirm some kind potentially dangerous operation. Its default action is to open a PopUpMenu.iVars:prompt		- a string describing the situation the user is asked to confirmconfirm		- a string describing the action that will be taken if the user confirmscancel		- a string describing the action that will be taken if the user does not confirm!!O2TextRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:35' prior: 0!This notification is used to ask the user to supply a short piece of text. Its defaultAction is to open a FillInTheBlank.iVars:prompt		- a string describing the text the user is asked to supplytemplate	- a default reply !!O2WaitRequest commentStamp: 'lr 5/14/2008 15:32' prior: 0!This notification is used to tell the user to wait while some longer action is performed. The default action is to show a hourglass instead of the normal cursor.iVars:block		- the code to execute!!O2SourceFilesRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:09' prior: 0!OBSourceFilesRequest is used to work around the fact that Squeak's source files are stored in a global array called SourceFiles. When testing OBMethodVersion and OBVersionBrowser, we don't want to use the real source files, as they are too unpredictable. Instead the test cases supply a source file array with known contents.Therefore, OBMethodVersion never refers directly to the SourceFiles global. Instead it raises an OBSourceFiles request. If this occurs during a test, the test catches the notification and resumes using the test source files. Otherwise, the default action resumes using the global source file array.!!O2PluggableListMorphOfMany commentStamp: 'dr 7/14/2008 11:37' prior: 0!OBPluggableListMorphOfMany makes sure that a multiple selection list as implemented in PluggableListMorphOfMany can be integrated in OmniBrowser.In particular, it assures that icons can be displayed for list elements and that drag & drop works. This multiple selection list is only used in the method column in the class browser, here methods can be dragged by selecting a particular method while holding the mouse down. Moving the mouse cursor while a method is dragged to a method category allows the user to drop this method in this category. There are currently no other means to drag & drop list elements.!!O2PluggableTextMorph commentStamp: 'cwp 12/7/2004 00:04' prior: 0!This is a trivial subclass of PluggableTextMorph. It overrides initialization methods to use an OBTextMorph rather than a regular TextMorph!!O2DraggableButtonMorph commentStamp: 'dr 6/12/2007 15:21' prior: 0!I represent a button morph which is draggable. Other draggable button morphs can be dropped on me.!!O2TextMorphEditor commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:27' prior: 0!OBTextMorphEditor overrides the TextMorphEditors handling of command keys, passing them along to its model for processing, rather than hard-coding their implementations.!!O2Pane commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:24' prior: 0!An OBPane is the visual representation of a column in a browser. It contains a morph to display nodes (typically a PluggableListMorph) and (optionally) a morph for communicating with the column's filter. It's main responsibility is to lay out its submorphs as the filter controls are added and removed.iVars:model	- the OBColumn that controls the node list displayed in this panelist		- the morph which displays the node list, usually a PluggableListMorphbutton	- the morph which controls the column's filter, usually an OBRadioButtonBar.!!O2PaneScroller commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:13' prior: 0!Instances of OBPaneScroller contain the panes which represent columns in a browser. Their primary responsibilities are laying out panes to fit the space available and scrolling them horizontally when there isn't sufficient space. iVars:sizing		- The number of panes which should exactly fit the available space.		   	   During layout, the  width of the panes is determined accordingly.transform	- A TransformMorph used for scrollingscrollBar	- An OBHorizontalScrollBar used for scrolling!!O2RadioButtonBar commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:27' prior: 0!An OBRadioButtonBar is similar to a PluggableListMorph except that it displays a row of buttons rather than a vertical list. Clicking on a button selects it.model				- the model for this button barbuttons			- a collection of OBButtonModels, which are derived from the model's listselection			- the index of the currently selected buttongetListSelector	 	- the message for getting the list of labels for the buttonsgetSelectionSelector	- the message for getting the index of the currently selected itemsetSelectionSelector	- the message for informing the model that a button has been clicked!!OR2SwapMethodRefactoring commentStamp: 'lr 10/19/2007 09:16' prior: 0!Move a method from the class to the instance side, or vice versa. Normally this is not considered to be a refactoring.!!O2ScrollBar commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:01' prior: 0!This class is a relic. It was originally created to work around bugs in ScrollBar which prevented it from working correctly in horizontal orientation. At some point the bugs should be fixed, and ScrollBar should be used instead.!!O2TextMorph commentStamp: 'cwp 12/7/2004 00:07' prior: 0!This is a trivial subclass of TextMorph. It overrides editor creation to use OBTextMorphEditor rather than a regular TextMorphEditor.!!OR2RealizeClassRefactoring commentStamp: 'lr 10/19/2007 09:16' prior: 0!Make a given class concrete, by providing empty templates for all the abstract methods.!!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode commentStamp: 'jk 12/9/2007 13:35' prior: 0!A PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode is wrapper for items in OBPluggableTreeMorph instances. Each instance remembers its parent wrapper (same kind of instance) and position in a subtree.Instance Variables	parent:		<PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode>	position:		<Number>parent	- parent wrapperposition	- position in subtree (among siblings)!!O2AutoSelection commentStamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 14:52' prior: 0!A auto selection holds a strategy that returns the node to auto select in columns. An auto selection strategy is stored in the metanode representing the respective column. !!O2PreviousAutoSelection commentStamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 15:05' prior: 0!Automatically select methods with the same selector as the method had we previously selected. !!O2PreviousWithSingleAutoSelection commentStamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 15:08' prior: 0!Automatically select methods with the same selector as the method had we previously selected and also select automatically for a method protocol with just one method inside this single method. !!O2SmartGroupAutoSelection commentStamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 15:07' prior: 0!Automatically select the first method in the search results that satisfy the search query. !!O2Browser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:17' prior: 0!OBBrowser is the core of OmniBrower. It's the root object for each browser and the model for the SystemWindows which display them. Its main responsibily is managing panels, particularly passing update messages between them.On the class side, OBBrowser provides some default settings for creating and opening browsers. Subclasses can override these settings to acheive customized behavior.iVars:panels	- A collection of objects which manage submorphs of the browser's SystemWindow.cVars:MetaGraphs - A dictionary matching names to metagraphs!!O2CodeBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:45' prior: 0!OBCodeBrowser is a superclass for all browsers which active code in the image. It provides methods for registering with the SystemChangeNotifier and updating it's display when it receives notification of system changes.!!O2HierarchyBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:50' prior: 0!OBHierarchyBrowser provides a three-pane browers that displays a class within it's surrounding hierarchy - both superclasses and subclasses!!O2InheritanceBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:51' prior: 0!OBInheritanceBrowser shows the inheritance hierarchy of a method, both superclass implementations which it overrides, and subclass implementations which override it.!!O2ListBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:53' prior: 0!OBListBrowsers are used to display simple lists of methods, such as senders or implementors.!!O2SystemBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:56' prior: 0!This is the basic system browser that is the work-horse of Smalltalk development tools. It presents four panes showing class categories, classes, method categories and methods.!!O2VersionBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:58' prior: 0!OBVersionBrowser displays a list of OBMethodVersions, which represent versions of a method present in the source or changes files. !!O2ButtonModel commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:15' prior: 0!An OBButtonModel serves as a model for PluggableButtonMorphs used OBRadioButtonBar. OBRadioButtonBar cannot be a direct model for its PBMs, since it can contain a variable number of buttons.iVars:bar		- the OBRadioButton bar to which this button belongslabel	- the label of the button!!O2ClassReference commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:15' prior: 0!OBClassReference provides a way to refer to classes that may or may not be loaded into the image. It refers to the class indirectly, via name, rather than with a direct pointer to the class object. It also provides a number of convenience methods, which makes it more convenient than using the class name directly.!!O2Column commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:19' prior: 0!An OBColumn manages a list of nodes, which it displays in a PluggableListMorph in the pane scroller at the top of the browser. All instances of OBColumn belong to an OBColumnPanel. It's main responsibility is keeping its list - and those of its neighbours - up to date. Each column has a MetaNode, which provides the list contents. It uses a filter to meditate between its self and the MetaNode.iVars:panel		- the panel which owns the columnfilter		- the filter which manages the column's MetaNode.parent		- the node selected in the column to the left of this columnchildren 	- the nodes which make up this column's listselection 	- the index of the node selected by the user!!O2EnhancementColumn commentStamp: 'dr 9/23/2008 16:19' prior: 0!I am a slightly adapted version of OBColumn and I am used in all browsers provided by the enhancements package.!!O2CmdFocusOnClassInHierarchy commentStamp: 'dr 4/14/2008 15:40' prior: 0!Special command triggered when a class in the class hierarchy browser gets double-clicked to focus in the hierarchy on that specific class.!!O2DPNotifier commentStamp: 'dc 9/7/2006 23:10' prior: 0!Used to update the cache of all dynamic protocols when something changes in the system.!!O2Definition commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:38' prior: 0!The responsibility of a definition is to express a node's composition textually and respond to changes in the text by updating the node it represents. For example,a file browser might use a file definition to allow editing of a files contents.!!O2ClassDefinition commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:13' prior: 0!OBClassDefinition presents a textual interface for examining, modifying and creating classes. Given a class, it knows how to display the definition expression that reflects it's current state, and knows how to create or modify a class given a definition expression.OBClassDefinition implements a number of safety checks when defining or redefining classes, to ensure that existing classes are not accidentally overwritten.!!O2MethodDefinition commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:20' prior: 0!OBMethodDefinition knows how to present method source in the browser's text pane and compile a new CompiledMethod when the source changes. It implements several safety checks to ensure that methods are not accidentally overwritten.!!O2OrganizationDefinition commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:31' prior: 0!OBOrganizationDefinition knows how to display and edit the organization of classes or methods by a Categorizer.!!O2DummyPackage commentStamp: 'dr 7/16/2007 10:42' prior: 0!I am a dummy for a Monticello package. I am used for class categories existing in the image that are not contained in any Monticello package. I list all these ownerless class categories in alphabetical order. !!O2DynamicProtocols commentStamp: 'dc 9/17/2006 14:31' prior: 0!A dynamic protocol is a category (displayed in the 3rd pane of your browser) whose content is computed dynamically based on the currently selected class. If a dynamic protocol is empty then it is not shown.This system is based on an idea of Nathanael Shärli and Andrew P. Black (see 'A Browser For Incremental Programming')Here is a small list of possible dynamic protocols:- HaltUsage: displays all methods containing a call to #halt- Override: contains methods that are defined in the superclasses and redefined in the current class- RecentlyModified, SuperSend...A preference system has been set to permit the selection of desired dynamic protocols. After having browsed at least one class using OmniBrowser, you can set your preferred protocols using the Preference Browser in the category 'dynamic protocols'.!!O2Filter commentStamp: 'cwp 3/4/2004 21:53' prior: 0!A browser's metagraph defines the way in which the user may traverse the graph of objects which make up the browser's domain. But it's not always desirable to have all the nodes made available by the metagraph to be visible in the browser. An filter provides a strategy for filtering out some of the nodes from the display. OBFilter provides a "null" filter - one that does no filtering at all - and serves as a superclass for other filters. !!O2ModalFilter commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:39' prior: 0!OBModalFilter is used to implement the 'instance/?/class' buttons in a standard class browser. In functional terms it filters the nodes of a column according to the edge of the metagraph that they correspond to. OBModalFilter displays an OBRadioButtonBar in its column's pane, with one button per edge. Only nodes from the currently selected edge are allowed in the column.iVars:selection	- the currently selected edge!!O2MercuryQuery commentStamp: 'PDC 6/29/2007 07:08' prior: 0!OBMercuryQuery is an abstract superclass for queries made through the 'Mercury' panel in OmniBrowser based browser. The main interface is the class method, find:for:, which builds an appropriate concrete query object for the query string and calls find on it.!!O2MClassQuery commentStamp: 'PDC 6/29/2007 07:11' prior: 0!I handle mercury queries like 'Object' and 'OBNode*'. I find classes.!!O2MClassRefsQuery commentStamp: 'PDC 6/29/2007 07:13' prior: 0!I handle mercury queries like '#Object'. I find references to classes.!!O2MMethodQuery commentStamp: 'PDC 6/29/2007 07:12' prior: 0!I handle queries that look like 'browse' and 'browse*'. I find method implementors.!!O2MMethodSendersQuery commentStamp: 'PDC 6/29/2007 07:13' prior: 0!I handle queries like '#browse'. I find method senders.!!O2MStringQuery commentStamp: 'PDC 6/29/2007 07:13' prior: 0!I handle queries that look like "'this is a string'". I find strings in methods.!!O2MetaEdge commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:20' prior: 0!An OBMetaEdge is an edge in the browser's metagraph. It represents a message sent to a node to obtain further nodes. It is refered to by the "parent" metanode, and refers to the "child" metanode.iVars:label 		-  a string describing the metaNode, for filters which allow the user 			   to choose which edges to followselector	- when a node is selected by the user, this message will be 			  sent to it to obtain its childrenmetaNode 	- a MetaNode corresponding to the nodes answered by the above message		!!O2MetaNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:23' prior: 0!A MetaNode represents a hypothetical node in the browser's domain graph.iVars:filterClass			- the class used to filter this hypothetical node's childrencolumnClass		- the class of column used to display this node's childrenedges				- messages that could be sent to the node to obtain childrenactors				- providers of functionality for manipulating the nodedisplaySelector		- the message used to retreive a nodes display name!!O2MethodVersion commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:25' prior: 0!OBMethodVerison represents a version of a method found in the .sources or .changes files. It provides methods for parsing the method definition referenced by a source pointer, and for filing in the source to replace the current version of the method.!!O2MorphicIcons commentStamp: 'lr 7/10/2009 11:12' prior: 0!Most of these icons come from http://www.famfamfam.com/lab/icons. They are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 License by Mark James.!!O2Node commentStamp: 'cwp 3/4/2004 22:20' prior: 0!A node is a wrapper for an object in the browser's domain graph. OBNode is an abstract superclass for concrete nodes which might appear in the browser.iVars:metaNode - the MetaNode which produced this node!!O2CodeNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 11:12' prior: 0!OBCodeNode is an abstract superclass for node classes that represent program elements active in the image. Though it provides little functionality, it exists for structural purposes.!!O2ClassAwareNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 11:23' prior: 0!OBClassAware node models program elements that are part of a class. It provides methods for manipulating the class, as well as methods relating to sorting according to class hierarchy.iVarstheClass 	- the class that this node is part ofsuperior 	- during hierarchical sorting this refers to the nearest superclass			  that belongs to the group being sorted!!O2ClassCommentNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 11:24' prior: 0!OBClassCommentNode represents the comment attached to a particular class. !!O2ClassNode commentStamp: 'lr 8/4/2007 10:30' prior: 0!OBClassNode wraps a class for display in various types of code browsers. It provides many navigation methods for the different types of browsers where classes may appear. The instance-variable theClass is always a non-metaclass.!!O2MetaclassNode commentStamp: 'lr 8/4/2007 10:30' prior: 0!OBMetaclassNode is essentially the same as an OBClassNode, but overrides a few methods to work properly with metaclasses. The instance-variable theClass is always a metaclass.!!O2MethodCategoryNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:29' prior: 0!OBMethodCategory represents a category within a ClassOrganization. Instead of an organization definition, OBMethodCategory presents a MethodDefinition with the class' default method template.!!O2AllMethodCategoryNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:31' prior: 0!OBAllMethodCategory implements the synthetic '-- all --' category, which contains all the methods in a class.!!O2DPAbstract commentStamp: 'dc 9/17/2006 14:27' prior: 0!I'm the base superclass of all dynamic protocols.See the comment in DynamicProtocols.Subclasses should implement #selectorsFor: on the instance side which should return a collection of selectors contained in this protocol.Developers should send #initialize to their class when they are ready to use it. This will activate the protocol and add a preference (in the preference browser) to allow the user to enable or disable the protocol.Developers can override #label on the class side to change the string displayed for their protocol. By default, the label is based on the class name.A cache is used to remember computed values and is updated automatically on system change using DynamicProtocolNotifier.!!O2DPFilterAbstract commentStamp: 'dc 9/22/2006 14:41' prior: 0!I'm the abstract superclass of all protocols which filter selectors of a given class. The enumeration of all selectors in a class is made here and subclasses just have to answer true or false if they want the selector or not.Subclasses must override #wantsSelector:for:!!O2DPDebugging commentStamp: 'dc 9/22/2006 15:14' prior: 0!I'm a dynamic protocol containing all methods with a call to #halt or a reference to the global Transcript!!O2DPDuplicated commentStamp: 'dc 9/7/2006 20:03' prior: 0!Contains methods with same implementation in the superclass hierarchy!!O2DPLong commentStamp: 'dc 9/7/2006 20:05' prior: 0!Contains method with more than #linesToBeConsideredLong lines of code.!!O2DPRecentlyModified commentStamp: 'dc 9/7/2006 17:35' prior: 0!I contained all the methods which have been modified recently. Recently means in less than #secondsToBeConsideredRecent seconds.!!O2DPUncommented commentStamp: 'dc 9/7/2006 20:05' prior: 0!Contains uncommented methods!!O2DPOverride commentStamp: 'dc 9/7/2006 17:34' prior: 0!I contain methods that are already implemented in one of my subclasses and overriden in the current class.!!O2DPRequired commentStamp: 'dc 9/25/2006 12:31' prior: 0!I contain all selectors you have to implement in order to make your class concrete.In Squeak3.9, there are required methods for all classes. This means that all your classes will display the required protocol. If you only want to see method required in your hierarchies and not the Squeak one, please set #wantsToFilter to true. If you do this, you might want to invalidate the cache of this protocol:DPRequired invalidateCache !!O2DPSuperSend commentStamp: 'dc 9/7/2006 17:36' prior: 0!A method in me contains a send to 'super'.!!O2MethodNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:37' prior: 0!OBMethodNode wraps a method in a particular class. It supplies an OBMethodDefinition for displaying and editing the source code of the method, and various actions for manipulating the method. It has two roles: first it appears in the right most pane of a standard system browser. Second, it often serves as the root node for an OBListBrowser, and has navigation methods for senders, implementors etc.OBMethodNode also serves as the superclass for nodes that represent *parts* of a method, such as sends of a particular message, references to a class, accesses to a instance variable, etc.!!O2ClassRefNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:38' prior: 0!Each instance of OBClassRefNode refers to a reference to a particular class from the source code of a method. It's used in the OBListBrowser created by the 'browse references' class action.!!O2MessageNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:40' prior: 0!An OBMessageNode refers to a message send in the source code of a method. They are typically used in the 'senders' browser.!!O2MethodVersionNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:41' prior: 0!OBMethodVersions refer to OBMethodVersions, and are used by the VersionBrowser.!!O2VariableNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:46' prior: 0!OBVariableNode is an abstract superclass for the two types of variables a class can contain - class variables and instance variables. The only difference between the two subclasses is how they search for methods that refer to them.!!O2ClassVariableNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:51' prior: 0!OBClassVariable provides a method for finding methods which refer to a shared variable, ie, by searching for an association in the literal frame rather than for bytecodes refering to an instance variable.!!O2InstanceVariableNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:50' prior: 0!OBClassVariable provides a method for finding methods which refer to an instance, ie, by searching for instance variable access bytecodes rather than for an association in the literal frame.!!O2ClassCategoryNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 12:58' prior: 0!OBClassCategory represents a system category in the image's SystemOrganization.!!O2MonticelloClassCategoryNode commentStamp: 'dr 7/16/2007 10:37' prior: 0!I represent a class category contained in a Monticello package.!!O2EnvironmentNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:01' prior: 0!OBEnvironmentNode wraps an instance of SystemDictionary. In current Squeak images, there is only one such instance, but OB-Standard is coded so as to use rely on this assumption as little as possible. Thus OBEnvironmentNode typically serves as the root of the standard browser, and passes its environment on to other nodes in the tree.!!O2MonticelloPackageNode commentStamp: 'dr 7/16/2007 10:36' prior: 0!I represent a Monticello package as a node in an OB system browser. My children are class, comment and metaclass nodes. Classes extended in the package I represent are also contained as nodes in my children.!!O2PackagesOrClassesNode commentStamp: 'dr 7/16/2007 10:34' prior: 0!I represent the root of the node tree in an OB system browser. My children are Monticello packages and Monticello class categories.!!O2SelectorNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:03' prior: 0!OBSelectorNode wraps an instance of Symbol. It typically serves as the root of a senders or implementors OBListBrowser, and is used when cmd-n or cmd-m is invoke from the definition panel, and so no OBMethodNode is available.!!O2CollectionNode commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:31' prior: 0!OBCollectionNode is a trivial wrapper for a collection of nodes. It is typically used as an artificial root node for metagraphs that have no natural root.!!O2NullParent commentStamp: 'jk 12/9/2007 13:31' prior: 0!A NullParent is representation of a parent node for PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode.It corresponds to Null Design Pattern.!!O2Panel commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:23' prior: 0!A panel is an object that manages part of the browser's window. It provides a protocol for receiving notifications when the current domain node changes, and reacts to these changes.!!O2ColumnPanel commentStamp: 'cwp 12/6/2004 23:50' prior: 0!OBColumnPanel handles navigation around the nodes of the object graph. It maintains a list of columns, which track the user's path through the node tree. As nodes are selected, additional columns are added to the list, which appear as panes on the right of the panel. iVars:columns	- A collection of OBColumns, each of which manages a single pane in the scroller.minPanes - The minimum number of panes that should ever be visible.maxPanes - The maximum number of panes that should ever be visible.!!O2FixedButtonPanel commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:35' prior: 0!OBFixedButtonPanel displays a horizontal row of buttons. In contrast to OBVarButtonPanel, the buttons do not change as nodes are selected in the navigation panel; instead they are enabled and disabled according to whether the actions they represent are applicable to the selected node.!!O2DefinitionPanel commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:35' prior: 0!OBDefinition serves as the model for the text pane of a typical browser. It's main responsibility is to act as a relay between a PluggableTextMorph and a Definition supplied by the currently selected node.iVars:browser - The browser of which this panel is a part.!!O2RecentClasses commentStamp: 'dc 7/16/2007 15:09' prior: 0!Stores the recently visited classes.The instance variable 'classes' contains an OrderedCollection of non-metaclass names. The browser inform me when a class is selected.!!O2SystemBrowserAdaptor commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:35' prior: 0!OBSystemBrowserAdaptor implements the protocol expected by the SystemBrowser app registry, and thus allows OmniBrowser to be chosen as the default system browser. Caveat: because the required protocol is a little ...odd.... it can't be implemented well by OBSystemBrowser directly. OBSystemBrowserAdaptor does this reasonably well, but it has no way to provide a more natural name than its class name to the app registry menu.!!O2TreeNodeMediator commentStamp: 'dr 9/12/2008 15:59' prior: 0!I represent a tree node that manages the node's fan (represented by OBFan) and subtree nodes.Instance Variables	fan:		<Object>	subfans:		<Object>fan	- xxxxxsubfans	- xxxxx!!O2PluggableListMorph commentStamp: 'dr 7/18/2007 14:27' prior: 0!I am a special kind of PluggableListMorph and provides methods to access icons for list elements. I use OBLazyListMorph as listMorphClass!!O2LazyListMorph commentStamp: 'dr 7/18/2007 14:28' prior: 0!I am an adapted version of LazyListMorph. I can display icons and colors for my elements.!!OBTParentNode classTrait methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'jk 8/14/2007 08:03'!on: aNestedObject of: aParentNode	^ self new on: aNestedObject of: aParentNode! !!OBTParentNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'jk 8/26/2007 12:07'!isUsedTrait	^ true! !!OBTParentNode methodsFor: 'displaying' stamp: 'jk 8/26/2007 11:37'!name	^ self nestedObject asString! !!OBTParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 8/23/2007 18:53'!nestedObject	self explicitRequirement ! !!OBTParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 8/23/2007 18:53'!nestedObject: anObject	self explicitRequirement ! !!OBTParentNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'jk 8/20/2007 15:30'!numberOfPredecessors	^ self parentNode numberOfPredecessors + 1! !!OBTParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 8/14/2007 08:03'!on: aNestedObject of: aParentNode	self parentNode: aParentNode.	self nestedObject: aNestedObject! !!OBTParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 8/14/2007 08:02'!parentNode	self explicitRequirement ! !!OBTParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 8/14/2007 08:02'!parentNode: anObject	self explicitRequirement! !!OBTParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 8/14/2007 09:01'!theClass	^ self parentNode theClass! !!OBTParentNode methodsFor: 'public' stamp: 'jk 8/14/2007 08:56'!withAllParents	^ (OrderedCollection new)		add: self nestedObject;		addAll: self parentNode withAllParents;		yourself! !!TOBCmdMoveToTrait methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'AlexandreBergel 1/6/2009 15:02'!askForNewTraitFromClass: actualClass	| traitName newTrait listOfTraits listOfTraitsNames index |	listOfTraits := actualClass traitComposition allTraits.	listOfTraitsNames := #('*New trait*'), (listOfTraits collect: [:tr | tr name]).	index := UIManager default chooseFrom: listOfTraitsNames title: 'Please choose the trait to move the method to'.	"Cancel was pressed"	index = 0 ifTrue: [^ false].	index ~= 1 ifTrue: [^ Smalltalk at: (listOfTraitsNames at: index)].		traitName := OBTextRequest prompt: 'Name for the new trait'				template: 'T' , actualClass name asString.	(traitName isNil or: [traitName isEmpty]) ifTrue: [^ false].	traitName := traitName asSymbol.	newTrait := (Smalltalk includesKey: traitName) 				ifTrue: [Smalltalk at: traitName]				ifFalse: [self createTraitNamed: traitName inCategory: actualClass category].	^ newTrait! !!TOBCmdMoveToTrait methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'AlexandreBergel 1/16/2009 04:31'!cannotMoveError: aString for: compiledMethod	| index v |	self ignoreNotification		ifTrue: [^ self]."	index := UIManager default chooseFrom: #('proceed' 'proceed to all moves' 'open a debugger') title: aString."	v := #('proceed' 'proceed to all moves' 'open a debugger') .	index := OBChoiceRequest prompt: aString labels: v values: v.	(index = v third)		ifTrue: [self error: aString].	(index = v second)		ifTrue: [self doIgnoreNotification]! !!TOBCmdMoveToTrait methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 1/21/2009 12:18'!checkIfOK: compiledMethod	compiledMethod isCompiledMethod		ifFalse: [self cannotMoveError: 'The method to move is not a compiled method' for: compiledMethod].		compiledMethod hasInstVarRef		ifTrue: [self cannotMoveError: 'The method to move refer to instance variables. Please, add accessors'						for: compiledMethod]	! !!TOBCmdMoveToTrait methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'ab 8/31/2007 19:03'!createTraitNamed: traitName inCategory: cat 	^ Trait 		named: traitName asSymbol		uses: { }		category: cat! !!TOBCmdMoveToTrait methodsFor: 'requirement' stamp: 'AlexandreBergel 1/7/2009 11:28'!doIgnoreNotification	self explicitRequirement! !!TOBCmdMoveToTrait methodsFor: 'requirement' stamp: 'AlexandreBergel 1/7/2009 11:31'!ignoreNotification	self explicitRequirement! !!TOBCmdMoveToTrait methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'ab 8/31/2007 19:06'!keystroke	^ $e! !!TOBCmdMoveToTrait methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'AlexandreBergel 1/6/2009 14:37'!moveMethodNamed: methodReference inTrait: aTrait	| compiledMethod actualClass |	compiledMethod := methodReference compiledMethod.	"the compiled Method to move should not refer to variable"		self checkIfOK: compiledMethod.	actualClass := methodReference actualClass.	actualClass removeSelector: methodReference methodSymbol.	(actualClass traitComposition includesTrait: aTrait) 		ifFalse: 			[actualClass setTraitComposition: actualClass traitComposition + aTrait].	aTrait compile: compiledMethod getSourceFromFile classified: methodReference category.! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'node access' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!contentsOfNode: node 	| children |	self assert: node class == O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode.	getChildrenSelector ifNil: 		[ ^ #() ].	children := model 		perform: getChildrenSelector		with: (self pathToItem: node).	^ children collectWithIndex: 		[ :item :index | 		O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode 			with: item			parent: node			position: index			model: self ]! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'events-processing' stamp: 'dr 11/19/2008 11:15'!handleMouseMove: anEvent	"slightly updated to make sure that we always have dragging enabled, even when mouseFocus of hand doesn't point to us"	anEvent wasHandled ifTrue: [^self]. 	anEvent anyButtonPressed ifFalse: [^self].	anEvent wasHandled: true.		self mouseMove: anEvent.		(self handlesMouseStillDown: anEvent) ifTrue:[		self startStepping: #handleMouseStillDown: 			at: Time millisecondClockValue			arguments: {anEvent copy resetHandlerFields}			stepTime: 1].! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'node access' stamp: 'dr 9/12/2008 11:16'!hasNodeContents: node	hasChildrenSelector ifNil:[ ^ false ]. 	^ model perform: hasChildrenSelector with: (self pathToItem: node)! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'node access' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!iconOfNode: node 	| iconName |	getIconSelector ifNil: [ ^ nil ].	iconName := model 		perform: getIconSelector		with: node fullPosition.	iconName ifNotNilDo: [ :name | ^ O2MorphicIcons iconNamed: name ].	^ nil! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!indentingItemClass	^ O2IndentingListItemMorph! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'selection' stamp: 'jk 11/24/2007 16:09'!indexOfSelectedItem: aPluggableTreeItemNode 	^ scroller submorphs findFirst: [ :e | e complexContents item = aPluggableTreeItemNode item ]! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'events-processing' stamp: 'dr 2/23/2009 11:42'!mouseEnter: event	super mouseEnter: event.	Preferences autoFocusForColumns ifTrue: [event hand newKeyboardFocus: self].! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'item path' stamp: 'jk 12/9/2007 13:41'!pathToItem: wrapper	^ wrapper ifNil: [#()] ifNotNil: [wrapper path]! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'item path' stamp: 'jk 12/8/2007 15:59'!pathToSelectedItem	^ self pathToItem: selectedWrapper! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'node access' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!roots: anArray 	roots := anArray collectWithIndex: 		[ :item :index | 		O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode 			with: item			parent: nil			position: index			model: self ].	self list: roots! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'item path' stamp: 'jk 11/27/2007 15:10'!selectPath: path in: listItem	| i |	i := 0.	path isEmpty ifTrue: [^self setSilentSelectedMorph: nil].	path isEmpty ifTrue: [^nil].	listItem withSiblingsDo: [:each | 		i := i + 1.		i = path first ifTrue: [			each isExpanded ifFalse: [				each toggleExpandedState.				self adjustSubmorphPositions.			].			each changed.			path size = 1 ifTrue: [				^ self setSilentSelectedMorph: each			].			each firstChild ifNil: [^self setSelectedMorph: nil].			^self selectPath: path allButFirst in: each firstChild		].	].	^ self setSilentSelectedMorph: nil! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'selection' stamp: 'jk 12/8/2007 16:10'!setSelectedMorph: aMorph	selectedWrapper := aMorph complexContents.	self selection: selectedWrapper.	setSelectedSelector ifNotNil:[		model 			perform: setSelectedSelector 			with: (self pathToItem:  selectedWrapper)	].! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'selection' stamp: 'jk 11/27/2007 15:09'!setSilentSelectedMorph: aMorph	selectedWrapper := aMorph complexContents.	self selection: selectedWrapper.! !!O2PluggableTreeMorph methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 9/18/2008 11:36'!update: what	| w | 	w := what.		what == getRootsSelector ifTrue:[		self roots: (model perform: getRootsSelector).		w := getSelectedPathSelector.	].	what = #selection ifTrue: [ 		w := getSelectedPathSelector ].	^ super update: w! !!MultiEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 34980318!browserClass	^ OR2MultiBrowser! !!MultiEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 34980426!environmentNamed: aString	^ environmentDictionaries at: aString ifAbsent: [ SelectorEnvironment new ]! !!OBBrowser methodsFor: '*omnibrowser2' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 10/17/2009 12:14'!definitionPanel	^ panels 		detect: [:ea | ea isDefinition] 		ifNone: [self error: 'No definition panel configured']! !!Trait methodsFor: '*o2-standard' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!allClassVarNames	^#()! !!Trait methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!asClassSideNodeOf: aParentNode 	^ O2UsedTraitMetaclassNode 		on: self		of: aParentNode! !!Trait methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!asNodeOf: aParentNode 	^ O2UsedTraitNode 		on: self		of: aParentNode! !!Trait methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2ClassSideNode	^ O2MetaclassNode on: self! !!Trait methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2CommentNode	^ O2ClassCommentNode on: self theNonMetaClass! !!Trait methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2Node	^ O2ClassNode on: self! !!Trait methodsFor: '*o2-standard' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 34980825!packageName	^''! !!O2EnhHierarchyBrowserTest methodsFor: 'setup' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!setUp	hierarchyBrowser := O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser 		onClass: self class		selector: #setUp! !!O2EnhHierarchyBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!testAutoSelection	| classColumn columns |	columns := hierarchyBrowser navigationPanel columns.	classColumn := columns first.	self assert: classColumn selection = 4.	self assert: classColumn selectedNode theClass = self class.	self assert: columns last selectedNode selector = #setUp.	self assert: columns last children size < 10.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser definitionPanel text = (self class >> #setUp) getSource.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser currentNode = columns last selectedNode.	classColumn selection: 3.	self assert: classColumn selection = 3.	self assert: classColumn selectedNode theClass = TestCase.	self assert: columns last selectedNode theClass = TestCase.	self assert: columns last selectedNode selector = #setUp.	self assert: columns last children size > 20.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser definitionPanel text asString withBlanksTrimmed = 'setUp'.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser currentNode = columns last selectedNode.	classColumn selection: 4.	self assert: classColumn selection = 4.	self assert: classColumn selectedNode theClass = self class.	self assert: columns last selectedNode theClass = self class.	self assert: columns last selectedNode selector = #setUp.	self assert: columns last children size < 10.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser definitionPanel text = (self class >> #setUp) getSource.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser currentNode = columns last selectedNode.	classColumn selection: 2.	self assert: classColumn selection = 2.	self assert: classColumn selectedNode theClass = Object.	self assert: columns last selectedNode isNil.	self assert: (hierarchyBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition isKindOf: O2ClassDefinition).	self assert: hierarchyBrowser definitionPanel text = Object definition.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser currentNode = classColumn selectedNode! !!O2EnhHierarchyBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!testBrowserSetup	| classNodes |	self assert: O2HierarchyBrowser isHierarchyBrowser.	self assert: (O2HierarchyBrowser definitionPanel isKindOf: O2EnhancementDefinitionPanel).	self assert: (O2HierarchyBrowser navigationPanel isKindOf: O2EnhancementColumnPanel).	self assert: (hierarchyBrowser root isKindOf: O2ClassNode).	self assert: hierarchyBrowser root theClass = self class.	self assert: (hierarchyBrowser currentNode isKindOf: O2MethodNode).	self assert: hierarchyBrowser currentNode theClass = self class.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser currentNode selector = #setUp.	classNodes := hierarchyBrowser navigationPanel columns first children.	self assert: classNodes size = 4.	self assert: classNodes last theClass = self class.	self assert: classNodes third theClass = TestCase! !!O2EnhHierarchyBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'dr 3/10/2008 10:30'!testDoubleClick    | classColumn columns |    columns := hierarchyBrowser navigationPanel columns.    classColumn := columns first.    self assert: classColumn selection = 4.     self assert: classColumn selectedNode theClass = self class.    self assert: (((hierarchyBrowser root displayStringForChild: classColumn selectedNode) attributesAt: 1) includes: TextEmphasis bold).    self deny: (hierarchyBrowser root displayStringForChild: classColumn children third) isText.    self assert: columns last selectedNode selector = #setUp.    classColumn selection: 3.    classColumn doubleClick.    self assert: classColumn selection = 3.     self assert: classColumn selectedNode theClass = TestCase.    self assert: classColumn children size > 10.    self assert: (((hierarchyBrowser root displayStringForChild: classColumn selectedNode) attributesAt: 1) includes: TextEmphasis bold).    self deny: (hierarchyBrowser root displayStringForChild: classColumn children fourth) isText.    self assert: hierarchyBrowser definitionPanel text = TestCase definition.    self assert: columns last children size > 20.! !!O2EnhHierarchyBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 11:23'!testMethodSelection	| hierarchyBrowser2 |	self assert: (hierarchyBrowser root isKindOf: O2ClassNode).	self assert: (hierarchyBrowser currentNode isKindOf: O2MethodNode).	self assert: hierarchyBrowser root metaNode ~= hierarchyBrowser currentNode metaNode.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser root metaNode edges size >= 3.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser root metaNode edges first selector = #classHierarchy.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser currentNode metaNode ancestrySelector = #isDescendantOfMethod:.	hierarchyBrowser2 := O2HierarchyBrowser onClass: self class.	self assert: (hierarchyBrowser2 root isKindOf: O2ClassNode).	self assert: (hierarchyBrowser2 currentNode isKindOf: O2ClassNode).	self assert: hierarchyBrowser2 root metaNode ~= hierarchyBrowser2 currentNode metaNode.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser2 root metaNode edges size >= 3.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser2 root metaNode edges first selector = #classHierarchy.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser2 currentNode metaNode edges size = 3.	self assert: hierarchyBrowser2 currentNode metaNode edges first selector = #allCategory! !!O2EnhHierarchyBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 11:24'!testSelectedClassHighlighting    | classColumn columns |    columns := hierarchyBrowser navigationPanel columns.    classColumn := columns first.    self assert: (((hierarchyBrowser root displayStringForChild: classColumn selectedNode) attributesAt: 1) includes: TextEmphasis bold).     classColumn switch selection: 2.    self assert: (((hierarchyBrowser root displayStringForChild: classColumn selectedNode) attributesAt: 1) includes: TextEmphasis bold).    self assert: columns second children isEmpty.    self assert: hierarchyBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = self class comment.    classColumn switch selection: 3.    self assert: (((hierarchyBrowser root displayStringForChild: classColumn selectedNode) attributesAt: 1) includes: TextEmphasis bold).    self assert: columns second children size >= 2.    self assert: hierarchyBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = self class class definition.! !!O2EnhPackageBrowserTest methodsFor: 'setup' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!setUp	dynamicBrowser := O2PackageBrowser dynamicBrowser! !!O2EnhPackageBrowserTest methodsFor: 'setup' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!tearDown	O2PackageBrowser setDynamicBrowser: dynamicBrowser! !!O2EnhPackageBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 17:03'!testBackButton	| classColumn |	packageBrowser := O2PackageBrowser 		onClass: O2Column		selector: #list.	classColumn := packageBrowser navigationPanel columns second.	self assert: packageBrowser hasHistory.	self deny: packageBrowser hasBackHistory.	self deny: packageBrowser hasForwardHistory.	self assert: packageBrowser historyCursor = 1.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor isMethodNode.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor theClass = O2Column.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor selector = #list.	self assert: packageBrowser historyNodes size = 1.	self assert: packageBrowser historyBackNodes size = 0.	classColumn selection: 1.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode theClass = O2AutoSelection.	self assert: packageBrowser hasBackHistory.	self deny: packageBrowser hasForwardHistory.	self assert: packageBrowser historyCursor = 2.	self deny: packageBrowser historyAtCursor isMethodNode.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor theClass = O2AutoSelection.	self assert: packageBrowser historyNodes size = 2.	self assert: packageBrowser historyBackNodes size = 1.	self assert: packageBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = O2AutoSelection definition.	packageBrowser fixedButtonPanel back.	self deny: packageBrowser hasBackHistory.	self assert: packageBrowser hasForwardHistory.	self assert: packageBrowser historyCursor = 1.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor isMethodNode.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor theClass = O2Column.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor selector = #list.	self assert: packageBrowser historyNodes size = 2.	self assert: packageBrowser historyBackNodes size = 0.	self assert: packageBrowser historyForwardNodes size = 1.	self assert: packageBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = (O2Column >> #list) getSource.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode selector = #list.	packageBrowser fixedButtonPanel forward.	self assert: packageBrowser hasBackHistory.	self deny: packageBrowser hasForwardHistory.	self assert: packageBrowser historyCursor = 2.	self deny: packageBrowser historyAtCursor isMethodNode.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor theClass = O2AutoSelection.	self assert: packageBrowser historyNodes size = 2.	self assert: packageBrowser historyBackNodes size = 1.	self assert: packageBrowser historyForwardNodes size = 0.	self assert: packageBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = O2AutoSelection definition.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode theClass = O2AutoSelection.	classColumn selection: 4.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode theClass = O2Column.	self assert: packageBrowser historyCursor = 3.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor theClass = O2Column.	self assert: packageBrowser historyNodes size = 3.	packageBrowser fixedButtonPanel setBackPressed: true.	packageBrowser historyGoToIndex: 1.	self deny: packageBrowser hasBackHistory.	self assert: packageBrowser hasForwardHistory.	self assert: packageBrowser historyCursor = 1.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor isMethodNode.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor theClass = O2Column.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor selector = #list.	self assert: packageBrowser historyNodes size = 3.	self assert: packageBrowser historyBackNodes size = 0.	self assert: packageBrowser historyForwardNodes size = 2.	self assert: packageBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = (O2Column >> #list) getSource.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode selector = #list.	classColumn selection: 2.	self assert: packageBrowser hasBackHistory.	self deny: packageBrowser hasForwardHistory.	self assert: packageBrowser historyCursor = 2.	self assert: packageBrowser historyAtCursor theClass = O2Browser.	self assert: packageBrowser historyNodes size = 2.	self assert: packageBrowser historyBackNodes size = 1.	self assert: packageBrowser historyForwardNodes isEmpty.	self assert: packageBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = O2Browser definition.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode theClass = O2Browser.	self assert: packageBrowser historyBackNodes first theClass = O2Column! !!O2EnhPackageBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'dr 3/12/2008 16:16'!testDeselection! !!O2EnhPackageBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 11:28'!testExtensionNodes	| packageNode objectNode textNode pkgMetaNode clMetaNode |	packageNode := O2MonticelloPackageNode on: (MCPackage named: 'OmniBrowser2') workingCopy.	pkgMetaNode := (O2MetaNode named: 'Package') addFilter: O2ClassSortFilter new.	packageNode metaNode: pkgMetaNode.	clMetaNode := O2MetaNode named: 'Class'.	pkgMetaNode 		childAt: #classes		put: clMetaNode.	self assert: packageNode classes notEmpty.	self assert: (packageNode classes anySatisfy: [ :ea | ea theClass == O2Column ]).	self assert: (packageNode classes anySatisfy: [ :ea | ea theClass == Object ]).	objectNode := packageNode classes 		detect: [ :ea | ea theClass == Object ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	objectNode metaNode: clMetaNode.	self assert: objectNode notNil.	self assert: (objectNode isKindOf: O2ClassExtensionNode).	self assert: objectNode name isText.	self assert: (objectNode name emphasisAt: 1) = TextEmphasis italic emphasisCode.	"to make sure indents are set in class filter..."	objectNode := packageNode childNodes 		detect: [ :ea | ea theClass == Object ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	self assert: (packageNode displayStringForChild: objectNode) isText.	self assert: ((packageNode displayStringForChild: objectNode) emphasisAt: 1) = TextEmphasis italic emphasisCode.	self assert: (packageNode displayStringForChild: objectNode) string = 'Object'.	textNode := packageNode classes 		detect: [ :ea | ea theClass == Text ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	textNode metaNode: clMetaNode.	self assert: textNode notNil.	self assert: (textNode isKindOf: O2ClassExtensionNode).	self assert: textNode name isText.	self assert: (textNode name emphasisAt: 1) = TextEmphasis italic emphasisCode.	"to make sure indents are set in class filter..."	textNode := packageNode childNodes 		detect: [ :ea | ea theClass == Text ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	self assert: (packageNode displayStringForChild: textNode) isText.	self assert: ((packageNode displayStringForChild: textNode) emphasisAt: 1) = TextEmphasis italic emphasisCode.	self assert: (packageNode displayStringForChild: textNode) string = '  Text'! !!O2EnhPackageBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 19:24'!testRememberingMethod	| classColumn methodColumn idx |	packageBrowser := O2PackageBrowser 		onClass: O2Browser		selector: #buildOn:.	classColumn := packageBrowser navigationPanel columns second.	methodColumn := packageBrowser navigationPanel columns last.	self assert: packageBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = (O2Browser >> #buildOn:) getSource.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode selector = #buildOn:.	classColumn selection: 4.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode isMethodNode.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode theClass = O2Column.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode selector = #buildOn:.	self assert: packageBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = (O2Column >> #buildOn:) getSource.	idx := methodColumn children indexOf: (O2MethodNode 			on: #children			inClass: O2Column).	methodColumn selection: idx.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode isMethodNode.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode theClass = O2Column.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode selector = #children.	self assert: packageBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = (O2Column >> #children) getSource.	classColumn selection: 6.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode isMethodNode.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode theClass = O2Fan.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode selector = #children.	self assert: packageBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = (O2Fan >> #children) getSource.	classColumn selection: 2.	self deny: packageBrowser currentNode isMethodNode.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode theClass = O2Browser.	self assert: packageBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = O2Browser definition.	classColumn selection: 4.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode isMethodNode.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode theClass = O2Column.	self assert: packageBrowser currentNode selector = #children.	self assert: packageBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = (O2Column >> #children) getSource! !!O2EnhPackageBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 17:15'!testRootNode	| rootNode packages pkgWithCategories pkgIdx dummyPackage dummyPackages |	rootNode := O2PackageBrowser defaultRootNode.	self assert: rootNode isEnvironment.	self assert: rootNode environment == Smalltalk.	packages := rootNode packages.	self assert: packages notEmpty.	self assert: (packages first isKindOf: O2MonticelloPackageNode).	pkgWithCategories := packages detect: [ :package | package classCatNames notEmpty ].	pkgIdx := packages indexOf: pkgWithCategories.	self assert: (packages at: pkgIdx) classCategories first name = pkgWithCategories classCatNames first.	self assert: (packages at: pkgIdx) workingCopy = pkgWithCategories workingCopy.	"test dummy package"	dummyPackages := packages 		select: [ :pkg | pkg workingCopy isKindOf: O2DummyPackage ]		thenCollect: [ :ea | ea workingCopy ].	dummyPackages ifNotEmpty: [		dummyPackage := dummyPackages last.		dummyPackage ifNotNil: [ 			self deny: dummyPackage modified.			self assert: dummyPackage packageName = 'Unpackaged'.			self assert: dummyPackage repositories isEmpty.			self assert: dummyPackage extensionClasses isEmpty.			self deny: dummyPackage categories isEmpty ] ]! !!O2EnhPackageNodeTest methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 12:35'!setUp	node := O2MonticelloPackageNode on: (MCPackage named: 'O2-Enhancements') workingCopy! !!O2EnhPackageNodeTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 12:34'!testAncestry	| otherNode |	otherNode := O2MonticelloPackageNode on: (MCPackage named: 'OmniBrowser2') workingCopy.	self deny: (node isDescendantOfClass: self class asO2Node).	self deny: (node isDescendantOfClassCat: otherNode).	self assert: (node isDescendantOfClassCat: node copy).	self deny: (node isDescendantOfPackage: otherNode).	self assert: (node isDescendantOfPackage: node copy)! !!O2EnhPackageNodeTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!testDummyPackage	| otherNode dummyPackage |	otherNode := node copy.	dummyPackage := O2DummyPackage packageName: 'dummyPkg'.	otherNode workingCopy: dummyPackage.	self deny: node isDummy.	self assert: otherNode isDummy.	self assert: otherNode workingCopy isDummy.	self assert: otherNode workingCopy packageName = 'dummyPkg'.	self assert: otherNode workingCopy = dummyPackage.	self assert: otherNode workingCopy classes isEmpty.	self assert: otherNode workingCopy extensionClasses isEmpty.	self deny: otherNode workingCopy modified.	self assert: (otherNode workingCopy possiblyNewerVersionsIn: nil) isEmpty.	self assert: otherNode workingCopy repositories isEmpty.	self assert: (otherNode workingCopy repositoryGroup isKindOf: MCRepositoryGroup).	self assert: otherNode workingCopy systemCategoryPrefix isString.	self assert: otherNode workingCopy systemCategoryPrefix isEmpty! !!O2EnhPackageNodeTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 12:53'!testPackage	| pkg |	pkg := MCPackage named: 'O2-Enhancements'.	self assert: node package = pkg.	self assert: node packageName = pkg name.	self assert: node name = pkg name.	self assert: node packageInfo = (PackageInfo named: pkg name).	self assert: node workingCopy = pkg workingCopy.	self assert: node classCatNames size = 14.	self assert: (node classCatNames includes: 'O2-Enhancements-Tests').	self assert: node classCategories size = 14.	self assert: (node classCategories allSatisfy: [ :e | e isKindOf: O2MonticelloClassCategoryNode ]).	self assert: node classes size > 200.	self assert: (node classes includes: O2EnhPackageNodeTest asO2Node).	self assert: node realClasses size > 100.	self assert: (node realClasses includes: O2EnhPackageNodeTest)! !!O2EnhPackageNodeTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'dr 9/2/2008 16:45'!testStyling   self assert: (node shouldBeStyledBy: (PluggableShoutMorph new styler: SHTextStylerST80 new)).! !!O2EnhPackageNodeTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 12:45'!testTemplate	self assert: (node definition isKindOf: O2ClassDefinition).	self assert: node definition text = (Class template: 'O2-Enhancements')! !!O2EnhPackageNodeTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'dr 9/2/2008 16:41'!testWithClassNode   self deny: node isDummy.! !!O2EnhSetupTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!testInstallation	"| iconicButtons |    self assert: (World submorphs anySatisfy: [:morph | morph isKindOf: OBIconicButton]).    iconicButtons := World submorphs select: [:morph | morph isKindOf: OBIconicButton].    iconicButtons := iconicButtons asSortedCollection: [:a :b | a left <= b left].    self assert: iconicButtons size = 4.    self assert: (iconicButtons first targets includes: OBSystemBrowser).    self assert: (iconicButtons second targets anyOne = Workspace).    self assert: (iconicButtons third targets isEmpty).    self assert: (iconicButtons third windowClass = PreDebugWindow).    self assert: (iconicButtons fourth targets anyOne = Inspector)."	self assert: ((Smalltalk at: #SystemBrowser) registeredClasses includes: O2PackageBrowserAdaptor).	self assert: O2PackageBrowserAdaptor browserClass == O2PackageBrowser.	self assert: (TheWorldMenu registeredOpenCommands noneSatisfy: [ :ea | ea first = 'Package Browser' ]).	self deny: (TheWorldMenu registeredOpenCommands anySatisfy: [ :ea | ea first = 'SmartGroup Browser' ])! !!O2EnhSmartGroupBrowserTest methodsFor: 'setUp' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!setUp	smartGroupBrowser := O2PackageBrowser 		onClass: self class		selector: #setUp! !!O2EnhSmartGroupBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!testAddSmartCategory	| columns smartGroupColumn |	columns := smartGroupBrowser navigationPanel columns.	smartGroupColumn := columns first.	smartGroupColumn switch selection: O2PackageBrowser smartGroupSwitchIndex.	self assert: (O2CmdAddSmartCategory 			on: smartGroupBrowser root			for: smartGroupColumn) isActive! !!O2EnhSmartGroupBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!testBrowserSetup	| smartGroup smartGroupEdge envNode |	self assert: O2SmartGroupBrowser paneCount = 4.	self assert: (O2SmartGroupBrowser definitionPanel isKindOf: O2MultipleDefinitionPanel).	self assert: (O2SmartGroupBrowser navigationPanel isKindOf: O2SmartGroupColumnPanel).	self assert: (smartGroupBrowser root isKindOf: O2PackagesOrClassesNode).	self assert: (smartGroupBrowser currentNode isKindOf: O2MethodNode).	self assert: smartGroupBrowser currentNode theClass = self class.	self assert: smartGroupBrowser currentNode selector = #setUp.	envNode := O2SmartGroupBrowser defaultMetaNode.	self assert: envNode name = 'Environment'.	self assert: envNode children size = 2.	smartGroup := envNode children 		detect: [ :ea | ea name = 'SmartGroup' ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	self assert: smartGroup notNil.	self assert: envNode edges size = 2.	smartGroupEdge := envNode edges 		detect: [ :ea | ea metaNode = smartGroup ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	self assert: smartGroupEdge notNil.	self assert: smartGroupEdge metaNode == smartGroup.	self assert: smartGroupEdge label = 'smart groups'! !!O2EnhSmartGroupBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!testCommands	| columns smartGroupColumn scan activeCommands |	columns := smartGroupBrowser navigationPanel columns.	smartGroupColumn := columns first.	smartGroupColumn switch selection: 2.	scan := smartGroupBrowser announce: O2NodeCommandScan.	activeCommands := (scan 		commandsOn: smartGroupColumn children first		for: smartGroupColumn) select: [ :ea | ea isActive ].	self deny: (activeCommands select: [ :ea | ea isKindOf: O2CmdCreatePackage ]) notEmpty! !!O2EnhSmartGroupBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!testNoRenameOfSearches	| columns smartGroupColumn searchGroup cmd |	columns := smartGroupBrowser navigationPanel columns.	smartGroupColumn := columns first.	smartGroupColumn switch selection: O2PackageBrowser smartGroupSwitchIndex.	searchGroup := smartGroupColumn children 		detect: 			[ :ea | 			ea isSmartGroupCategory and: [ ea name = O2SmartRootNode searchGroupName ] ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	searchGroup name: 'blabla'.	self assert: searchGroup name = O2SmartRootNode searchGroupName.	cmd := O2CmdRenameSmartCategory 		on: searchGroup		for: 'dontcare'.	self deny: cmd isActive! !!O2EnhSmartGroupBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 11/6/2009 15:54'!testRememberingSearchNodeOnSwitch	| columns smartGroupColumn searchNode query aliasNode |	columns := smartGroupBrowser navigationPanel columns.	smartGroupColumn := columns first.	query := OrderedCollection with: 'O2EnhSmart'.	searchNode := O2ClassSearchNode on: query.	aliasNode := smartGroupBrowser root smartGroups 		detect: [ :node | node isSmartAlias and: [ node alias = searchNode ] ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	aliasNode ifNotNil: [ aliasNode remove ].	smartGroupBrowser navigationPanel addSearchToSmartGroup: searchNode.	aliasNode := smartGroupBrowser root smartGroups 		detect: [ :node | node isSmartAlias and: [ node alias = searchNode ] ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	self assert: smartGroupColumn selectedNode = aliasNode.	self assert: columns second selection = 1.	self assert: columns second selectedNode theClass = self class.	smartGroupColumn switch selection: 1.	self assert: smartGroupBrowser currentNode theClass = self class.	self assert: columns second selectedNode theClass = self class.	self assert: smartGroupColumn selectedNode name = 'O2-Enhancements-Tests'.	self assert: smartGroupBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = self class definition.	smartGroupColumn switch selection: O2PackageBrowser smartGroupSwitchIndex.	self assert: smartGroupBrowser currentNode isNil.	self assert: columns second selectedNode isNil.	self assert: smartGroupColumn selectedNode isNil.	self assert: smartGroupBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition isNil.	aliasNode remove.	self assert: (smartGroupBrowser root smartGroups noneSatisfy: [ :node | node isSmartAlias and: [ node alias = searchNode ] ])! !!O2EnhSmartGroupBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 11/6/2009 15:54'!testSearchSmartGroup	| columns smartGroupColumn searchNode query aliasNode size |	columns := smartGroupBrowser navigationPanel columns.	smartGroupColumn := columns first.	query := OrderedCollection with: 'O2EnhSmart'.	searchNode := O2ClassSearchNode on: query.	aliasNode := smartGroupBrowser root smartGroups 		detect: [ :node | node isSmartAlias and: [ node alias = searchNode ] ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	aliasNode ifNotNil: [ aliasNode remove ].	self assert: (smartGroupBrowser root smartGroups noneSatisfy: [ :node | node isSmartAlias and: [ node alias = searchNode ] ]).	smartGroupBrowser navigationPanel addSearchToSmartGroup: searchNode.	aliasNode := smartGroupBrowser root smartGroups 		detect: [ :node | node isSmartAlias and: [ node alias = searchNode ] ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	self assert: aliasNode notNil.	self assert: searchNode = aliasNode alias.	self assert: (smartGroupColumn children anySatisfy: [ :node | node isSmartAlias and: [ node alias = searchNode ] ]).	self assert: smartGroupColumn selectedNode = aliasNode.	self assert: columns second children size = 1.	self assert: (columns second children first isKindOf: O2ClassNode).	self assert: columns second children first theClass = self class.	self assert: columns second selectedNode theClass = self class.	self assert: smartGroupBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = self class definition.	"no double adding possible"	size := smartGroupColumn children size.	smartGroupBrowser navigationPanel addSearchToSmartGroup: searchNode copy.	self assert: size = smartGroupColumn children size.	self assert: (smartGroupBrowser root smartGroups select: [ :node | node isSmartAlias and: [ node alias = searchNode ] ]) size = 1.	aliasNode remove.	self assert: (smartGroupBrowser root smartGroups noneSatisfy: [ :node | node isSmartAlias and: [ node alias = searchNode ] ])! !!O2EnhSmartGroupBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 23:44'!testSmartGroupNodes	| columns smartGroupColumn searchGroup defaultGroup |	columns := smartGroupBrowser navigationPanel columns.	smartGroupColumn := columns first.	smartGroupColumn switch selection: O2PackageBrowser smartGroupSwitchIndex.	defaultGroup := smartGroupColumn children 		detect: [ :ea | ea isSmartGroupCategory and: [ ea name = 'default' ] ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	searchGroup := smartGroupColumn children 		detect: 			[ :ea | 			ea isSmartGroupCategory and: [ ea name = O2SmartRootNode searchGroupName ] ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	self assert: searchGroup notNil.	self deny: (O2CmdRemoveFromSmartGroup 			on: searchGroup			for: nil) isActive! !!O2EnhSmartGroupBrowserTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 23:45'!testSmartGroupSwitch	| columns smartGroupColumn smartCategories smartAlias idx |	columns := smartGroupBrowser navigationPanel columns.	smartGroupColumn := columns first.	self assert: smartGroupColumn switch selection = 1.	self assert: smartGroupColumn switch list size = 3.	self assert: smartGroupColumn children size = smartGroupBrowser root packages size.	smartGroupColumn switch selection: O2PackageBrowser smartGroupSwitchIndex.	self assert: smartGroupColumn switch selection = O2PackageBrowser smartGroupSwitchIndex.	self assert: smartGroupColumn children size = smartGroupBrowser root smartGroups size.	smartAlias := smartGroupBrowser root smartGroups 		detect: [ :ea | ea isSmartAlias ]		ifNone: [ nil ].	smartAlias ifNotNil: 		[ idx := smartGroupBrowser root smartGroups indexOf: smartAlias.		self assert: smartGroupColumn selectedNode isNil.		smartGroupColumn selection: idx.		self assert: smartGroupColumn selectedNode = smartAlias.		self assert: smartGroupBrowser currentNode = smartAlias.		self assert: smartGroupBrowser definitionPanel getDefinition text = smartAlias alias definition text ]! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!metagraphDFG	| d f g |	d := O2MetaNode named: 'D'.	f := O2MetaNode named: 'F'.	g := O2MetaNode named: 'G'.	d 		childAt: #d2f		put: f.	(d 		childAt: #d2g		put: g) navigateTree.	^ d! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!rootNodeD1FG	" 	 d1	 d2 -d2f-> f1	 d3 -d2f-> f2	 d3 -d2g-tree-> g1	 d4 -d2g-tree-> g2	"	| root |	root := O2FakeDNUNode tree: #(#d1 #(#(#d2f #noChildren ) #(#d2g #noChildren ) ) ).	root metaNode: self metagraphDFG.	^ root! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!rootNodeD2FG	" 	 d1	 d2 -d2f-> f1	 d3 -d2f-> f2	 d3 -d2g-tree-> g1	 d4 -d2g-tree-> g2	"	| root |	root := O2FakeDNUNode tree: #(			#d2			#(				#(#d2f #(#f1 #(#(#f2h #noChildren ) ) ) )				#(#d2g #noChildren )			)		).	root metaNode: self metagraphDFG.	^ root! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!rootNodeD3FG	"	 d1	 d2 -d2f-> f1	 d3 -d2f-> f2	 d3 -d2g-tree-> g1 	 d4 -d2g-tree-> g2	"	| root |	root := O2FakeDNUNode tree: #(#d3 #(#(#d2f #f2 ) #(#d2g #g1 ) ) ).	root metaNode: self metagraphDFG.	^ root! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!rootNodeD4FG	"	 d1	 d2 -d2f-> f1	 d3 -d2f-> f2	 d3 -d2g-tree-> g1	 d4 -d2g-tree-> g2 	"	| root |	root := O2FakeDNUNode tree: #(#d4 #(#(#d2g #g2 ) #(#d2f #noChildren ) ) ).	root metaNode: self metagraphDFG.	^ root! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!test01ChildrenOfD1	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD1FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 0.	fan := O2Fan defaultParent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 0.	fan := O2Fan treeParent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 0! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 11:18'!test02ChildrenOfD2	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD2FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 1.	fan := O2Fan treeParent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 0! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!test03ChildrenOfD3	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD3FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 2.	fan := O2Fan defaultParent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 1.	fan := O2Fan treeParent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 1! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 11:18'!test04ChildrenOfD4	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD4FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 1.	fan := O2Fan treeParent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 1! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 11:13'!test05RestrictToDefaultChildrenOfD1	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD1FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 0.	fan restrictToTreeChildrenAndAdjustSelection: 0.	self should: fan children size = 0! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!test06RestrictToTreeChildrenOfD1	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD1FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 0.	fan restrictToTreeChildrenAndAdjustSelection: 0.	self should: fan children size = 0! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 11:19'!test07RestrictToDefaultChildrenOfD2	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD2FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 1.	fan restrictToTreeChildrenAndAdjustSelection: 0.	self should: fan children size = 0! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!test08RestrictToTreeChildrenOfD2	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD2FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 1.	fan restrictToTreeChildrenAndAdjustSelection: 0.	self should: fan children size = 0! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 11:12'!test09RestrictToDefaultChildrenOfD3	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD3FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 2.	fan restrictToTreeChildrenAndAdjustSelection: 1.	self should: fan children size = 1! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!test10RestrictToTreeChildrenOfD3	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD3FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 2.	fan restrictToTreeChildrenAndAdjustSelection: 1.	self should: fan children size = 1! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 11:19'!test11RestrictToDefaultChildrenOfD4	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD4FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 1.	fan restrictToTreeChildrenAndAdjustSelection: 0.	self should: fan children size = 1! !!O2FanTestsTraitsIntegration methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!test12RestrictToTreeChildrenOfD4	| parent fan |	parent := self rootNodeD4FG.	fan := O2Fan parent: parent.	self should: fan children size = 1.	fan restrictToTreeChildrenAndAdjustSelection: 0.	self should: fan children size = 1! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNodeTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!test01	| m1 m11 m12 m2 m21 m22 |	m1 := O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode 		with: 1		parent: nil		position: 1		model: nil.	m11 := O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode 		with: 11		parent: m1		position: 1		model: nil.	m12 := O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode 		with: 12		parent: m1		position: 2		model: nil.	m2 := O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode 		with: 2		parent: nil		position: 2		model: nil.	m21 := O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode 		with: 21		parent: m2		position: 1		model: nil.	m22 := O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode 		with: 22		parent: m2		position: 2		model: nil.	self should: m1 path asArray = #(1 ).	self should: m11 path asArray = #(1 1 ).	self should: m12 path asArray = #(1 2 ).	self should: m2 path asArray = #(2 ).	self should: m21 path asArray = #(2 1 ).	self should: m22 path asArray = #(2 2 )! !!O2TreeColumnTests class methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 20:04'!isHierarchyBrowser	^ false! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 20:43'!announcer 	announcer ifNil: [announcer := O2Announcer new].	^ announcer ! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 20:48'!columnPanelABCDEFGH	| root panel |	root := self rootNodeABCDEFGH.	panel := O2EnhancementColumnPanel 		minPanes: 1		maxPanes: 1.	panel browser: self.	panel 		setMetaNode: root metaNode		node: root.	^ panel! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 16:17'!fixedButtonPanel 	^nil! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!metagraphABCD	| a b c d |	a := O2MetaNode named: 'A'.	b := O2MetaNode named: 'B'.	c := O2MetaNode named: 'C'.	d := O2MetaNode named: 'D'.	a 		childAt: #a2b		put: b.	b 		childAt: #b2c		put: c.	(b 		childAt: #b2d		put: d) navigateTree.	^ a! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!metagraphABCDEFGH	"A --> B --> C -tree-> E	       B -tree-> D --> F --> H	                  D -tree-> G	"	| a b c d e f g h |	a := O2MetaNode named: 'A'.	b := O2MetaNode named: 'B'.	c := O2MetaNode named: 'C'.	d := O2MetaNode named: 'D'.	e := O2MetaNode named: 'E'.	f := O2MetaNode named: 'F'.	g := O2MetaNode named: 'G'.	h := O2MetaNode named: 'H'.	a 		childAt: #a2b		put: b.	b 		childAt: #b2c		put: c.	(b 		childAt: #b2d		put: d) navigateTree.	(c 		childAt: #c2e		put: e) navigateTree.	d 		childAt: #d2f		put: f.	(d 		childAt: #d2g		put: g) navigateTree.	f 		childAt: #f2h		put: h.	^ a! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!metagraphABD	| a b d |	a := O2MetaNode named: 'A'.	b := O2MetaNode named: 'B'.	d := O2MetaNode named: 'D'.	a 		childAt: #children		put: b.	(b 		childAt: #children		put: d) navigateTree.	^ a! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!metagraphABDF	| a b d f |	a := O2MetaNode named: 'A'.	b := O2MetaNode named: 'B'.	d := O2MetaNode named: 'D'.	f := O2MetaNode named: 'F'.	a 		childAt: #children		put: b.	(b 		childAt: #children		put: d) navigateTree.	(d 		childAt: #children		put: f) navigateTree.	^ a! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!rootNodeABCDEFGH	"a1 -a2b-> b1 -b2c-> c1 -c2e-tree-> e1	                       c1 -c2e-tree-> e2	            b1 -b2c-> c2	            b1 -b2d-tree-> d1	            b1 -b2d-tree-> d2 -d2f-> f1	            b1 -b2d-tree-> d3 -d2f-> f2 -f2h-> h1	                             d3 -d2g-tree-> g1	            b1 -b2d-tree-> d4 -d2g-tree-> g2	 a1 -a2b-> b2 	"	| root |	root := O2FakeDNUNode tree: #(			#a1			#(				#(					#a2b					#(						#b1						#(							#(								#b2c								#(#c1 #(#(#c2e #e1 #e2 ) ) )								#(#c2 #(#(#c2e #noChildren ) ) )							)							#(								#b2d								#(									#d1									#(										#(#d2f #noChildren )										#(#d2g #noChildren )									)								)								#(									#d2									#(										#(#d2f #(#f1 #(#(#f2h #noChildren ) ) ) )										#(#d2g #noChildren )									)								)								#(									#d3									#(										#(#d2f #(#f2 #(#(#f2h #h1 ) ) ) )										#(#d2g #g1 )									)								)								#(#d4 #(#(#d2g #g2 ) #(#d2f #noChildren ) ) )							)						)					)					#(#b2 #(#(#b2c #noChildren ) #(#b2d #noChildren ) ) )				)			)		).	root metaNode: self metagraphABCDEFGH.	^ root! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 11/6/2009 16:02'!test01AllInOneColumn	"Nodes: a1 --> b1 -tree-> d1."	| root select |	root := O2Fake2Node tree: #(a1 ((b1 (d1)))).	root metaNode: self metagraphABD.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #d1.	"panel := OBTraitColumnPanel minPanes: 1 maxPanes: 1.	panel browser: self.	panel setMetaNode: root metaNode node: root.	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 1.	self assert: panel currentNode = select."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 11/6/2009 16:02'!test02AllInOneColumn	"Nodes: a1 -> b1 -tree-> d1 -tree-> f1."	| root select |	root := O2Fake2Node tree: #(a1 ((b1 ((d1 (f1)))))).	root metaNode: self metagraphABDF.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #f1. 	! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 20:47'!test03NodeWithBothTreeChildrenAndDefaultChildren	"Nodes: a1 -a2b-> b1 -b2d-tree-> d1.	                    b1 -b2c-> c1"	| root select panel |	root := O2FakeDNUNode tree: #(#a1 #(#(#a2b #(#b1 #(#(#b2d #d1 ) #(#b2c #c1 ) ) ) ) ) ).	root metaNode: self metagraphABCD.	panel := O2EnhancementColumnPanel 		minPanes: 1		maxPanes: 1.	panel browser: self.	panel 		setMetaNode: root metaNode		node: root.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #d1.	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 1.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #c1.	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 2.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #d1. 	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 1.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #b1.	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 2.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = select.	self assert: panel columns second parent = select.	self assert: panel columns second children anyOne = (O2Fake2Node tree: #c1)! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:07'!test04JumpToB2	"| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #b2. 	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 1.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #a1).	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = select."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 11/6/2009 16:03'!test05JumpToB1	| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #b1.	panel jumpTo: select. 	self assert: panel columns size = 2.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #a1).	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = select.	self assert: panel columns second parent = select.	self assert: panel columns first children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b2).	self assert: panel columns second children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns second children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #c1).	self assert: panel columns second children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #c2).! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:07'!test06JumpToC2	"| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #c2.	panel jumpTo: select. 	self assert: panel columns size = 2.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns second selectedNode = select. 		self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #a1).	self assert: panel columns second parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b2).	self assert: panel columns second children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns second children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #c1).	self assert: panel columns second children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #c2)."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:08'!test07JumpToC1	"| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #c1.	panel jumpTo: select. 	self assert: panel columns size = 2.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns second selectedNode = select.		self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #a1).	self assert: panel columns second parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b2).	self assert: panel columns second children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns second children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #c1).	self assert: panel columns second children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #c2)."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:06'!test08JumpToE1	"| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #e1. 	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 2.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns second selectedNode = select.		self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #a1).	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns second parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #c1).	self assert: panel columns first children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b2).	self assert: panel columns second children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns second children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #e1).	self assert: panel columns second children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #e2)."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:06'!test09JumpToE2	"| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #e2.	panel jumpTo: select. 	self assert: panel columns size = 2.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns second selectedNode = select.		self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #a1).	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns second parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #c1).	self assert: panel columns first children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b2).	self assert: panel columns second children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns second children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #e1).	self assert: panel columns second children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #e2)."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:06'!test10JumpToD1	"| select panel | 	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #d1.	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 1.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = select.		self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first children size = 4.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d2).	self assert: panel columns first children third = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).	self assert: panel columns first children fourth = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d4)."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:06'!test11JumpToD2	"| select panel | 	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #d2.	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 2.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = select.		self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns second parent = select.	self assert: panel columns second children size = 1.	self assert: panel columns second children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #f1).	self assert: panel columns first children size = 4.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d2).	self assert: panel columns first children third = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).	self assert: panel columns first children fourth = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d4)."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:06'!test12JumpToD3	"| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #d3. 	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 2.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = select.		self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns second parent = select.	self assert: panel columns second children size = 1.	self assert: panel columns second children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #f2).	self assert: panel columns first children size = 4.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d2).	self assert: panel columns first children third = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).	self assert: panel columns first children fourth = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d4)."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:06'!test13JumpToD4	"| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #d4. 	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 3.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = select.		self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first children size = 4.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d2).	self assert: panel columns first children third = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).	self assert: panel columns first children fourth = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d4)."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:07'!test14JumpToF1	"| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #f1.	panel jumpTo: select. 	self assert: panel columns size = 2.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns second selectedNode = select.		self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d2).	self assert: panel columns second parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d2).	self assert: panel columns first children size = 4.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d2).	self assert: panel columns first children third = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).	self assert: panel columns first children fourth = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d4).	self assert: panel columns second children size = 1.	self assert: panel columns second children first = select."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:07'!test15JumpToF2	"| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #f2.	panel jumpTo: select. 	self assert: panel columns size = 3.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns second selectedNode = select.		self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).	self assert: panel columns second parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).	self assert: panel columns third parent = select.	self assert: panel columns first children size = 4.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d2).	self assert: panel columns first children third = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).	self assert: panel columns first children fourth = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d4).	self assert: panel columns second children size = 1.	self assert: panel columns second children first = select.	self assert: panel columns third children size = 1.	self assert: panel columns third children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #h1)."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:07'!test16JumpToH1	"| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #h1.	panel jumpTo: select. 	self assert: panel columns size = 3.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns third selectedNode = select.		self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).	self assert: panel columns second parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).	self assert: panel columns second selectedNode = (O2Fake2Node tree: #f2).	self assert: panel columns third parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #f2).	self assert: panel columns first children size = 4.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d2).	self assert: panel columns first children third = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).	self assert: panel columns first children fourth = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d4).	self assert: panel columns second children size = 1.	self assert: panel columns second children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #f2).	self assert: panel columns third children size = 1.	self assert: panel columns third children first = select."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:07'!test17JumpToG1	"| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #g1.	panel jumpTo: select. 	self assert: panel columns size = 1.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d3).		self assert: panel columns first children size = 1.	self assert: panel columns first children first = select."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 21:07'!test18JumpToG2	"| select panel | 	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #g2.	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 1.	self assert: panel currentNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first selectedNode = select.	self assert: panel columns first parent = (O2Fake2Node tree: #d4).		self assert: panel columns first children size = 1.	self assert: panel columns first children first = select."! !!O2TreeColumnTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 11/6/2009 16:08'!test19JumpToA1	| select panel |	panel := self columnPanelABCDEFGH.	select := O2Fake2Node tree: #a1. 	panel jumpTo: select.	self assert: panel columns size = 1.	self assert: panel columns first parent = select.		self assert: panel columns first children size = 2.	self assert: panel columns first children first = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b1).	self assert: panel columns first children second = (O2Fake2Node tree: #b2).! !!O2TreeFanTests methodsFor: 'support' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/6/2009 11:23'!makeTreeFanStructure	"aTreeFan<fan: 0>  - aTreeFan<fan: 1>  - aTreeFan<fan: 2>    + aTreeFan<fan: 3>       - aTreeFan<fan: 4>       - aTreeFan<fan: 5>	"	| t0 t01 t02 t021 t0211 t0212 |	t0 := O2TreeNodeMediator fan: (O2Fan 			parent: 0			children: #('1' '2' )).	t01 := (O2TreeNodeMediator 		fan: (O2Fan 				parent: 1				children: #()))		parent: t0		at: 1.	t02 := (O2TreeNodeMediator 		fan: (O2Fan 				parent: 2				children: #('3')))		parent: t0		at: 2.	t021 := (O2TreeNodeMediator 		fan: (O2Fan 				parent: 3				children: #('4' '5' )))		parent: t02		at: 1.	t0211 := (O2TreeNodeMediator 		fan: (O2Fan 				parent: 4				children: #()))		parent: t021		at: 1.	t0212 := (O2TreeNodeMediator 		fan: (O2Fan 				parent: 5				children: #()))		parent: t021		at: 2.	^ t0! !!O2TreeFanTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'jk 12/10/2007 14:15'!test01fanAt	| f |	f := self makeTreeFanStructure.		self assert: (f fanAt: #(1)) parent = 0.	self assert: (f fanAt: #(2)) parent = 0.	self assert: (f fanAt: #(2 1)) parent = 2.	self assert: (f fanAt: #(2 1 1)) parent = 3.	self assert: (f fanAt: #(2 1 2)) parent = 3.! !!O2TreeFanTests methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'jk 12/10/2007 20:23'!test02nodeAt	| f |	f := self makeTreeFanStructure.		self assert: (f nodeAt: #(1)) = '1'.	self assert: (f nodeAt: #(2)) = '2'.	self assert: (f nodeAt: #(2 1)) = '3'.	self assert: (f nodeAt: #(2 1 1)) = '4'.	self assert: (f nodeAt: #(2 1 2)) = '5'.! !!TestCase class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!methodsFailed	^(self lastRun at: #failures), (self lastRun at: #errors)! !!TestCase class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!methodsPassed	^self lastRun at: #passed! !!ParagraphEditor methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!findClass: characterStream	^self find: characterStream! !!VariableEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 34985771!browserClass	^ OR2VariableBrowser! !!IndentingListItemMorph methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!initWithContents: aString font: aFont emphasis: emphasisCode   "fix problem of wrong emphasis of font used for tree items"   super initWithContents: aString font: (aFont emphasis: 0) emphasis: emphasisCode! !!O2IndentingListItemMorph methodsFor: 'drawing' stamp: 'dr 12/2/2008 15:50'!drawOn: aCanvas	| tRect sRect columnRect columnScanner columnData columnLeft colorToUse |	tRect := self toggleRectangle.	sRect := bounds withLeft: tRect right + 4.	self drawToggleOn: aCanvas in: tRect.	colorToUse := complexContents preferredColor ifNil: [color].	complexContents backgroundColor ifNotNilDo: [:aColor | aCanvas fillRectangle: sRect color: aColor].	icon isNil ifFalse:[		aCanvas			translucentImage: icon			at: sRect left @ (self top + (self height - icon height // 2)).		sRect := sRect left: sRect left + icon width + 2.	].	(container columns isNil or: [(contents asString indexOf: Character tab) = 0]) ifTrue: [		sRect := sRect top: sRect top + sRect bottom - self fontToUse height // 2.		aCanvas drawString: contents asString in: sRect font: self fontToUse color: colorToUse.	] ifFalse: [		columnLeft := sRect left.		columnScanner := ReadStream on: contents asString.		container columns do: [ :width |			columnRect := columnLeft @ sRect top extent: width @ sRect height.			columnData := columnScanner upTo: Character tab.			columnData isEmpty ifFalse: [				aCanvas drawString: columnData in: columnRect font: self fontToUse color: colorToUse.			].			columnLeft := columnRect right + 5.		].	]! !!O2InteractionRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 12/7/2004 00:13' prior: 35442132!OBInteractionRequest is an abstract superclass for notifications that request some interaction with the user. It's useful for catching such notifications in an exception handler, while allowing other notifications to operate normally.!!O2BrowseRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 12/7/2004 00:10' prior: 35442431!This notification is raised whenever a browser needs to be opened. The default action is to open a SystemWindow in Morphic, but it can be caught in situations where that's not appropriate. The OB test suite uses this extensively. !!O2BrowseRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'cwp 10/17/2004 18:45'!signal: aBrowser	^ (self new browser: aBrowser) signal! !!O2BrowseRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 10/17/2004 18:45'!browser	^ browser! !!O2BrowseRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!browser: aBrowser	browser := aBrowser! !!O2BrowseRequest methodsFor: 'dispatching' stamp: 'cwp 5/25/2007 22:51'!handleWith: anObject	^ anObject handleBrowseRequest: self! !!O2BrowseRequest methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 10/17/2004 19:32'!isBrowseRequest	^ true! !!O2ChoiceRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:26' prior: 35442725!This notification is used to ask the user for to choose from a list of alternatives. Its defaultAction is to open a PopUpMenu. Test cases an intercept the notification and respond programmatically.prompt	- A string describing the choice the user is asked to make.labels	- A list of strings describing the alternatives.values	- When the user chooses an alternative, the corresponding item from this list is returned!!O2ChoiceRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'cwp 7/9/2006 00:07'!labels: anArray	^ self		prompt: nil		labels: anArray		values: anArray		lines: #()! !!O2ChoiceRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'cwp 7/9/2006 00:08'!labels: labelArray lines: lineArray	^ self		prompt: nil		labels: labelArray		values: labelArray		lines: lineArray! !!O2ChoiceRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'cwp 7/9/2006 00:06'!prompt: aString labels: labelArray values: valueArray	^ self		prompt: aString		labels: labelArray		 values: valueArray		lines: #()! !!O2ChoiceRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'cwp 7/9/2006 00:05'!prompt: aString labels: labelArray values: valueArray lines: lineArray	^ (self new 		setPrompt: aString 		labels: labelArray 		values: valueArray 		lines: lineArray) 			signal! !!O2ChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'dispatching' stamp: 'cwp 6/1/2007 16:38'!handleWith: anObject	^ anObject handleChoiceRequest: self! !!O2ChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 7/8/2006 23:45'!labels	^ labels! !!O2ChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 7/9/2006 00:11'!lines	^ lines! !!O2ChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 7/8/2006 23:45'!prompt	^ prompt! !!O2ChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'signaling' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!select: aString	| index |	index := labels indexOf: aString.	self resume: (values at: index ifAbsent: [nil])! !!O2ChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!setPrompt: aString labels: labelArray values: valueArray lines: lineArray	prompt := aString.	labels := labelArray.	values := valueArray.	lines := lineArray.! !!O2ChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 7/8/2006 23:45'!values	^ values! !!O2MultipleChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'dispatching' stamp: 'lr 4/5/2008 09:27'!handleWith: anObject	^ anObject handleMultipleChoiceRequest: self! !!O2MultipleChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 4/5/2008 10:34'!label: anObject	^ ((selection includes: anObject) ifTrue: [ '<yes>' ] ifFalse: [ '<no>' ]) , 	  (labels at: (values indexOf: anObject ifAbsent: [ ^ nil ]))! !!O2MultipleChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 4/5/2008 10:30'!selection	^ selection! !!O2MultipleChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'lr 4/5/2008 10:35'!setPrompt: aString labels: labelArray values: valueArray lines: lineArray	super setPrompt: aString labels: labelArray values: valueArray lines: lineArray.	selection := IdentitySet withAll: valueArray! !!O2MultipleChoiceRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 4/5/2008 10:31'!toggle: anObject	(selection includes: anObject)		ifTrue: [ selection remove: anObject ]		ifFalse: [ selection add: anObject ]! !!O2CloseRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'avi 12/5/2007 13:17'!signal: aBrowser	^ (self new browser: aBrowser) signal! !!O2CloseRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'avi 12/5/2007 13:17'!browser	^ browser! !!O2CloseRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!browser: aBrowser	browser := aBrowser! !!O2CloseRequest methodsFor: 'dispatching' stamp: 'avi 12/5/2007 13:17'!handleWith: anObject	^ anObject handleCloseRequest: self! !!O2ConfirmationRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:30' prior: 35443213!This notification is used to ask the user to confirm some kind potentially dangerous operation. Its default action is to open a PopUpMenu.iVars:prompt		- a string describing the situation the user is asked to confirmconfirm		- a string describing the action that will be taken if the user confirmscancel		- a string describing the action that will be taken if the user does not confirm!!O2ConfirmationRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'cwp 2/28/2004 12:09'!newPrompt: prompt confirm: confirm cancel: cancel	^ self new setPrompt: prompt confirm: confirm cancel: cancel! !!O2ConfirmationRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'cwp 2/28/2004 12:13'!prompt: prompt	^ self prompt: prompt confirm: 'Ok'! !!O2ConfirmationRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'cwp 2/28/2004 12:12'!prompt: prompt confirm: confirm	^ self prompt: prompt confirm: confirm cancel: 'Cancel'! !!O2ConfirmationRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'cwp 2/28/2004 12:02'!prompt: prompt confirm: confirm cancel: cancel	^ (self newPrompt: prompt confirm: confirm cancel: cancel) signal! !!O2ConfirmationRequest methodsFor: 'responding' stamp: 'cwp 6/1/2007 16:58'!cancel	^ self resume: false! !!O2ConfirmationRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 6/1/2007 16:46'!cancelChoice	^ cancel! !!O2ConfirmationRequest methodsFor: 'dispatching' stamp: 'cwp 6/1/2007 16:40'!handleWith: anObject	^ anObject handleConfirmationRequest: self! !!O2ConfirmationRequest methodsFor: 'responding' stamp: 'cwp 2/28/2004 12:11'!ok	self resume: true! !!O2ConfirmationRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 6/1/2007 16:46'!okChoice	^ confirm! !!O2ConfirmationRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 6/1/2007 16:44'!prompt	^ prompt! !!O2ConfirmationRequest methodsFor: 'initalizing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!setPrompt: promptString confirm: confirmString cancel: cancelString	prompt := promptString.	confirm := confirmString.	cancel := cancelString! !!O2InformRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'dc 7/22/2007 20:31'!message: aString	^ (self new		message: aString;		yourself) signal! !!O2InformRequest methodsFor: 'dispatching' stamp: 'dc 7/22/2007 20:26'!handleWith: anObject	^ anObject handleInformRequest: self! !!O2InformRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dc 7/22/2007 20:28'!message	^ message! !!O2InformRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dc 7/22/2007 20:28'!message: aString 	message := aString! !!O2InteractionRequest methodsFor: 'exceptionDescription' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultAction	^ self handleWith: O2Platform current! !!O2InteractionRequest methodsFor: 'dispatching' stamp: 'dc 7/22/2007 20:27'!handleWith: anObject	self subclassResponsibility ! !!O2InteractionRequest methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 10/17/2004 19:31'!isBrowseRequest	^ false! !!O2MultiLineTextRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'dkh 12/19/2007 09:11'!prompt: aString	^ self prompt: aString template: ''! !!O2MultiLineTextRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'dkh 12/19/2007 09:11'!prompt: promptString template: templateString	^ (self new prompt: promptString; template: templateString) signal! !!O2MultiLineTextRequest methodsFor: 'dispatching' stamp: 'dkh 12/19/2007 09:12'!handleWith: anObject	^ anObject handleMultiLineTextRequest: self! !!O2MultiLineTextRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dkh 12/19/2007 09:11'!prompt	^ prompt! !!O2MultiLineTextRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!prompt: aString	prompt := aString! !!O2MultiLineTextRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dkh 12/19/2007 09:11'!template	^ template! !!O2MultiLineTextRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!template: aString	template := aString! !!O2TextRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:35' prior: 35443666!This notification is used to ask the user to supply a short piece of text. Its defaultAction is to open a FillInTheBlank.iVars:prompt		- a string describing the text the user is asked to supplytemplate	- a default reply !!O2TextRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'dc 7/23/2007 16:51'!prompt: aString	^ self prompt: aString template: ''! !!O2TextRequest class methodsFor: 'exceptionInstantiator' stamp: 'cwp 2/5/2004 20:31'!prompt: promptString template: templateString	^ (self new prompt: promptString; template: templateString) signal! !!O2TextRequest methodsFor: 'dispatching' stamp: 'cwp 6/1/2007 16:40'!handleWith: anObject	^ anObject handleTextRequest: self! !!O2TextRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 2/2/2004 21:24'!prompt	^ prompt! !!O2TextRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!prompt: aString	prompt := aString! !!O2TextRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 2/2/2004 21:00'!template	^ template! !!O2TextRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!template: aString	template := aString! !!O2WaitRequest commentStamp: 'lr 5/14/2008 15:32' prior: 35443953!This notification is used to tell the user to wait while some longer action is performed. The default action is to show a hourglass instead of the normal cursor.iVars:block		- the code to execute!!O2WaitRequest class methodsFor: 'instance-creation' stamp: 'lr 5/14/2008 15:47'!block: aBlock	^ self new block: aBlock; signal! !!O2WaitRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 5/14/2008 15:41'!block	^ block! !!O2WaitRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 5/14/2008 15:41'!block: aBlock	block := aBlock! !!O2WaitRequest methodsFor: 'dispatching' stamp: 'lr 5/14/2008 15:41'!handleWith: anObject	^ anObject handleWaitRequest: self! !!O2SourceFilesRequest commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:09' prior: 35444221!OBSourceFilesRequest is used to work around the fact that Squeak's source files are stored in a global array called SourceFiles. When testing OBMethodVersion and OBVersionBrowser, we don't want to use the real source files, as they are too unpredictable. Instead the test cases supply a source file array with known contents.Therefore, OBMethodVersion never refers directly to the SourceFiles global. Instead it raises an OBSourceFiles request. If this occurs during a test, the test catches the notification and resumes using the test source files. Otherwise, the default action resumes using the global source file array.!!O2SourceFilesRequest methodsFor: 'exceptionDescription'!defaultAction	^ SourceFiles! !!O2SourceFilesRequest methodsFor: 'exceptionDescription' stamp: 'cwp 11/27/2004 22:49'!isBrowseRequest	^ false! !!O2PluggableListMorphOfMany commentStamp: 'dr 7/14/2008 11:37' prior: 35444921!OBPluggableListMorphOfMany makes sure that a multiple selection list as implemented in PluggableListMorphOfMany can be integrated in OmniBrowser.In particular, it assures that icons can be displayed for list elements and that drag & drop works. This multiple selection list is only used in the method column in the class browser, here methods can be dragged by selecting a particular method while holding the mouse down. Moving the mouse cursor while a method is dragged to a method category allows the user to drop this method in this category. There are currently no other means to drag & drop list elements.!!O2PluggableListMorphOfMany methodsFor: 'list management' stamp: 'dr 8/21/2007 15:20'!iconAt: index	^ model iconAt: index! !!O2PluggableListMorphOfMany methodsFor: 'list management' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!listMorphClass	^ O2LazyListMorph! !!O2PluggableListMorphOfMany methodsFor: 'event handling' stamp: 'dr 2/18/2009 11:38'!mouseDown: evt	| selectors row oldIndex oldVal |	oldVal := nil.	evt yellowButtonPressed  "First check for option (menu) click"		ifTrue: [^ self yellowButtonActivity: evt shiftPressed].	row := self rowAtLocation: evt position.	row = 0  ifTrue: [^super mouseDown: evt].	"self dragEnabled ifTrue: [aMorph highlightForMouseDown]."		model okToChange ifFalse: [^ self].  "No change if model is locked"	"Set meaning for subsequent dragging of selection"	dragOnOrOff := (self listSelectionAt: row) not.	oldIndex := self getCurrentSelectionIndex.	oldIndex ~= 0 ifTrue: [oldVal := self listSelectionAt: oldIndex].	"Set or clear new primary selection (listIndex)"	dragOnOrOff		ifTrue: [self changeModelSelection: row]		ifFalse: [self changeModelSelection: 0].	"Need to restore the old one, due to how model works, and set new one."	oldIndex ~= 0 ifTrue: [self listSelectionAt: oldIndex put: oldVal].	self listSelectionAt: row put: dragOnOrOff.			selectors := Array 		with: nil"#click:"		with: (doubleClickSelector ifNotNil:[#doubleClick:])		with: nil		with: (self dragEnabled ifTrue:[#startDrag:] ifFalse:[nil]).	evt hand waitForClicksOrDrag: self event: evt selectors: selectors threshold: 10 ! !!O2PluggableListMorphOfMany methodsFor: 'event handling' stamp: 'dr 2/18/2009 11:38'!mouseMove: evt	| oldIndex oldVal row |	oldVal := nil. 	(self dropEnabled and: [evt hand hasSubmorphs]) 		ifFalse:[^super mouseMove: evt].	potentialDropRow ifNotNil:[		potentialDropRow = (self rowAtLocation: evt position)			ifTrue:[^self]. 	].	self mouseLeaveDragging: evt.	(self containsPoint: evt position) 		ifTrue:[self mouseEnterDragging: evt].			"Set meaning for subsequent dragging of selection"	oldIndex := self getCurrentSelectionIndex.	oldIndex ~= 0 ifTrue: [oldVal := self listSelectionAt: oldIndex].     row := self rowAtLocation: evt position.	"Set or clear new primary selection (listIndex)"	(dragOnOrOff ifNil: [dragOnOrOff := (self listSelectionAt: row) not. ])		ifTrue: [self changeModelSelection: row]		ifFalse: [self changeModelSelection: 0].	"Need to restore the old one, due to how model works, and set new one."	oldIndex ~= 0 ifTrue: [self listSelectionAt: oldIndex put: oldVal].	self listSelectionAt: row put: dragOnOrOff.	row changed! !!O2PluggableListMorphOfMany methodsFor: 'event handling' stamp: 'dr 11/30/2007 11:18'!mouseUp: event 	"The mouse came up within the list; take appropriate action"	| row |	row := self rowAtLocation: event position.	"aMorph ifNotNil: [aMorph highlightForMouseDown: false]."	model okToChange		ifFalse: [^ self].	"No change if model is locked"		dragOnOrOff := nil.  "So improperly started drags will have not effect"			"row == self selectionIndex		ifTrue: [(autoDeselect ifNil: [true]) ifTrue:[row == 0 ifFalse: [self changeModelSelection: 0] ]]		ifFalse: [self changeModelSelection: row]."	Cursor normal show! !!O2PluggableListMorphOfMany methodsFor: 'event handling' stamp: 'dr 2/8/2008 10:00'!specialKeyPressed: asciiValue	"A special key with the given ascii-value was pressed; dispatch it"	| oldSelection result |	oldSelection := self getCurrentSelectionIndex.	result := super specialKeyPressed: asciiValue.		self listSelectionAt: oldSelection put: false.	^result! !!ProtocolEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35000904!browserClass	^ OR2ProtocolBrowser! !!Metaclass methodsFor: '*o2-standard-converting' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2ClassSideNode	^ O2MetaclassNode on: self! !!Metaclass methodsFor: '*o2-standard-converting' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2Node	^ O2MetaclassNode on: self! !!O2CmdRenameMethodRefactoring methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 6/5/2009 16:49'!cluster	^nil! !!O2CmdRenameMethodRefactoring methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 6/26/2009 10:04'!group	^#xAdditional! !!O2CmdRenameMethodRefactoring methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 6/5/2009 16:50'!isActive	^target isMethodNode and: [requestor isSelected: target]! !!O2CmdRenameMethodRefactoring methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 6/5/2009 16:49'!label	^'rename refactor...'! !!RBBasicLintRule methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-converting' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 15:38'!asO2Node	^ OR2BasicLintNode on: self! !!RBBasicLintRule methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35002569!browserInstance	^ self filteredResult browserInstance! !!RBBasicLintRule methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35002701!open	^ self browserInstance open! !!MenuIcons class methodsFor: '*omnibrowser2-services' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:11'!o2TryIcons: anArray 	| selector |	selector := anArray 		detect: [ :ea | self respondsTo: ea ]		ifNone: [ self blankIcon ].	^ MenuIcons perform: selector! !!MenuMorph methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 35003125!add: label target: anObject selector: aSelector enabled: aBoolean icon: aSymbol	self add: label target: anObject selector: aSelector.	self lastItem isEnabled: aBoolean.	Preferences menuWithIcons		ifTrue: [self lastItem icon: (self iconNamed: aSymbol)]! !!MenuMorph methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 35003451!addSubmenu: aString enabled: aBoolean	"Append the given submenu with the given label."	| item submenu |	item := MenuItemMorph new.	submenu := MenuMorph new.	item 		contents: aString;		isEnabled: aBoolean;		subMenu: submenu.	self addMorphBack: item.	^ submenu! !!MenuMorph methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 35003790!iconNamed: aSymbol	| sel |	aSymbol ifNil: [^ MenuIcons blankIcon].	sel := (MenuIcons respondsTo: aSymbol)			ifTrue: [aSymbol]			ifFalse: [('small', aSymbol capitalized) asSymbol].	^ MenuIcons perform: sel! !!PackageEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35004313!browserClass	^ OR2PackageBrowser! !!MessageSend methodsFor: '*omnibrowser2-evaluating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 35005602!valueWithPossibleArgs: anArray	^ receiver 		perform: selector 		withArguments: (self collectArguments: anArray)! !!MCWorkingCopy methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2Node	^ O2MonticelloPackageNode on: self! !!MCWorkingCopy methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!includesCategoryWithName: aString   ^aString beginsWith: self packageName, '-'! !!MCWorkingCopy methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!isDummy    ^false! !!O2PluggableTextMorph commentStamp: 'cwp 12/7/2004 00:04' prior: 35445603!This is a trivial subclass of PluggableTextMorph. It overrides initialization methods to use an OBTextMorph rather than a regular TextMorph!!O2PluggableTextMorph methodsFor: 'model access' stamp: 'dkh 1/9/2009 10:58'!getColor	"Use a fixed selector until we find the need to make the selector pluggable"		^model color! !!O2PluggableTextMorph methodsFor: 'menu' stamp: 'dr 9/5/2008 11:28'!getMenu: shiftKeyState	"Answer the menu for this text view, supplying an empty menu to be filled in. If the menu selector takes an extra argument, pass in the current state of the shift key."	| menu aMenu aTitle | 	getMenuSelector == nil ifTrue: [^ nil].	menu := MenuMorph new defaultTarget: model. 	aTitle := getMenuTitleSelector ifNotNil: [model perform: getMenuTitleSelector].	aMenu := model menu: menu shifted: shiftKeyState selection: self selectionNode.	aTitle ifNotNil:  [aMenu addTitle: aTitle].	^ aMenu! !!O2PluggableTextMorph methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!handleMouseDown: event	super handleMouseDown: event.	model notifyMouseEnter.! !!O2PluggableTextMorph methodsFor: 'event handling' stamp: 'cwp 10/30/2004 23:07'!keyStroke: evt	^ textMorph keyStroke: evt! !!O2PluggableTextMorph methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!removeIcons	(Smalltalk hasClassNamed: #ALMain) ifTrue: [		(Smalltalk classNamed: #ALMain) default typedInBrowser: model browser.	].! !!O2PluggableTextMorph methodsFor: 'access' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!selectionNode	^ O2TextSelection 		on: self selectionInterval		inText: self text! !!O2PluggableTextMorph methodsFor: 'model access' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!setText: aText 	scrollBar setValue: 0.0.	textMorph 		ifNil: 			[ textMorph := O2TextMorph new 				contents: aText				wrappedTo: self innerBounds width - 6.			textMorph setEditView: self.			scroller addMorph: textMorph ]		ifNotNil: [ textMorph newContents: aText ].	self hasUnacceptedEdits: false.	self setScrollDeltas! !!O2PluggableTextMorph methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 3/19/2009 11:27'!update: aSymbol 	super update: aSymbol.	aSymbol == #accept ifTrue: [ ^self accept ].	aSymbol == #color ifTrue: [ ^self color: self getColor ].	aSymbol == #displayWorld  ifTrue: [ ^self currentWorld displayWorld ]! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'tween 4/24/2007 16:28'!on: anObject text: getTextSel accept: setTextSel readSelection: getSelectionSel menu: getMenuSel	|styler answer stylerClass |	answer := self new.	stylerClass := Smalltalk classNamed: #SHTextStylerST80.	styler := stylerClass		ifNotNil:[			stylerClass new				view: answer;				yourself].	^ answer		styler: styler;		on: anObject		text: getTextSel		accept: setTextSel		readSelection: getSelectionSel		menu: getMenuSel! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'accepting' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:00'!acceptTextInModel 		self okToStyle ifFalse:[^super acceptTextInModel].				"#correctFrom:to:with: is sent when the method source is	manipulated during compilation (removing unused temps,	changing selectors etc). But 	#correctFrom:to:with: operates 	on the textMorph's text, and we may be saving an unstyled 	copy of the text. This means that these corrections will be lost	unless we also apply the corrections to the unstyled copy that we are saving.		So remember the unstyled copy in unstyledAcceptText, so	that when #correctFrom:to:with: is received we can also apply	the correction to it"	unstyledAcceptText := styler unstyledTextFrom: textMorph asText.	[^setTextSelector isNil or:		[setTextSelector numArgs = 2			ifTrue: [model perform: setTextSelector with: unstyledAcceptText with: self]			ifFalse: [model perform: setTextSelector with: unstyledAcceptText]]	] ensure:[unstyledAcceptText := nil]! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:00'!classOrMetaClass: aBehavior	"set the classOrMetaClass in the receiver's styler to aBehavior"			styler classOrMetaClass: aBehavior ! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:00'!correctFrom: start to: stop with: aString	"see the comment in #acceptTextInModel "	unstyledAcceptText ifNotNil:[unstyledAcceptText replaceFrom: start to: stop with: aString ].	^ super correctFrom: start to: stop with: aString! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:00'!environment: anObject	"set the environment in the receiver's styler to anObject"			styler environment: anObject ! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:00'!font: aFont	super font: aFont.	styler ifNotNil: [styler font: aFont]! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:01'!hasUnacceptedEdits: aBoolean	"re-implemented to re-style the text iff aBoolean is true"	 	super hasUnacceptedEdits: aBoolean.	(aBoolean and: [self okToStyle])		ifTrue: [ styler styleInBackgroundProcess: textMorph contents]! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:01'!okToStyle	styler ifNil:[^false].	Preferences syntaxHighlightingAsYouType ifFalse: [^false].	(model respondsTo: #shoutAboutToStyle: ) ifFalse:[^true].	^model shoutAboutToStyle: self! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:14'!privateSetText: aText	scrollBar setValue: 0.0.	textMorph		ifNil: [textMorph := self textMorphClass new						contents: aText wrappedTo: self innerBounds width-6.				textMorph setEditView: self.				scroller addMorph: textMorph]		ifNotNil: [textMorph newContents: aText].	self hasUnacceptedEdits: false.	self setScrollDeltas.! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:14'!setText: aText		self okToStyle ifFalse:[^self privateSetText: aText].	self privateSetText: (styler format: aText asText).	aText size < 4096		ifTrue:[	styler style: textMorph contents]		ifFalse:[styler styleInBackgroundProcess:  textMorph contents]! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:01'!sourceMap: aSortedCollection	"set the sourceMap in the receiver's styler to aSortedCollection"			styler sourceMap: aSortedCollection! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:01'!styler	^styler! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:02'!styler: anObject		styler := anObject! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 11/16/2007 07:17'!stylerStyled: styledCopyOfText	textMorph contents runs: styledCopyOfText runs .	"textMorph paragraph recomposeFrom: 1 to: textMorph contents size delta: 0."  "caused chars to appear in wrong order esp. in demo mode. remove this line when sure it is fixed"	textMorph updateFromParagraph.	selectionInterval 		ifNotNil:[			textMorph editor				selectInvisiblyFrom: selectionInterval first to: selectionInterval last;				storeSelectionInParagraph;				setEmphasisHere].	textMorph editor blinkParen.	self scrollSelectionIntoView! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:02'!stylerStyledInBackground: styledCopyOfText 	"It is possible that the text string	has changed since the styling began. Disregard the styles if styledCopyOfText's string differs with the current textMorph contents string"		textMorph contents string = styledCopyOfText string		ifTrue: [self stylerStyled: styledCopyOfText]	! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!textMorphClass	"Answer the class used to create the receiver's textMorph"	^ O2TextMorphWithShout! !!O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'styler' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:02'!workspace: anObject	"set the workspace in the receiver's styler to anObject"			styler workspace: anObject ! !!Behavior methodsFor: '*omnibrowser2-converting' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:11'!asO2Announcement	^ self new! !!Behavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!conflictsSelectors	| conflictSelectors |	conflictSelectors := IdentitySet new.	self hasTraitComposition ifFalse: [^ conflictSelectors].	self traitComposition allTraits do:				 [:eachTrait | 				 conflictSelectors addAll: (eachTrait allSelectors select: 					[:each | (self compiledMethodAt: each) isConflict])].	^ conflictSelectors! !!Behavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!overridesSelectors	^ (superclass selectors intersection: self selectors) union:	  (self localSelectors intersection: self traitCompositionSelectors)! !!Behavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!selfSentSelectors	^self sendCaches selfSenders keys! !!Behavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 17395351!selfSentSelectorsFromSelectors: interestingSelectors 	| m result info |	result := IdentitySet new.	interestingSelectors collect: 			[:sel | 			m := self compiledMethodAt: sel ifAbsent: [].			m ifNotNil: 					[info := (SendInfo on: m) collectSends.					info selfSentSelectors do: [:sentSelector | result add: sentSelector]]].	^result! !!Behavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 17396221!setTraitCompositionFrom: aTraitExpression	^ self setTraitComposition: aTraitExpression asTraitComposition! !!Behavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!subclassRequiredSelectors	| selectors  |	selectors := IdentitySet new.	self allSubclasses do: 		[:aSubclass |		selectors addAll: (aSubclass selfSentSelectors difference: aSubclass localSelectors)].	^selectors! !!Behavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!superSenderSelectors	| superSenderSelectors |	superSenderSelectors := IdentitySet new.		self sendCaches superSenders		 ifNotNilDo: [:each |					each do: [:each2 | 							 each2 do: [ :each3 |superSenderSelectors add: each3 ]]].	^ superSenderSelectors ! !!Behavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!suppliedSelectors	^ (self localSelectors intersection: self subclassRequiredSelectors )   union:	  (self localSelectors intersection: self traitCompositionRequiredSelectors)! !!Behavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!traitCompositionRequiredSelectors	| traitCompositionRequiredSelectors |	traitCompositionRequiredSelectors  := IdentitySet new.	self traitComposition traits do: [:each | traitCompositionRequiredSelectors addAll: each requiredSelectors ].	^  traitCompositionRequiredSelectors ! !!Behavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!traitCompositionSelectors	| traitCompositionSelectors |	traitCompositionSelectors  := IdentitySet new.	self traitComposition traits do: [:each | traitCompositionSelectors addAll: each selectors ].	^  traitCompositionSelectors ! !!Text methodsFor: '*omnibrowser2-morphic' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36' prior: 35013744!colorAt: characterIndex    | textColor |     textColor := (self attributesAt: characterIndex) detect: [:att | att isMemberOf: TextColor] ifNone: [TextColor black].    ^textColor color! !!Text methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!hasColor    ^(self colorAt: 1) ~= TextColor black! !!BorderedSubpaneDividerMorph methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 35436575!styleWith: aBuilder	self vResizing = #spaceFill 		ifTrue: [aBuilder styleVerticalDivider: self]		ifFalse: [aBuilder styleHorizontalDivider: self]! !!TraitDescription methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!asCommentNodeOf: aParentNode 	^ O2UsedTraitCommentNode 		on: self		of: aParentNode! !!TraitDescription methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:44'!o2BrowserIcon	^ nil! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph commentStamp: 'dr 6/12/2007 15:21' prior: 35445813!I represent a button morph which is draggable. Other draggable button morphs can be dropped on me.!!O2BackButtonMorph methodsFor: 'mouse events' stamp: 'dr 2/8/2008 16:46'!handlesMouseStillDown: evt    ^true! !!O2BackButtonMorph methodsFor: 'mouse events' stamp: 'dr 3/4/2008 15:10'!mouseStillDown: evt     panel navigateHistoryInDirection: actionSelector.     super mouseStillDown: evt.     showSelectionFeedback := false.     self changed.! !!O2BackButtonMorph methodsFor: 'mouse events' stamp: 'dr 2/8/2008 16:48'!mouseStillDownThreshold    ^1000! !!O2BackButtonMorph methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/8/2008 16:07'!panel: aPanel    panel := aPanel! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph methodsFor: 'events-processing' stamp: 'dr 6/11/2007 15:44'!acceptDroppingMorph: aMorph event: evt      model dropMorph: aMorph.		self resetDropOn.	evt hand releaseMouseFocus: self.	Cursor normal show. ! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'dr 6/8/2007 15:25'!click: evt    super mouseDown: evt! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph methodsFor: 'drawing' stamp: 'dr 2/2/2009 10:23'!drawOn: aCanvas	super drawOn: aCanvas. 	    dropOn ifNotNil: [self highlightOn: aCanvas].! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph methodsFor: 'drawing' stamp: 'dr 6/11/2007 11:39'!highlightOn: aCanvas	| topLeft drawBounds |	topLeft := self topLeft x @ (self topLeft y + 1).	drawBounds := topLeft extent: self width @ (self height + 1).	drawBounds := drawBounds intersect: self bounds.	aCanvas frameRectangle: self innerBounds width: 1 color: Color blue! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'dr 2/8/2008 14:27'!mouseDown: evt	| selectors |	evt yellowButtonPressed  "First check for option (menu) click"		ifTrue: [^ self yellowButtonActivity: evt shiftPressed].	selectors := Array 		with: #click:		with: nil		with: nil		with: #startDrag:.	evt hand waitForClicksOrDrag: self event: evt selectors: selectors threshold: 10.! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'dr 7/7/2009 11:56'!mouseEnterDragging: evt	(self dropEnabled and: [evt hand hasSubmorphs]) ifFalse: [^super mouseEnterDragging: evt].		(self wantsDroppedMorph: evt hand firstSubmorph event: evt)		ifTrue: [			dropOn := true.						evt hand newMouseFocus: self.							self changed.		].! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'dr 9/10/2007 16:55'!mouseLeaveDragging: evt	(self dropEnabled and: [evt hand hasSubmorphs]) ifFalse: [^super mouseLeaveDragging: evt].	self resetDropOn.	evt hand releaseMouseFocus: self.! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'dr 7/7/2009 11:59'!mouseMove: evt	(self dropEnabled and: [evt hand hasSubmorphs]) ifFalse: [^super mouseMove: evt].			self mouseLeaveDragging: evt.	(self containsPoint: evt position) ifTrue: [self mouseEnterDragging: evt].! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'dr 6/11/2007 11:18'!resetDropOn    dropOn ifNotNil: [dropOn := nil. self changed].! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'dr 6/8/2007 15:54'!startDrag: evt 	| ddm |	evt hand hasSubmorphs ifTrue: [^self].	[  (self dragEnabled and: [model okToChange]) ifFalse: [^self].	   ddm := TransferMorph withPassenger: model from: self.        evt hand grabMorph: ddm]	ensure: [Cursor normal show. evt hand releaseMouseFocus: self]! !!O2DraggableButtonMorph methodsFor: 'drag and drop' stamp: 'dr 7/7/2009 12:11'!wantsDroppedMorph: transferMorph event: evt	(transferMorph isKindOf: TransferMorph ) ifTrue: [^model wantsDroppedMorph: transferMorph].	     ^false! !!RBLintRule methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-converting' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 15:37'!asO2Node	^ self subclassResponsibility! !!OR2PluggableRewriteRule class methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'lr 2/24/2009 17:10'!isVisible	^ false! !!OR2PluggableRewriteRule methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/24/2009 13:57'!name	^ 'Rewrite Code'! !!OR2PluggableRewriteRule methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/24/2009 13:53'!rewriteRule: aRule	rewriteRule := aRule! !!RBTransformationRule methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-converting' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 15:37'!asO2Node	^ OR2TransformationLintNode on: self! !!RBTransformationRule methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35439307!browserInstance	| change |	change := CompositeRefactoryChange named: self name.	change changes: self changes.	^ change browserInstance! !!RBTransformationRule methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35439528!open	^ self browserInstance open! !!ClassEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35441601!browserClass	^ self classNames size > 1 		ifTrue: [ OR2ClassBrowser ]		ifFalse: [ OR2SingleClassBrowser ]! !!RBCompositeLintRule methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-converting' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 15:37'!asO2Node	^ OR2CompositeLintNode on: self! !!RBMethodName methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35441098!printOn: aStream	| argumentStream |	self selector isNil 		ifTrue: [ self selector: (#value numArgs: self arguments size) ].	argumentStream := self arguments readStream.	self selector keywords keysAndValuesDo: [ :key :part |		key = 1 ifFalse: [ aStream space ].		aStream nextPutAll: part.		(self selector isUnary or: [ argumentStream atEnd ]) 			ifTrue: [ ^ self ].		aStream space; nextPutAll: argumentStream next ]! !!SystemOrganizer methodsFor: '*o2-standard-testing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 35441921!isClassOrganizer	^ false! !!OR2PrettyPrintCodeRefactoring methodsFor: 'preconditions' stamp: 'lr 10/23/2008 15:52'!preconditions	^ RBCondition empty! !!OR2PrettyPrintCodeRefactoring methodsFor: 'transforming' stamp: 'lr 7/4/2009 16:15'!transform	| classes parsed protocols |	classes := OrderedCollection new.	self model allClassesDo: [ :each | classes add: each ].	classes		do: [ :class |			class selectors do: [ :selector |				(self model environment includesSelector: selector in: class realClass) ifTrue: [					parsed := class parseTreeFor: selector.					parsed isNil ifFalse: [ 						protocols := class protocolsFor: selector.						class compile: parsed formattedCode classified: protocols ] ] ] ]		displayingProgress: 'Pretty Printing'! !!O2TextMorphEditor commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:27' prior: 35445977!OBTextMorphEditor overrides the TextMorphEditors handling of command keys, passing them along to its model for processing, rather than hard-coding their implementations.!!O2TextMorphEditor methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'alain.plantec 6/18/2008 09:10'!browseIt	| symbol |	self lineSelectAndEmptyCheck: [^ self].	(symbol := self selectedSymbol) isNil ifTrue: [^ self flash].	self send: #browseIt: toModelWith: {symbol} orDo: [super browseIt]! !!O2TextMorphEditor methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!findClass	"locate package column to be able to use find class command"	| requestor target |	requestor := model browser navigationPanel columns first.	target := requestor selectedNode.	(O2CmdFindClass 		on: target		for: requestor) execute! !!O2TextMorphEditor methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 11/6/2009 15:06'!findClass: characterStream	self closeTypeIn: characterStream.	self findClass.	^ true! !!O2TextMorphEditor methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'alain.plantec 6/18/2008 09:10'!implementorsOfIt	"Open a senders browser on the selected selector"	| selector |	self lineSelectAndEmptyCheck: [^ self].	(selector := self selectedSelector) == nil ifTrue: [^ self flash].	self send: #implementorsOfIt: toModelWith: {selector} orDo: [super sendersOfIt]! !!O2TextMorphEditor methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'alain.plantec 6/18/2008 09:10'!referencesToIt	| selector |	self lineSelectAndEmptyCheck: [^ self].	(selector := self selectedSelector) == nil ifTrue: [^ self flash].	self send: #referencesToIt: toModelWith: {selector} orDo: [super referencesToIt]! !!O2TextMorphEditor methodsFor: 'model access' stamp: 'alain.plantec 6/18/2008 09:10'!send: aSelector toModelWith: args orDo: aBlock	self terminateAndInitializeAround:		[(model respondsTo: aSelector)			ifTrue: [(model perform: aSelector withArguments: args)						ifFalse: [self flash]]			ifFalse: aBlock]! !!O2TextMorphEditor methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'alain.plantec 6/18/2008 09:10'!sendersOfIt	"Open a senders browser on the selected selector"	| selector |	self lineSelectAndEmptyCheck: [^ self].	(selector := self selectedSelector) == nil ifTrue: [^ self flash].	self send: #sendersOfIt: toModelWith: {selector} orDo: [super sendersOfIt]! !!O2TextMorphEditorWithShout methodsFor: 'backspace handling' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:16'!backTo: startIndex	"When backspacing, 2 notifications of the userHasEdited are received.	This then causes a background process to not terminate correctly.	The reason for all this is uncertain, but discarding the superfluous userHasEdited	message received while running backTo: seems to cure the problem"	| answer |	[inBackTo := true.	answer := super backTo: startIndex	] ensure:[		inBackTo:=false.		^answer]	! !!O2TextMorphEditorWithShout methodsFor: 'parenblinking' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:17'!blinkParen	lastParentLocation ifNotNil:		[self text string size >= lastParentLocation ifTrue: [			self text				addAttribute: TextEmphasis bold				from: lastParentLocation				to: lastParentLocation]]! !!O2TextMorphEditorWithShout methodsFor: 'new selection' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:18'!changeEmphasis: characterStream 	morph editView styler 		evaluateWithoutStyling: [^super changeEmphasis: characterStream]! !!O2TextMorphEditorWithShout methodsFor: 'parenblinking' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:18'!clearParens	super clearParens.	lastParentLocation := nil! !!O2TextMorphEditorWithShout methodsFor: 'backspace handling' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:16'!userHasEdited	"ignore this if generated during backTo:	See comment in backTo: "	(inBackTo isNil or: [inBackTo not])		ifTrue:[^super userHasEdited]	! !!O2ButtonBar class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 3/11/2007 16:39'!on: aModel	^ self new 		model: aModel;		initGeometry;		update: #commands.! !!O2ButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dc 9/8/2007 15:02'!addButtonFor: aCommand       self addMorphBack: ((self buttonFor: aCommand)								position: self position;								yourself)! !!O2ButtonBar methodsFor: 'visual' stamp: 'dr 2/2/2009 11:49'!adoptPaneColor: aColor	self submorphs do: [:ea | ea onColor: aColor offColor: aColor whiter].	super adoptPaneColor: aColor.! !!O2ButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!buttonFor: aCommand 	| buttonColor |	buttonColor := model color duller.	^ (PluggableButtonMorphPlus 		on: aCommand		getState: nil		action: (aCommand isActive 				ifTrue: [ #execute ]				ifFalse: [ #yourself ])		label: #buttonLabelWithSpaces)		onColor: buttonColor			offColor: buttonColor whiter;		height: Preferences standardCodeFont height * 1.84;		getEnabledSelector: #isActive;		hResizing: #shrinkWrap;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		styleWith: O2MorphBuilder new;		setBalloonText: aCommand longDescription;		cellInset: 1;		yourself! !!O2ButtonBar methodsFor: 'initialize-release' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!initGeometry	self		layoutPolicy: TableLayout new;		listDirection: #leftToRight;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		rubberBandCells: true;		styleWith: O2MorphBuilder new! !!O2ButtonBar methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 3/11/2007 15:56'!model	^ model! !!O2ButtonBar methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 3/11/2007 15:26'!model: aModel	model ifNotNil: [model removeDependent: self].	model := aModel.	model addDependent: self.! !!O2ButtonBar methodsFor: 'visual' stamp: 'dr 1/30/2009 15:24'!noteNewOwner: aMorph	| window |	window := aMorph containingWindow.	window ifNotNil: ["self adoptPaneColor: window paneColor"]! !!O2ButtonBar methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/21/2007 21:35'!styleWith: aBuilder	aBuilder styleButtonBar: self! !!O2ButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 3/11/2007 15:58'!update: aSymbol	aSymbol == #commands ifTrue: [self updateCommands]! !!O2ButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 6/2/2009 01:12'!updateCommands	self removeAllMorphs.	model commands do: [:cmd | self addButtonFor: cmd].! !!O2EnhancementButtonBar methodsFor: 'visual' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!adoptPaneColor: aColor 	(self submorphs reject: [ :ea | ea isKindOf: O2BackButtonMorph ]) do: 		[ :ea | 		ea 			onColor: aColor			offColor: aColor whiter ].	super adoptPaneColor: aColor! !!O2EnhancementButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 7/4/2009 14:40'!updateCommandsself flag: #toBeOptimized.	self removeAllMorphs.		self addMorphBack: model createBackButton.		self addMorphBack: model createHistoryButton.	self addMorphBack: model createForwardButton.						model commands  do: [:cmd | self addButtonFor: cmd].! !!O2GroupingMorph methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 10/17/2009 16:24'!addBorders	self borderWidth: 0.	self submorphs do:		[:morph |		morph class = self class			ifTrue: [morph addBorders]			ifFalse:				[morph adoptPaneColor: color.				morph 					borderWidth: 2; 					borderColor: #inset; 					color: Color transparent]]! !!O2GroupingMorph methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 12/9/2007 10:50'!addMorph: aMorph frame: relFrame	"Stole this from SystemWindow"		| frame |	frame := LayoutFrame new.	frame 		leftFraction: relFrame left; 		rightFraction: relFrame right; 		topFraction: relFrame top; 		bottomFraction: relFrame bottom.	self addMorph: aMorph fullFrame: frame.! !!O2GroupingMorph methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'lr 1/22/2008 20:08'!initialize	super initialize.	self borderWidth: 0.	self color: Color transparent! !!O2Pane commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:24' prior: 35446201!An OBPane is the visual representation of a column in a browser. It contains a morph to display nodes (typically a PluggableListMorph) and (optionally) a morph for communicating with the column's filter. It's main responsibility is to lay out its submorphs as the filter controls are added and removed.iVars:model	- the OBColumn that controls the node list displayed in this panelist		- the morph which displays the node list, usually a PluggableListMorphbutton	- the morph which controls the column's filter, usually an OBRadioButtonBar.!!O2Pane methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 2/17/2009 16:11'!addButton: aButton	self hasButton ifTrue: [self removeMorph: button].	button := aButton.	button height: (aButton minExtent y max: self defaultButtonHeight).		self 		addMorph: button;		adjustList;		adjustButton! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 3/14/2007 23:33'!addList: aListMorph	list := aListMorph.	self addMorph: list.	list bounds: self innerBounds.! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 5/17/2007 23:56'!adjustButton	| inner |	self hasButton ifTrue: 		[inner := self innerBounds.		button bounds: (inner withTop: inner bottom - button height)]! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 3/14/2007 23:26'!adjustList	self hasButton		ifFalse: [self list bounds: self innerBounds]		ifTrue: [self list bounds: (self innerBounds withHeight: (self height - self buttonHeight))]! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'geometry' stamp: 'cwp 2/12/2004 18:32'!bounds: aRectangle	super bounds: aRectangle.	self adjustList.	self adjustButton.! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 3/14/2007 23:28'!button	^ button! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'constructing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!buttonFor: aSwitch 	^ aSwitch buildOn: O2MorphBuilder new! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'constructing' stamp: 'cwp 11/2/2004 00:57'!buttonHeight	^ self hasButton		ifTrue: [button height]		ifFalse: [self defaultButtonHeight]! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'constructing' stamp: 'cwp 11/2/2004 01:10'!defaultButtonHeight	^ 23! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 2/12/2004 18:35'!hasButton	^ button notNil! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'cwp 3/14/2007 23:42'!initGeometry	self			hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		clipSubmorphs: true;		color: Color transparent;		cellInset: 0;		borderWidth: 0;		layoutPolicy: ProportionalLayout new.		! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 3/14/2007 23:42'!list	^ list! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'cwp 2/12/2004 18:44'!model: anObject	"Set my model and make me me a dependent of the given object."	model ifNotNil: [model removeDependent: self].	anObject ifNotNil: [anObject addDependent: self].	model := anObject.! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'constructing' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 10/17/2009 16:57'!noteNewOwner: aMorph	self containingWindow ifNotNilDo: [:window | self adoptPaneColor: window paneColor]! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 2/12/2004 20:29'!removeButton	self hasButton 		ifTrue: [self removeMorph: button.				button := nil.				self adjustList]! !!O2Pane methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 5/18/2007 23:09'!update: aSelector	aSelector = #switch ifFalse: [^ self].	self hasButton = model wantsButton ifTrue: [^ self].	model wantsButton		ifTrue: [self addButton: (self buttonFor: model switch)]		ifFalse: [self removeButton]! !!O2PaneScroller commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:13' prior: 35446808!Instances of OBPaneScroller contain the panes which represent columns in a browser. Their primary responsibilities are laying out panes to fit the space available and scrolling them horizontally when there isn't sufficient space. iVars:sizing		- The number of panes which should exactly fit the available space.		   	   During layout, the  width of the panes is determined accordingly.transform	- A TransformMorph used for scrollingscrollBar	- An OBHorizontalScrollBar used for scrolling!!O2PaneScroller class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 11/17/2004 22:01'!withModel: aModel	^ self new model: aModel! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!addPaneSplitters	| splitter remaining target targetX sameX minY maxY targetY sameY minX maxX |	self removePaneSplitters.	self removeCornerGrips. 	remaining := transform submorphs reject: [ :each | each layoutFrame rightFraction = 1 ].	[ remaining notEmpty ] whileTrue: 		[ target := remaining first.		targetX := target layoutFrame rightFraction.		sameX := transform submorphs select: [ : each | each layoutFrame rightFraction = targetX ].		minY := (sameX detectMin: [ :each | each layoutFrame topFraction ]) layoutFrame topFraction.		maxY := (sameX detectMax: [ :each | each layoutFrame bottomFraction ]) layoutFrame bottomFraction.		splitter := ProportionalSplitterMorph new.		splitter layoutFrame: (LayoutFrame 				fractions: (targetX @ minY corner: targetX @ maxY)				offsets: ((0 @ (target layoutFrame topOffset ifNil: [ 0 ]) corner: 4 @ (target layoutFrame bottomOffset ifNil: [ 0 ])) translateBy: (target layoutFrame rightOffset ifNil: [ 0 ]) @ 0)).		transform addMorphBack: (splitter position: self position).		remaining := remaining copyWithoutAll: sameX ].	remaining := transform submorphs copy reject: [ :each | each layoutFrame bottomFraction = 1 ].	[ remaining notEmpty ] whileTrue: 		[ target := remaining first.		targetY := target layoutFrame bottomFraction.		sameY := transform submorphs select: [ :each | each layoutFrame bottomFraction = targetY ].		minX := (sameY detectMin: [ :each | each layoutFrame leftFraction ]) layoutFrame leftFraction.		maxX := (sameY detectMax: [ :each | each layoutFrame rightFraction ]) layoutFrame rightFraction.		splitter := ProportionalSplitterMorph new			beSplitsTopAndBottom ;			yourself.		splitter layoutFrame: (LayoutFrame 				fractions: (minX @ targetY corner: maxX @ targetY)				offsets: (((target layoutFrame leftOffset ifNil: [ 0 ]) @ 0 corner: (target layoutFrame rightOffset ifNil: [ 0 ]) @ 4) translateBy: 0 @ (target layoutFrame bottomOffset ifNil: [ 0 ]))).		transform addMorphBack: (splitter position: self position).		remaining := remaining copyWithoutAll: sameY ].	self linkSubmorphsToSplitters. 	self splitters do: [ :each | each comeToFront ]! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 2/8/2004 11:10'!adjustPaneHeight	"This gets called after the scrollbar has been shown or hidden, to move the bottom	of the panes to the right place."		transform bounds: self innerBounds.	transform submorphsDo: [:m | m bounds: (m bounds withHeight: self paneHeight)]		! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 10/17/2009 16:49'!adoptPaneColor: aColor	super adoptPaneColor: aColor.	scrollBar adoptPaneColor: aColor! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 10/17/2009 16:59'!basicUpdatePanes	| builder |	builder := O2MorphBuilder new.	panes := model 		ifNil: [ Array new ]		ifNotNil: [ model columns collect: [ :ea | ea buildOn: builder ] ].	self clearPanes.	panes do: [ :ea | self pushPane: ea ].	self containingWindow ifNotNilDo: [:window | self adoptPaneColor: window paneColor].! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2004 01:14'!basicUpdateSizing	model ifNil: [sizing := 1] ifNotNil: [sizing := model sizing]! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 11/21/2004 23:45'!bounds: aRectangle	super bounds: aRectangle.	self layoutWidgets.	self layoutPanes.	self setScrollDeltas.! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'panes' stamp: 'cwp 12/6/2003 17:06'!clearPanes	transform removeAllMorphs! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 2/26/2004 23:14'!computeMorphWidths	| paneWidths widths |	paneWidths := self paneWidthsToFit: self totalPaneWidth.	widths := OrderedCollection new.	paneWidths do: [:w | widths add: w] separatedBy: [widths add: self separatorWidth].	^ widths asArray! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 2/8/2004 11:06'!doLayout	self layoutWidgets.	self layoutPanes.	self hideOrShowScrollBar.	self setScrollDeltas.	self scrollToRight.! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 2/8/2004 10:44'!hideOrShowScrollBar	self isScrollable ifTrue: [self showScrollBar] ifFalse: [self hideScrollBar]! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 2/8/2004 11:10'!hideScrollBar	self removeMorph: scrollBar.	self adjustPaneHeight.! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'cwp 5/28/2007 01:30'!initialize	super initialize.	self 		color: Color white;		borderWidth: 0;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		hResizing: #spaceFill.	self 		initializeTransform;		initializeScrollbar.! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!initializeScrollbar	scrollBar := O2ScrollBar new 		model: self		slotName: 'scrollBar'.	scrollBar		borderWidth: 0;		borderColor: #inset;		height: self scrollBarHeight.	self resizeScrollBar! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'cwp 2/8/2004 10:52'!initializeTransform	transform := TransformMorph new.	transform		color: Color transparent;		borderWidth: 0;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		disableTableLayout;		bounds: super innerBounds.	self addMorphBack: transform.! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 2/8/2004 10:54'!innerBounds	| rect |	rect := super innerBounds.	^ self scrollBarIsVisible		ifTrue: [rect withHeight: rect height - self scrollBarHeight - 1]		ifFalse: [rect]! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 2/8/2004 10:42'!isScrollable	^ self leftoverScrollRange > 0! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 2/8/2004 01:22'!layoutPanes	| widths rect |	widths := self computeMorphWidths.	rect := 0@0 extent: (0 @ self paneHeight).	transform submorphs 					with: widths 					do: [:m :w | 						rect := rect withWidth: w.						m bounds: rect.						rect := rect translateBy: (w@0)]						! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 8/25/2003 22:13'!layoutWidgets	| inner outer |	outer := super innerBounds.	inner := self innerBounds.	transform bounds: inner.	scrollBar bounds: ((inner left @ inner bottom + 1)						corner: outer bottomRight)! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 8/25/2003 21:04'!leftoverScrollRange	^ (self totalScrollRange - self innerBounds width roundTo: self scrollDeltaWidth) max: 0! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!linkSubmorphsToSplitters	self splitters do:		[:each |		each splitsTopAndBottom			ifTrue:				[transform submorphsDo:					[:eachMorph |					(eachMorph ~= each and: [eachMorph layoutFrame bottomFraction = each layoutFrame topFraction]) ifTrue: [each addLeftOrTop: eachMorph].					(eachMorph ~= each and: [eachMorph layoutFrame topFraction = each layoutFrame bottomFraction]) ifTrue: [each addRightOrBottom: eachMorph]]]			ifFalse:				[transform submorphsDo:					[:eachMorph |					(eachMorph ~= each and: [eachMorph layoutFrame rightFraction = each layoutFrame leftFraction]) ifTrue: [each addLeftOrTop: eachMorph].					(eachMorph ~= each and: [eachMorph layoutFrame leftFraction = each layoutFrame rightFraction]) ifTrue: [each addRightOrBottom: eachMorph]]]]! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/17/2004 22:03'!model	^model! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/17/2004 22:11'!model: anObject	model ifNotNil: [model removeDependent: self].	anObject ifNotNil: [anObject addDependent: self].	model := anObject! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 11/17/2004 23:09'!paneCount	^ self panes size! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 12/6/2003 17:08'!paneHeight	^ transform bounds height! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 2/26/2004 23:14'!paneWidthsToFit: limit	| padded |	padded := Array new: self paneCount.	padded atAllPut: (limit / self sizing) floor.	(1 to: limit - padded sum) do: [:i | padded at: i put: (padded at: i) + 1].	^ padded		! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/17/2004 23:09'!panes	^ panes ifNil: [self updatePanes. panes]! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'panes' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2004 01:22'!popPanes: count	count * 2 timesRepeat: [transform removeMorph: transform lastSubmorph].	panes removeLast: count! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'panes' stamp: 'cwp 11/17/2004 22:46'!pushPane: aMorph	aMorph 		borderWidth: 0;		hResizing: #rigid;		vResizing: #rigid;		layoutInset: 0.	transform hasSubmorphs ifTrue: [transform addMorphBack: self separator].	transform addMorphBack: aMorph.! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!removeCornerGrips	| corners |	corners := transform submorphsSatisfying: [:each | each isKindOf: CornerGripMorph].	corners do: [:each | each delete]! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 2/8/2004 11:03'!resizeScrollBar	| inner outer |	outer := super innerBounds.	inner := outer withHeight: outer height - self scrollBarHeight - 1.	scrollBar bounds: ((inner left @ inner bottom + 1)						corner: outer bottomRight)! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 8/24/2003 14:29'!scrollBarHeight	^ 12! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 2/8/2004 10:56'!scrollBarIsVisible	^ submorphs includes: scrollBar! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 11/21/2004 13:51'!scrollBarValue: value	transform hasSubmorphs ifFalse: [^ self].	transform offset: (self leftoverScrollRange * value) rounded @ 0.! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 8/23/2003 16:21'!scrollDeltaWidth	^ 1! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 12/8/2003 21:42'!scrollToRight	^ scrollBar setValue: 1.! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'panes' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 10/17/2009 16:56'!separator	^ BorderedSubpaneDividerMorph vertical		color: model defaultBackgroundColor duller;		styleWith: O2MorphBuilder new;		yourself! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'defaults' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!separatorWidth	^ O2MorphBuilder new style39 		ifTrue: [ 3 ]		ifFalse: [ 4 ]! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 8/25/2003 21:14'!setScrollDeltas	| range interval value |	transform hasSubmorphs ifFalse: [scrollBar interval: 1.0. ^ self].	range := self leftoverScrollRange.	range = 0 ifTrue: [^ scrollBar interval: 1.0; setValue: 0].	interval := ((self innerBounds width) / self totalScrollRange) asFloat.	value := (transform offset x / range min: 1.0) asFloat.	scrollBar interval: interval.	scrollBar setValue: value.! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 2/8/2004 11:11'!showScrollBar	self scrollBarIsVisible ifTrue: [^ self].	self resizeScrollBar.	self addMorphFront: scrollBar.	self adjustPaneHeight.	! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/22/2004 23:19'!sizing	^ sizing ifNil: [self updateSizing]! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!splitters	^ transform submorphsSatisfying: [:each | each isKindOf: ProportionalSplitterMorph]! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'layout' stamp: 'cwp 2/25/2004 20:23'!totalPaneWidth	^ self innerBounds width - ((self sizing - 1) * self separatorWidth)! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 8/25/2003 19:27'!totalScrollRange	| submorphBounds |	submorphBounds := transform localSubmorphBounds ifNil: [^ 0].	^ submorphBounds width! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 3/25/2007 00:23'!update: aSymbol	aSymbol = #sizing ifTrue: [^ self updateSizing].	aSymbol = #columns ifTrue: [^ self updatePanes].! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2004 01:34'!updatePanes	| count |	model ifNil: [panes := Array new. ^ self].	count := panes ifNotNil: [panes size] ifNil: [0].	self basicUpdatePanes.	self basicUpdateSizing.		self layoutPanes.	panes size = count		ifFalse: [self hideOrShowScrollBar.				self setScrollDeltas].	panes size > count ifTrue: [self scrollToRight].	^ panes! !!O2PaneScroller methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2004 01:14'!updateSizing	| old |	old := sizing.	self basicUpdateSizing.	sizing = old ifFalse: [self layoutPanes].	^sizing! !!O2RadioButtonBar commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:27' prior: 35447367!An OBRadioButtonBar is similar to a PluggableListMorph except that it displays a row of buttons rather than a vertical list. Clicking on a button selects it.model				- the model for this button barbuttons			- a collection of OBButtonModels, which are derived from the model's listselection			- the index of the currently selected buttongetListSelector	 	- the message for getting the list of labels for the buttonsgetSelectionSelector	- the message for getting the index of the currently selected itemsetSelectionSelector	- the message for informing the model that a button has been clicked!!O2EnhancementRadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 10/21/2008 14:06'!getLabels    | labels selectedNode |    labels := super getLabels.    selectedNode := model column selectedNode.    (labels includes: '?') ifTrue: [(selectedNode isNil or: [selectedNode hasComment]) ifTrue: [^labels]].        ^labels collect: [:ea | ea = '?' ifTrue: [ ea asText addAttribute: TextEmphasis bold;		                                                   addAttribute: TextColor red] 	                                 ifFalse: [ea]].! !!O2EnhancementRadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 7/7/2009 14:29'!isDropEdge: aString	^model isDropEdge: aString! !!O2RadioButtonBar class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 2/22/2004 16:44'!on: aModel list: listSelector selected: selectionSelector changeSelected: changedSelector 	^ self new			on: aModel			list: listSelector			selected: selectionSelector			changeSelected: changedSelector! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'constructing' stamp: 'dr 2/12/2009 11:04'!adoptPaneColor: aColor	super adoptPaneColor: aColor.	color := aColor.	self updateSubmorphColor! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 7/11/2009 23:21'!browser	^model browser! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!buttons    ^buttons! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 10/21/2008 13:19'!getLabels    ^model perform: getListSelector    ! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 3/23/2009 15:30'!getLongDescriptions    ^model longDescriptions! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 2/24/2004 18:53'!getSelectionIndex	^ model perform: getSelectionSelector! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'initialize-release' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!initGeometry	self		layoutPolicy: TableLayout new;		listDirection: #leftToRight;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		rubberBandCells: true;		styleWith: O2MorphBuilder new! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 7/7/2009 14:29'!isDropEdge: aString	^false! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 7/19/2007 15:17'!isEnabled: aButton	^model isEnabled: aButton! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 2/24/2004 18:54'!isSelected: aButton	^ (buttons at: selection ifAbsent: [^ false]) == aButton! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!list	buttons ifNil: 		[ | labels descriptions |		labels := self getLabels.		descriptions := self getLongDescriptions.		buttons := Array new: labels size.		labels withIndexDo: 			[ :label :index | 			buttons 				at: index				put: (O2ButtonModel 						withLabel: label						inBar: self						longDescription: (descriptions 								at: index								ifAbsent: [ nil ])) ].		selection := self getSelectionIndex.		self ].	^ buttons collect: [ :b | b label ]! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!model	^model! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 3/11/2007 15:33'!model: aModel	model ifNotNil: [model removeDependent: self].	model := aModel.	model addDependent: self.! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'constructing' stamp: 'dr 2/20/2009 15:44'!noteNewOwner: aMorph	| window |	window := aMorph containingWindow.	window ifNotNil: [self adoptPaneColor: window paneColor]! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'initialize-release' stamp: 'cwp 2/25/2004 00:36'!on: aModel list: listSelector selected: selectionGetter changeSelected: selectionSetter 	self model: aModel.	selection := 0.	getListSelector := listSelector.	getSelectionSelector := selectionGetter.	setSelectionSelector := selectionSetter.	self initGeometry.	self updateList.! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 2/24/2004 18:47'!push: aButton	| index |	index := buttons indexOf: aButton.	model perform: setSelectionSelector with: index.! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'constructing' stamp: 'cwp 7/21/2007 21:54'!styleWith: aBuilder	aBuilder styleButtonBar: self! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 2/25/2004 00:35'!update: aSymbol	aSymbol = getListSelector ifTrue: [self updateList. ^ self].	aSymbol = getSelectionSelector ifTrue: [self updateSelection]! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!updateButtons	| labels descriptions |	labels := self getLabels.	descriptions := self getLongDescriptions.	buttons := Array new: labels size.	labels withIndexDo: 		[ :label :index | 		buttons 			at: index			put: (O2ButtonModel 					withLabel: label					inBar: self					longDescription: (descriptions 							at: index							ifAbsent: [ nil ])) ].	selection := self getSelectionIndex! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 11/27/2004 17:58'!updateList	self 		updateButtons; 		updateMorphs! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!updateMorphs	self removeAllMorphs.	buttons do: [ :button | self addMorphBack: (O2MorphBuilder build: button) ].	self updateSubmorphColor! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 2/24/2004 19:39'!updateSelection	| oldSelection |	oldSelection := selection.	selection := self getSelectionIndex.	self withButtonAt: oldSelection do: [:button | button selectionChanged].	self withSelectedButtonDo: [:button | button selectionChanged]! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'constructing' stamp: 'dr 2/20/2009 16:13'!updateSubmorphColor	| localColor |	localColor := model browser defaultBackgroundColor.	self submorphs do: [:ea | ea onColor: localColor muchDarker offColor: localColor twiceDarker].! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 7/9/2007 23:39'!withButtonAt: index do: aBlock	^ aBlock value: (buttons at: index ifAbsent: [^ self]) ! !!O2RadioButtonBar methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 2/24/2004 19:38'!withSelectedButtonDo: aBlock	^ self withButtonAt: selection do: aBlock! !!CategoryEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 34980922!browserClass	^ self categories size > 1 		ifTrue: [ OR2CategoryBrowser ]		ifFalse: [ OR2ClassBrowser ]! !!O2CmdBrowsePackageEnvironment methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 7/4/2009 17:43'!cluster	^ #browse! !!O2CmdBrowsePackageEnvironment methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 7/4/2009 17:45'!isActive	^requestor isSelected: target! !!ORCmdBrowsePackageEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!isActive	^false! !!OR2SwapMethodRefactoring commentStamp: 'lr 10/19/2007 09:16' prior: 35448038!Move a method from the class to the instance side, or vice versa. Normally this is not considered to be a refactoring.!!OR2SwapMethodRefactoring class methodsFor: 'instance-creation' stamp: 'lr 4/5/2007 08:48'!model: aRBSmalltalk swapMethod: aSelector in: aClass	^ self new 		model: aRBSmalltalk;		swapMethod: aSelector in: aClass;		yourself! !!OR2SwapMethodRefactoring class methodsFor: 'instance-creation' stamp: 'lr 4/5/2007 08:48'!swapMethod: aSelector in: aClass	^ self new swapMethod: aSelector in: aClass! !!OR2SwapMethodRefactoring methodsFor: 'preconditions' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 09:57'!checkInstVars	class instanceVariableNames do: [ :each |		(target instanceVariableNames includes: each) ifFalse: [			((class whichSelectorsReferToInstanceVariable: each) includes: selector) ifTrue: [				self					refactoringError: ('<1p> refers to <2s>, which is not defined in <3p>' expandMacrosWith: selector with: each with: target) ] ] ]! !!OR2SwapMethodRefactoring methodsFor: 'preconditions' stamp: 'lr 3/13/2008 08:06'!preconditions	^ (RBCondition definesSelector: selector in: class)		& (RBCondition definesSelector: selector in: target) not		& (RBCondition withBlock: [ self checkInstVars. true ])! !!OR2SwapMethodRefactoring methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'lr 4/5/2007 08:53'!swapMethod: aSelector in: aClass	class := self classObjectFor: aClass.	target := self classObjectFor: (class isMeta		ifTrue: [ class nonMetaclass ]		ifFalse: [ class metaclass ]).	selector := aSelector! !!OR2SwapMethodRefactoring methodsFor: 'transforming' stamp: 'lr 4/5/2007 09:00'!transform	target compile: (class sourceCodeFor: selector) classified: (class protocolsFor: selector).	class removeMethod: selector! !!MessageNode methodsFor: '*o2-standard' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 34983896!selectorIs: aSymbol	aSymbol == nil ifTrue: [^ false].	((selector isKindOf: SelectorNode) or: [selector isKindOf: Association])		ifTrue: [^ selector key == aSymbol].	selector isSymbol ifTrue: [^ selector == aSymbol].	^ false! !!O2ScrollBar commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:01' prior: 35448216!This class is a relic. It was originally created to work around bugs in ScrollBar which prevented it from working correctly in horizontal orientation. At some point the bugs should be fixed, and ScrollBar should be used instead.!!O2ScrollBar class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:07'!alwaysShowFlatScrollbarForAlternativeLook	"Set this value to true, if you want to see the flat scrollbar look in flop-out mode as well as inboard.  Otherwise the flop-out scrollbar will be rounded and inboard will be flat."	^ false! !!O2ScrollBar class methodsFor: 'class initialization' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:07'!initialize "ScrollBar initialize"	UpArrow := Form		extent: 6@3		fromArray: #(2r11e28 2r1111e27 2r111111e26)		offset: 0@0.! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 1/30/2009 16:20'!adoptPaneColor: aColor	"Adopt the given pane color"	super adoptPaneColor: aColor.	aColor ifNil:[^self].	self sliderColor: aColor.! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'geometry' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!buttonExtent	^ bounds isWide		ifTrue: [11 @ self innerBounds height]		ifFalse: [self innerBounds width @ 11]! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!cachedImageAt: aKey ifAbsentPut: aBlock	CachedImages ifNil: [CachedImages := Dictionary new].	^CachedImages at: aKey ifAbsentPut: aBlock! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!doScrollByPage	"Scroll automatically while mouse is down"	(self waitForDelay1: 300 delay2: 100) ifFalse: [^ self].	nextPageDirection		ifTrue: [self setValue: (value + pageDelta min: 1.0)]		ifFalse: [self setValue: (value - pageDelta max: 0.0)]! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!doScrollDown	"Scroll automatically while mouse is down"	(self waitForDelay1: 200 delay2: 40) ifFalse: [^ self].	self setValue: (value + scrollDelta + 0.000001 min: 1.0)! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!doScrollUp	"Scroll automatically while mouse is down"	(self waitForDelay1: 200 delay2: 40) ifFalse: [^ self].	self setValue: (value - scrollDelta - 0.000001 max: 0.0)! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'geometry' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!expandSlider	"Compute the new size of the slider (use the old sliderThickness as a minimum)."	| r |	r := self totalSliderArea.	slider extent: (bounds isWide		ifTrue: [((r width * interval) asInteger max: self sliderThickness) @ slider height]		ifFalse: [slider width @ ((r height * interval) asInteger max: self sliderThickness)])! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'geometry' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!extent: p        p x > p y                ifTrue: [super extent: (p max: 42@8)]                ifFalse: [super extent: (p max: 8@42)]! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'dr 6/22/2009 15:13'!finishedScrolling	self stopStepping.	self scrollBarAction: nil.	self roundedScrollbarLook ifTrue: [		upButton borderStyle: (BorderStyle complexRaised width: upButton borderWidth).		downButton borderStyle: (BorderStyle complexRaised width: downButton borderWidth).	] ifFalse:[		downButton borderRaised.		upButton borderRaised.	].! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:07'!initialize	super initialize.	scrollDelta := 0.02.	pageDelta := 0.2.	self roundedScrollbarLook ifTrue:[		self borderStyle: ((BorderStyle complexFramed width: 2) "baseColor: Color gray")].! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'initialize' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!initializeDownButton	downButton := RectangleMorph		newBounds: (self innerBounds bottomRight - self buttonExtent extent: self buttonExtent)		color: self thumbColor.	downButton on: #mouseDown send: #scrollDownInit to: self.	downButton on: #mouseUp send: #finishedScrolling to: self.	downButton addMorphCentered: (ImageMorph new image: 		(self 			cachedImageAt: (bounds isWide ifTrue: ['right'] ifFalse: ['down']) 			ifAbsentPut: [				self upArrow8Bit					rotateBy: (bounds isWide ifTrue: [#right] ifFalse: [#pi])					centerAt: 0@0			]		)	).	self roundedScrollbarLook ifTrue:[		downButton color: Color veryLightGray.		downButton borderStyle: (BorderStyle complexRaised width: 3).	] ifFalse:[		downButton setBorderWidth: 1 borderColor: #raised.	].	self addMorph: downButton.! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'initialize' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!initializeEmbedded: aBool	"aBool == true => inboard scrollbar	aBool == false => flop-out scrollbar"	self roundedScrollbarLook ifFalse:[^self].	aBool ifTrue:[		self borderStyle: (BorderStyle inset width: 2).		self cornerStyle: #square.	] ifFalse:[		self borderStyle: (BorderStyle width: 1 color: Color black).		self cornerStyle: #rounded.	].	self removeAllMorphs.	self initializeSlider.! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'initialize' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!initializePagingArea	pagingArea := RectangleMorph newBounds: self totalSliderArea								color: (Color r: 0.6 g: 0.6 b: 0.8).	pagingArea borderWidth: 0.	pagingArea on: #mouseDown send: #scrollPageInit: to: self.	pagingArea on: #mouseUp send: #finishedScrolling to: self.	self addMorph: pagingArea.	self roundedScrollbarLook 		ifTrue:[pagingArea color: (Color gray: 0.9)].! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'initialize' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!initializeSlider	self roundedScrollbarLook ifTrue:[		self 			initializeUpButton;			initializeDownButton;			initializePagingArea.	] ifFalse:[		self initializeUpButton; 			initializeDownButton; 			initializePagingArea.	].	super initializeSlider.	self roundedScrollbarLook ifTrue:[		slider cornerStyle: #rounded.		slider borderStyle: (BorderStyle complexRaised width: 3).		sliderShadow cornerStyle: #rounded.	].	self sliderColor: self sliderColor.! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'initialize' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!initializeUpButton	upButton := self roundedScrollbarLook 				ifTrue:  					[RectangleMorph 						newBounds: (self innerBounds topLeft extent: self buttonExtent)]				ifFalse: 					[RectangleMorph 						newBounds: ((self innerBounds topLeft) extent: self buttonExtent)].	upButton color: self thumbColor.	upButton 		on: #mouseDown		send: #scrollUpInit		to: self.	upButton 		on: #mouseUp		send: #finishedScrolling		to: self.	upButton 		addMorphCentered: (ImageMorph new image: (self 						cachedImageAt: (bounds isWide ifTrue: ['left'] ifFalse: ['up'])						ifAbsentPut: 							[bounds isWide 								ifTrue: [self upArrow8Bit rotateBy: #left centerAt: 0 @ 0]								ifFalse: [self upArrow8Bit]])).	self roundedScrollbarLook 		ifTrue: 			[upButton color: Color veryLightGray.			upButton borderStyle: (BorderStyle complexRaised width: 3)]		ifFalse: [upButton setBorderWidth: 1 borderColor: #raised].	self addMorph: upButton! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'access' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!interval: d	"Supply an optional floating fraction so slider can expand to indicate range"	interval := d min: 1.0.	self expandSlider.	self computeSlider.! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'other events' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!menuButtonMouseDown: event	event hand showTemporaryCursor: nil.	self use: menuSelector orMakeModelSelectorFor: 'MenuButtonPressed:'		in: [:sel | menuSelector := sel.  model perform: sel with: event]! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'other events' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!mouseDownInSlider: event	interval = 1.0 ifTrue:		["make the entire scrollable area visible if a full scrollbar is clicked on"		self setValue: 0.		self model hideOrShowScrollBar].	super mouseDownInSlider: event! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'access' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!pagingArea	^pagingArea! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scroll timing' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:07'!resetTimer	timeOfMouseDown := Time millisecondClockValue.	timeOfLastScroll := timeOfMouseDown - 1000 max: 0.	nextPageDirection := nil.	currentScrollDelay := nil! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'access' stamp: 'md 2/24/2006 21:25'!roundedScrollbarLook	"Rounded look currently only shows up in flop-out mode"	^false and: [self class alwaysShowFlatScrollbarForAlternativeLook not]! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!scrollBarAction	^self valueOfProperty: #scrollBarAction! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!scrollBarAction: aSymbol	self setProperty: #scrollBarAction toValue: aSymbol! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'access' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!scrollDelta	^ scrollDelta! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'access' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!scrollDelta: d1 pageDelta: d2	"Supply optional increments for better scrolling of, eg, text"	scrollDelta := d1.	pageDelta := d2.! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!scrollDown	self flag: #obsolete.	downButton eventHandler: nil.	downButton on: #mouseDown send: #scrollDownInit to: self.	downButton on: #mouseUp send: #finishedScrolling to: self.	^self scrollDownInit! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!scrollDown: count	self setValue: (value + (scrollDelta * count) + 0.000001 min: 1.0)! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!scrollDownInit	downButton borderInset.	self resetTimer.	self scrollBarAction: #doScrollDown.	self startStepping.! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!scrollPageInit: evt	self resetTimer.	self setNextDirectionFromEvent: evt.	self scrollBarAction: #doScrollByPage.	self startStepping.! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!scrollUp	self flag: #obsolete.	upButton eventHandler: nil.	upButton on: #mouseDown send: #scrollUpInit to: self.	upButton on: #mouseUp send: #finishedScrolling to: self.	^self scrollUpInit! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!scrollUp: count	self setValue: (value - (scrollDelta * count) - 0.000001 max: 0.0)! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!scrollUpInit	upButton borderInset.	self resetTimer.	self scrollBarAction: #doScrollUp.	self startStepping.! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scrolling' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!setNextDirectionFromEvent: event	nextPageDirection := bounds isWide ifTrue: [		event cursorPoint x >= slider center x	]	ifFalse: [		event cursorPoint y >= slider center y	]! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'model access' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!setValue: newValue	"Using roundTo: instead of truncateTo: ensures that scrollUp will scroll the same distance as scrollDown."	^ super setValue: (newValue roundTo: scrollDelta)! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'access' stamp: 'md 2/24/2006 16:26'!sliderColor: aColor	"Change the color of the scrollbar to go with aColor."	| buttonColor |	super sliderColor: aColor.	buttonColor := self thumbColor.	upButton color: buttonColor.	downButton color: buttonColor.	slider color: buttonColor.	self roundedScrollbarLook			ifTrue:				[self color: Color transparent.				pagingArea color: aColor muchLighter.				self borderStyle style == #simple 					ifTrue:[self borderColor: aColor darker darker]					ifFalse:[self borderStyle baseColor: aColor]]			ifFalse:				[pagingArea color: (aColor alphaMixed: 0.3 with: Color white).				self borderWidth: 0]! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'geometry' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!sliderExtent	"The sliderExtent is now stored in the slider itself, not hardcoded as it is in the superclass."	^slider extent! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'access' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!sliderShadowColor	^ self roundedScrollbarLook		ifTrue: [self sliderColor darker]		ifFalse: [super sliderShadowColor]! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'geometry' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:07'!sliderThickness	^ self roundedScrollbarLook ifTrue:[15] ifFalse:[super sliderThickness]! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'stepping and presenter' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:07'!step	| action |	action := self scrollBarAction.	action ifNotNil:[self perform: action].! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!stepTime	^ currentScrollDelay ifNil: [300]! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'access' stamp: 'md 2/24/2006 16:27'!thumbColor	"Problem: Part of the ScrollBar/Slider code uses 'slider' to mean the entire scrollbar/slider widget, and part of it uses 'slider' to mean only the draggable 'thumb'.  This should be cleaned up so that 'thumb' is used instead of 'slider' where appropriate.  For now, the meaning of thumbColor is clear, at least."	^self sliderColor alphaMixed: 0.7 with: (Color gray: 0.95).! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'geometry' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:07'!totalSliderArea	| upperBoundsButton |	upperBoundsButton := upButton.	upButton bottom > upperBoundsButton bottom		ifTrue: [upperBoundsButton := upButton].	^ bounds isWide		ifTrue: [upperBoundsButton bounds topRight corner: downButton bounds bottomLeft]		ifFalse: [upperBoundsButton bounds bottomLeft corner: downButton bounds topRight].! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'initialize' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!upArrow8Bit	"convert to 8-bit and convert white to transparent to avoid gratuitous conversion every time we put one in an ImageMorph"	^UpArrow8Bit ifNil: [		UpArrow8Bit := (ColorForm mappingWhiteToTransparentFrom: UpArrow) asFormOfDepth: 8	]! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'scroll timing' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:07'!waitForDelay1: delay1 delay2: delay2 	"Return true if an appropriate delay has passed since the last scroll operation.	The delay decreases exponentially from delay1 to delay2."	| now scrollDelay |	timeOfLastScroll isNil ifTrue: [self resetTimer].	"Only needed for old instances"	now := Time millisecondClockValue.	(scrollDelay := currentScrollDelay) isNil 		ifTrue: [scrollDelay := delay1	"initial delay"].	currentScrollDelay := scrollDelay * 9 // 10 max: delay2.	"decrease the delay"	timeOfLastScroll := now.	^true! !!O2ScrollBar methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 11/23/2003 18:06'!wantsSteps	^self scrollBarAction notNil! !!O2TextMorph commentStamp: 'cwp 12/7/2004 00:07' prior: 35448505!This is a trivial subclass of TextMorph. It overrides editor creation to use OBTextMorphEditor rather than a regular TextMorphEditor.!!O2TextMorph methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!installEditorToReplace: priorEditor 	"Install an editor for my paragraph.  This constitutes 'hasFocus'.	If priorEditor is not nil, then initialize the new editor from its state.	We may want to rework this so it actually uses the prior editor."	| stateArray |	priorEditor ifNotNil: [ stateArray := priorEditor stateArray ].	editor := O2TextMorphEditor new morph: self.	editor changeParagraph: self paragraph.	priorEditor ifNotNil: [ editor stateArrayPut: stateArray ].	self selectionChanged.	^ editor! !!O2TextMorph methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!keyStroke: anEvent		| stringHolder completionAllowed  |	"eCompletion: to make sure that this also gets executed when we an acceptOnCR textMorph" 	stringHolder := editor ifNotNil: [editor model]. 	completionAllowed := (Smalltalk hasClassNamed: #ECController) and: [ECController allowModel: stringHolder].	completionAllowed		ifTrue: [(stringHolder completionController handleKeystrokeBefore: anEvent editor: editor)				ifTrue: [editView scrollSelectionIntoView. ^ self]].					(anEvent anyModifierKeyPressed or: [editView model isEditable])		ifTrue: [super keyStroke: anEvent. editView removeIcons].! !!O2TextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!editorClass	"Answer the class used to create the receiver's editor"	^ O2TextMorphEditorWithShout! !!O2TextMorphWithShout methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'tween 3/15/2007 14:25'!installEditorToReplace: priorEditor	"Install an editor for my paragraph.  This constitutes 'hasFocus'.	If priorEditor is not nil, then initialize the new editor from its state.	We may want to rework this so it actually uses the prior editor."	| stateArray |	priorEditor ifNotNil: [stateArray := priorEditor stateArray].	editor := self editorClass new morph: self.	editor changeParagraph: self paragraph.	priorEditor ifNotNil: [editor stateArrayPut: stateArray].	self selectionChanged.	^ editor! !!UndefinedObject methodsFor: '*o2-Standard-testing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 34985890!isClassBrowser	^false! !!OR2AccessorClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'preconditions' stamp: 'lr 1/7/2008 00:10'!preconditions	^ self refactorings		inject: RBCondition empty		into: [ :result :each | result & each preconditions ]! !!OR2AccessorClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 11/30/2007 09:18'!refactorings	| class |	class := self model classNamed: className asSymbol.	^  class instanceVariableNames collect: [ :each | 		CreateAccessorsForVariableRefactoring			variable: each class: class classVariable: false ]! !!OR2AccessorClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'transforming' stamp: 'lr 11/30/2007 09:13'!transform	self refactorings do: [ :each | self performComponentRefactoring: each ]! !!OR2RealizeClassRefactoring commentStamp: 'lr 10/19/2007 09:16' prior: 35448714!Make a given class concrete, by providing empty templates for all the abstract methods.!!OR2RealizeClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'preconditions' stamp: 'lr 3/18/2008 08:43'!preconditions	^ RBCondition		withBlock: [			(self theClass withAllSubclasses				detect: [ :each | 					(each whichSelectorsReferToSymbol: #subclassResponsibility) notEmpty 						or: [ (each metaclass whichSelectorsReferToSymbol: #subclassResponsibility) notEmpty ] ]				ifNone: [ nil ]) isNil ]		errorString: self theClass printString , ' is abstract or has abstract subclasses.'! !!OR2RealizeClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 3/18/2008 08:43'!theClass	^ (self model classNamed: className) nonMetaclass! !!OR2RealizeClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'transforming' stamp: 'lr 3/18/2008 08:43'!transform	self transform: self theClass.	self transform: self theClass metaclass! !!OR2RealizeClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'transforming' stamp: 'lr 3/18/2008 08:38'!transform: aClass	| class method parseTree |	aClass allSelectors do: [ :selector |		class := aClass whoDefinesMethod: selector.		(class notNil and: [ class ~= aClass ]) ifTrue: [			method := class methodFor: selector.			(method notNil and: [ method refersToSymbol: #subclassResponsibility ]) ifTrue: [				parseTree := method parseTree.				parseTree body 					temporaries: OrderedCollection new; 					statements: OrderedCollection new;					addNode: (RBMessageNode 						receiver: (RBVariableNode named: 'self')						selector: #shouldBeImplemented).				aClass					compileTree: parseTree 					classified: (class protocolsFor: selector) ] ] ]! !!ClassDescription methodsFor: '*o2-standard' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2CommentNode	^ O2ClassCommentNode on: self theNonMetaClass! !!ClassDescription methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:44'!o2BrowserIcon	^ nil! !!ClassDescription methodsFor: '*o2-standard' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 34988563!package	| possiblePkgName package |	possiblePkgName := self category copyUpTo: '-'.    	package := PackageOrganizer default packageNamed: possiblePkgName ifAbsent: [nil].   	package ifNotNil: [(package classes includes: self) ifTrue: [^package]].   	^PackageInfo allPackages detect: [:pkg | self category asString asLowercase beginsWith: pkg packageName asLowercase] ifNone: [nil]! !!ClassDescription methodsFor: '*o2-standard' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 34988715!packageName    ^self package ifNotNilDo: [:pkg | pkg packageName] ifNil: ['']! !!ClassDescription methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!theClass    ^self! !!TraitTransformation methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!asClassSideNodeOf: aParentNode 	^ O2TraitTransformationMetaclassNode 		on: self		of: aParentNode! !!TraitTransformation methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!asCommentNodeOf: aParentNode 	^ O2TraitTransformationCommentNode 		on: self		of: aParentNode! !!TraitTransformation methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!asNodeOf: aParentNode 	^ O2TraitTransformationNode 		on: self		of: aParentNode! !!TraitTransformation methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2Node	^ O2ClassNode on: self! !!O2CmdRenameClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 5/6/2009 12:08'!cluster	^nil! !!O2CmdRenameClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 6/26/2009 10:06'!group	^#xAdditional! !!O2CmdRenameClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 5/6/2009 13:38'!isActive	^target isClassNode and: [requestor isSelected: target]! !!O2CmdRenameClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 5/6/2009 13:41'!label	^'rename refactor...'! !!O2CmdRenameClassRefactoring methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 5/6/2009 13:40'!priority	^3! !!MCFileBasedRepository methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!versionsAvailableForPackage: aPackage    ^self allVersionNames select: [:versionName | versionName beginsWith: aPackage packageName]! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode commentStamp: 'jk 12/9/2007 13:35' prior: 35448883!A PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode is wrapper for items in OBPluggableTreeMorph instances. Each instance remembers its parent wrapper (same kind of instance) and position in a subtree.Instance Variables	parent:		<PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode>	position:		<Number>parent	- parent wrapperposition	- position in subtree (among siblings)!!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'jk 11/28/2007 14:26'!with: item parent: parent model: model	^ (self with: item model: model) parent: parent ! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'jk 12/8/2007 15:27'!with: item parent: parent position: index model: model 	^ (self 		with: item		parent: parent		model: model) position: index! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 1/20/2009 19:38'!backgroundColor	^(model model childAt: self fullPosition) ifNotNilDo: [:node | node backgroundColor]! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 12/9/2008 20:00'!fullPosition	| positions node |	positions := OrderedCollection new. 	node := self.	[node isNullParent] whileFalse: [		positions addFirst: node position.		node := node parent.	].	^positions asArray! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'jk 12/8/2007 16:06'!hasParent	^ self parent notNil! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 12/9/2008 20:21'!highlightingColor	^self backgroundColor ifNotNil: [Color blue] ifNil: [Color red]! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 11/19/2008 11:42'!isNullParent	^false! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!parent	^ parent ifNil: [ parent := O2NullParent new ]! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 11/28/2007 14:18'!parent: anObject	parent := anObject! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 12/9/2007 13:28'!path	^ self parent path add: self position; yourself! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 12/8/2007 15:25'!position	^ position! !!O2PluggableTreeItemWithParentNode methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 12/8/2007 15:25'!position: anObject	position := anObject! !!BrowserEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-accessing' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35001132!allClasses	| classes |	classes := IdentitySet new: 4096.	self classesDo: [ :each | 		classes add: each theNonMetaClass ].	^ classes asArray! !!BrowserEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-accessing' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35001367!allMetaClasses	| classes |	classes := IdentitySet new: 4096.	self classesDo: [ :each | 		each isMeta			ifTrue: [ classes add: each ] ].	^ classes asArray! !!BrowserEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-accessing' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35001617!allNonMetaClasses	| classes |	classes := IdentitySet new: 4096.	self classesDo: [ :each | 		each isMeta			ifFalse: [ classes add: each ] ].	^ classes asArray! !!BrowserEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 15:29' prior: 35001860!browserClass	^ OR2MethodBrowser! !!BrowserEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35001971!browserInstance	^ self browserClass on: self! !!BrowserEnvironment methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35002096!open	^ self browserInstance open! !!TraitBehavior methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!allSubclassesWithLevelDo: classAndLevelBlock startingLevel: level ! !!TraitBehavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!conflictsSelectors	| conflictSelectors |	conflictSelectors := IdentitySet new.	self hasTraitComposition ifFalse: [^ conflictSelectors].	self traitComposition allTraits do:				 [:eachTrait | 				 conflictSelectors addAll: (eachTrait allSelectors select: 					[:each | (self compiledMethodAt: each) isConflict])].	^ conflictSelectors! !!TraitBehavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!overridesSelectors	^ self localSelectors intersection: self traitCompositionSelectors ! !!TraitBehavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!selfSentSelectors	|  info |	self selectorsAndMethodsDo: 			[:sender :method | 			info := (SendInfo on: method) collectSends.].	^ info selfSentSelectors ! !!TraitBehavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 31430265!selfSentSelectorsFromSelectors: interestingSelectors 	| m result info |	result := IdentitySet new.	interestingSelectors collect: 			[:sel | 			m := self compiledMethodAt: sel ifAbsent: [].			m ifNotNil: 					[info := (SendInfo on: m) collectSends.					info selfSentSelectors do: [:sentSelector | result add: sentSelector]]].	^result! !!TraitBehavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 31430648!setTraitCompositionFrom: aTraitExpression	^ self setTraitComposition: aTraitExpression asTraitComposition! !!TraitBehavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!superSenderSelectors	| superSenderSelectors |	superSenderSelectors := IdentitySet new.	self selectorsAndMethodsDo:    		 [:eachSelector :eachMethod | 		 (SendInfo on: eachMethod) collectSends superSentSelectors isEmpty ifFalse:		 	[superSenderSelectors add: eachSelector ].		 ].	^ superSenderSelectors ! !!TraitBehavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!suppliedSelectors	^ (self localSelectors intersection: self traitCompositionRequiredSelectors ) ! !!TraitBehavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!traitCompositionRequiredSelectors	| traitCompositionRequiredSelectors |	traitCompositionRequiredSelectors  := IdentitySet new.	self traitComposition traits do: [:each | traitCompositionRequiredSelectors addAll: each requiredSelectors ].	^  traitCompositionRequiredSelectors ! !!TraitBehavior methodsFor: '*o2-Enhancements-DynamicProtocols' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!traitCompositionSelectors	| traitCompositionSelectors |	traitCompositionSelectors  := IdentitySet new.	self traitComposition traits do: [:each | traitCompositionSelectors addAll: each selectors ].	^  traitCompositionSelectors ! !!OR2PluggableSearchRule class methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'lr 2/24/2009 17:10'!isVisible	^ false! !!OR2PluggableSearchRule methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/24/2009 13:56'!matcher: aMatcher	matcher := aMatcher! !!OR2PluggableSearchRule methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/24/2009 13:57'!name	^ 'Search Code'! !!RefactoryChange methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-converting' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 15:36'!asO2Node	^ OR2ChangeNode on: self! !!RefactoryChange methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35004542!browserClass	^ OR2ChangesBrowser! !!RefactoryChange methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35004651!browserInstance	^ self browserClass change: self! !!RefactoryChange methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-accessing' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35004788!changeClass	^ nil! !!RefactoryChange methodsFor: '*o2-refactory' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:48' prior: 35004883!open	^ self browserInstance open! !!CompiledMethod methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28' prior: 19052001!isSubclassResponsibility	^self isSubclassResponsibility: self markerOrNil ! !!Class methodsFor: '*o2-standard-converting' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2ClassSideNode	^ O2MetaclassNode on: self! !!Class methodsFor: '*o2-standard-converting' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2Node	^ O2ClassNode on: self! !!MethodExtensionReference methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2Node	^ ((self category asString asLowercase 		copyFrom: 2		to: self category size) beginsWith: self extensionName asLowercase) 		ifTrue: 			[ (O2MethodExtensionNode on: self)				categoryExtensionNode: categoryExtensionNode;				yourself ]		ifFalse: [ O2MethodNode on: self ]! !!MethodExtensionReference methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/24/2008 14:00'!categoryExtensionNode: aCategoryExtensionNode	categoryExtensionNode := aCategoryExtensionNode! !!MethodExtensionReference methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/24/2008 13:58'!extensionName	^categoryExtensionNode extensionName! !!MethodReference methodsFor: '*o2-standard' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2Node	^ O2MethodNode on: self! !!MethodReference methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!prettyName    ^self actualClass name, ' >> ', methodSymbol! !!ClassTrait methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!asClassSideNodeOf: aParentNode 	^ O2UsedTraitMetaclassNode 		on: self		of: aParentNode! !!ClassTrait methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!asNodeOf: aParentNode 	^ O2UsedTraitNode 		on: self		of: aParentNode! !!ClassTrait methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2ClassSideNode	^ O2MetaclassNode on: self baseTrait! !!ClassTrait methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!asO2Node	^ O2MetaclassNode on: self! !!O2AnnotationRequest class methodsFor: 'instance-creation' stamp: 'PDC 6/25/2007 22:01'!onClass: aClass selector: aSelector	^ self new		onClass: aClass selector: aSelector;		yourself! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'requests' stamp: 'lr 11/13/2008 13:44'!allChangeSets	^ (ChangeSorter 		allChangeSetsWithClass: class		selector: selector) 		ifNotEmpty: 			[ String streamContents: 				[ :aStream | 				(ChangeSorter 					allChangeSetsWithClass: class					selector: selector) size = 1 					ifTrue: [ aStream nextPutAll: 'only in change set ' ]					ifFalse: [ aStream nextPutAll: 'in change sets: ' ].				(ChangeSorter 					allChangeSetsWithClass: class					selector: selector) do: 					[ :aChangeSet | 					aStream						nextPutAll: aChangeSet name;						nextPutAll: ' ' ] ] ]		ifEmpty: [ 'in no change set' ]! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'dr 9/25/2008 16:39'!annotationRequests	^(self respondsTo: #defaultAnnotationRequests) 	     ifTrue: [self defaultAnnotationRequests] ifFalse: [Preferences defaultAnnotationRequests]! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!defaultAnnotationRequests	^ #(#timeStamp #messageComesFrom #messageCategory #implementorsCount #allChangeSets )! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'requests' stamp: 'dc 5/2/2007 18:57'!documentation	^ class precodeCommentOrInheritedCommentFor: selector! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'requests' stamp: 'dc 5/2/2007 18:20'!firstComment	^ class firstCommentAt: selector! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 11/13/2008 13:44'!getAnnotations	^ String streamContents: 		[ :aStream | 		((self annotationRequests collect: [ :request | self perform: request ]) select: [ :stringOrNil | stringOrNil isEmptyOrNil not ]) 			do: [ :ea | aStream nextPutAll: ea ]			separatedBy: [ aStream nextPutAll: separator ] ]! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'requests' stamp: 'dr 7/4/2009 16:08'!implementorsCount	| implementorsCount |	implementorsCount := self systemNavigation numberOfImplementorsOf: selector.	implementorsCount := implementorsCount == 1				ifTrue: ['1 implementor']				ifFalse: [implementorsCount printString , ' implementors'].	^ implementorsCount! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'requests' stamp: 'dc 5/2/2007 18:57'!masterComment	^ class supermostPrecodeCommentFor: selector! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'requests' stamp: 'dc 5/2/2007 18:53'!messageCategory	^ class organization categoryOfElement: selector! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!messageComesFrom	class isNil ifTrue: [^ String new].	selector isNil ifTrue: [^ class printString ].	^ (class traitOrClassOfSelector: selector) printString! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dc 6/18/2007 18:55'!method	^ class compiledMethodAt: selector ifAbsent: [nil]! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'initialize-release' stamp: 'MAD 1/14/2009 11:44'!onClass: aClass selector: aSelector	class := aClass.	selector := aSelector.	separator := ' - '.! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'requests' stamp: 'dc 5/2/2007 19:00'!priorTimeStamp	^ (VersionsBrowser 		timeStampFor: selector		class: class		reverseOrdinal: 2) ifNotNilDo: [:stamp | 'prior time stamp: ' , stamp]! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'requests' stamp: 'dc 5/2/2007 18:34'!priorVersionsCount	| versionsCount |	versionsCount := VersionsBrowser versionCountForSelector: selector class: class.	^ versionsCount > 1			ifTrue:				[versionsCount == 2					ifTrue: ['1 prior version']					ifFalse: [versionsCount printString, ' prior versions']]			ifFalse:				['no prior versions']! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'requests' stamp: 'dc 5/2/2007 18:37'!recentChangeSet	^ ChangeSorter mostRecentChangeSetWithChangeForClass: class		selector: selector! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'requests' stamp: 'dc 5/2/2007 18:31'!sendersCount	| sendersCount |	sendersCount := (self systemNavigation allCallsOn: selector) size.	sendersCount := sendersCount == 1						ifTrue: ['1 sender']						ifFalse: [sendersCount printString , ' senders'].	^ sendersCount! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dc 5/2/2007 18:14'!separator: aString	separator := aString! !!O2AnnotationRequest methodsFor: 'requests' stamp: 'dc 5/2/2007 18:29'!timeStamp	^ self method ifNotNilDo: [:method | Utilities timeStampForMethod: method]! !!O2AboutToChange methodsFor: 'vetos' stamp: 'cwp 4/17/2006 22:18'!isVetoed	^ veto notNil! !!O2AboutToChange methodsFor: 'vetos' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!veto	veto := true! !!O2AboutToChangeSilently methodsFor: 'vetos' stamp: 'cwp 3/3/2007 22:28'!isVetoed	^ veto notNil! !!O2AboutToChangeSilently methodsFor: 'vetos' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!veto	veto := true! !!O2ChildrenChanged class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/5/2006 00:49'!node: aNode	^ self new node: aNode! !!O2ChildrenChanged methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/5/2006 00:49'!node	^ node! !!O2ChildrenChanged methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!node: aNode	node := aNode! !!O2CommandScan methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!addCommandsOn: aNode for: aRequestor to: aSet	| cmd |	factories do: 		[:ea | 		cmd := ea on: aNode for: aRequestor.		cmd isActive ifTrue: [aSet add: cmd]]! !!O2CommandScan methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:00'!addFactory: aCommandFactory 	self assert: aCommandFactory notNil.	factories add: aCommandFactory! !!O2CommandScan methodsFor: 'user interface' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!clusterCommands: aCollection 	| groups root name cluster |	groups := IdentityDictionary new.	root := O2CommandCluster new.	aCollection do: 		[ :command | 		name := command cluster.		cluster := name 			ifNil: [ root ]			ifNotNil: 				[ groups 					at: name					ifAbsentPut: [ command createCluster ] ].		cluster addCommand: command ].	groups values do: [ :ea | root addCommand: ea ].	^ root! !!O2CommandScan methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/2/2006 00:30'!commandsOn: aNode for: aRequestor	^ factories collect: [:ea | ea on: aNode for: aRequestor]! !!O2CommandScan methodsFor: 'user interface' stamp: 'cwp 9/30/2007 18:43'!groupCommands: commands 	| groups |	groups := commands groupBy: [:svc | svc group]				having: [:group | group isEmpty not].	groups := groups 				collect: [:ea | ea asArray sort: [:a :b | a label <= b label]].	^groups asArray sort: [:a :b | a anyOne group <= b anyOne group]! !!O2CommandScan methodsFor: 'initialize-release' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!initialize	factories := OrderedCollection new! !!O2CommandScan methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!populateMenu: aMenu withNode: aNode forRequestor: aRequestor filter: aBlock	| commands cluster |	commands := IdentitySet new.	self addCommandsOn: aNode for: aRequestor to: commands.	commands := commands select: [:cmd | aBlock value: cmd].	cluster := self clusterCommands: commands.	cluster populateMenu: aMenu! !!O2CommandScan methodsFor: 'user interface' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!populateMenu: aMenu withNodes: aCollection forRequestor: aRequestor	| commands cluster |	commands := IdentitySet new.	aCollection do: [:node | self addCommandsOn: node for: aRequestor to: commands].	cluster := self clusterCommands: commands.	cluster populateMenu: aMenu! !!O2CommandScan methodsFor: 'user interface' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!processKeystroke: aCharacter withNode: aNode for: aRequestor	| commands |	commands := self commandsOn: aNode for: aRequestor. 	(commands select: [:cmd | cmd keystroke == aCharacter]) do:		[:cmd |		(cmd isActive and: [cmd isEnabled])			ifTrue: [cmd execute]]! !!O2DefinitionChanged class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 11:28'!definition: aDefinition	^ self new		definition: aDefinition;		yourself! !!O2DefinitionChanged class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 11:27'!node: aNode definition: aDefinition	^ self new		node: aNode;		definition: aDefinition;		yourself! !!O2DefinitionChanged methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 11:25'!definition	^ definition! !!O2DefinitionChanged methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!definition: aDefinition	definition := aDefinition! !!O2DefinitionChanged methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/5/2006 00:47'!node	^ node! !!O2DefinitionChanged methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!node: aNode	node := aNode! !!O2Navigate class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 9/17/2008 14:02'!of: aNode	^ self new setRoot: aNode! !!O2Navigate class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 2/10/2009 16:25'!of: aNode label: aString	^(self of: aNode) label: aString; yourself! !!O2Navigate methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 8/20/2007 22:50'!bid: anInteger toDo: aBlock	anInteger > bid ifTrue:		[bid := anInteger.		action := aBlock]! !!O2Navigate methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultAction	^ 	[ fan children size = 0 		ifTrue: [ O2InformRequest message: self noChildrenMessage ]		ifFalse: 			[ self browserClass 				browseRoot: fan parent				label: self label ] ]! !!O2Navigate methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 10/1/2007 16:28'!defaultMetaNode	^self browserClass defaultMetaNode! !!O2Navigate methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 8/20/2007 22:51'!execute	^ action value! !!O2Navigate methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 8/20/2007 23:10'!fan	^ fan! !!O2Navigate methodsFor: 'initialize-release' stamp: 'cwp 8/20/2007 22:52'!initialize	bid := 0.	action := self defaultAction! !!O2Navigate methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/10/2009 16:25'!label	^label! !!O2Navigate methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/10/2009 16:25'!label: aString	label := aString! !!O2Navigate methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2007 00:30'!setRoot: aNode 	fan := (aNode copy metaNode: self defaultMetaNode) asFan! !!O2ShowHierarchyImplementors methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!browserClass	^ O2HierarchyImplementorsBrowser! !!O2ShowHierarchyImplementors methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 9/21/2007 11:20'!noChildrenMessage	^ 'no hierarchy implementors'! !!O2ShowHierarchySenders methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!browserClass	^ O2HierarchySendersBrowser! !!O2ShowHierarchySenders methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 9/21/2007 11:19'!noChildrenMessage	^'no hierarchy senders'! !!O2ShowImplementors methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!browserClass	^ O2ImplementorsBrowser! !!O2ShowImplementors methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2007 00:34'!noChildrenMessage	^ 'no implementors'! !!O2ShowSenders methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!browserClass	^ O2SendersBrowser! !!O2ShowSenders methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2007 00:33'!noChildrenMessage	^'no senders'! !!O2NodeChanged class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 11:17'!node: aNode	^ self new node: aNode! !!O2NodeChanged methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 11:17'!node	^ node! !!O2NodeChanged methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!node: aNode	node := aNode! !!O2NodeCreated class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 01:09'!node: aNode	^ self new node: aNode! !!O2NodeCreated methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 00:53'!node	^ node! !!O2NodeCreated methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!node: aNode	node := aNode! !!O2NodeDeleted class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 11:56'!node: aNode	^ self new node: aNode! !!O2NodeDeleted class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 5/4/2009 15:32'!node: aNode column: aColumn	^ self new node: aNode; column: aColumn! !!O2NodeDeleted methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 5/4/2009 15:32'!column	^ column! !!O2NodeDeleted methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 5/4/2009 15:33'!column: aColumn	column := aColumn! !!O2NodeDeleted methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 11:56'!node	^ node! !!O2NodeDeleted methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!node: aNode	node := aNode! !!O2RefreshRequired class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'dr 4/17/2009 11:43'!for: anEvent	^ self new event: anEvent! !!O2RefreshRequired methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 4/17/2009 11:43'!event	^event! !!O2RefreshRequired methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 4/17/2009 11:43'!event: anEvent	event := anEvent! !!O2SelectingNode class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 13:58'!node: aNode	^ self new node: aNode! !!O2SelectingNode methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 13:58'!node	^ node! !!O2SelectingNode methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!node: aNode	node := aNode! !!O2SelectionChanged class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 4/19/2006 00:51'!column: aColumn 	^ self new column: aColumn! !!O2SelectionChanged class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 4/19/2006 00:31'!node: aNode	^ self new node: aNode! !!O2SelectionChanged methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 4/19/2006 00:53'!column	^ column! !!O2SelectionChanged methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!column: aColumn	column := aColumn! !!O2SelectionChanged methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 7/19/2007 11:11'!deselectedNode	^deselectedNode! !!O2SelectionChanged methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 7/19/2007 11:11'!deselectedNode: aNode	deselectedNode := aNode! !!O2SelectionChanged methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 12:19'!node	^ column 		ifNil: [node]		ifNotNil: [column selectedNode]! !!O2SelectionChanged methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!node: aNode	node := aNode! !!O2Announcer class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!current	^ O2AnnouncerRequest signal! !!O2Announcer class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 4/17/2006 11:50'!new	^ self basicNew initialize! !!O2Announcer methodsFor: 'subscription' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:11'!announce: anObject 	| ann |	ann := anObject asO2Announcement.	subscriptions keysAndValuesDo: 		[ :class :action | 		(ann isKindOf: class) ifTrue: [ action valueWithArguments: (Array with: ann) ] ].	^ ann! !!O2Announcer methodsFor: 'initialize-release' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!initialize	subscriptions := IdentityDictionary new.! !!O2Announcer methodsFor: 'subscription' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!observe: aClass do: aValuable 	| actions |	actions := subscriptions at: aClass ifAbsent: [ActionSequence new].	subscriptions at: aClass put: (actions copyWith: aValuable).! !!O2Announcer methodsFor: 'subscription' stamp: 'cwp 6/3/2006 23:31'!observe: aClass send: aSelector to: anObject	self		observe: aClass		do: (MessageSend receiver: anObject selector: aSelector)! !!O2Announcer methodsFor: 'subscription' stamp: 'cwp 6/10/2006 00:40'!unsubscribe: anObject	subscriptions keysAndValuesDo:		[:class :actions |		subscriptions at: class put: (actions reject: [:ea | ea receiver == anObject])].	subscriptions keysAndValuesRemove: [:key :value | value isEmpty]! !!O2AutoSelection commentStamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 14:52' prior: 35449292!A auto selection holds a strategy that returns the node to auto select in columns. An auto selection strategy is stored in the metanode representing the respective column. !!O2AutoSelection class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 15:33'!on: aMetaNode	^self new metaNode: aMetaNode; yourself! !!O2AutoSelection methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 14:49'!autoSelection	^fan children detect: [:ea | ea metaNode == metaNode] ifNone: [nil]! !!O2AutoSelection methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 15:33'!fan: aFan	fan := aFan.! !!O2AutoSelection methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 15:43'!metaNode	^metaNode! !!O2AutoSelection methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 15:33'!metaNode: aMetaNode	metaNode := aMetaNode! !!O2PreviousAutoSelection commentStamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 15:05' prior: 35449536!Automatically select methods with the same selector as the method had we previously selected. !!O2PreviousAutoSelection methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 16:04'!autoSelection	^fan lastNode ifNotNil: [fan children detect: [:ea | ea selector = fan lastNode selector] ifNone: [nil]]! !!O2PreviousWithSingleAutoSelection commentStamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 15:08' prior: 35449712!Automatically select methods with the same selector as the method had we previously selected and also select automatically for a method protocol with just one method inside this single method. !!O2PreviousWithSingleAutoSelection methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 1/29/2009 11:08'!autoSelection	fan children size = 1 ifTrue: [fan setLastNode: fan children first. ^fan children first].	^super autoSelection! !!O2SmartGroupAutoSelection commentStamp: 'dr 1/28/2009 15:07' prior: 35449979!Automatically select the first method in the search results that satisfy the search query. !!O2SmartGroupAutoSelection methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 2/12/2009 10:28'!autoSelection	^fan children detect: [:ea | metaNode methodSatisfiesQuery: ea reference] ifNone: [nil].	! !!O2Benchmarks class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'Alexandre.Bergel 4/15/2009 18:13'!foo ^ 5! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'Alexandre.Bergel 4/15/2009 18:56'!bar ^ self foo! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'Alexandre.Bergel 4/15/2009 19:06'!bar2 ^ self foo! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!browserOpeningEvent	"	Time millisecondsToRun: self new browserOpeningEvent  	    => 510   David Roethlisberger 7/4/2009 optimized button panel	MessageTally spyOn: self new receivingEvent	"	^ 	[ O2PackageBrowser 		openOnClass: self class		selector: #foo ]! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!createPackageBenchmark	"	Time millisecondsToRun: self new createPackageBenchmark 16905 16065  	    => 510   David Roethlisberger 7/4/2009 optimized button panel	MessageTally spyOn: self new createPackageBenchmark	"	| browser cmd |	browser := O2PackageBrowser 		openOnClass: self class		selector: #foo.	cmd := O2CmdCreatePackage 		on: browser model root		for: browser model navigationPanel columns first.	^ [ cmd execute ]! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!findClassBenchmark	"	Time millisecondsToRun: self new findClassBenchmark  15513   18250	    => 510   David Roethlisberger 7/4/2009 optimized butto 8934n panel	MessageTally spyOn: self new findClassBenchmark	"	| browser cmd |	browser := O2PackageBrowser 		openOnClass: self class		selector: #foo.	cmd := O2CmdFindClass 		on: browser model root		for: browser model navigationPanel columns first.	^ [ cmd execute ]! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 7/4/2009 14:56'!foo ^ 20! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!receivingEmittingEvent	"	Time millisecondsToRun: self new receivingEvent  613 440  1049   		=> 1746		=> 1694 Alexandre.Bergel 4/15/2009 18:26  For 1 browser	MessageTally spyOn: self new receivingEvent nil	"	| browser |	browser := O2PackageBrowser 		openOnClass: self class		selector: #foo.	^ 	[ 1 		to: 20		do: 			[ :i | 			browser model definitionPanel 				accept: 'foo ^ ' , i printString				notifying: nil ] ]! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!receivingEvent	"	Time millisecondsToRun: self new receivingEvent  	    => 510   David Roethlisberger 7/4/2009 optimized button panel		=> 1746		=> 1694 Alexandre.Bergel 4/15/2009 18:26  For 1 browser	MessageTally spyOn: self new receivingEvent	"	| browser |	browser := O2PackageBrowser 		openOnClass: self class		selector: #foo.	^ 	[ 1 		to: 20		do: 			[ :i | 			browser model definitionPanel 				accept: 'foo ^ ' , i printString				notifying: nil ] ]! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'event handling' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!receivingEvent1	"	The class selected in the browser is modified		Time millisecondsToRun: self new receivingEvent1		=> 1673 Alexandre.Bergel 4/20/2009 17:33 (OB-Enhancements-dr.319, OB-Standard-dr.404, OmniBrowser-dr.447)		=> 21737 Alexandre.Bergel 4/20/2009 17:24 (OB-Enhancements-dr.316, OB-Standard-dr.402, OmniBrowser-dr.444)	MessageTally spyOn: self new receivingEvent1	"	| event window |	window := O2PackageBrowser 		openOnClass: self class		selector: #foo.	event := AddedEvent 		method: self class >> #receivingEvent1		class: self class.	^ 	[ 1 		to: 20		do: 			[ :i | 			window model				event: event;				signalRefresh ] ]! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'event handling' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!receivingEvent2	"	A new class is added and a browser is displaying the package of the class		Time millisecondsToRun: self new receivingEvent2  		=> 1622  Alexandre.Bergel 4/20/2009 17:34 (OB-Enhancements-dr.319, OB-Standard-dr.404, OmniBrowser-dr.447)		=> 22048 Alexandre.Bergel 4/20/2009 17:24 (OB-Enhancements-dr.316, OB-Standard-dr.402, OmniBrowser-dr.444)	MessageTally spyOn: self new receivingEvent2	"	| event window |	window := O2PackageBrowser openOnClass: self class.	event := AddedEvent class: self class.	^ 	[ 1 		to: 20		do: 			[ :i | 			window model				event: event;				signalRefresh ] ]! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'event handling' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!receivingEvent3	"	A new class is added and a browser is displaying another package		Time millisecondsToRun: self new receivingEvent3   		=> 1615 Alexandre.Bergel 4/20/2009 17:34 (OB-Enhancements-dr.319, OB-Standard-dr.404, OmniBrowser-dr.447)		=> 33732 Alexandre.Bergel 4/20/2009 17:30 (OB-Enhancements-dr.316, OB-Standard-dr.402, OmniBrowser-dr.444)	MessageTally spyOn: self new receivingEvent3	"	| event window |	window := O2PackageBrowser openOnClass: Object.	event := AddedEvent class: self class.	^ 	[ 1 		to: 20		do: 			[ :i | 			window model				event: event;				signalRefresh ] ]! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'event handling' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!receivingEvent4	"	A new method is added and the browser shows a different method on a different class		Time millisecondsToRun: self new receivingEvent4    		=> 1628 Alexandre.Bergel 4/20/2009 17:36 (OB-Enhancements-dr.319, OB-Standard-dr.404, OmniBrowser-dr.447)		=> 11760 Alexandre.Bergel 4/20/2009 17:30 (OB-Enhancements-dr.316, OB-Standard-dr.402, OmniBrowser-dr.444)	"	| event window |	window := O2PackageBrowser 		openOnClass: Object		selector: #halt.	event := AddedEvent class: self class.	^ 	[ 1 		to: 20		do: 			[ :i | 			window model				event: event;				signalRefresh ] ]! !!O2Benchmarks methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!signalRefresh	"	Time millisecondsToRun: self new signalRefresh       		=> 22024 Alexandre.Bergel 4/15/2009 18:45	MessageTally spyOn: self new signalRefresh		self new signalRefresh value	"	| browser window obTreeColumn |	window := O2PackageBrowser 		openOnClass: self class		selector: #foo.	browser := window model.	obTreeColumn := browser navigationPanel columns first.	^ 	[ 1 		to: 10		do: [ :i | obTreeColumn refreshAndSignal: false ] ]! !!O2Browser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:17' prior: 35450128!OBBrowser is the core of OmniBrower. It's the root object for each browser and the model for the SystemWindows which display them. Its main responsibily is managing panels, particularly passing update messages between them.On the class side, OBBrowser provides some default settings for creating and opening browsers. Subclasses can override these settings to acheive customized behavior.iVars:panels	- A collection of objects which manage submorphs of the browser's SystemWindow.cVars:MetaGraphs - A dictionary matching names to metagraphs!!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'avi 9/17/2005 01:10'!defaultMetaNode	self subclassResponsibility! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 12/6/2004 23:20'!defaultRootNode	self subclassResponsibility! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!definitionPanel	^ O2DefinitionPanel new! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 7/14/2009 10:58'!draggableButtonClass	^PluggableButtonMorph! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!hasReferencePanel    ^false! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!isHierarchyBrowser    ^false! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 8/31/2004 11:01'!maxPanes	^ self paneCount! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 18:12'!metaNode: metaNode node: rootNode 	^ self metaNode: metaNode root: rootNode selection: nil panels: self panels! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'avi 9/17/2005 01:16'!metaNode: metaNode root: rootNode selection: selectedNode	^ self metaNode: metaNode root: rootNode selection: selectedNode panels: self panels! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!metaNode: metaNode root: rootNode selection: selectedNode panels: panels	| browser |	browser := self basicNew initialize.	panels do: [:ea | browser addPanel: ea].	browser setMetaNode: metaNode node: rootNode.	selectedNode ifNotNil: [browser jumpTo: selectedNode].	^ browser! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 8/31/2004 11:00'!minPanes	^ self paneCount! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!navigationPanel	^ O2ColumnPanel 		minPanes: self minPanes		maxPanes: self maxPanes! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'avi 9/16/2005 23:25'!new	^ self 		metaNode: self defaultMetaNode		root: self defaultRootNode		selection: nil		panels: self panels! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'auto opening' stamp: 'cwp 12/6/2004 23:22'!open	^ self new open! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'auto opening' stamp: 'cwp 1/22/2007 23:21'!openRoot: aNode	^ (self root: aNode) open! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'auto opening' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 17:03'!openRoot: rootNode selection: selectedNode	^ (self root: rootNode selection: selectedNode) open! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!optionalButtonPanel	^ O2Platform current optionalButtons ifTrue: [ O2FixedButtonPanel new ]! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 8/31/2004 11:07'!optionalButtons	^ #()! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 8/31/2004 11:01'!paneCount	^ 4! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dkh 5/31/2007 13:45'!panels	^ (Array with: self navigationPanel with: self optionalButtonPanel with: self definitionPanel)		reject: [:ea | ea isNil]! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!radioButtonBarClass	^ O2RadioButtonBar! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 15:26'!root: aNode 	^ self root: aNode selection: nil! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'avi 9/16/2005 23:25'!root: rootNode selection: selectedNode	^ self metaNode: self defaultMetaNode root: rootNode selection: selectedNode panels: self panels! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 12/6/2004 22:04'!selection: selectedNode	^ self root: self defaultRootNode selection: selectedNode! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 8/31/2004 11:32'!title	^ 'OmniBrowser'! !!O2Browser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 8/31/2004 13:02'!titleForRoot: aNode	^ self title! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 6/4/2006 00:36'!addPanel: aPanel	panels add: aPanel.	aPanel browser: self.! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 10/4/2006 10:06'!announce: anObject	^ self announcer announce: anObject! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 4/17/2006 15:42'!announcer	^ announcer! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 12/9/2007 10:37'!buildGroup: aCollection on: aBuilder 	^aBuilder verticalGroupWith: [aCollection do: [:ea | ea buildOn: aBuilder]]! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 20:50'!buildOn: aBuilder 	| group |	^aBuilder window: self		with: 			[group := OrderedCollection with: panels first.			panels allButFirst do: 					[:panel | 					group last vResizing = #spaceFill 						ifTrue: 							[self buildGroup: group on: aBuilder.							group := OrderedCollection new].					group add: panel].			self buildGroup: group on: aBuilder]! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!close	^ O2CloseRequest signal: self! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 3/11/2007 18:29'!cmdFactories	^ cmdFactories! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!commandSelectors	| all obsolete commands |	all := self class allSelectors.	obsolete := Set new.	all do: [:ea | (ea beginsWith: 'obsolete') ifTrue: [obsolete add: (self perform: ea)]].	commands := all select: [:ea | ea beginsWith: 'cmd'].	^ commands reject: [:ea | obsolete includes: ea]! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/20/2004 21:00'!currentNode	^self navigationPanel currentNode! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/20/2004 21:00'!currentOrRootNode	^self navigationPanel currentOrRootNode! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 11/28/2008 14:20'!defaultBackgroundColor	^ Color gray veryMuchLighter! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 8/31/2004 13:04'!defaultLabel	^ self class titleForRoot: self root! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 5/24/2007 12:21'!definitionPanel	^ panels 		detect: [:ea | ea isDefinition] 		ifNone: [self error: 'No definition panel configured']! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 6/9/2006 23:29'!dontTranscribe	self announcer unsubscribe: self.	self subscribe.! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/20/2009 09:40'!fixedButtonPanel	^ panels 		detect: [:ea | ea isFixedButton] 		ifNone: [nil]! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!initialize	panels := OrderedCollection new.	announcer := O2Announcer new.	cmdFactories := #().	self subscribe! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 2/19/2009 10:00'!initializeCommands	cmdFactories := Array streamContents: 		[:stream | 		(self commandSelectors) do: 			[:selector | 			| result |			result := self perform: selector.			result isCollection 				ifTrue: [stream nextPutAll: result]				ifFalse: [stream nextPut: result]]]. 	! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 11/20/2004 21:00'!jumpTo: aNode 	self navigationPanel jumpTo: aNode! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 11/20/2004 21:00'!jumpToRoot	^self navigationPanel jumpToRoot! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 11/20/2004 21:05'!labelString	| label |	label := self navigationPanel labelString.	^label 		ifNil: [self defaultLabel]		ifNotNil: [self defaultLabel , ': ' , label]! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 16:25'!navigationPanel	^ panels 		detect: [:ea | ea isNavigation] 		ifNone: [self error: 'No navigation panel configured']! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!okToChange	^ (self announcer announce: O2AboutToChange) isVetoed not! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!open	^ O2BrowseRequest signal: self! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 9/17/2004 00:53'!panels	^ panels! !!O2Browser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!refreshAll   self navigationPanel columns first refreshAll! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 4/24/2006 15:10'!relabel: ann	self changed: #relabel.! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 9/17/2005 17:48'!root	^self navigationPanel root! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'matthias.berth 11/14/2009 14:47'!scanNodeCommands: ann 	(cmdFactories select: [:ea | ea isNil not and: [ ea takesNodes]]) 		do: [:ea | ann addFactory: ea]! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 11/2/2006 00:35'!scanTextCommands: ann 	(cmdFactories select: [:ea | ea takesText]) do: [:ea | ann addFactory: ea]! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dvf 9/5/2005 17:30'!selectionPath	^self navigationPanel selectionPath! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'cwp 11/1/2006 22:24'!setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode 	self navigationPanel setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode.	self initializeCommands! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!signalRefresh	self announcer announce: O2RefreshRequired! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!subscribe	self announcer		observe: O2SelectionChanged			send: #relabel:			to: self;		observe: O2NodeCommandScan			send: #scanNodeCommands:			to: self;		observe: O2TextCommandScan			send: #scanTextCommands:			to: self! !!O2Browser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!transcribe	self announcer 		observe: O2Announcement		do: 			[ :ann | 			Transcript				cr;				show: ann ]! !!O2CodeBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:45' prior: 35450740!OBCodeBrowser is a superclass for all browsers which active code in the image. It provides methods for registering with the SystemChangeNotifier and updating it's display when it receives notification of system changes.!!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!annotationPanel	^ Preferences annotationPanes 		ifTrue: [ O2AnnotationPanel new ]		ifFalse: [ nil ]! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 5/20/2007 00:02'!buildMetagraphOn: root 	^ self 		buildMetagraphOn: root		class: #classes		comment: #comments		metaclass: #metaclasses! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!buildMetagraphOn: root class: classSel comment: commentSel metaclass: metaclassSel 	^ (O2MetagraphBuilder 		on: root		class: classSel		comment: commentSel		metaclass: metaclassSel) execute! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'avi 5/30/2007 22:09'!chasingBrowsers	^ Preferences chasingBrowsers! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:55'!defaultBrowserClass	| browserOpener |	Smalltalk 		at: #SystemBrowser		ifPresent: 			[ :class | 			browserOpener := class default.			(browserOpener name beginsWith: 'O2') ifTrue: [ ^ browserOpener browserClass ] ].	^ O2SystemBrowser! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 2/15/2008 15:32'!defaultHierarchyBrowserClass    ^self defaultBrowserClass hierarchyBrowserClass! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'PDC 6/27/2007 23:02'!defaultRootNode	^nil! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!dynamicBrowser    ^false! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!hasHistoryButtons    ^false! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!hierarchyBrowserClass	^ O2HierarchyBrowser! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!hierarchySwitchIndex     ^0! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'avi 5/30/2007 22:10'!initialize	"OBCodeBrowser initialize"	Preferences 		addPreference: #chasingBrowsers		categories: #('browsing')		default: true		balloonHelp: 'Use recursive multi-column browsers for senders, implementors, etc.'! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!mercuryPanel	^ Preferences mercuryPanel 		ifTrue: [ O2MercuryPanel new ]		ifFalse: [ nil ]! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 12/15/2004 22:52'!optionalButtons	^ #('browse' 'variables' 'hierarchy' 'inheritance' 'senders' 'implementors' 'versions')! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!packageSwitchIndex     ^0! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 2/14/2009 19:12'!panels	^ {self topPanel. self navigationPanel. self annotationPanel. self definitionPanel} reject: [:ea | ea isNil]! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!smartGroupSwitchIndex     ^0! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!topPanel	^ O2TopNavigationPanel withPanels: ({  (self mercuryPanel). (self optionalButtonPanel)  } reject: [ :ea | ea isNil ])! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 10/18/2008 10:35'!unload    	Preferences removePreference: #chasingBrowsers! !!O2CodeBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!useMultipleSelection    ^false! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!addModelItemsToWindowMenu: aMenu 	Smalltalk 		at: #SystemBrowser		ifPresent: 			[ :class | 			class 				addRegistryMenuItemsTo: aMenu				inAccountOf: O2SystemBrowserAdaptor new ]! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!browseHistory    ^OrderedCollection new! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 4/17/2009 11:47'!clearChanges	changeEvent := nil! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!clearHistoryAfter: anInteger    "remove all following elements"    self setHistory: (self browseHistory copyFrom: 1 to: anInteger).! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdAutoCategorizeCat	^ O2CmdAutoCategorize! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowse	^ O2CmdBrowse! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseHierarchy	^ O2CmdBrowseHierarchy! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseHierarchyImplementors	^ O2CmdBrowseHierarchyImplementors! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseHierarchySenders	^ O2CmdBrowseHierarchySenders! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseImplementors	^ O2CmdBrowseImplementors! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseImplementorsOfIt	^ O2CmdBrowseImplementorsOfIt! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseInheritance	^ O2CmdBrowseInheritance! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseMethodImplementor	^ O2CmdBrowseMethodImplementor! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseMethodVersions	^ O2CmdBrowseMethodVersions! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseProtocol	^ O2CmdBrowseProtocol! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseReferences	^ O2CmdBrowseReferences! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseSenders	^ O2CmdBrowseSenders! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseSendersOfIt	^ O2CmdBrowseSendersOfIt! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseTraitUser	^ O2CmdBrowseTraitUsers! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdChaseVariables	^ O2CmdChaseVariables! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!cmdClassRefactroings	^ OR2CmdClassRefactoring allSubclasses! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!cmdClassVarRefactroings	^ OR2CmdClassVarRefactoring allSubclasses! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdCompareToCurrent	^ O2CmdCompareToCurrent! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdCopyClass	^ O2CmdCopyClass! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdCreateCat	^ Array 		with: O2CmdCreateClassCategory		with: O2CmdCreateMethodCategory! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!cmdEnvironments	^ OR2CmdEnvironment allSubclasses! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdFileOut	^ O2CmdFileOut! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:49'!cmdFindClass	^ Array with: O2CmdFindClass with: O2CmdRecentClasses! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdFindMethod	^ Array 		with: O2CmdFindMethod		with: O2CmdFindMethodWildcard! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!cmdInstVarRefactroings	^ OR2CmdInstVarRefactoring allSubclasses! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!cmdMethodRefactroings	^ OR2CmdMethodRefactoring allSubclasses! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdMethodsContainingIt	^ O2CmdBrowseMethodsWithIt! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdMoveMethodCategoryToTrait	^ O2CmdMoveMethodCategoryToTrait! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdMoveMethodToTrait	^ O2CmdMoveMethodToTrait! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdMoveToPackage	^ O2CmdMoveToPackage! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdMultiView	^ O2CmdMultiView! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdNewClassTemplate	^ O2CmdNewClassTemplate! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdNewTraitTemplate	^ O2CmdNewTraitTemplate! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!cmdOpen	^ OR2CmdOpen allSubclasses! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!cmdPrettyPrint	^ OR2CmdPrettyPrint! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!cmdPrettyPrintAll	^ OR2CmdPrettyPrintAll! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!cmdRecompile	^ OR2CmdRecompile! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!cmdRefactoryTools	^ OR2CmdRefactoringTool allSubclasses! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdRemoveCat	^ O2CmdRemoveCategoryOrProtocol subclasses! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdRemoveClass	^ O2CmdRemoveClass! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdRemoveElement	^ O2CmdRemoveElement! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdRemoveEmptyCats	^ O2CmdRemoveEmptyProtocols! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdRemoveMethod	^ O2CmdRemoveMethod! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdRenameCat	^ O2CmdRenameCategoryOrProtocol allSubclasses! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdRenameClass	^ O2CmdRenameClass! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdReorgCats	^ O2CmdReorgProtocols! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdResetSearch	^ O2CmdResetSearch! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdRevertMethod	^ O2CmdRevertMethod! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:51'!cmdSUnitIntegration	^ Array 		with: O2CmdTestPackage		with: O2CmdTestClass		with: O2CmdTestMethod		with: O2CmdTestProtocol! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdSelectMethodCategory	^ O2CmdSelectMethodCategory! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!cmdSourceRefactroings	^ OR2CmdSourceRefactoring allSubclasses! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdSubclassTemplate	^ O2CmdSubclassTemplate! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdToggleBreak	^ O2CmdToggleBreak! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:51'!cmdTraitsIntegration	^ Array with: O2CmdExcludeMethod with: O2CmdExcludeClass! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-refactory-accessing' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:50'!environment	^ BrowserEnvironment new! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 4/17/2009 15:55'!event: anEvent	anEvent isDoIt ifTrue: [ ^ self ].	"Transcript show: 'OBPackageBrowser>>event:  ', anEvent itemKind printString; cr."	changeEvent := anEvent."	v := Time millisecondsToRun: [anEvent itemKind == #method 		ifFalse: [changeEvent := anEvent. ^ self].	selectedClassNode := self navigationPanel columns second selectedNode.	selectedClassNode ifNil: [ ^ self ]. 		selectedClass := selectedClassNode theClass.	methodClass := anEvent item methodClass.		selectedClass ~~ methodClass ifTrue: [ ^ self ]. 	changeEvent := anEvent.].Transcript show: 'OBPackageBrowser>>event:  ', anEvent itemKind printString, '  time: ', v printString; cr."	! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!hasBackHistory    ^self hasHistory and: [self historyPrevious notNil]! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!hasForwardHistory      ^self hasHistory and: [self historyNext notNil]! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!hasHistory    ^self browseHistory isEmpty not and: [self browseHistory last notNil]! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyAtCursor    ^nil! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyBack    self browseHistory isEmpty ifTrue: [^false].     ^self historyGoToIndex: self historyCursor - 1. ! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyBackNodes    ^(self browseHistory copyFrom: 1 to: self historyCursor - 1) reversed reject: [:ea | ea isNil].! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyCursor    ^0! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyCursor: anInteger! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyForward    self browseHistory isEmpty ifTrue: [^false].    ^self historyGoToIndex: self historyCursor + 1. ! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyForwardNodes    ^(self browseHistory copyFrom: self historyCursor + 1 to: self browseHistory size) reject: [:ea | ea isNil].! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyGoToIndex: anInteger    | node | "self halt."    self browseHistory at: anInteger ifAbsent: [^false].    self historyCursor: anInteger.     node := self historyAtCursor.    node ifNotNil: [        self historyIndexOnSwitch >= anInteger ifTrue: [		  self setMetaNode: self class defaultMetaNode root: self class defaultRootNode. 		  self clearHistoryAfter: anInteger.		  self resetHistoryIndexOnSwitch]. 	   self jumpTo: node. 	   ^true    ].    ^false! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyIncrementCursor   self historyCursor: self historyCursor + 1! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyIndexOnSwitch	^0! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyNext    ^self browseHistory at: self historyCursor + 1 ifAbsent: [nil]! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyNodes    ^self browseHistory reject: [:ea | ea isNil].! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyPrevious    ^self browseHistory at: self historyCursor - 1 ifAbsent: [nil]! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historyPush: aNode     aNode ifNotNil: [	   self historyCursor < self browseHistory size ifTrue: [		   self clearHistoryAfter: self historyCursor.	   ].	   self historyAtCursor = aNode ifFalse: [self browseHistory addLast: aNode. self historyIncrementCursor].    ]! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!historySizeOnSwitch    ^0! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'morphic' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 11/6/2009 15:08'!initialExtent	self register.	^ super initialExtent! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 4/18/2007 23:48'!isClassBrowser	^ false! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 2/7/2008 17:20'!isSearchBrowser	^ false! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 4/17/2009 11:49'!noteChanges	changeEvent := true! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 10/24/2008 16:06'!register	SystemChangeNotifier uniqueInstance notify: self ofAllSystemChangesUsing: #event:.! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'morphic' stamp: 'dr 7/16/2008 15:19'!release    "work-around for bug #7119"    super release.    self panels do: [:panel | panel release].! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!resetHistoryIndexOnSwitch! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!resetHistorySize    "do nothing"! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!setHistory: aCollection! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!setMetaNode: aMetaNode root: aNode! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!signalRefresh	changeEvent == true ifTrue: [ ^ super signalRefresh ].	self announcer announce: (O2RefreshRequired for: changeEvent)! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 4/17/2009 15:56'!stepAt: milliseconds in: aSystemWindow	changeEvent ifNotNil: [self signalRefresh.		"v := Time millisecondsToRun: [self signalRefresh].		Transcript show: 'Time to refresh = ', v printString; cr]"	].	self clearChanges.! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!subscribe	super subscribe.	self announcer 		observe: O2SelectionChanged		send: #columnSelected:		to: O2RecentClasses default! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 10/24/2008 16:06'!unregister	SystemChangeNotifier uniqueInstance noMoreNotificationsFor: self.	! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'morphic'!wantsStepsIn: aSystemWindow	^ true! !!O2CodeBrowser methodsFor: 'morphic' stamp: 'dr 11/20/2008 09:51'!windowIsClosing	self unregister! !!O2HierarchyBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:50' prior: 35451026!OBHierarchyBrowser provides a three-pane browers that displays a class within it's surrounding hierarchy - both superclasses and subclasses!!O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 11/6/2009 23:35'!defaultMetaNode	| metaGraph |	metaGraph := (self dynamicBrowser 		ifTrue: [ Smalltalk at: #OBDynamicMetagraphBuilder ]		ifFalse: [ O2EnhancementMetagraphBuilder ]) 		on: (O2MetaNode named: 'RootClass')		class: #classHierarchy		comment: #commentHierarchy		metaclass: #metaclassHierarchy.	metaGraph classMetaNode doubleClickCommandClass: O2CmdFocusOnClassInHierarchy.	metaGraph metaclassMetaNode doubleClickCommandClass: O2CmdFocusOnClassInHierarchy.	"metaGraph methodMetaNode doubleClickCommandClass: OBCmdSelectMethodCategory."	^ metaGraph execute! !!O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/16/2009 10:06'!definitionPanel	^ (self dynamicBrowser 		ifTrue: [ Smalltalk at: #OBEnrichedDefinitionPanel ]		ifFalse: [ O2EnhancementDefinitionPanel ]) new! !!O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 2/15/2008 14:29'!dynamicBrowser    ^false! !!O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!optionalButtonPanel	^ O2Platform current optionalButtons ifTrue: [ O2EnhancementFixedButtonPanel new ]! !!O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 4/14/2008 16:49'!browseHistory    browseHistory ifNil: [browseHistory := OrderedCollection new].    ^browseHistory! !!O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 4/14/2008 16:50'!historyAtCursor   ^self browseHistory at: self historyCursor ifAbsent: [nil]! !!O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 4/14/2008 16:50'!historyCursor    ^historyCursor ifNil: [0]! !!O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 4/14/2008 16:50'!historyCursor: anInteger    historyCursor := anInteger! !!O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 4/14/2008 16:50'!historyIndexOnSwitch    historyIndexOnSwitch ifNil: [historyIndexOnSwitch := 0].    ^historyIndexOnSwitch! !!O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 4/14/2008 16:50'!resetHistoryIndexOnSwitch    historyIndexOnSwitch := 0! !!O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 4/14/2008 16:50'!setHistory: aCollection    browseHistory := aCollection! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!buildMetagraphOn: root class: classSel comment: commentSel metaclass: metaclassSel 	"to make sure that the enh. graph builder is also used if package browser is not default browser"	^ (O2EnhancementMetagraphBuilder 		on: root		class: classSel		comment: commentSel		metaclass: metaclassSel) execute! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultMetaNode	^ self 		buildMetagraphOn: (O2MetaNode named: 'RootClass')		class: #classHierarchy		comment: #commentHierarchy		metaclass: #metaclassHierarchy! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!definitionPanel	^ O2EnhancementDefinitionPanel new! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!hasReferencePanel    ^self dynamicBrowser! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!isHierarchyBrowser    ^true! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!navigationPanel	^ O2EnhancementColumnPanel 		minPanes: self minPanes		maxPanes: self maxPanes! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!onClass: aClass 	^ self 		root: aClass asO2Node		selection: aClass asO2Node! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!onClass: aClass selector: aSelector 	| methodNode |	methodNode := O2MethodNode 		on: aSelector		inClass: aClass.	^ self 		root: aClass asO2Node		selection: methodNode! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'cwp 12/15/2004 22:49'!openOnClass: aClass	^ (self onClass: aClass) open! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!openOnClass: aClass selector: aSelector	^(self onClass: aClass selector: aSelector) open! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 12/13/2004 00:37'!paneCount	^ 3! !!O2HierarchyBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 12/13/2004 01:00'!titleForRoot: aNode	^ aNode name, ' Hierarchy'! !!O2HierarchyBrowser methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 2/14/2009 19:45'!defaultBackgroundColor	| color | 	color := Preferences browserWindowColor.	^ color isColor 		ifFalse: [Color lightGreen]		ifTrue: [color]! !!O2HierarchyBrowser methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 12/13/2004 01:00'!defaultLabel	^ self root name, ' Hierarchy'! !!O2InheritanceBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:51' prior: 35451234!OBInheritanceBrowser shows the inheritance hierarchy of a method, both superclass implementations which it overrides, and subclass implementations which override it.!!O2InheritanceBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultMetaNode	| method root |	method := O2MetaNode named: 'Method'.	root := O2MetaNode named: 'Root'.	root 		childAt: #children		put: method.	method		displaySelector: #fullName;		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfMethod:;		childAt: #overrides			put: method.	^ root! !!O2InheritanceBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration'!title	^ 'Inheritance'! !!O2InheritanceBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 11/25/2004 22:05'!titleForRoot: aCollectionNode	^ 'Inheritance of ', aCollectionNode children first selector printString! !!O2InheritanceBrowser methodsFor: 'morphic' stamp: 'avi 11/29/2004 21:52'!defaultBackgroundColor	^ Color lightGreen! !!O2ListBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:53' prior: 35451461!OBListBrowsers are used to display simple lists of methods, such as senders or implementors.!!O2HierarchyImplementorsBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 4/17/2007 16:54'!defaultMetaNode	^self implementorsNav: #hierarchyImplementors! !!O2HierarchyImplementorsBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 4/17/2007 16:53'!title	^'Hierarchy Implementors of'! !!O2ImplementorsBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 7/2/2007 14:47'!defaultMetaNode	 ^self implementorsNav: #implementors.! !!O2ImplementorsBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!hasReferencePanel    ^self dynamicBrowser! !!O2ImplementorsBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!implementorsNav: navSelector 	| selector message implementor |	selector := O2MetaNode named: 'Selector'.	message := O2MetaNode named: 'Message'.	implementor := O2MetaNode named: 'Implementor'.	selector		childAt: navSelector			put: implementor;		addFilter: O2ClassSortFilter new.	implementor displaySelector: #fullNameWithProtocol.	self chasingBrowsers ifTrue: 		[ implementor 			childAt: #messages			put: message.		message 			childAt: navSelector			put: implementor ].	^ selector! !!O2ImplementorsBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'avi 9/17/2005 01:36'!title	^ 'Implementors of'! !!O2ListBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'avi 9/17/2005 01:34'!browseRoot: aNode	self browseRoot: aNode title: self title! !!O2ListBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'dr 2/10/2009 16:23'!browseRoot: aNode label: aString 	(self metaNode: self defaultMetaNode root: aNode selection: nil)		label: aString;		open	! !!O2ListBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'avi 9/17/2005 01:21'!browseRoot: aNode title: aString 	(self metaNode: self defaultMetaNode root: aNode selection: nil)		labelPrefix: aString;		open	! !!O2ListBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!definitionPanel	^ O2DefinitionPanel new! !!O2ListBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!hasReferencePanel    ^self dynamicBrowser! !!O2ListBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 17:54'!maxPanes	^ 2! !!O2ListBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 17:54'!minPanes	^ 1! !!O2ListBrowser methodsFor: 'morphic' stamp: 'dr 9/22/2008 11:28'!defaultBackgroundColor	^ Color lightBlue ! !!O2ListBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/11/2009 10:58'!defaultLabel	label ifNotNil: [^label].	^ self labelPrefix, ' ', self root name printString, ' [', self root childNodes size printString, ']'! !!O2ListBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/10/2009 16:23'!label: aString	label := aString! !!O2ListBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/25/2004 22:18'!labelPrefix	^ labelPrefix ifNil: [labelPrefix := self root metaNode edges first label capitalized, ' of']! !!O2ListBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 10/17/2004 20:54'!labelPrefix: aString	labelPrefix := aString! !!O2MessageSetBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultMetaNode	| matches collection |	collection := O2MetaNode named: 'Collection'.	matches := O2MetaNode named: 'Methods'.	collection 		childAt: #children		put: matches.	matches		displaySelector: #fullName;		ancestrySelector: #isAncestorOf:.	^ collection! !!O2MessageSetBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 3/27/2009 15:22'!defaultLabel	^ self labelPrefix! !!O2MethodStringsBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DM 5/23/2007 20:21'!browseRoot: aNode target: targetNode	(self root: aNode selection: targetNode) open.! !!O2MethodStringsBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultMetaNode	| matches selection |	selection := O2MetaNode named: 'Selection'.	matches := O2MetaNode named: 'Methods'.	selection 		childAt: #methods		put: matches.	matches		displaySelector: #fullName;		ancestrySelector: #isAncestorOf:.	^ selection! !!O2MethodStringsBrowser methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 6/21/2007 15:30'!defaultBackgroundColor	| color |	color := Preferences messageListWindowColor.	^ color isColor 		ifFalse: [super defaultBackgroundColor]		ifTrue: [color]! !!O2MethodStringsBrowser methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DM 5/23/2007 20:24'!defaultLabel	^ 'Methods with literal', self selectorString, self numOfMatchesString! !!O2MethodStringsBrowser methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DM 5/23/2007 20:26'!numOfMatchesString	^ '[' , self root methods size asString , ']'! !!O2MethodStringsBrowser methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DM 5/23/2007 20:23'!selectorString	^ ' ''', self root selector string, ''' '! !!O2ReferencesBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultMetaNode	| class method sender |	class := O2MetaNode named: 'Class'.	method := O2MetaNode named: 'References'.	sender := O2MetaNode named: 'Sender'.	class 		childAt: #users		put: method.	method displaySelector: #fullNameWithProtocol.	self chasingBrowsers ifTrue: 		[ method 			childAt: #senders			put: sender.		sender			displaySelector: #fullNameWithProtocol;			childAt: #senders				put: sender ].	^ class! !!O2ReferencesBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'avi 9/17/2005 01:34'!title	^ 'References to'! !!O2HierarchySendersBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 4/19/2007 10:57'!defaultMetaNode    ^self sendersNav: #hierarchySenders.    ! !!O2HierarchySendersBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 7/2/2007 16:55'!title	^'Hierarchy Senders of'     ! !!O2SendersBrowser class methodsFor: 'defaults' stamp: 'dr 7/2/2007 14:46'!defaultMetaNode	^self sendersNav: #senders! !!O2SendersBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!sendersNav: navSelector 	| selector sender |	selector := O2MetaNode named: 'Selector'.	sender := O2MetaNode named: 'Sender'.	selector		childAt: navSelector			put: sender;		addFilter: O2RescueFilter new.	sender		displaySelector: #fullNameWithProtocol;		addFilter: O2RescueFilter new.	self chasingBrowsers ifTrue: 		[ sender 			childAt: navSelector			put: sender ].	^ selector! !!O2SendersBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'avi 9/17/2005 01:36'!title	^ 'Senders of'! !!O2VariablesBrowser class methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!addChasingFiltersTo: nodes 	(nodes at: #method)		childAt: #senders			put: (nodes at: #message);		addFilter: O2ModalFilter new.	(nodes at: #var) addFilter: O2ModalFilter new.	(nodes at: #message)		displaySelector: #fullName;		childAt: #senders			put: (nodes at: #message);		addFilter: O2ModalFilter new! !!O2VariablesBrowser class methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!buildClassNodeIn: nodeDictionary 	(nodeDictionary at: #class)		childAt: #instanceVariables			labeled: 'instance'			put: (nodeDictionary at: #var);		childAt: #classVariables			labeled: 'class'			put: (nodeDictionary at: #var);		addFilter: O2ModalFilter new! !!O2VariablesBrowser class methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'PDC 6/27/2007 22:52'!buildMethodNodeIn: nodeDictionary 	(nodeDictionary at: #method) displaySelector: #fullName! !!O2VariablesBrowser class methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!buildVarNodeIn: nodeDictionary 	(nodeDictionary at: #var)		childAt: #accessors			put: (nodeDictionary at: #method);		addFilter: O2ClassSortFilter new! !!O2VariablesBrowser class methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'PDC 6/27/2007 22:55'!connectNodesIn: nodeDictionary 	self		buildClassNodeIn: nodeDictionary;		buildVarNodeIn: nodeDictionary;		buildMethodNodeIn: nodeDictionary! !!O2VariablesBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'PDC 6/27/2007 22:55'!defaultMetaNode	| nodes |	nodes := Dictionary new.	self		initializeNodesIn: nodes;		connectNodesIn: nodes.	self chasingBrowsers ifTrue: [self addChasingFiltersTo: nodes].	^ nodes at: #class! !!O2VariablesBrowser class methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!initializeNodesIn: nodeDictionary 	nodeDictionary		at: #class			put: (O2MetaNode named: 'Class');		at: #var			put: (O2MetaNode named: 'Variable');		at: #method			put: (O2MetaNode named: 'Method');		at: #message			put: (O2MetaNode named: 'Message')! !!O2VariablesBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'avi 5/30/2007 22:13'!minPanes	^ 2! !!O2VariablesBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'avi 9/17/2005 01:35'!title	^ 'Variables of'! !!O2ProtocolBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultMetaNode	| protocol method class |	class := O2MetaNode named: 'Class'.	protocol := O2MetaNode named: 'Protocol'.	method := O2MetaNode named: 'Method'.	class		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfClass:;		childAt: #allCategories			put: protocol.	protocol		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfMethodCat:;		childAt: #allMethods			put: method.	method		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfMethod:;		displaySelector: #nameWithClassNameInBrackets.	^ class! !!O2ProtocolBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DM 5/20/2007 15:31'!on: aNode 	^ (self root: aNode selection: aNode) open! !!O2ProtocolBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DM 5/20/2007 02:32'!paneCount^ 2.! !!O2ProtocolBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdFilterProtocol	^ O2CmdLimitProtocol! !!O2ProtocolBrowser methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 2/14/2009 19:45'!defaultBackgroundColor	| color | 	color := Preferences browserWindowColor.	^ color isColor 		ifFalse: [Color lightGreen]		ifTrue: [color]! !!O2ProtocolBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DM 5/20/2007 15:33'!defaultLabel	^ 'Vocabulary of ' , self root theClass name.! !!O2ProtocolBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DM 5/22/2007 18:41'!defaultLimitClass	^ (theClass isKindOf: Metaclass) 		ifTrue: [Object class]		ifFalse: [Object]! !!O2ProtocolBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DM 5/22/2007 18:42'!limitClass	^ limitClass 		ifNil: [self defaultLimitClass]		ifNotNil: [limitClass]! !!O2ProtocolBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DM 5/31/2007 14:55'!limitClass: ann	limitClass := ann node.	filter limitClass: ann node! !!O2ProtocolBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'DM 5/31/2007 14:54'!refresh: ann 	panels do: [:p | p changed: #commands].! !!O2ProtocolBrowser methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode 	super 		setMetaNode: aMetaNode		node: aNode.	theClass := aNode theClass.	filter := O2LimitProtocolFilter on: aNode theClass.	aMetaNode addFilter: filter! !!O2ProtocolBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!subscribe	super subscribe.	self announcer		observe: O2RefreshRequired			send: #refresh:			to: self;		observe: O2NodeChanged			send: #limitClass:			to: self! !!O2ProtocolBrowser methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'DM 5/23/2007 15:25'!theClass	^ theClass.! !!O2SearchBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultMetaNode	| root search |	root := O2MetaNode named: 'root'.	search := O2MetaNode named: 'search'.	root 		childAt: #children		put: search.	self buildMetagraphOn: search.	^ root! !!O2SearchBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultRootNode	^ O2CollectionNode on: IdentitySet new! !!O2SearchBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 4/16/2007 00:17'!initialize	self registerInOpenMenu! !!O2SearchBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 4/16/2007 00:16'!registerInOpenMenu	TheWorldMenu registerOpenCommand: {'Search Browser'. {self. #open}}.! !!O2SearchBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 4/16/2007 00:18'!title	^ 'Search Browser'! !!O2SearchBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 10/18/2008 10:36'!unload    TheWorldMenu unregisterOpenCommandWithReceiver: self.! !!O2SearchBrowser class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!with: aSearchNode 	^ self 		metaNode: self defaultMetaNode		root: (O2CollectionNode on: (OrderedCollection with: aSearchNode))		selection: aSearchNode! !!O2SearchBrowser methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 4/1/2007 23:01'!defaultBackgroundColor	^ Color lightGreen! !!O2SearchBrowser methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 4/15/2007 22:28'!isSearchBrowser	^ true! !!O2SystemBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:56' prior: 35451617!This is the basic system browser that is the work-horse of Smalltalk development tools. It presents four panes showing class categories, classes, method categories and methods.!!O2MultipleSelectionBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!definitionPanel	^ O2MultipleDefinitionPanel new! !!O2MultipleSelectionBrowser class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 7/19/2007 16:10'!initialize	self registerInOpenMenu! !!O2MultipleSelectionBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 7/18/2007 16:17'!methodColumnIndex    ^4! !!O2MultipleSelectionBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!navigationPanel	^ O2MultipleSelectionColumnPanel 		minPanes: self minPanes		maxPanes: self maxPanes! !!O2MultipleSelectionBrowser class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 2/23/2008 15:22'!registerInOpenMenu	TheWorldMenu registerOpenCommand: {'Multiple Selection Browser'. {self. #open}}.! !!O2MultipleSelectionBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 5/14/2008 10:31'!title    ^'OB Multiple Selection Browser'! !!O2MultipleSelectionBrowser class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 10/18/2008 10:29'!unload   super unload.   TheWorldMenu unregisterOpenCommandWithReceiver: self.! !!O2MultipleSelectionBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 7/18/2007 16:15'!useMultipleSelection    ^true! !!O2SmartGroupBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultMetaNode	| env smartGroup package |	env := O2MetaNode named: 'Environment'.	package := O2MetaNode named: 'Package'.	package		displaySelector: #indentedName;		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfClassCat:.	self buildMetagraphOn: package.	smartGroup := O2MetaNode named: 'SmartGroup'.	smartGroup displaySelector: #indentedName.	self buildMetagraphOn: smartGroup.	env		childAt: #packages			labeled: 'packages'			put: package;		childAt: #smartGroups			labeled: 'smart groups'			put: smartGroup;		addFilter: O2ModalFilter new.	^ env! !!O2SmartGroupBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!navigationPanel	^ O2SmartGroupColumnPanel 		minPanes: self minPanes		maxPanes: self maxPanes! !!O2SmartGroupBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 5/14/2008 10:32'!title    ^'OB Smart Group Browser'! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 2/23/2009 11:40'!addPreferences	"self addPreferences"	Preferences 		addPreference: #visualizations		categories: #('browsing')		default: true		balloonHelp: 'Display visualizations in the code browser such as UML, system complexity, etc..'.			Preferences 		addPreference: #classCommentOnClassSelect		categories: #('browsing')		default: self isDeveloperImage		balloonHelp: 'Automatically display class comment when selecting a class.'.				Preferences 		addPreference: #beDynamic		categories: #('browsing')		default: false		balloonHelp: 'Integrate facilities to reason about dynamic information of the software being developed.'.					Preferences 		addPreference: #autoFocusForColumns		categories: #('browsing')		default: true		balloonHelp: 'Columns in OmniBrowser should automatically get the focus on mouse over.'.								Preferences setDefaultAnnotationInfo.				! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'package ordering' stamp: 'dr 9/9/2008 17:29'!addTopPackage: aWorkingCopy    ^self alwaysOnTopPackages add: aWorkingCopy! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'package ordering' stamp: 'dr 9/9/2008 16:58'!alwaysOnTopPackages    alwaysOnTopPackages ifNil: [alwaysOnTopPackages := OrderedCollection new].    ^alwaysOnTopPackages! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 8/15/2008 11:37'!beDynamic   Preferences enable: #beDynamic.! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 11/6/2009 23:35'!buildMetagraphOn: root class: classSel comment: commentSel metaclass: metaclassSel 	| metaGraph |	metaGraph := (self dynamicBrowser 		ifTrue: [ Smalltalk at: #OBDynamicMetagraphBuilder ]		ifFalse: [ O2EnhancementMetagraphBuilder ]) 		on: root		class: classSel		comment: commentSel		metaclass: metaclassSel.	metaGraph classMetaNode doubleClickCommandClass: O2EnhancementCmdBrowseHierarchy.	metaGraph metaclassMetaNode doubleClickCommandClass: O2EnhancementCmdBrowseHierarchy.	"metaGraph methodMetaNode doubleClickCommandClass: OBCmdSelectMethodCategory."	^ metaGraph execute! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'system changes' stamp: 'dr 7/10/2008 11:51'!classModified: anEvent	MCWorkingCopy managersForClass: anEvent item do: [:mgr| mgr modified: true].! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'system changes' stamp: 'dr 7/10/2008 11:51'!classMoved: anEvent	self classModified: anEvent.	MCWorkingCopy managersForCategory: anEvent oldCategory do:[:mgr | mgr modified: true].! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 10/20/2008 18:53'!defaultExtent    ^800@450    ! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultMetaNode	| env smartGroup package cats classes builder |	env := O2MetaNode named: 'Environment'.	package := O2MetaNode named: 'Package'.	package		displaySelector: #indentedName;		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfPackage:.	cats := O2MetaNode named: 'Cats'.	cats		displaySelector: #nameWithoutPrefix;		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfClassCat:.	(package 		childAt: #classCategories		put: cats) navigateTree.	self buildMetagraphOn: package.	(package edges reject: [ :edge | edge selector = #classCategories ]) do: [ :edge | cats addEdge: edge ].	package filters do: [ :filter | cats addFilter: filter ].	classes := O2MetaNode named: 'Classes'.	classes		displaySelector: #indentedName;		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfClass:.	builder := O2EnhancementMetagraphBuilder 		on: classes		class: #packagesForClassClass		comment: #packagesForClassComment		metaclass: #packagesForClassMetaclass.	builder execute.	builder classMetaNode		removeFilter: O2ClassInheritanceFilter new;		displaySelector: #indentedName.	builder metaclassMetaNode		removeFilter: O2ClassInheritanceFilter new;		displaySelector: #indentedName.	builder classCommentMetaNode		removeFilter: O2ClassInheritanceFilter new;		displaySelector: #indentedName.	classes removeFilter: O2QueryingClassSortFilter new.	smartGroup := O2MetaNode named: 'SmartGroup'.	smartGroup displaySelector: #indentedName.	package edges do: 		[ :edge | 		"reject: [:edge | edge selector = #classCategories])"		smartGroup addEdge: edge ].	smartGroup		addFilter: O2ModalFilter new;		addFilter: O2ClassSortFilter new.	"(smartGroup childAt: #classCategories put: cats) navigateTree."	env		childAt: #packages			labeled: 'pkgs'			put: package;		childAt: #classesHierarchically			labeled: 'hier.'			put: classes.	(env 		childAt: #smartGroups		labeled: 'groups'		put: smartGroup) setIsDropEdge.	env addFilter: O2ModalFilter new.	^ env! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultRootNode	^ O2PackagesOrClassesNode new! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/16/2009 10:07'!definitionPanel	^ self dynamicBrowser 		ifTrue: [ (Smalltalk at: #OBEnrichedDefinitionPanel) new ]		ifFalse: [ O2EnhancementDefinitionPanel new ]! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!draggableButtonClass	^ O2DraggableButtonMorph! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 9/2/2008 15:51'!dynamicBrowser	^Preferences beDynamic! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 2/27/2008 15:43'!hasHistoryButtons    ^true! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 2/22/2008 15:15'!hasReferencePanel    ^self dynamicBrowser! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!hierarchyBrowserClass	^ O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 7/8/2008 17:17'!hierarchySwitchIndex    ^2! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 11/19/2008 14:27'!initialize	"self initialize"	self registerInOpenMenu.	self addPreferences.		Smalltalk at: #SystemChangeNotifier ifPresent: [:cls |		cls uniqueInstance noMoreNotificationsFor: self.	].     self registerForNotifications.		     "to be removed in a while"     TheWorldMenu unregisterOpenCommand: 'SmartGroup Browser'.! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 4/10/2008 16:34'!isDeveloperImage    ^(Smalltalk classNamed: #DEVImageCreator) notNil! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!mercuryPanel	^ Preferences mercuryPanel 		ifTrue: [ O2EnhancementMercuryPanel new ]		ifFalse: [ nil ]! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'system changes' stamp: 'dr 7/10/2008 12:04'!methodModified: anEvent	MCWorkingCopy managersForClass: anEvent itemClass selector: anEvent itemSelector do: [:mgr | self modifiedPackage: mgr].! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'package ordering' stamp: 'dr 7/10/2008 12:07'!modificationOfPackage: aWorkingCopy    ^self packageModification at: aWorkingCopy ifAbsent: [0] ! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'package ordering' stamp: 'dr 7/10/2008 16:26'!modifiedPackage: aWorkingCopy    self packageModification at: aWorkingCopy put: DateAndTime now asSeconds.! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!navigationPanel	^ O2SmartGroupColumnPanel 		minPanes: self minPanes		maxPanes: self maxPanes! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!onMonticelloClassCategory: aString 	^ self selection: (O2MonticelloClassCategoryNode on: aString)! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!onPackage: aPackage 	^ self selection: aPackage asO2Node! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'dr 7/20/2007 15:07'!openOnMonticelloClassCategory: aString	^ (self onMonticelloClassCategory: aString) open! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'dr 7/20/2007 15:07'!openOnPackage: aPackage	^ (self onPackage: aPackage) open! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!optionalButtonPanel	^ O2Platform current optionalButtons ifTrue: [ O2EnhancementFixedButtonPanel new ]! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'package ordering' stamp: 'dr 11/19/2008 15:04'!orderedPackages	^self packageOrganization packages! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'package ordering' stamp: 'dr 7/10/2008 12:03'!packageModification    packageModification ifNil: [packageModification := Dictionary new].    ^packageModification! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'package ordering' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!packageOrganization	packageOrganization ifNil: [ packageOrganization := O2PackageOrganizer default ].	^ packageOrganization! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 10/29/2008 16:11'!packageSwitchIndex    ^1! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 2/20/2009 09:48'!panels	^ {self topPanel. self navigationPanel. self annotationPanel. self definitionPanel} reject: [:ea | ea isNil]! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!radioButtonBarClass	^ O2EnhancementRadioButtonBar! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'system changes' stamp: 'dr 7/10/2008 11:53'!registerForNotifications	Smalltalk at: #SystemChangeNotifier ifPresent: [:cls |	(cls uniqueInstance)		noMoreNotificationsFor: self;		notify: self ofSystemChangesOfItem: #class change: #Added using: #classModified:;		notify: self ofSystemChangesOfItem: #class change: #Modified using: #classModified:;		notify: self ofSystemChangesOfItem: #class change: #Renamed using: #classModified:;		notify: self ofSystemChangesOfItem: #class change: #Commented using: #classModified:;		notify: self ofSystemChangesOfItem: #class change: #Recategorized using: #classMoved:;		notify: self ofSystemChangesOfItem: #class change: #Removed using: #classModified:;		notify: self ofSystemChangesOfItem: #method change: #Added using: #methodModified:;		notify: self ofSystemChangesOfItem: #method change: #Modified using: #methodModified:;		notify: self ofSystemChangesOfItem: #method change: #Recategorized using: #methodModified:;		notify: self ofSystemChangesOfItem: #method change: #Removed using: #methodModified:	].! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 2/23/2008 15:22'!registerInOpenMenu	TheWorldMenu registerOpenCommand: {'Image Browser'. {self. #open}}.! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'package ordering' stamp: 'dr 9/9/2008 17:29'!removeTopPackage: aWorkingCopy    ^self alwaysOnTopPackages remove: aWorkingCopy! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'package ordering' stamp: 'dr 12/1/2008 15:04'!resetPackageOrganization	self packageOrganization reset! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 8/15/2008 11:39'!setDynamicBrowser: aBoolean    Preferences setPreference: #beDynamic toValue: aBoolean.! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 7/8/2008 16:26'!smartGroupSwitchIndex    ^3! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dr 4/11/2008 11:32'!title    ^'OB Package Browser'! !!O2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 10/18/2008 10:28'!unload    TheWorldMenu unregisterOpenCommandWithReceiver: self.    Smalltalk at: #SystemChangeNotifier ifPresent: [:cls | cls uniqueInstance noMoreNotificationsFor: self].    Preferences removePreference: #visualizations.    Preferences removePreference: #classCommentOnClassSelect.    Preferences removePreference: #beDynamic.! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!addModelItemsToWindowMenu: aMenu 	Smalltalk 		at: #SystemBrowser		ifPresent: 			[ :class | 			class 				addRegistryMenuItemsTo: aMenu				inAccountOf: O2PackageBrowserAdaptor new ]! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 2/22/2008 16:23'!browseHistory    browseHistory ifNil: [browseHistory := OrderedCollection new].    ^browseHistory! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdAddPackageOnTop	^ O2CmdAddPackageOnTop! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdAddSmartCategory	^ O2CmdAddSmartCategory! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdAddToSmartGroup	^ O2CmdAddToSmartGroup! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowse	^ O2CmdSmartGroupBrowse! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdBrowseHierarchy	^ O2EnhancementCmdBrowseHierarchy! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdCreateMonticelloCategory	^ O2CmdCreateMonticelloCategory! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdCreatePackage	^ O2CmdCreatePackage! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:02'!cmdFindClass	^ Array with: O2CmdFindClassOrTrait with: O2CmdRecentClasses ! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdMethodToExtendClass	^ O2CmdMethodToExtendClass! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdMonticello	^ O2CmdMonticello allSubclasses! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdPackageDependencies	^ O2CmdPackageDependencies! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdPackageToScope	^ O2CmdPackageToScope! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:03'!cmdRemoveCat	^ Array with: O2CmdRemoveMonticelloCategory with: O2CmdRemoveProtocol! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdRemoveFromSmartGroup	^ O2CmdRemoveFromSmartGroup! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdRemovePackage	^ O2CmdRemovePackage! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdReorgPackages	^ O2CmdReorgPackages! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdResetSearchSmartGroups	^ O2CmdResetSearchSmartGroups! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdSearchGroupClassRefs	^ O2CmdSearchGroupClassRefs! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdSearchGroupImplementors	^ O2CmdSearchGroupImplementors! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdSearchGroupSenders	^ O2CmdSearchGroupSenders! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!cmdTogglePackageScope	^ O2CmdTogglePackageScope! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 2/22/2008 17:18'!historyAtCursor   ^self browseHistory at: self historyCursor ifAbsent: [nil]! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 2/23/2008 15:30'!historyCursor    ^historyCursor ifNil: [0]! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 2/22/2008 16:21'!historyCursor: anInteger    historyCursor := anInteger! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 2/26/2008 16:23'!historyIndexOnSwitch    historyIndexOnSwitch ifNil: [historyIndexOnSwitch := 0].    ^historyIndexOnSwitch! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 10/20/2008 18:53'!initialExtent    super initialExtent.    ^self class defaultExtent! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 4/10/2008 16:52'!isSearchBrowser    ^true! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 2/26/2008 16:23'!markSwitch    historyIndexOnSwitch := self historyCursor.! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'panels' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!optionalButtonPanel	^ panels 		detect: [ :ea | ea isKindOf: O2FixedButtonPanel ]		ifNone: [ self error: 'No optional button panel configured' ]! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 10/24/2008 16:10'!register	super register.	PackageOrganizer default addDependent: self.	MCWorkingCopy addDependent: self.			! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 2/26/2008 16:24'!resetHistoryIndexOnSwitch    historyIndexOnSwitch := 0! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'history' stamp: 'dr 2/22/2008 16:48'!setHistory: aCollection    browseHistory := aCollection! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 4/21/2008 15:41'!setMetaNode: aMetaNode root: aNode    self navigationPanel setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode.! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 10/24/2008 16:03'!unregister	super unregister.	PackageOrganizer default removeDependent: self.	MCWorkingCopy removeDependent: self.			! !!O2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 2/13/2009 11:59'!update: aSymbol	(#(#packages #allManagers) includes: aSymbol) ifTrue: [self signalRefresh]	! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultMetaNode	| env classCategory |	env := O2MetaNode named: 'Environment'.	classCategory := O2MetaNode named: 'ClassCategory'.	env 		childAt: #categories		put: classCategory.	classCategory ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfClassCat:.	self buildMetagraphOn: classCategory.	^ env! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultRootNode	^ O2EnvironmentNode forImage! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!hierarchyBrowserClass	^ O2EnhancementHierarchyBrowser! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'initializing'!initialize	self registerInOpenMenu! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 11:29'!onClass: aClass 	^ self selection: aClass asO2Node! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!onClass: aClass category: aSymbol 	^ self selection: (O2MethodCategoryNode 			on: aSymbol			inClass: aClass)! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!onClass: aClass selector: aSelector 	^ self selection: (O2MethodNode 			on: aSelector			inClass: aClass)! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!onEnvironment: anEnvironment category: aSymbol 	^ self selection: (O2ClassCategoryNode 			on: aSymbol			inEnvironment: anEnvironment)! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'cwp 12/5/2004 18:32'!openOnClass: aClass	^ (self onClass: aClass) open! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'cwp 12/15/2004 21:47'!openOnClass: aClass category: aSymbol	^ (self onClass: aClass category: aSymbol) open! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'dr 9/24/2008 11:57'!openOnClass: aClass selector: aSelector       aSelector ifNil: [^ (self onClass: aClass) open].       ^ (self onClass: aClass selector: aSelector) open.! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'cwp 12/15/2004 21:54'!openOnEnvironment: anEnvironment category: aSymbol	^ (self onEnvironment: anEnvironment category: aSymbol) open! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!openOnMonticelloClassCategory: aString	(self openOnEnvironment: Smalltalk category: aString) open! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!openOnNode: aNode    | class |    class := aNode theClass.    aNode isMethodNode ifTrue: [self openOnClass: class selector: aNode selector] ifFalse: [self openOnClass: class].! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'initializing'!registerInOpenMenu	TheWorldMenu registerOpenCommand: {'Image Browser'. {self. #open}}.! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'dc 4/11/2008 09:21'!title	^ 'OB System Browser'! !!O2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 10/18/2008 10:36'!unload    TheWorldMenu unregisterOpenCommandWithReceiver: self.! !!O2SystemBrowser methodsFor: 'morphic' stamp: 'dr 2/14/2009 19:45'!defaultBackgroundColor	| color | 	color := Preferences browserWindowColor.	^ color isColor		ifFalse: [Color lightGreen]		ifTrue: [color]! !!O2SystemBrowser methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 4/18/2007 23:49'!isClassBrowser	^ true! !!O2SystemBrowser methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 8/26/2007 01:38'!showImplementors: ann	ann fan children size = 1 ifTrue: 		[ann bid: 1 toDo: 			[self class 				openRoot: self class defaultRootNode				selection: ann fan children first asMethodNode]]! !!O2SystemBrowser methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'cwp 8/23/2007 23:35'!showSenders: ann	ann fan children size = 1 ifTrue: 		[ann bid: 1 toDo: 			[self class 				openRoot: self class defaultRootNode				selection: ann fan children first asMethodNode]]! !!O2SystemBrowser methodsFor: 'navigating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!subscribe	super subscribe.	self announcer		observe: O2ShowSenders			send: #showSenders:			to: self;		observe: O2ShowImplementors			send: #showImplementors:			to: self! !!O2VersionBrowser commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:58' prior: 35451858!OBVersionBrowser displays a list of OBMethodVersions, which represent versions of a method present in the source or changes files. !!O2VersionBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!defaultMetaNode	| version |	version := O2MetaNode named: 'Version'.	version ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfMethodVersion:.	^ (O2MetaNode named: 'Method')		childAt: #versions			put: version;		yourself! !!O2VersionBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 11/27/2004 22:32'!maxPanes	^ 1! !!O2VersionBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 11/27/2004 22:32'!minPanes	^ 1! !!O2VersionBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'lr 4/25/2007 09:51'!openOn: aMethodVersionNode	^ (self root: aMethodVersionNode selection: aMethodVersionNode versions first) open! !!O2VersionBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'cwp 11/27/2004 22:34'!optionalButtons	^ #('browse' 'revert')! !!O2VersionBrowser methodsFor: 'morphic' stamp: 'avi 11/29/2004 21:52'!defaultBackgroundColor	^ Color lightMagenta! !!O2VersionBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/27/2004 22:28'!defaultLabel	^ 'Versions of ', self root name printString! !!OR2CategoryBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 14:56'!defaultMetaNode	| root cat |	root := O2MetaNode named: 'Environment'.	cat := O2MetaNode named: 'Class Category'.	root childAt: #classCategories put: cat.	cat ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfClassCat:.	self buildMetagraphOn: cat.	^ root! !!OR2ClassBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 11:50'!defaultMetaNode	| root |	root := OBMetaNode named: 'Environment'.	^ self buildMetagraphOn: root! !!OR2ClassBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 11:52'!paneCount	^ 3! !!OR2EnvironmentBrowser class methodsFor: 'instance-creation' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:44'!on: anEnvironment 	^ self root: (OR2EnvironmentNode onEnvironment: anEnvironment)! !!OR2EnvironmentBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'lr 2/9/2008 01:24'!openOn: anEnvironment	^ (self on: anEnvironment) open! !!OR2EnvironmentBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 13:37'!titleForRoot: aNode	^ aNode browserEnvironment label! !!OR2EnvironmentBrowser methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'lr 2/9/2008 12:03'!defaultBackgroundColor	^ Color yellow! !!OR2EnvironmentBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 12:55'!definitionPanel	^ self panels 		detect: [ :each | each isKindOf: OBDefinitionPanel ] 		ifNone: [ self error: 'No definition panel configured' ]! !!OR2EnvironmentBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 12:55'!environment	^ self root browserEnvironment! !!OR2EnvironmentBrowser methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'lr 3/12/2008 10:21'!open	self signalRefresh.	super open! !!OR2EnvironmentBrowser methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 12:56'!selectionChanged: anAnnouncement	| interval |	interval := self environment selectionIntervalFor: self definitionPanel text.	interval isNil ifFalse: [ self definitionPanel selection: interval ]! !!OR2EnvironmentBrowser methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 12:56'!setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode	super setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode.	announcer		observe: OBSelectionChanged		send: #selectionChanged: to: self! !!OR2MethodBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 14:55'!defaultMetaNode	| class method |	class := O2MetaNode named: 'Class'.	method := O2MetaNode named: 'Method'.	class		childAt: #methods put: method;		addFilter: O2ClassSortFilter new.	method		displaySelector: #fullNameWithProtocol.	^ class! !!OR2MethodBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 2/9/2008 01:36'!paneCount	^ 1! !!OR2MultiBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 14:56'!defaultMetaNode	| multi envi method |	multi := O2MetaNode named: 'MultiEnvironment'.	envi := O2MetaNode named: 'Environment'.	method := O2MetaNode named: 'Method'.	multi childAt: #environments put: envi.	envi 		childAt: #methods put: method;		addFilter: O2ClassSortFilter new.	method		displaySelector: #fullNameWithProtocol.	^ multi! !!OR2MultiBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 2/9/2008 11:46'!paneCount	^ 2! !!OR2PackageBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 14:57'!defaultMetaNode	| root extensionCategory packageCategory |	root := O2MetaNode named: 'Environment'.	extensionCategory := O2MetaNode named: 'ExtensionCategory'.	packageCategory := O2MetaNode named: 'PackageCategory'.	root childAt: #packageExtensionCategory put: extensionCategory.	root childAt: #packageCategories put: packageCategory.	self buildMetagraphOn: extensionCategory.	extensionCategory ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfClassCat:.	self buildMetagraphOn: packageCategory.	packageCategory ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfClassCat:.	^ root! !!OR2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:44'!setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode 	| filter |	filter := OR2HightlightEnvironmentFilter on: aNode browserEnvironment.	aMetaNode withAllChildrenDo: 		[ :each | 		(self unfilteredNames includes: each name) ifFalse: [ each addFilter: filter ] ].	super 		setMetaNode: aMetaNode		node: aNode! !!OR2PackageBrowser methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 2/10/2008 13:19'!unfilteredNames	^ #('Environment')! !!OR2ProtocolBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 14:57'!defaultMetaNode	| browser protocol method |	browser := O2MetaNode named: 'Environment'.	protocol := O2MetaNode named: 'Protocol'.	method := O2MetaNode named: 'Method'.	browser		childAt: #protocols put: protocol;		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfClass:.	protocol		childAt: #methods put: method;		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfMethodCat:.	method		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfMethod:;		addFilter: O2InheritanceFilter new.	^ browser! !!OR2ProtocolBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 21:33'!paneCount	^ 2! !!OR2ProtocolBrowser methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:44'!setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode 	| filter |	filter := OR2HideEnvironmentFilter on: aNode browserEnvironment.	aMetaNode withAllChildrenDo: [ :each | each addFilter: filter ].	super 		setMetaNode: aMetaNode		node: aNode! !!OR2SingleClassBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 14:58'!defaultMetaNode	| browser protocol method |	browser := O2MetaNode named: 'Environment'.	protocol := O2MetaNode named: 'Protocol'.	method := O2MetaNode named: 'Method'.	browser		childAt: #classProtocols labeled: 'instance' put: protocol;		childAt: #metaclassProtocols labeled: 'class' put: protocol;		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfClass:;		addFilter: O2ModalFilter new.	protocol		childAt: #methods put: method;		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfMethodCat:.	method		ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfMethod:;		addFilter: O2InheritanceFilter new.	^ browser! !!OR2SingleClassBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 2/12/2009 21:36'!paneCount	^ 2! !!OR2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 14:58'!defaultMetaNode	| root cat |	root := O2MetaNode named: 'Environment'.	cat := O2MetaNode named: 'Class Category'.	root childAt: #categories put: cat.	cat ancestrySelector: #isDescendantOfClassCat:.	self buildMetagraphOn: cat.	^ root! !!OR2SystemBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:44'!defaultRootNode	^ OR2EnvironmentNode onEnvironment: BrowserEnvironment new! !!OR2SystemBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:44'!cmdToggleContainment	^ OR2CmdToggleContainment! !!OR2SystemBrowser methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:44'!setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode 	| filter |	filter := OR2HightlightEnvironmentFilter on: aNode selectorEnvironment.	aMetaNode withAllChildrenDo: [ :each | each addFilter: filter ].	super 		setMetaNode: aMetaNode		node: aNode! !!OR2VariableBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 14:58'!defaultMetaNode	| browser variable method |	browser := O2MetaNode named: 'Environment'.	variable := O2MetaNode named: 'Variable'.	method := O2MetaNode named: 'Method'.	browser		childAt: #instanceVariables put: variable;		childAt: #classVariables put: variable;		addFilter: O2ClassSortFilter new.	variable		childAt: #accessors put: method;		displaySelector: #fullName;		addFilter: O2ClassSortFilter new.	method		displaySelector: #fullNameWithProtocol.	^ browser! !!OR2VariableBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 3/8/2009 18:49'!paneCount	^ 2! !!OR2VariableBrowser methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:44'!setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode 	| filter |	filter := OR2HideEnvironmentFilter on: aNode browserEnvironment.	aMetaNode withAllChildrenDo: 		[ :each | 		each name = 'Environment' ifFalse: [ each addFilter: filter ] ].	super 		setMetaNode: aMetaNode		node: aNode! !!OR2ChangesBrowser class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 15:06'!change: aChange	^ self root: aChange asO2Node! !!OR2ChangesBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 3/19/2008 16:52'!defaultMetaNode	| root change |	root := OBMetaNode named: 'root'.	change := OBMetaNode named: 'change'.	change displaySelector: #indentedName.	root childAt: #changes put: change.	^ root! !!OR2ChangesBrowser class methodsFor: 'global settings' stamp: 'lr 1/30/2009 23:43'!displayDiffs: aBoolean	displayDiffs := aBoolean! !!OR2ChangesBrowser class methodsFor: 'global settings' stamp: 'lr 1/30/2009 23:51'!isDisplayingDiffs	^ displayDiffs ifNil: [ displayDiffs := true ]! !!OR2ChangesBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'lr 2/9/2008 09:51'!openChange: aChange	^ (self change: aChange) open! !!OR2ChangesBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 18:24'!paneCount	^ 1! !!OR2ChangesBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 20:25'!titleForRoot: aNode	^ 'Changes: ' , aNode name! !!OR2ChangesBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:44'!cmdCommands	^ OR2CmdChangeCommand allSubclasses! !!OR2ChangesBrowser methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 18:25'!defaultBackgroundColor	^ Color lightBlue! !!OR2LintBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:44'!defaultMetaNode	| comp leaf |	comp := OBMetaNode named: 'comp'.	leaf := OBMetaNode named: 'leaf'.	comp 		childAt: #compositeRules		put: comp.	comp 		childAt: #leafRules		put: leaf.	comp		addFilter: OR2SortingFilter new;		addFilter: OR2LintResultFilter new.	leaf addFilter: OR2LintResultFilter new.	^ comp! !!OR2LintBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 15:05'!defaultRootNode	^ RBCompositeLintRule lintChecks asO2Node! !!OR2LintBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'lr 2/23/2009 23:57'!openRule: aRule	^ (self rule: aRule) open! !!OR2LintBrowser class methodsFor: 'opening' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 14:37'!openRule: aRule environment: anEnvironment	^ (self rule: aRule environment: anEnvironment) open! !!OR2LintBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 2/8/2008 09:49'!paneCount	^ PaneCount ifNil: [ 2 ]! !!OR2LintBrowser class methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 2/8/2008 09:56'!panesFor: aRule level: anInteger	^ (aRule rules collect: [ :each |		each isComposite			ifFalse: [ anInteger ]			ifTrue: [ self panesFor: each level: anInteger + 1 ] ])		detectMax: [ :each | each ]! !!OR2LintBrowser class methodsFor: 'instance-creation' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 14:20'!rule: aRule	^ self rule: aRule environment: BrowserEnvironment new! !!OR2LintBrowser class methodsFor: 'instance-creation' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/11/2009 15:05'!rule: aRule environment: anEnvironment	PaneCount := self panesFor: aRule level: 1.	^ (self root: aRule asO2Node) environment: anEnvironment! !!OR2LintBrowser class methodsFor: 'configuration' stamp: 'lr 6/6/2008 16:58'!titleForRoot: aNode	^ 'Code Critics: ' , aNode name! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 7/3/2009 21:22'!basicSearch: aRule	| percent increment checker |	aRule resetResult.	self status: 'Searching'; refresh.	percent := 0.0.	increment := self environment numberSelectors isZero		ifFalse: [ 100.0 / self environment numberSelectors ]		ifTrue: [ 0 ].	checker := SmalllintChecker new.	checker		rule: aRule;		context: SmalllintContext new;		environment: self environment;		methodBlock: [ 			percent := percent + increment min: 100.			self status: percent truncated asString , '%' ].	[ checker run ] ensure: [		self refresh.		self status: (self root problemCount > 0			ifTrue: [ self root problemCount asString , ' problems' ]).		checker release.		process := nil ]! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 9/8/2009 23:44'!cmdCommands	^ OR2CmdLintCommand allSubclasses! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'lr 3/25/2008 20:41'!defaultBackgroundColor	^ Color orange! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'lr 3/1/2009 08:44'!defaultLabel	^ super defaultLabel , ' on ' , (self environment printStringLimitedTo: 45) , (status isNil ifFalse: [ ' (' , status , ')' ] ifTrue: [ '' ])! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 2/7/2008 14:21'!environment	^ environment! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 10/22/2008 14:08'!environment: anEnvironment	environment := anEnvironment! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'lr 5/29/2008 14:35'!isSearching	^ process notNil and: [ process isTerminated not ]! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 7/16/2009 09:34'!refresh	self root update: self environment.	self navigationPanel selectedNode isNil ifFalse: [		self announcer announce: (OBSelectingNode 			node: self navigationPanel selectedNode) ].	self signalRefresh! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'accessing-dynamic' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 21:41'!rule	^ self root rule! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 1/25/2009 15:24'!search: aRule	process := [ self basicSearch: aRule ]		newProcess.	process name: 'lint'.	process resume! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'initialization' stamp: 'lr 1/25/2009 15:22'!setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode	super setMetaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode.	self search: self root rule! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'actions' stamp: 'lr 11/11/2008 21:56'!status: aString	status = aString		ifTrue: [ ^ self ].	status := aString.	self relabel: self defaultLabel! !!OR2LintBrowser methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'lr 5/29/2008 14:46'!windowIsClosing	self isSearching		ifTrue: [ process terminate ]! !!O2Builder class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!build: aModel	| builder |	builder := self new.	^ aModel buildOn: builder.	! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 23:55'!button: aModel with: aBlock 	self subclassResponsibility! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!current: aWidget	current := aWidget! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 11/12/2008 10:13'!current: anObject do: aBlock	| saved | 	[saved := current.	current := anObject.	aBlock value]		ensure: [current := saved].	^ anObject! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 23:52'!fixedButtonBar: aPanel with: aBlock 	self subclassResponsibility! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 11/12/2008 10:13'!horizontalGroupWith: aBlock	self subclassResponsibility ! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 23:47'!pane: aColumn with: aBlock 	self subclassResponsibility! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 11/12/2008 10:13'!radioButtonBar: aPanel with: aBlock 	self subclassResponsibility ! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 11/12/2008 10:15'!root	^ current ! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 23:46'!scroller: aPanel with: aBlock 	self subclassResponsibility! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 23:48'!textarea: aPanel with: aBlock 	self subclassResponsibility! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 11/12/2008 10:13'!textfield: aModel with: aBlock 	self subclassResponsibility ! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 12/9/2007 10:39'!verticalGroupWith: aBlock	self subclassResponsibility! !!O2Builder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 11/12/2008 10:13'!window: aBrowser with: aBlock 	self subclassResponsibility ! !!O2MorphBuilder class methodsFor: 'instance-creation' stamp: 'lr 6/20/2007 09:36'!open: aModel	^ (self build: aModel) openInWorld! !!O2MorphBuilder class methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!openWithExtent: aBrowser	^ (self build: aBrowser) openInWorldExtent: aBrowser extent! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!annotationField: anAnnotationPanel with: aBlock 	| morph divider |	morph := self mercuryMorphFor: anAnnotationPanel.	morph		vResizing: #rigid;		color: Color white.	current ifNotNil: 		[ current addMorphBack: morph.		self 			current: morph			do: aBlock.		divider := BorderedSubpaneDividerMorph horizontal			color: anAnnotationPanel browser defaultBackgroundColor duller;			styleWith: O2MorphBuilder new.		current addMorphBack: divider ].	^ morph! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!button: aButtonModel with: aBlock 	| morph buttonClass |	buttonClass := (aButtonModel isDropEdge: aButtonModel label) 		ifTrue: [ aButtonModel browser class draggableButtonClass ]		ifFalse: [ PluggableButtonMorph ].	morph := buttonClass 		on: aButtonModel		getState: #isSelected		action: #push		label: #labelMorph.	morph		hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		setBalloonText: aButtonModel longDescription;		styleWith: O2MorphBuilder new;		enableDragNDrop.	^ self 		current: morph		do: aBlock! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!closableDefinitionPanel: aDefinitionPanel with: aBlock	| morph contentMorph | 	morph := (RectangleMorph new)		layoutPolicy: TableLayout new;		listDirection: #topToBottom;		borderWidth: 0;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #spaceFill;				wrapCentering: #center;		cellPositioning: #topLeft;		rubberBandCells: true;		layoutInset: 2;		cellInset: 2;		color: Color white;		yourself.          ((Preferences visualizations and: [aDefinitionPanel respondsTo: #codeTabPanel]) and: [aDefinitionPanel codeTabPanel commands notEmpty]) ifTrue: [	    morph addMorphBack: (aDefinitionPanel codeTabPanel buildOn: self).		].		aDefinitionPanel hasSeveralPanels ifTrue: [morph addMorphBack: aDefinitionPanel createTitleBar].		contentMorph := aDefinitionPanel createContentMorph.	aDefinitionPanel setContentMorph: contentMorph.	morph addMorphBack: contentMorph.		current ifNotNil: [current addMorphBack: morph].	^ self current: morph do: aBlock! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!createPaneForColumn: aColumn with: listSelector 	| pane |	pane := O2Pane new.	pane		model: aColumn;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		clipSubmorphs: true;		color: Color transparent;		cellInset: 0;		borderWidth: 0;		layoutPolicy: ProportionalLayout new;		addList: (self 				perform: listSelector				with: aColumn).	^ pane! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!createReferencePaneFor: aDefinitionPanel 	| columnPanel paneScroller saved referenceMorph |	columnPanel := O2ColumnPanel 		minPanes: 1		maxPanes: 1.	columnPanel pushColumn: aDefinitionPanel referenceList.	paneScroller := (O2PaneScroller withModel: columnPanel)		name: 'scroller';		vResizing: #spaceFill;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		yourself.		[ saved := current.	self 		current: paneScroller		do: [ aDefinitionPanel referenceList buildOn: self ] ] ensure: [ current := saved ].	referenceMorph := RectangleMorph new		layoutPolicy: TableLayout new;		listDirection: #topToBottom;		borderWidth: 0;		hResizing: #rigid;		width: aDefinitionPanel referenceList defaultWidth;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		wrapCentering: #center;		cellPositioning: #topLeft;		rubberBandCells: true;		layoutInset: 2;		cellInset: 2;		color: Color white;		yourself.	referenceMorph addMorphBack: aDefinitionPanel referenceList createTitleBar.	referenceMorph addMorphBack: paneScroller.	^ referenceMorph! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!enhancementFixedButtonBar: aPanel with: aBlock 	| morph |	morph := O2EnhancementButtonBar on: aPanel.	morph		height: Preferences standardCodeFont height * 2.2;		layoutPolicy: TableLayout new;		vResizing: #shrinkWrap;		hResizing: #shrinkWrap;		listDirection: #leftToRight;		cellPositioning: #topLeft;		rubberBandCells: true;		layoutInset: 2;		cellInset: 2;		borderWidth: 0.	current addMorphBack: morph.	^ self 		current: morph		do: aBlock! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!enrichedTextarea: aDefinitionPanel with: aBlock 	| morph definitionMorph tabBarMorph textMorph |	morph := (RectangleMorph new)		layoutPolicy: TableLayout new;		listDirection: #leftToRight;		borderWidth: 0;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #spaceFill;				wrapCentering: #center;		cellPositioning: #topLeft;		rubberBandCells: true;		layoutInset: 0;		cellInset: 0;		color: Color white;		yourself. 				definitionMorph := (RectangleMorph new)		layoutPolicy: TableLayout new;		listDirection: #topToBottom;		borderWidth: 0;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #spaceFill;			minWidth: 300;			wrapCentering: #center;		cellPositioning: #topLeft;		rubberBandCells: true;		layoutInset: 0;		cellInset: 0;		color: Color white;		yourself.     			tabBarMorph := (RectangleMorph new)		layoutPolicy: TableLayout new;		listDirection: #leftToRight;		borderWidth: 0;		hResizing: #shrinkWrap;		vResizing: #shrinkWrap;				wrapCentering: #center;		cellPositioning: #topLeft;		rubberBandCells: true;		layoutInset: 0;		cellInset: 0;		color: Color white;		yourself.				     ((Preferences visualizations and: [aDefinitionPanel hasCodeTabPanel])                                       and: [aDefinitionPanel codeTabPanel commands notEmpty]) ifTrue: [	     tabBarMorph addMorphBack: (aDefinitionPanel codeTabPanel buildOn: self).			definitionMorph addMorphBack: tabBarMorph	].						textMorph := aDefinitionPanel createContentMorph.		     aDefinitionPanel setContentMorph: textMorph.			definitionMorph addMorphBack: textMorph.		morph addMorphBack: definitionMorph.		aDefinitionPanel hasReferencePanel ifTrue: [morph addMorphBack: (self createReferencePaneFor: aDefinitionPanel)].					current ifNotNil: [current addMorphBack: morph].	self current: morph do: aBlock.     ^definitionMorph! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!fixedButtonBar: aPanel with: aBlock 	| morph |	morph := O2ButtonBar on: aPanel.	morph		height: Preferences standardButtonFont height * 2.2;		layoutPolicy: TableLayout new;		vResizing: #rigid;		hResizing: #shrinkWrap;		listDirection: #leftToRight;		rubberBandCells: true;		borderWidth: 0.	current addMorphBack: morph.	self 		current: morph		do: aBlock! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!horizontalGroupWith: aBlock 	| morph |	morph := O2GroupingMorph new.	morph layoutPolicy: TableLayout new.	morph listDirection: #leftToRight.	current 		addMorph: morph		frame: (0 @ 0 extent: 1 @ 1).	self 		current: morph		do: aBlock.	morph addBorders! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!layoutPanels	| panes |	panes := current submorphs select: [ :ea | ea class == O2GroupingMorph ].	(self shouldUseSpecialLayoutFor: panes) 		ifTrue: 			[ panes first layoutFrame bottomFraction: 0.4.			panes second layoutFrame topFraction: 0.4 ]		ifFalse: 			[ panes withIndexDo: 				[ :morph :index | 				morph layoutFrame					topFraction: (index - 1) / panes size;					bottomFraction: index / panes size ] ].	panes do: 		[ :ea | 		ea 			on: #mouseEnter			send: #paneTransition:			to: current.		ea 			on: #mouseLeave			send: #paneTransition:			to: current ].	self style39 ifTrue: [ current addPaneSplitters ]! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!listMorphForColumn: aColumn 	^ (O2PluggableListMorph 		on: aColumn		list: #list		selected: #selection		changeSelected: #selection:		menu: #menu:		keystroke: #keystroke:from:)		getListElementSelector: #listAt:;		getListSizeSelector: #listSize;		dragEnabled: aColumn dragEnabled;		dropEnabled: aColumn dropEnabled;		borderWidth: 0;		autoDeselect: false;		yourself! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!mercuryMorphFor: aMercuryPanel 	^ (O2PluggableTextMorph 		on: aMercuryPanel		text: #text		accept: #accept:notifying:		readSelection: #selection		menu: #menu:shifted:)		font: Preferences standardCodeFont;		hideScrollBarsIndefinitely;		acceptOnCR: true;		height: Preferences standardButtonFont height * 1.6;		vResizing: #shrinkWrap;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		width: 235;		borderWidth: 1;		cellPositioning: #bottomLeft;		yourself! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!multipleDefinitionPanel: aMultipleDefinitionPanel with: aBlock 	| morph defMorph |	morph := RectangleMorph new		layoutPolicy: TableLayout new;		listDirection: #topToBottom;		borderWidth: 0;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		wrapCentering: #center;		cellPositioning: #topLeft;		rubberBandCells: true;		layoutInset: 2;		cellInset: 2;		color: Color white;		yourself.	defMorph := (O2PaneScroller withModel: aMultipleDefinitionPanel)		name: 'def';		yourself.	morph addMorphBack: defMorph.	current ifNotNil: [ current addMorphBack: morph ].	self 		current: morph		do: aBlock.	^ defMorph! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!multipleSelectionColumn: aColumn with: aBlock   	| pane |     pane := self createPaneForColumn: aColumn with: #multipleSelectionListMorphForColumn:.	current ifNotNil: [current pushPane: pane].	^ self current: pane do: aBlock! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!multipleSelectionListMorphForColumn: aColumn 	^ (O2PluggableListMorphOfMany 		on: aColumn		list: #list		primarySelection: #selection		changePrimarySelection: #selection:		listSelection: #listSelectionAt:		changeListSelection: #listSelectionAt:put:		menu: #menu:		keystroke: #keystroke:from:)		getListElementSelector: #listAt:;		getListSizeSelector: #listSize;		dragEnabled: aColumn dragEnabled;		dropEnabled: aColumn dropEnabled;		borderWidth: 0;		autoDeselect: false;		yourself! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!pane: aColumn with: aBlock 	| pane |	pane := O2Pane new.	pane		model: aColumn;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		clipSubmorphs: true;		color: Color transparent;		cellInset: 0;		borderWidth: 0;		layoutPolicy: ProportionalLayout new;		addList: (self listMorphForColumn: aColumn).	current ifNotNil: [ current pushPane: pane ].	^ self 		current: pane		do: aBlock! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 7/7/2009 13:44'!radioButtonBar: aSwitch with: aBlock 	| morph buttonBarClass |	buttonBarClass := aSwitch browser class radioButtonBarClass.	^aSwitch isActive 		ifTrue: 			[morph := buttonBarClass 						on: aSwitch						list: #list						selected: #selection						changeSelected: #selection:.			current ifNotNil: [current addButton: morph].			morph]! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!referenceList: aReferenceList with: aBlock 	| pane |	pane := O2Pane new.	pane		model: aReferenceList;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		clipSubmorphs: true;		color: Color transparent;		cellInset: 0;		borderWidth: 0;		layoutPolicy: ProportionalLayout new;		addList: (self listMorphForColumn: aReferenceList).	current ifNotNil: [ current pushPane: pane ].	^ self 		current: pane		do: aBlock! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!scroller: aColumnPanel with: aBlock 	| morph |	morph := (O2PaneScroller withModel: aColumnPanel)		name: 'scroller';		vResizing: #spaceFill;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		yourself.	current ifNotNil: [ current addMorphBack: morph ].	^ self 		current: morph		do: aBlock! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!shouldUseSpecialLayoutFor: panes 	^ panes size = 2 		and: [ panes first listDirection = #topToBottom ]		and: [ panes second listDirection = #topToBottom ]		and: [ panes first lastSubmorph class = O2PaneScroller ]		and: [ panes last lastSubmorph class = O2PluggableTextMorph ]! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'style' stamp: 'cwp 7/23/2007 02:04'!style39	^ Smalltalk hasClassNamed: #AbstractResizerMorph! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'style' stamp: 'cwp 7/21/2007 22:26'!styleButton: aButton	self style39 ifFalse:		[aButton			borderWidth: 2;			borderRaised]! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'style' stamp: 'cwp 7/21/2007 22:26'!styleButtonBar: aBar	self style39		ifFalse: [aBar borderWidth: 0]		ifTrue: 			[aBar				color: Color transparent;				borderWidth: 0;				layoutInset: 2;				cellInset: 2]! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'style' stamp: 'cwp 7/23/2007 02:08'!styleHorizontalDivider: divider	self style39		ifTrue: [divider height: 3]		ifFalse:			[divider				borderWidth: 2;				borderInset]! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'style' stamp: 'cwp 7/23/2007 02:08'!styleVerticalDivider: divider	self style39		ifTrue: [divider height: 3]		ifFalse:			[divider				borderWidth: 2;				borderRaised]! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!textarea: aDefinitionPanel with: aBlock 	"see CodeHolder>>buildMorphicCodePaneWith:"	| morph shoutInstalled morphClass |	shoutInstalled := (Smalltalk classNamed: #SHTextStylerST80) notNil.	morphClass := shoutInstalled 		ifTrue: [ O2PluggableTextMorphWithShout ]		ifFalse: [ O2PluggableTextMorph ].	morph := morphClass 		on: aDefinitionPanel		text: #text		accept: #accept:notifying:		readSelection: #selection		menu: #menu:shifted:.	morph		font: Preferences standardCodeFont;		borderWidth: 0;		vResizing: #spaceFill;		hResizing: #spaceFill.	current ifNotNil: [ current addMorphBack: morph ].	^ self 		current: morph		do: aBlock! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 2/16/2009 15:00'!textfield: aMercuryPanel with: aBlock 	| morph |	morph := self mercuryMorphFor: aMercuryPanel.	morph color: Color white.	current ifNotNil: 			[current addMorphBack: morph.			self current: morph do: aBlock].	^morph! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!topNavigationPanel: aPanel with: aBlock 	| morph divider |	morph := RectangleMorph new		layoutPolicy: TableLayout new;		height: Preferences standardCodeFont height * 2.2;		listDirection: #leftToRight;		borderWidth: 0;		hResizing: #spaceFill;		vResizing: #rigid;		wrapCentering: #center;		cellPositioning: #topLeft;		rubberBandCells: false;		layoutInset: 2;		cellInset: 2;		color: Color white;		yourself.	morph := self 		current: morph		do: aBlock.	current ifNotNil: 		[ current addMorphBack: morph.		divider := BorderedSubpaneDividerMorph horizontal			color: aPanel browser defaultBackgroundColor duller;			styleWith: O2MorphBuilder new.		current addMorphBack: divider ].	^ morph! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!treeColumn: aColumn with: aBlock   	| pane |      pane := self createPaneForColumn: aColumn with: #treeMorphForColumn:.	current ifNotNil: [current pushPane: pane].	^ self current: pane do: aBlock! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!treeMorphForColumn: aColumn 	"See MorphicToolBuilder>>buildPluggableTree:"	^ O2PluggableTreeMorph new		model: aColumn;		getLabelSelector: #getTreeLabelOf:;		getSelectedPathSelector: #getTreeSelectionPath;		getChildrenSelector: #getTreeChildrenOf:;		hasChildrenSelector: #hasTreeChildren:;		setSelectedSelector: #treeSelection:;		getIconSelector: #iconAt:;		getRootsSelector: #list;		getMenuSelector: #menu:;		dragEnabled: aColumn dragEnabled;		dropEnabled: aColumn dropEnabled;		dropItemSelector: #drop:on:;		wantsDropSelector: #canDrop:on:;		keystrokeActionSelector: #keystroke:from:;		borderWidth: 0;		autoDeselect: false;		yourself! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!verticalGroupWith: aBlock 	| morph |	morph := O2GroupingMorph new.	morph layoutPolicy: TableLayout new.	current 		addMorph: morph		frame: (0 @ 0 extent: 1 @ 1).	self 		current: morph		do: aBlock! !!O2MorphBuilder methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 4/11/2008 11:47'!window: aBrowser with: aBlock 	| window |	color := aBrowser defaultBackgroundColor.	window := SystemWindow labelled: aBrowser labelString.	window model: aBrowser.	^self current: window		do: 			[aBlock value.			self layoutPanels]! !!O2ButtonModel commentStamp: 'cwp 3/5/2004 12:15' prior: 35452051!An OBButtonModel serves as a model for PluggableButtonMorphs used OBRadioButtonBar. OBRadioButtonBar cannot be a direct model for its PBMs, since it can contain a variable number of buttons.iVars:bar		- the OBRadioButton bar to which this button belongslabel	- the label of the button!!O2ButtonModel class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 8/29/2004 13:31'!offColor	^ Color lightGray twiceLighter! !!O2ButtonModel class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 8/29/2004 13:30'!onColor	^ Color lightGray lighter! !!O2ButtonModel class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'cwp 2/24/2004 18:35'!withLabel: aString inBar: aRadioButtonBar	^ self new label: aString; bar: aRadioButtonBar! !!O2ButtonModel class methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'dr 3/23/2009 15:29'!withLabel: aString inBar: aRadioButtonBar longDescription: aToolTip	^ self new label: aString; bar: aRadioButtonBar; longDescription: aToolTip! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 2/24/2004 18:29'!bar: aRadioButtonBar	bar := aRadioButtonBar! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 7/11/2009 23:22'!browser	^bar browser! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 23:55'!buildOn: aBuilder 	^aBuilder button: self with: []! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!dropMorph: aMorph 	| package column |	package := aMorph passenger.	column := bar model column.	(O2CmdAddToSmartGroup 		on: package		for: column) execute	"smartGroups := column panel smartGroup nodes select: [:ea | ea isSmartGroupCategory and: [ea isSearchGroup not]].    selection := OBChoiceRequest prompt: nil labels: (smartGroups collect: [:ea | ea name]) values: smartGroups.    selection ifNotNil: [selection addAlias: package].    column refresh.    self select: package with: column announcer"! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 7/7/2009 14:13'!isDropEdge: aString	^bar isDropEdge: aString! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 11/27/2004 19:09'!isEnabled	^ bar isEnabled: self! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 2/24/2004 18:42'!isSelected	^ bar isSelected: self! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 3/2/2004 21:46'!label	^ label! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 2/24/2004 18:29'!label: aString	label := aString! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 2/17/2009 15:51'!labelMorph	| morph |	(Smalltalk classNamed: #UITheme) ifNotNilDo: [:uit |		^uit current buttonLabelForText: label].	morph := (StringMorph 		contents: label 		font: TextStyle defaultFont).	(label isText and: [label hasColor]) ifFalse: [morph color: (self isEnabled ifTrue: [Color black] ifFalse: [Color gray])].	^morph! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 3/23/2009 16:02'!longDescription	^longDescription! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 3/23/2009 15:27'!longDescription: aString	longDescription := aString! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 2/24/2004 19:30'!push	bar push: self.! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/27/2004 00:50'!selectionChanged	self changed: #isSelected.	self changed: #labelMorph! !!O2ButtonModel methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 7/7/2009 12:12'!wantsDroppedMorph: transferMorph	^transferMorph passenger isNode and: [transferMorph passenger isPackage]! !!O2ClassReference commentStamp: 'cwp 1/8/2005 13:15' prior: 35452405!OBClassReference provides a way to refer to classes that may or may not be loaded into the image. It refers to the class indirectly, via name, rather than with a direct pointer to the class object. It also provides a number of convenience methods, which makes it more convenient than using the class name directly.!!O2ClassReference class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!metaNamed: aSymbol	^ (self named: aSymbol) beMeta! !!O2ClassReference class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!named: aSymbol	^ self new setName: aSymbol! !!O2ClassReference class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!to: aClass	^ self named: aClass name! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'comparing'!<= other	^ self name <= other name! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'comparing' stamp: 'lr 11/13/2008 13:44'!= other 	^ (other isKindOf: self class) and: [ name = other theNonMetaName and: [ isMeta = other isMeta ] ]! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'accessing'!beMeta	isMeta := true! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'accessing'!beNonMeta	isMeta := false! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'comparing'!hash	^ isMeta		ifTrue: [name hash bitInvert]		ifFalse: [name hash]! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'testing'!isMeta	^ isMeta! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'accessing'!name	^ isMeta		ifTrue: [name, ' class']		ifFalse: [name]! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'printing'!printOn: aStream	aStream nextPutAll: 'OBClassReference'.	aStream nextPut: $<.	aStream nextPutAll: name.	isMeta ifTrue: [aStream nextPutAll: ' class'].	aStream nextPut: $>.! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'converting'!referenceToMethod: aSelector	| ref |	ref := MethodReference new.	ref setClassSymbol: name classIsMeta: isMeta  methodSymbol: aSelector stringVersion: ''.	^ ref! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'initializing'!setName: aSymbol	name := (aSymbol copyUpTo: $ ) asSymbol.	isMeta := aSymbol endsWith: ' class'.! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'accessing'!theClass	| theClass |	theClass := self theNonMetaClass ifNil: [^ nil].	^ isMeta		ifFalse: [theClass]		ifTrue: [theClass class]! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'accessing'!theNonMetaClass	^ Smalltalk at: name ifAbsent: [].! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'accessing'!theNonMetaName	^ name! !!O2ClassReference methodsFor: 'accessing'!theNonMetaName: aSymbol	name := aSymbol! !!O2Column commentStamp: 'cwp 1/7/2005 23:19' prior: 35452776!An OBColumn manages a list of nodes, which it displays in a PluggableListMorph in the pane scroller at the top of the browser. All instances of OBColumn belong to an OBColumnPanel. It's main responsibility is keeping its list - and those of its neighbours - up to date. Each column has a MetaNode, which provides the list contents. It uses a filter to meditate between its self and the MetaNode.iVars:panel		- the panel which owns the columnfilter		- the filter which manages the column's MetaNode.parent		- the node selected in the column to the left of this columnchildren 	- the nodes which make up this column's listselection 	- the index of the node selected by the user!!O2Column class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'cwp 9/18/2005 13:26'!inPanel: aBrowser	^ self new setPanel: aBrowser! !!O2Column class methodsFor: 'instance creation' stamp: 'dr 12/18/2008 15:24'!inPanel: aPanel metaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode	^ self new			setPanel: aPanel			metaNode: aMetaNode			node: aNode! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!acceptDroppingMorph: transferMorph event: evt inMorph: listMorph 	| target |	target := self nodeForDropEvent: evt inMorph: listMorph.	^self drop: transferMorph passenger on: target! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!addCommandsToMenu: aMenu 	| scan nodes |	scan := self announce: O2NodeCommandScan.	nodes := self hasSelection 		ifTrue: 			[ {  (self parent). (self selectedNode)  } ]		ifFalse: 			[ {  (self parent)  } ].	scan 		populateMenu: aMenu		withNodes: nodes		forRequestor: self! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!addSubtreeWithFan: aFan selection: anInteger	self listHolder 		at: anInteger		putFan: aFan! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 10/13/2006 09:05'!announce: anAnnouncement 	^ self browser announce: anAnnouncement! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 4/17/2006 15:52'!announcer	^ panel announcer! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!autoSelect    "do nothing"! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 10/31/2008 16:17'!backgroundColorAt: anInteger    ^self listHolder backgroundColorAt: anInteger! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 11/16/2004 21:49'!basicNext	^panel columnAfter: self! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 9/17/2008 10:54'!basicParent: aNode 	self listHolder parent: aNode.	self switchFilter: self listHolder switchFilter! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 5/4/2009 11:51'!browser	^ panel browser   ! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'cwp 7/25/2007 23:47'!buildOn: aBuilder 	^aBuilder pane: self with: [switch buildOn: aBuilder]! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 10/21/2008 22:50'!canDrop: passenger on: node	^node notNil and: [node wantsDroppedNode: passenger]! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 9/18/2008 10:03'!children 	^ self listHolder children! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 6/9/2006 22:35'!childrenChanged: announcement	(self parent = announcement node) ifTrue:		[self refresh]! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'jk 3/23/2008 11:04'!clear	self switchFilter: nil.	self listHolder clearAll.	self changed: #list.	self changed: #selection! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'jk 3/22/2008 21:04'!clearSelection	self listHolder clearSelection! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 9/24/2008 10:42'!createNext	| nextMetaNode created |	nextMetaNode := self nextMetaNode.	created := panel columnClass inPanel: panel metaNode: nextMetaNode node: self selectedNode.	panel pushColumn: created.	^created! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'printing' stamp: 'avi 3/6/2004 16:23'!descriptor	self isEmpty ifTrue: [^ 'empty'].	self hasSelection ifTrue: [^ self selectedNode name].	^ ''! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!dragEnabled	^ true! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!dragPassengerFor: item inMorph: listMorph 	^ self nodeForItem: item contents asString! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!dragTransferType	^ #OmniBrowser! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!dragTransferTypeForMorph: listMorph	^ self dragTransferType! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!drop: passenger on: target 	^ [ target acceptDroppedNode: passenger ] 		on: O2AnnouncerRequest		do: [ :notification | notification resume: self announcer ]! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!dropEnabled	^ true! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!fan    ^self listHolder fan! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 9/19/2008 11:14'!fan: aFan selection: index	self listHolder fan: aFan selection: index.	selection := index.	self selectedNode ifNotNilDo: [:node | self listHolder noteChild: node].	self switchFilter: self listHolder switchFilter.	switch refresh.	self changed: #list! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'jk 4/6/2008 18:43'!hasSelection	^ self listHolder hasSelection! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 3/19/2009 11:27'!iconAt: index 	^ self listHolder iconAt: index! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 9/19/2008 16:53'!includesNode: aNode  	^ self listHolder includesNode: aNode! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 3/23/2008 10:55'!isEmpty	^ self listHolder isEmpty! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 10/9/2006 15:41'!isSelected: aNode	^ self selectedNode == aNode! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 3/23/2008 10:54'!jumpTo: cNode 	cNode 		ifNil: 			[self clearSelection.			self changed: #list.			panel clearAfter: self]		ifNotNil: 			[self listHolder noteChild: cNode.			self selectSilently: cNode.			panel selectionChangedIn: self.			switch currentNode: cNode.			self changed: #list]! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!keystroke: aChar from: aMorph 	| scan |	self isEmpty ifTrue: [ ^ self ].	scan := self announcer announce: O2NodeCommandScan.	scan 		processKeystroke: aChar		withNode: self parent		for: self.	self hasSelection ifTrue: 		[ scan 			processKeystroke: aChar			withNode: self selectedNode			for: self ]! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 3/19/2009 11:27'!list	^ self listHolder list! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 11/20/2008 15:10'!listAt: index 	^ self listHolder displayStringForChildAt: index ! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 9/29/2008 16:34'!listChanged	self refreshAndSignal: true! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'list' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!listHolder	^ listHolder ifNil: [ listHolder := O2List column: self ]! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 10/20/2008 14:57'!listSize	^ self listHolder listSize! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'cwp 3/13/2007 00:51'!menu: aMenu 	self isEmpty ifFalse: [self addCommandsToMenu: aMenu].	^aMenu! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 5/6/2007 23:19'!metaNode	^ self parent metaNode! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 20:59'!next	^ self basicNext		ifNil: [(self hasSelection and: [self shouldBeLast not])				ifTrue: [self createNext]]	! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'column' stamp: 'jk 3/28/2008 12:51'!nextColumnForDefaultNavigationWithFan: anOBFan selection: aSmallInteger 	| column |	column := self next.	column fan: anOBFan selection: aSmallInteger.	^ column! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!nextColumnForTreeNavigationWithFan: aFan selection: anInteger	^self nextColumnForDefaultNavigationWithFan: aFan selection: anInteger! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'column' stamp: 'dr 9/17/2008 12:10'!nextColumnWithFan: aFan selection: anInteger 	^ aFan columnAfter: self selection: anInteger! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'nodes' stamp: 'cwp 3/3/2004 00:11'!nextMetaNode	^ self selectedNode metaNode! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 4/16/2009 10:58'!nodeChanged: ann 	(self listHolder includesNode: ann node) ifTrue: [self changed: #list]! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'jk 3/23/2008 10:58'!nodeDeleted: announcement 	"This gets called if an action causes the currently selected node to be deleted."	self selectedNode = announcement node		ifTrue: 			[self listHolder refresh.			self changed: #list.			self selection: 0]! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!nodeForDropEvent: evt inMorph: pluggableListMorph 	| index item label |	index := pluggableListMorph rowAtLocation: evt position.	index = 0 ifTrue: [^nil].	item := pluggableListMorph listMorph item: index.	label := item contents asString withBlanksTrimmed.	^self children 		detect: [:child | child displayString asString withBlanksTrimmed = label]		ifNone: [nil]! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'commands' stamp: 'dr 9/22/2008 11:14'!nodeForItem: aString 	^ self listHolder nodeForItem: aString  ! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!okToChange	^ (self announcer announce: O2AboutToChange) isVetoed not! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!panel	^panel ! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 3/23/2008 11:15'!parent	^ self listHolder parent! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'jk 3/23/2008 10:54'!parent: aNode 	| cNode |	self basicParent: aNode.	cNode := self listHolder autoSelection.	self jumpTo: cNode! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!preselectNodes    self next ifNotNil: [self next preselectNodes].! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 10/21/2008 09:09'!previous    ^panel columnBefore: self! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'printing' stamp: 'cwp 2/11/2004 23:31'!printOn: aStream	super printOn: aStream.	aStream nextPut: $(.	aStream nextPutAll: self descriptor.	aStream nextPut: $)! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'cwp 6/9/2006 23:08'!refresh	self refreshAndSignal: false! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 4/16/2009 18:13'!refresh: ann	| selectedNode |	self previous ifNotNilDo:  [:prev | selectedNode := prev selectedNode] ifNil: [selectedNode := panel browser root].	(selectedNode notNil and: [ selectedNode shouldRefresh: ann])  ifTrue: [self refreshAndSignal: false ].! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!refreshAll    | requestor |    requestor := self.    [requestor notNil] whileTrue: [	   requestor refresh.	   requestor := requestor next.    ]    ! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 3/4/2009 15:40'!refreshAndSignal: aBoolean	| shouldSignal |	shouldSignal := aBoolean.	self isEmpty ifTrue: [^self]. 	self listHolder refresh ifTrue:		[self selectSilently: self selectedNode.		self hasSelection ifFalse: 			[shouldSignal := true]].	shouldSignal ifTrue: [self signalSelectionChanged].	self changed: #list! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 11/10/2008 15:37'!select: aNode 	self listHolder children doWithIndex: [:child :i | 		child = aNode ifTrue: [			selection := nil. 			^self selection: i]].	self selection: nil! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'jk 3/23/2008 11:07'!selectSilently: aNode 		self listHolder selectSilently: aNode! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'jk 3/23/2008 11:18'!selectedNode	^ self listHolder selectedNode! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'jk 3/22/2008 21:05'!selection	^ self listHolder selection! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 3/19/2009 11:15'!selection: anInteger	self listHolder selection: anInteger. 	self signalSelectionChanged.	self changed: #selection.	switch currentNode: self selectedNode! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 3/1/2008 17:17'!selectionChanged: ann! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!setPanel: aPanel 	panel := aPanel.	switch := O2Switch inColumn: self.	self subscribe.	self listHolder clearAll! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!setPanel: aPanel metaNode: aMetanode node: aNode 	switch := O2Switch inColumn: self.	panel := aPanel.	aNode metaNode: aMetanode.	self basicParent: aNode.	self clearSelection.	self subscribe! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'avi 3/6/2004 16:27'!shouldBeLast	^ self hasSelection not or: [self nextMetaNode hasChildren not]! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!signalSelectionChanged	self announcer announce: (O2SelectionChanged column: self)! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!subscribe	self announcer		observe: O2RefreshRequired			send: #refresh:			to: self;		observe: O2NodeChanged			send: #nodeChanged:			to: self;		observe: O2NodeDeleted			send: #nodeDeleted:			to: self;		observe: O2ChildrenChanged			send: #childrenChanged:			to: self;		observe: O2SelectionChanged			send: #selectionChanged:			to: self! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 5/17/2007 23:25'!switch	^ switch! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'cwp 5/18/2007 20:24'!switchFilter: aFilter	"We should only be sending #changed: if the filter is actually different	from the one the switch already has, but that causes some visually odd	behavior because of the way OBRadioButtonBar resizes its self when updating,	so for now we always just recreate the button bar."		switch filter: aFilter.	self changed: #switch! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!updateIcon   self changed: #list! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!updateIconOfAllColumns    panel columns do: [:ea | ea updateIcon]! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'DamienCassou 12/23/2009 16:36'!updateIconOfAllPreviousColumns    | col |    col := self.    [col notNil] whileTrue: [        col updateIcon.        col := col previous.    ]! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!useDoubleClick: aBoolean! !!O2Column methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'cwp 5/17/2007 23:24'!wantsButton	^ switch isActive! !!O2Column methodsFor: '*o2-morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!wantsDroppedMorph: transferMorph event: evt inMorph: listMorph 	| node passenger |	(transferMorph isKindOf: TransferMorph) ifFalse: [^false].	node := self nodeForDropEvent: evt inMorph: listMorph.	transferMorph dragTransferType == self dragTransferType ifFalse: [^false].	passenger := transferMorph passenger. 	^self canDrop: passenger on: node! !!O2EnhancementColumn commentStamp: 'dr 9/23/2008 16:19' prior: 35453527!I am a slightly adapted version of OBColumn and I am used in all browsers provided by the enhancements package.!!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 1/29/2009 11:06'!autoSelect    self fan autoSelection ifNotNilDo: [:node | (selection = 0 or: [node = self selectedNode]) 	 	ifTrue: [self jumpTo: node. 				self fan shouldUpdateOnAutoSelect ifTrue: [self signalSelectionChanged]]].     self next ifNotNilDo: [:next | next autoSelect] ! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 12/15/2008 18:43'!basicParent: aNode      super basicParent: aNode.    fan := listHolder fan.! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 2/25/2008 15:15'!buildOn: aBuilder	| pane |	pane := super buildOn: aBuilder.	pane list doubleClickSelector: self doubleClickSelector.	^pane! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 3/1/2008 16:52'!childrenChanged: ann     super childrenChanged: ann.	ann node isSmartGroup ifTrue:		[self refresh].! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!clear	super clear.	fan := O2EnhancementFan new! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!deselectItem	| previousColumn |	self clearSelection.	self changed: #selection.	self fan removeAutoSelection.	previousColumn := self previous.	"this is ugly but works"	"panel columns last = self ifTrue: [previousColumn := previousColumn previous]."	previousColumn 		ifNotNil: [ previousColumn signalSelectionChanged ]		ifNil: 			[ self signalSelectionChanged.			self announcer announce: (O2DefinitionChanged definition: O2Definition new) ]! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 9/19/2008 16:08'!doubleClick    "only used in hierarchy browser in the first column to change focus to the selected class"    "should be change to be based on metagraph"    | commandClass |    "panel browser class isHierarchyBrowser ifTrue: [	   panel changeRootNode: self selectedNode    ] ifFalse: [(OBEnhancementCmdBrowseHierarchy on: self selectedNode for: self) execute]."    commandClass := self selectedNode metaNode doubleClickCommandClass.    commandClass ifNotNil: [(commandClass on: self selectedNode for: self) execute]. ! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 2/25/2008 15:15'!doubleClickSelector    ^doubleClickSelector! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 11/19/2008 14:09'!fan    ^fan! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 12/11/2008 14:43'!fan: aFan selection: index     super fan: aFan asEnhancedFan selection: index.     self selectedNode ifNotNilDo: [:node | node isMethodNode ifTrue: [self fan setLastNode: self selectedNode]].! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 10/18/2009 14:32'!handleNonAliasSwitchFor: oldNode currentNode: oldCurrentNode nextNode: nextOldNode 	| smartNode |	panel columns first = self ifTrue: 		[ "switched to 'hierarchy'" 		(switch selection = panel browser class hierarchySwitchIndex and: [ nextOldNode respondsTo: #theClass ]) ifTrue: 			[self selectClassInHierarchy: nextOldNode theNonMetaClass.			self selectPackageInHierarchyView.			oldCurrentNode isMethodNode ifTrue: [ self selectHierarchyClassMethod: oldCurrentNode ] ].		"switched to 'packages'"		(switch selection = panel browser class packageSwitchIndex and: [ oldNode isClassNode ]) ifTrue: 			[ (self selectedNode isNil or: [ self selectedNode isClassNode not ]) ifTrue: [ panel jumpTo: oldNode ] ].		"switched to 'smart groups'"		switch selection = panel browser class smartGroupSwitchIndex ifTrue: 			[ smartNode := O2SmartRootNode default allSmartNodes 				detect: [ :node | node alias = oldCurrentNode ]				ifNone: [ nil ].			smartNode ifNotNil: [ smartNode jumpIn: panel ] ] ].			(switch selection = panel browser class packageSwitchIndex and: [ oldNode isClassNode ]) ifTrue: 		[ self selectedNode = oldNode ifTrue: 			[ panel clearAfter: self.			panel jumpTo: oldNode ] ]! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 10/23/2008 09:49'!handleSmartAliasSwitchFor: oldNode currentNode: oldCurrentNode    oldNode isSearchOrPackageAlias ifFalse: [        switch selection = 1 		ifTrue: [oldNode jumpIn: panel]          ifFalse: [(oldCurrentNode respondsTo: #theClass) ifTrue: [		     self selectClassInHierarchy: oldCurrentNode theNonMetaClass.		     self selectPackageInHierarchyView]].        ^self    ].    oldNode isPackageAlias ifTrue: [	   (oldCurrentNode notNil and: [oldCurrentNode isSmartAlias not]) ifTrue: [panel jumpTo: oldCurrentNode].	   ^self    ].    (oldNode isSearchAlias and: [oldCurrentNode notNil and: [oldCurrentNode ~= oldNode]]) ifTrue: [	    panel jumpTo: (oldNode selectThisOrNextNodeOnSwitch: oldCurrentNode)]                	    ! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 10/21/2008 11:20'!handleSwitchFor: oldNode node: oldCurrentNode nextNode: nextOldNode	   oldNode isSmartAlias ifTrue: [self handleSmartAliasSwitchFor: oldNode currentNode: oldCurrentNode] 	                           ifFalse: [self handleNonAliasSwitchFor: oldNode currentNode: oldCurrentNode nextNode: nextOldNode].! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 9/26/2008 16:47'!jumpToAliasNode     (self selectedNode notNil and: [self selectedNode isSmartAlias]) ifTrue: [self selectedNode jumpIn: panel. ^self].! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!listChanged	| oldNode oldCurrentNode nextOldNode |	oldNode := self selectedNode.	oldCurrentNode := panel currentNode.	nextOldNode := self next ifNotNilDo: [ :next | next selectedNode ].	"dirty hack to make sure that we find a clean metagraph when navigating in the first column"	panel columns first = self ifTrue: [ panel cleanMetagraph ].	self refreshAndSignal: true.	oldNode ifNotNil: 		[ self 			handleSwitchFor: oldNode			node: oldCurrentNode			nextNode: nextOldNode ].	"make sure that if we have a pre-selected method node before the change occurred, its defintion is displayed"	panel currentNode ifNotNilDo: 		[ :node | 		self announcer announce: (O2DefinitionChanged definition: node definition) ]! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 1/29/2009 11:12'!parent: aNode 	| cNode autoselectNode |	autoselectNode := self fan lastNode.	self basicParent: aNode.	autoselectNode ifNotNil: [self fan setLastNode: autoselectNode].	cNode := self fan autoSelection. 			self jumpTo: cNode.  	"(self fan shouldUpdateOnAutoSelect and: [cNode notNil]) ifTrue: [self signalSelectionChanged]."! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'dr 7/11/2008 16:26'!selectClassInHierarchy: aClass    | selectNode |    selectNode := self children detect: [:ea | (ea respondsTo: #theNonMetaClass) and: [ea theNonMetaClass = aClass]] ifNone: [nil].    selectNode ifNotNil: [self select: selectNode]! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'dr 10/21/2008 11:37'!selectHierarchyClassMethod: aMethodNode    | selectNode methodColumn |    methodColumn := panel columns last.    selectNode := methodColumn children detect: [:ea | ea = aMethodNode] ifNone: [nil].    selectNode ifNotNil: [methodColumn select: aMethodNode]! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'dr 10/21/2008 22:55'!selectPackageInHierarchyView    self selectPackageInHierarchyViewWith: nil! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!selectPackageInHierarchyViewWith: lastNode 	| packageNodeOfClass last |	(self selectedNode notNil and: 		[ panel columns first = self and: [ switch selection = panel browser class hierarchySwitchIndex ] ]) ifTrue: 		[ self selectedNode ifNotNilDo: 			[ :node | 			self next ifNotNilDo: 				[ :next | 				next 					fan: node asFan					selection: 0 ] ].		packageNodeOfClass := self next children 			detect: [ :pkgNode | pkgNode includesClass: self selectedNode theNonMetaClass ]			ifNone: [ nil ].		self next selection: (self next children indexOf: packageNodeOfClass).		lastNode ifNotNil: 			[ "make sure to keep last selected node as it gets lost when selection changes"			last := panel columns last.			last fan setLastNode: lastNode.			last previous signalSelectionChanged.			last fan autoSelection ifNotNilDo: 				[ :node | 				self announcer announce: (O2DefinitionChanged definition: node definition) ] ] ]! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!selection: anInteger 	"select the same item a second time => unselect"	| oldSelectedNode newSelectedNode |	(selection = anInteger and: [ doubleClickSelector isNil ]) ifTrue: 		[ self selectedNode ifNotNil: 			[ (self selectedNode isKindOf: O2AllMethodCategoryNode) ifFalse: 				[ self deselectItem.				^ self ] ] ].	"make sure that a click on an already selected item brings it up again (no auto-selection afterwards)"	oldSelectedNode := self selectedNode.	newSelectedNode := self children 		at: anInteger		ifAbsent: [ nil ].	oldSelectedNode = newSelectedNode ifTrue: [ panel clearAfter: self ].	"selecting of smart nodes"	selection := anInteger.	self jumpToAliasNode.	super selection: anInteger.	panel autoSelect: self.	(self selectedNode notNil and: [ self selectedNode isMethodNode ]) ifTrue: [ self fan setLastNode: self selectedNode ].	(Smalltalk hasClassNamed: #CMModel) ifTrue: 		[ self selectedNode ifNotNilDo: 			[ :node | 			(Smalltalk classNamed: #CMModel) recentlyBrowsed updateEntity: node entity ] ]! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 2/25/2008 15:16'!setDoubleClickSelector: aSymbol    doubleClickSelector := aSymbol! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!setPanel: aPanel 	super setPanel: aPanel.	fan := O2EnhancementFan new! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 4/14/2008 15:54'!setPanel: aPanel metaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode    super setPanel: aPanel metaNode: aMetaNode node: aNode.    self useDoubleClick: aMetaNode next supportsDoubleClick.! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 10/20/2008 18:30'!signalSelectionChanged	super signalSelectionChanged. 	self next ifNotNil: [self next preselectNodes]. ! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 2/25/2008 15:25'!useDoubleClick    self setDoubleClickSelector: #doubleClick.! !!O2EnhancementColumn methodsFor: 'initializing' stamp: 'dr 9/19/2008 16:30'!useDoubleClick: aBoolean    aBoolean ifTrue: [self setDoubleClickSelector: #doubleClick].! !!O2MultipleSelectionColumn methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 7/4/2007 15:51'!buildOn: aBuilder	^ aBuilder		multipleSelectionColumn: self 		with: [switch buildOn: aBuilder]! !!O2MultipleSelectionColumn methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 2/29/2008 10:16'!hasSeveralSelections   ^(self multipleSelection values select: [:ea | ea]) size > 1! !!O2MultipleSelectionColumn methodsFor: 'morphic' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!listMorph	^ (O2PluggableListMorphOfMany 		on: self		list: #list		primarySelection: #selection		changePrimarySelection: #selection:		listSelection: #listSelectionAt:		changeListSelection: #listSelectionAt:put:		menu: #menu:		keystroke: #keystroke:from:)		getListElementSelector: #listAt:;		getListSizeSelector: #listSize;		dragEnabled: self dragEnabled;		dropEnabled: self dropEnabled;		borderWidth: 0;		autoDeselect: false;		adoptPaneColor: panel defaultBackgroundColor;		yourself! !!O2MultipleSelectionColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 2/29/2008 10:16'!listSelectionAt: anIndex	^self multipleSelection at: anIndex ifAbsent: [^false]! !!O2MultipleSelectionColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!listSelectionAt: anIndex put: aValue 	| isSelected |	isSelected := self multipleSelection 		at: anIndex		ifAbsent: [ false ].	"if we did not de-select the primary selection"	(aValue not and: [ anIndex = selection ]) ifFalse: 		[ self multipleSelection 			at: anIndex			put: aValue.		"if we de-select this item"		(isSelected and: [ aValue not ]) 			ifTrue: 				[ self announcer announce: ((O2SelectionChanged column: self) deselectedNode: (self children at: anIndex)) ]			ifFalse: 				[ "if we select an new item => check all old items"				self multipleSelection associationsDo: 					[ :assoc | 					(assoc value = true and: [ self paneExistsForSelection: assoc key ]) ifFalse: 						[ self multipleSelection 							at: assoc key							put: false ] ] ] ]! !!O2MultipleSelectionColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 2/29/2008 10:15'!multipleSelect: anInteger    (self multipleSelection isEmpty and: [self = panel columns last]) ifTrue: [self multipleSelection at: anInteger put: true].! !!O2MultipleSelectionColumn methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 2/29/2008 10:15'!multipleSelection    multipleSelection ifNil: [multipleSelection := Dictionary new].    ^multipleSelection! !!O2MultipleSelectionColumn methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 2/27/2008 16:19'!paneExistsForSelection: anIndex    ^panel definitionPanel includesNode: (self children at: anIndex ifAbsent: [nil]).! !!O2MultipleSelectionColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 8/11/2008 14:29'!preselectNodes     self children keysAndValuesDo: [:idx :node | self multipleSelection at: idx put: (panel definitionPanel includesNode: node)]. ! !!O2MultipleSelectionColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 2/14/2008 12:05'!selectSilently: aNode	super selectSilently: aNode.	self multipleSelect: selection.! !!O2MultipleSelectionColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 8/11/2008 14:25'!selection: anInteger     ((self hasSeveralSelections not and: [selection = anInteger or: [anInteger = 0]]) and: [doubleClickSelector isNil]) ifTrue: [ 	    "select the same item a second time => unselect"	    self deselectItem.	    ^self	].     "de-selected an item"	anInteger = 0 ifTrue: [         selection := oldSelection. "self halt."         "selection keysAndValuesDo: [:index :value | value ifTrue: [primarySelection := index]]."	] ifFalse: [ 	    oldSelection := selection.	    selection := anInteger.	    self multipleSelect: anInteger.         self signalSelectionChanged.	]. 	self changed: #selection.      fan setLastNode: self selectedNode.! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'fan' stamp: 'dr 9/23/2008 15:14'!addSubtreeWithFan: aFan selection: anInteger	self treeNodeMediator putFan: aFan at: self treeSelection.	self extendSelection: anInteger.! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!basicParent: aNode 	super basicParent: aNode.	treeNodeMediator := O2TreeNodeMediator parent: aNode.	treeNodeMediator fan: self fan! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'building' stamp: 'dr 9/11/2008 16:38'!buildOn: aBuilder	^ aBuilder		treeColumn: self 		with: [switch buildOn: aBuilder]! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 12/9/2008 20:09'!childAt: anArray	^ self nodeAt: anArray! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!clear	super clear.	treeNodeMediator := O2TreeNodeMediator fan: O2Fan new! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 9/19/2008 11:12'!clearSelection	treeSelection := #(0)! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'fan' stamp: 'dr 9/19/2008 11:25'!currentFan	^ self fanAt: self treeSelection! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'fan' stamp: 'dr 9/22/2008 15:27'!currentSelection	^ self treeSelection notEmpty 		ifTrue: [self treeSelection last]		ifFalse: [0]! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!dropNode: passengerNode on: targetNode 	"self haltOnce."	^ [ targetNode acceptDroppedNode: passengerNode ] 		on: O2AnnouncerRequest		do: [ :notification | notification resume: self announcer ]! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 2/12/2009 15:26'!extendSelection: anInteger	^ anInteger = 0		ifFalse: [self treeSelectionSilently: (self treeSelection copyWith: anInteger)]! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'DavidRoethlisberger 10/18/2009 15:38'!fan: aFan selection: index	fan := aFan.	self listHolder fan: aFan selection: index.	treeNodeMediator fan: aFan.	treeSelection := Array with: index.	self selectedNode ifNotNilDo: [:node | self listHolder noteChild: node].	self switchFilter: self listHolder switchFilter.	switch refresh.	self changed: #list.! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'fan' stamp: 'dr 9/23/2008 15:10'!fanAt: anArray	^ self treeNodeMediator fanAt: anArray! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'fan' stamp: 'dr 9/23/2008 15:10'!fanWithParentNodeAt: anOrderedCollection 	^ self treeNodeMediator fanWithParentNodeAt: anOrderedCollection! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'jk 1/6/2008 03:28'!getTreeChildrenOf: nodePosition	| currentFan |	currentFan := self fanWithParentNodeAt: nodePosition.	currentFan restrictToTreeChildrenAndAdjustSelection: 0. 	^ currentFan treeChildren collect: [:e | currentFan parent displayStringForChild: e ]! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 10/20/2008 18:25'!getTreeLabelOf: aStringOrText	^ aStringOrText ! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 9/19/2008 11:28'!getTreeSelectionPath	^ self treeSelection! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'dr 9/19/2008 11:36'!hasSelection	^ self treeSelection notEmpty and: [ self treeSelection last ~~ 0 ]! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 9/11/2008 17:24'!hasTreeChildren: nodePosition	| node |	node := self nodeAt: nodePosition.	^ node ifNotNil: [node hasTreeChildren] ifNil: [false]! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 12/9/2008 20:09'!iconAt: anArray	^(self childAt: anArray) icon! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'compatibility' stamp: 'dr 9/12/2008 10:00'!lastNode! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!listChanged	"we might somehow have to update fans when the list changes, eg. when adding a new element"	"self children do: [:node | self fan putFan: node asFan at: #(1)]."	| oldNode oldCurrentNode nextOldNode |	oldNode := self selectedNode.	oldCurrentNode := panel currentNode.	nextOldNode := self next ifNotNilDo: [ :next | next selectedNode ].	"dirty hack to make sure that we find a clean metagraph when navigating in the first column"	panel columns first = self ifTrue: [ panel cleanMetagraph ].	treeSelection := #(0 ).	self refreshAndSignal: true.	oldNode ifNotNil: 		[ self 			handleSwitchFor: oldNode			node: oldCurrentNode			nextNode: nextOldNode ].	self changed: #list.	"make sure that if we have a pre-selected method node before the change occurred, its defintion is displayed"	panel currentNode ifNotNilDo: 		[ :node | 		self announcer announce: (O2DefinitionChanged definition: node definition) ]! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'fan' stamp: 'dr 9/23/2008 16:12'!nextColumnForTreeNavigationWithFan: aFan selection: anInteger	| nextColumn | 	nextColumn := self addSubtreeWithFan: aFan selection: anInteger.	^ nextColumn! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'node' stamp: 'dr 9/23/2008 15:10'!nodeAt: anArray	^ self treeNodeMediator nodeAt: anArray! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 11/19/2008 11:51'!nodeForDropEvent: evt inMorph: pluggableTreeMorph 	| item label itemParent classCat | 	item := pluggableTreeMorph itemFromPoint: evt position. 	item ifNil: [^nil].	label := item contents asString withBlanksTrimmed.	"search for class cat node in opened packages first"	itemParent := item complexContents parent.	itemParent isNullParent ifFalse: [		classCat := itemParent item, '-', label.		self treeNodeMediator subTreeNodeMediators values do: [:ea | 	     	ea fan children do: [:n | n name = classCat ifTrue: [^n]]].	].	"if no class cat found, search for a package with the name label"	^self children 		detect: [:child | child displayString asString withBlanksTrimmed = label]		ifNone: [nil]. ! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 4/17/2009 12:17'!refresh: ann	| selectedNode packageNode | 	self previous ifNotNilDo:  [:prev | selectedNode := prev selectedNode] ifNil: [		selectedNode := panel browser root.		 self selectedNode ifNotNilDo: [:node |			packageNode := selectedNode packages detect: [:pkg | pkg workingCopy = node workingCopy] ifNone: [nil].			packageNode ifNotNil: [packageNode resetCache].			]].	(selectedNode notNil and: [ selectedNode shouldRefresh: ann])  ifTrue: [self refreshAndSignal: false ].! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'updating' stamp: 'dr 7/4/2009 18:07'!refreshAndSignal: aBoolean	self treeNodeMediator refresh.	super refreshAndSignal: aBoolean.! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'dr 9/12/2008 10:57'!selectedNode	^ self currentFan children at: self currentSelection ifAbsent: [nil]! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'selecting' stamp: 'dr 11/10/2008 15:36'!selection: anInteger	treeSelection := OrderedCollection with: anInteger.    	super selection: anInteger.! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'compatibility' stamp: 'dr 9/12/2008 10:00'!setLastNode: aNode! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!setPanel: aPanel 	super setPanel: aPanel.	treeNodeMediator := O2TreeNodeMediator fan: O2Fan new! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'compatibility' stamp: 'TestRunner 11/7/2009 20:57'!shouldBeLast	^ self hasSelection not or: [		self nextMetaNode hasChildren not 			or: [self nextMetaNode edges allSatisfy: [:e | e isTreeEdge]]]! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 9/23/2008 15:10'!treeNodeMediator    ^treeNodeMediator! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 9/19/2008 11:24'!treeSelection	^ treeSelection ifNil: [#(0)]! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 2/12/2009 15:26'!treeSelection: anArray     | lastNode |     self treeSelectionSilently: anArray.	lastNode := panel columns last fan lastNode.	self signalSelectionChanged.	self changed: #selection.     self jumpToAliasNode.     self selectPackageInHierarchyViewWith: lastNode.			switch currentNode: self selectedNode.	! !!O2TreeColumn methodsFor: 'callbacks' stamp: 'dr 2/12/2009 15:25'!treeSelectionSilently: anArray     treeSelection := anArray.	self listHolder selection: anArray.! !!O2CategoryCommand methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'avi 5/30/2007 23:07'!group	^ #category! !!O2CategoryCommand methodsFor: 'as yet unclassified' stamp: 'lr 11/13/2008 13:44'!isActive	^ target hasOrganization and: 		[ (requestor isSelected: target) not and: 			[ requestor selectedNode isNil or: [ requestor selectedNode isCategoryNode ] ] ]! !!O2CmdCreateCategory methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'cwp 9/25/2006 00:12'!categoryTemplateFor: anOrganization	^ anOrganization isClassOrganizer		ifTrue: ['category name']		ifFalse: ['Category-Name']! !!O2CmdCreateCategory methodsFor: 'execution' stamp: 'dc 1/16/2008 12:41'!execute	| catName |	catName := self requestCategoryToUser.	catName ifNotNil: 		[ target organization addCategory: catName.		self 			select: (target categoryNodeNamed: catName)			with: requestor announcer ]! !!O2CmdCreateCategory methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!group	^#general! !!O2CmdCreateCategory methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'lr 6/9/2007 10:33'!icon	^ #newIcon! !!O2CmdCreateCategory methodsFor: 'execution' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!requestCategoryToUser	^ O2TextRequest 		prompt: 'Please type new category name'		template: (self categoryTemplateFor: target organization)! !!O2CmdCreateClassCategory methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!isActive	^ (requestor selectedNode isNil or: [ requestor selectedNode isKindOf: O2ClassCategoryNode ]) and: [ super isActive ]! !!O2CmdCreateClassCategory methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'onierstrasz 7/4/2009 18:27'!label	^ 'create category...'! !!O2CmdCreateMethodCategory methodsFor: 'private' stamp: 'damiencassou 4/17/2009 15:35'!getCategories: labels reject: reject lines: lines 	| cats |	target theClass allSuperclassesDo: 		[ :cls | 		cls = Object ifFalse: 			[ cats := cls organization categories reject: [ :cat | reject includes: cat ].			cats isEmpty ifFalse: 				[ lines add: labels size.				labels addAll: cats asSortedCollection.				reject addAll: cats ] ] ]! !!O2CmdCreateMethodCategory methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!isActive	^ (requestor selectedNode isNil or: [ requestor selectedNode isKindOf: O2MethodCategoryNode ]) and: [ super isActive ]! !!O2CmdCreateMethodCategory methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'onierstrasz 7/4/2009 18:28'!label	^ 'create protocol...'! !!O2CmdCreateMethodCategory methodsFor: 'execution' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!requestCategoryToUser	"Present a choice of categories or prompt for a new category name."	| labels reject lines answer newLabel |	newLabel := 'new...'.	labels := OrderedCollection with: newLabel.	reject := Set new.	reject		addAll: target organization categories;		add: ClassOrganizer nullCategory;		add: ClassOrganizer default.	lines := OrderedCollection new.	self 		getCategories: labels		reject: reject		lines: lines.	^ (labels size = 1 or: 		[ answer := O2ChoiceRequest 			prompt: 'Add Category'			labels: labels			values: labels			lines: lines.		answer ifNil: [ ^ nil ].		answer = newLabel ]) 		ifTrue: [ super requestCategoryToUser ]		ifFalse: [ answer ]! !!O2CmdRemoveEmptyProtocols methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!cluster	^#various! !!O2CmdRemoveEmptyProtocols methodsFor: 'execution' stamp: 'cwp 10/15/2006 18:52'!execute	target organization removeEmptyCategories! !!O2CmdRemoveEmptyProtocols methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!group	^#xAdditional! !!O2CmdRemoveEmptyProtocols methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'onierstrasz 7/4/2009 18:56'!label	^ 'remove empty protocols'! !!O2CmdReorgProtocols methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!cluster	^#various! !!O2CmdReorgProtocols methodsFor: 'execution' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!execute	| definition organizer |	organizer := target organization.	definition := O2OrganizationDefinition on: organizer.	requestor announce: definition! !!O2CmdReorgProtocols methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!group	^#xAdditional! !!O2CmdReorgProtocols methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'onierstrasz 7/4/2009 18:56'!label	^ 'reorganize protocols'! !!O2CmdAddPackageOnTop methodsFor: 'execution' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!execute	target isOnTop 		ifTrue: [ O2PackageBrowser removeTopPackage: target workingCopy ]		ifFalse: [ O2PackageBrowser addTopPackage: target workingCopy ].	requestor browser root resetCache.	requestor listChanged.	self 		select: target		with: requestor announcer! !!O2CmdAddPackageOnTop methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 4/27/2009 11:18'!group	^#atTop! !!O2CmdAddPackageOnTop methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'Alexandre.Bergel 9/3/2009 17:53'!isActive	"^false"	^target isPackage and: [requestor isSelected: target]! !!O2CmdAddPackageOnTop methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 9/10/2008 10:28'!label    ^target isOnTop ifTrue: ['remove packge from top']                       ifFalse: ['place package on top']! !!O2CmdAddPackageOnTop methodsFor: 'accessing' stamp: 'dr 6/5/2009 16:57'!priority	^2! !!O2CmdAddSmartCategory methodsFor: 'command' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:45'!execute	| name |	name := O2TextRequest 		prompt: 'Please type new category name'		template: ''.	name ifNil: [ ^ self ].	requestor panel smartGroup addNode: (O2SmartGroupNode name: name).	requestor panel columns first refresh! !!O2CmdAddSmartCategory methodsFor: 'command' stamp: 'dr 7/8/2008 16:41'!isActive     target isEnvironment ifFalse: [^false].	^(target isSmartGroup and: [requestor isSelected: target]) or: [requestor switch selection = requestor browser class smartGroupSwitchIndex]! !!O2CmdAddSmartCategory methodsFor: 'command' stamp: 'dr 3/1/2008 17:06'!label    ^'new smart group...'! !!O2CmdAddToSmartGroup methodsFor: 'command' stamp: 'dr 4/28/2009 11:09'!cluster	^#various! !!O2CmdAddToSmartGroup methodsFor: 'command' stamp: 'dr 7/8/2009 19:21'!execute	| smartGroups |	smartGroups := requestor panel smartGroup nodes select: [:ea | ea isSmartGroupCategory and: [ea isSearchGroup not]].    "selection := OBChoiceRequest prompt: nil labels: (smartGroups collect: [:ea | ea name]) values: smartGroups.    selection ifNotNil: [selection addAlias: target]."	(smartGroups first addAlias: target) level: 0.	 	requestor panel columns first refresh.	self select: target with: requestor announcer! !!O2CmdAddToSmartGroup methodsFor: 'command' stamp: 'dr 4/27/2009 11:37'!group	^#xAdditional! !!O2CmdAddToSmartGroup methodsFor: 'command' stamp: 'dr 7/11/2008 11:11'!isActive	^target isSmartGroup not		and: [target isDummy not and: [requestor isSelected: target]]! !!O2CmdAddToSmartGroup methodsFor: 'command' stamp: 'dr 4/5/2007 13:27'!label    ^'add to smart group'! !!O2CmdAutoCategorize methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!cluster	^#various! !!O2CmdAutoCategorize methodsFor: 'execution' stamp: 'cwp 10/15/2006 01:12'!execute	"Categorize methods by looking in parent classes for a method category."	| organizers organizer |	organizer := target organization.	organizers := organizer subject withAllSuperclasses collect: [:ea | ea organization].	(organizer listAtCategoryNamed: ClassOrganizer default) do: [:sel | | found |		found := (organizers collect: [ :org | org categoryOfElement: sel])			detect: [:ea | ea ~= ClassOrganizer default and: [ ea ~= nil]]			ifNone: [].		found ifNotNil: [organizer classify: sel under: found]]! !!O2CmdAutoCategorize methodsFor: '*o2-enhancements' stamp: 'scg 8/24/2009 10:28'!group	^#xAdditional! !!O2CmdAutoCategorize methodsFor: 'testing' stamp: 'lr 11/13/2008 13:44'!isActive	^ target hasOrganization and: 		[ t